window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1001,"title":"Chapter 1001: Chapter 1000 - A Goal of Universal Conquest! II","paragraphs":["The arrival of Chronos had even made Valentina who was showing off terrifying battle prowess to pull back.","It had filled the watching Hegemonies with apprehension as they looked at his heavy weight in the same tier as Oathkeeper and wondered just what plans he had within this group of Hegemonies!","Yet in the midst of all this, a Paragon came and stole the spot light as he appeared in the middle of the intense stand off, finding the restriction that was present in all the 9 Universes after the process of Universal Amalgamation was initiated.","\"...\"","Ambrose looked towards the figure of Noah with intense wrath, this being accounting for many of his plans being knocked out of order as his entrance at this time was like getting slapped multiple times!","What was worse was that he couldn't even move against such a creature that he thought would be dead, expecting Dark Shadow to have killed him first even before the Amalgamation began. But he now watched as this being domineeringly stood in front of them, his figure smiling as he began to float towards the Universal Construct that was behind Ambrose and the others.","All eyes were on this nonchalant Tyrant Dragon as he came upon the crimson barrier enacted by Ambrose, his body lighting up with the essence of destruction as he released attacks upon attacks at this barrier!","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","The explosive force of galaxies dying emanated from his body as he attacked a barrier enacted by a Hegemony to no avail, only stopping seconds later as he let out a sigh.","No Hegemonies could attack those in the lower Ranks within these Universes, but those in the Lower Ranks didn't stand a chance of stopping their plans as they couldn't break the barriers of protection that would no doubt be enacted across all 9 Universal Constructs!","This was why even though Ambrose and the others were maddened by the disrespect of this Paragon, they weren't the least bit worried about him.","THRUM!","The purple clock behind Chronos faded away as he gazed at Noah with a somber light of curiosity, this being not appearing in the past lives he lived as he took him as one of the many changes he was experiencing in this life.","Any changes that deviated from what he experienced before...he had to pay attention to!","So he watched with utter clarity as the Tyrant Dragon gazed towards the direction of the boundary of the Animus Universe where he knew Oathkeeper and the others were watching as he spoke once more.","\"Paragons and below cannot be harmed by this group of Hegemonies, but we cannot get past their protection of their Universal Constructs. Unless...a strong enough Paragon who has the power capable of contending against a Hegemony while in the lower ranks appears!\"","...!","This mere Paragon...was he boasting that he would get the power of a Hegemony at his rank as he worked to stand against Chronos and the others?!","He seemed to go at his own pace as his words continued for one more time before he disappeared in a flash of light, only to reappear in another location within the same Animus Universe.","\"You all figure out other ways to stop their Universal Constructs- they are gathering the essence of the Universes for a reason, and I think none of us want to wait to find out for what!\"","With that, the figure of the Tyrant Dragon disappeared as it left behind multiple Hegemonies that looked at its position in shock.","In front of the Bloody Battlefields Galaxy, Chronos turned towards Ambrose as his eyes gazed towards the direction of the Draconic Holy Lands where he picked up the aura of the same domineering Tyrant Dragon reappearing.","\"Tell me everything that has happened since the appearance of that Paragon.\"","...!","Past the boundary of the Animus Universe where Oathkeeper and a few other Hegemonies watched.","Many of them stared at Valentina as the archaic gaze of Oathkeeper locked onto her as he posed out a question as well.","\"Tell us about this Paragon and the things that happened within the Animus Universe...\"","As the powerful experts tried to find out their enemies and allies amidst the dreadful actions taken by a certain group of Hegemonies, the identity of one particular Paragon popped up throughout as both sides sought to understand his role!","As for the being in question?","He appeared on the battlefield of the Universal War where 9 Bloodline Races were still fighting, the state of this battle already edging towards completion as his Animus Summons backed by his own power were ripping apart any remaining Paragons of the 5 Bloodline Races.","His appearance was the nail in the coffin as with his return, the Legions being led by a few remaining Paragons felt utter despair as the mere presence of Noah was that suffocating!","A Hegemony had acted against him, and this being didn't die! What would they be able to do?","Noah gazed at these despairing eyes with a sharp expression as his main body continued to sense his continued rise in power, as well as what his influence and actions within the Animus Universe were doing to contribute to his continued forming of the Marks of Antiquity.","For his goal to obtain 50 Billion Marks of Antiquity and forge 50 Billion Dao Galaxies that would enable him to have complete connections of all of his Galaxies...he had told himself he would have to explore other Universes and expand his influence!","In order to birth his Universal Seed and go towards becoming a Hegemony, he saw the fastest way to be the one he just did with the Universal War of the Animus Universe.","A little bit of bloodshed. Obtaining Vassals. Standing as the being with the strongest influence within that Universe.","Such a reality caused Noah's heart to bubble with an intense longing.","A longing for Marks of Antiquity.","A longing for Vassals that could provide him with such marks in the millions.","A longing for the many beings within each of the 9 Universes currently affected by the Universal Amalgamation.","A longing...for Universal Conquest!"]},{"number":1002,"title":"Chapter 1002: Chapter 1001 - The Strongest Influence in the Animus Universe! I","paragraphs":["Conquest!","The mere word caused Noah's heart to beat faster as he found his path towards the Universal Rank.","It also coincided with what he had to do if he wanted to stand against Ambrose and the others, and whatever plans they had within these 9 Universes that they carried out the Universal Amalgamation.","Noah would go to these Universes as the targets of Conquest, obtaining Vassals within them as he raised strong enough forces to possibly break apart the Universal Constructs that Hegemonies were protecting!","If he himself broke into the Universal Realm, would beings like Ambrose be able to stop him?","At a rank where he would have obtained 50 Billion Dao Galaxies that he could even use to elevate a Grand Dao to a Cosmic one?!","The truly powerful enemy he saw was the mysterious Chronos that could utilize the terrifying Daos of Reincarnation and Chronos, but as long as he used Protagonist's Bookmark and obtained these Daos himself, what was to stop him from being able to stand against such an opponent?","THRUM!","His main body in the Dark Universe had swirling fortune and destiny raging all around him as Noah finalized his thoughts, the Primordial Ruination Clone in the Animus Universe moving across the rivers of blood his Summons and subordinates created as he moved to end the Universal War.","\"Blood debts were repaid by blood.\"","RUMBLE!","His voice reverberated out of the bloody chaotic void as the forces of the 5 Bloodline Races felt their hearts turn cold.","His words also stopped the movements of the Animus Summons that were fused with his clones, their gazes cold as they locked on to the billions of creatures still filling up the legions of the Bloodline Races!","\"Unless something changes...this cycle of bloodshed will continue as by the end of it, you will all face annihilation!\"","WAAA!","\"You followed the aims of Hegemonies as all it led was for the glorious Bloodline Races to fracture, bright Rulers being unjustly taken down as entire races became enslaved. At this point...you all failed! You chose the wrong being to follow. You need direction. You need discipline and true leadership\"","...!","As he spoke, the figure of the Tyrant Dragon let out waves of oppressive power that caused the few remaining enemy paragons to quake, none of them moving forward as his gaze domineering waved over the billions of Monarchs, Great Sages, Sages, and Entities that made up their Legions.","\"True leadership....\"","As Noah said these words, the essence of a certain Dao began to fill up the body of the Primordial Ruination Clone as he prepared for it to be released onto the region with billions of beings wildly.","It was, of course, the Dao of Fealty!","\"To stop all this bloodshed, you all...will pledge Fealty to a single being!\"","The hearts of those that had already become Vassals among the 4 allied Bloodline Races buzzed as the hearts of the 5 enemy bloodline races shook.","They sensed a unique dao beginning to wrap around them with the words of the Tyrant Dragon, his gaze utterly cold as he continued with his words!","\"You will pledge Fealty...or face Annihilation!\"","WAA!","Mana wildly erupted from Noah as the essence of the Dao of Fealty spread throughout.","In front of the eyes of all beings floating amidst the rivers of blood near the Draconic Holy Lands, a prompt appeared.","[In exchange for a portion of his power, bind a portion of your soul to Noah Osmont and become his Vassal. Do you wish to swear Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor?]","Noah didn't even bother hiding his name at this point.","He gave them the same prompt that he gave Valentina, all of the billions of powerful creatures of the bloodline races seeing this prompt appear brightly in front of them as they reached a point of no return for their long lives!","The 10 Animus Summons that Noah controlled lined up behind him as their bodies released horrendous waves of power, the essence of Cosmic Daos leaking from every single one of them.","The wrathful Queen Dowager whose body was bathed by blood for the retribution of her race.","The cerulean crowned boy who held a smile but had eyes filled with a hidden pain as the last being of his race.","The Twin Draconic Serpents that had just joined Noah's ranks.","The luminous Golden Crow with flames scorching the chaotic void, the Galaxy Devouring Serpent, Colossal Helios Leviathan, the kingly Calamity Bear, the vibrant Obsidian Panther, and the star sized Oculothorax carrying out deadly rays of soul destroying light!","All of these beings let out horrendous waves of power as they floated in front of the billions of creatures of the Bloodline Races.","With such a force behind him, Noah's figure of the Tyrant Dragon was filled with regality and majesty as he called out grandly once more.","\"Fealty...or Annihilation.\"","...","Essence began to dance in waves.","The hearts of the fearful Bloodline Races that had seen this singular being survive even attacks of Paragons wavered and shook.","Within their minds, they voiced out.","\"I Swear Fealty...!\"","With their mouths, they called out.","\"I Swear Fealty...!\"","With their actions, they contributed to the birth of a terrifying being.","THRUUUM!","Each of the billions that had begun to pledge Fealty felt mana fill them to the brim as Noah got his first feeling of what Conquest would be like at this moment.","Past the boundary of the Animus Universe, Valentina watched this scene with a sharp light as Oathkeeper and the others watched on with intense gazes!","In the Dark Universe where Noah's main body was, his starry eyes gazed all around him as rivers of Universal Fortune began to form!","The glimmers of gold and wonder raged around him, Marks of Antiquity forming in the hundreds of thousands every second as rainbow colored Dao Galaxies began to light up in his Origin.","It was the boon of Conquest, and it was just a small test of it!"]},{"number":1003,"title":"Chapter 1003: Chapter 1002 - The Strongest Influence in the Animus Universe! II","paragraphs":["The gazes of the Hegemonies still using their power to observe from a large distance turned somber.","They saw the scenes in the chaotic void near the Holy Draconic Lands that was filled with the rivers of blood- they saw the scene where a single being told billions of creatures that before him, they would either have Annihilation...or Fealty!","They all chose fealty as seconds later, the auras of these beings began to crazily rise up as their eyes that were filled with despair and fear a second ago turned into those of shock, and when they looked up towards the figure of the Tyrant Dragon once more, their eyes had a fervent light aside from the fears.","This was because of the power they felt coursing through their bodies!","Yet...the gazes of the Hegemonies were still somber.","This was because they remembered this scene from not too long ago.","The eyes of Oathkeeper and others turned towards Valentina.","They realized the answer to their question of just who she had pledged Fealty to that caused her situation to entirely change as she turned the tables against 2 Hegemonies!","Valentina felt her face heat up at the questioning gazes of the Hegemonies, her figure beginning to waver as she spoke out.","\"I have to go into seclusion and heal. Let me know how we decide to deal with these guys!\"","WAP!","Without another word, she disappeared from the eyes of the Hegemonies as she didn't stay to answer their questions!","Their eyes had to turn back towards the incredulous scene of the Tyrant Dragon as at this moment, the many watching Hegemonies placed him on their watchlist as an important existence to keep track of.","This was because at this moment, he was directly placing his influence on an entire Universe at a rate even Hegemonies didn't dare or had the capabilities to- and these knowledgeable beings knew that when such an existence broke through to the Universal Realm, their Universal Fortune must be great as they would quickly rise in power!","But even these Hegemonies could never expect that Noah's fortune was already more massive than many Hegemonies, the number of Marks of Antiquity he had collected being something that many of them could only ever dream of.","WAA!","The scene at the bloody chaotic void of the area near the Draconic Holy Land turned quiet as Noah's eyes gazed at all the Billions of beings with the Legions of both sides.","Both the allied 4 Bloodline Races and the 5 Bloodline Races that were enemies.","All the forces of these Bloodline Races that had participated in the Universal War had pledged Fealty under his words of Fealty of Annihilation!","His fortune and destiny were swirling crazily around his main body in the Dark Universe, but the eyes of his clone remained utterly cold as with the wild power it showed, a command released from it once more.","\"The strongest of your Races have pledged Fealty...but their Trillions more back in your Holy lands that need to do the same. Only with this path can peace be achieved.\"","\"Set off and spread the word. You've tested the wonders of pledging Fealty...let all your people do the same!\"","...!","The hearts of many beings trembled as they couldn't help but nod, the Legions of many creatures beginning to move as the cluster of forces around Noah began to spread to different directions.","8 Animus Summons shot towards the cluster of 8 Bloodline Races, each of them being Noah's representatives as they would spread Noah's influence to the trillions of creatures spread out across the Holy Lands of these Bloodline Races!","Noah's Tyrant Dragon figure, Tiamat, and the Blue Slime remained in the chaotic void as their eyes turned towards the Draconic Holy Land not too far from them, Noah's command ringing out as the Dragons that were watching this scene in a stupor like many others began to move.","Paragon Quinnie's heart was still shaking as she watched her husband move towards the Serpentine Holy Land with Noah's Galaxy Devouring Serpent in the lead, her gaze turning back towards the Draconic Holy Land that all dragons were heading to as it was time.","Time for them to reclaim the homes stolen from them long ago!","The Queen Dowager was leading the procession of Dragons as a fantastical scene of rows of majestic Dragons making their way towards their Holy Land played out, the figures of the bloodline races that had remained behind within these lands feeling a shocking force come towards them as they would soon begin quaking where they stood.","Tiamat's goal of revenge and reclamation of her home after over a hundred thousand years...Noah would achieve it for her merely days after he arrived in the Animus Universe!","It wasn't the two Hegemonies that were fighting for influence over the last tens of thousands of years...but a Paragon that had risen up in mere days taking the seat of the most influential creature within this Universe!","Waves of change continued to spread out from this moment as many powerful beings moved to understand exactly what had occurred, even more on them focusing on a few figures they had to pay attention to.","Near the Bloody Battlefields Galaxy Clusters where a Universal Construct stood.","Chronos watched as the figures of Oathkeeper and a few others faded away, leaving behind only a few clones from the Hegemonies that had cloning abilities as they kept watch over the events within the Animus Universe.","Chronos stared at Ambrose and the other Hegemonies around him with eyes shining with ancient lights as he spoke, the aura he emanated making these powerful beings all turn towards him as he was the center of attention.","\"Assess the status of all the other Universes and how the rate of Accumulation is proceeding. We need to get a timeline of when everything will come together...and when the Antiquity will be born!\"","RUMBLE!","With a gaze full of relentless might, Chronos forged forward with an unknown goal that the powerhouses of the Primordial Cosmos were currently moving to stop!"]},{"number":1004,"title":"Chapter 1004: Chapter 1003 - A Universal Banquet! I","paragraphs":["Within the Dark Universe.","Noah's main body remained floating amidst the fields of verdant gold greenery while all around him, rivers of fortune and destiny were swirling around brightly, his hands gradually plucking off strings of destiny as he tried to understand his path forward.","At the same time, spatial fluctuations began to erupt not too far from him as his languid eyes turned towards this direction, the appearance of one of his clones coming to fruition as with him...was the slender figure of a captivating woman!","A woman whose aura alone caused the space around her to shake, her dark eyes that could draw in the souls of weak men opening as her aura spread out all around her- her gaze becoming that of increasing shock before her eyes focused on a particular being that was wantonly releasing the Fortune and Destiny he wielded!","Noah's clone faded away as it achieved the task of bringing a powerful Hegemony into the Dark Universe, this Hegemony herself locking her gaze towards Noah as her eyes shone like bright lanterns.","\"This...isn't the Primordial Cosmos!\"","THRUM!","This powerful being sensed it right away, looking towards Noah with shock as the implications of what she found were truly grand!","Amidst the golden rivers of fortune and destiny, Noah smiled lightly as he nodded.","\"Yes. It is the Lost Universe that was fractured from the Primordial Cosmos some time ago, the Dark Universe that is currently under my control.\"","...!","The eyes of Valentina constricted into slits at these calm yet boastful words as she brought herself to purely focus on Noah at this moment.","Truth be told, she didn't even know how to interact with this being as the situation surrounding him was just too special. She had her status as a powerful Hegemony, yet this being in front of her was a mere Paragon...and at the same time the one that she had pledged fealty to and become a Vassal!","'Well, at least that is even bigger than before.'","She tried to simplify her thoughts as she focused on Noah's vast fortune that had become rivers about to form into seas at this moment, her body moving faster than light as she appeared in front of him an instant later and locked eyes with him from a few inches away.","She saw his calm eyes that didn't even flutter, eyes that seemed to show no fear even in front of a Hegemony as he merely looked towards her with a smile! Valentina sighed in defeat as she stared at this being and spoke out.","\"I cannot see through you. What exactly is it that you want? What is driving you to do everything you're doing right now?\"","She tried to understand the being she had pledged her Fealty to at this moment as she wondered what would happen in the future, and she watched as Noah ignored her question and wave his hands to the verdant golden greenery below them, Fruits filled with the essence of laws being plucked and rising towards them a second later as Noah offered her some.","His gaze seemed far away as he thought about her question before he replied.","\"I actually can't give a proper answer to that as my goals have constantly changed over the weeks...\"","Valentina raised her eyes at this as she expected someone to at least say their goals had changed over the years, but she said nothing as she continued to listen!","\"In the past, I moved for the sake of securing my safety, and I later moved for the sake of others where even my entrance in the Animus Universe was for Tiamat. But...\"","A myriad of thoughts crossed Noah's mind as Valentina's question had made him reflective! He thought about the Apocalypses he got past and against the enemies he found, even his current goals where he planned to go on the Conquest of multiple universes!","He might say it was to try and stop the actions of the terrifying Hegemonies following Chronos and whatever they were trying to bring to fruition within the Primordial Cosmos but...even though this was something he wanted to do, he saw it as part of what drove him to make the goal of Universal Conquest.","The even larger part that caused his heart to blaze with ambition...was Antiquity!","It was power!","As he thought about this, he found himself coming up with too many answered as he merely shook his head while looking towards Valentina.","\"Well, it doesn't really matter what my past goals were. For now and in the coming future...my goal is the Conquest of the Universes affected by the Universal Amalgamation that Ambrose and the others carried out, it is to increase my influence at a scale that even Hegemonies could not even dream of as in a matter of weeks or months...I will form my Universal Seed and rip apart whatever plans these beings have.\"","\"...!\"","RUMBLE!","Valentina's eyes shook as she saw the rivers of Fortune above this being churn at just his words- words that were so domineering that even this Hegemony found herself taking a step back!","A claim of conquering Universes as he achieved the Rank of a Hegemony within months.","Not the hundreds of thousands of years it took others, but within weeks or months!","Valentina wanted to call this claim a mere dream but she couldn't bring herself to, gathering herself as she recalled how this being had jumped from Great Sage to Paragon in seconds.","She looked at him seriously as she didn't refute his words and merely nodded. With such a vast fortune swirling around him, who was to say what he could and could not do?!","\"On the way here, Oathkeeper sent a message that in three days, a Universal Banquet will be held in the Elysian Universe to discuss the events surrounding Chronos and the others, as well as the gathering of information on what to do about it!\"","RUMBLE!","Noa's eyes shone brightly at these words as he looked towards the gorgeous figure of Valentina that was looking at him with bright eyes.","\" It will be nearly all of the Hegemonies within the Primordial Cosmos, including many beings that weren't present during the events that occurred today. Among those attending, the invitation was extended to the Tyrant Dragon Paragon that was moving around in the midst of Hegemonies like nothing today.\"","...!"]},{"number":1005,"title":"Chapter 1005: Chapter 1004 - A Universal Banquet! II","paragraphs":["\"...Among those attending, the invitation was extended to the Tyrant Dragon Paragon that was moving around in the midst of Hegemonies like nothing today.\"","RUMBLE!","These words caused Noah's eyes to shine brightly, the idea of meeting even more powerful existences being something he was not averse to!","After all, they would just be lining themselves up for who would be next in line for Protagonist's Bookmark in the coming future.","\"We'll go see what solutions others can come up with, but first...let's power you up a bit before anything else!\"","Valentina raised her eyes at Noah's words as he only gave her a light smile while moving his hands to cause their figures to shift away.","This Hegemony that had lived for a great deal of years was curious how the strength of someone of her level could be further increased, not yet knowing how Noah held an entire library of vast amounts of skills and Skill Trees, few of them being spectacular skills he designed himself as even a Hegemony was about to enjoy the boosts of Noah's System!","As this scene of an introduction of a Hegemony under Noah getting shown around the Dark Universe took place, the events in the Animus Universe were concluding in a spectacular fashion.","Currently, Tiamat was standing on the highest mountain peak of the Draconic Holy Land- a mountain peak that was called the Holy Dragon Mountain that she used to reside on as it was located on the highest galaxy within the many galaxy clusters, all her subordinates climbing towards it whenever they wanted to pay respect!","The Holy Dragon Mountain was shaped in a manner as if it had the jaws of a dragon sharply closing towards the very peak, the area around it filled with an overabundance of essence that nearly formed into thick rivers as this area was one of the many unique locations across the Animus Universe that was at a point where a large amount of essence condensed continuously.","Verdant greenery could be seen all around it as this was the most respected peak any being could ever stand a chance of climbing in the Draconic Holy Lands!","Paragon Quinnie was standing right behind Tiamat atop the mountain as her gaze contained a great deal of memories, never thinking the reclamation of their home land would happen this fast or in this manner.","The eyes of Quinnie were locked onto the single figure that made it all possible, the Tyrant Dragon that had actually turned into a human form as was currently leaning against Tiamat's glistening scales as he took in the spectacular scenery of the Holy Dragon Mountain.","Beside him, Tiamat's eyes were red with emotions as she voiced out towards him.","\"Thank you, not just for keeping your promise but for everything else.\"","...!","The Progenitor of Dragons humbled herself down as she gave thanks to the being that had taken her from Entity to Paragon in a matter of less than 3 months, and he had now given her back her home along with all the retribution she could want!","Something out of her wildest dreams- this being made possible. Yet to all this...Noah just smiled as he patted the scales of Tiamat.","If one wanted to look at the biggest winners of this Universal War and the whole venture into the Animus Universe, there was no bigger winner than him!","He had thundered into the Draconic Holy Land with them and ripped apart any creatures of the Bloodline Races that resisted, the trillions upon trillions that had not participated in the Universal War being given the same option of Annihilation or Fealty!","At the majesty of the Tyrant Dragon as well as seeing a vast number of their own Paragons and Monarchs that had already become Vassals under Noah, the wills of these creatures shattered as they bent the knee soon after.","This meant that among the most clustered locations of the Animus Universe, Noah had already brought the entirety of the Draconic Holy Lands under his heel- his Animus Summons that made their way to other Holy Lands of the Bloodline Races only needing some more time before such a scene repeated itself in the homes of the other Bloodline Races.","After that...with the majority of the powerful creatures within the Animus Universe as his Vassals, it would be another Universe that Noah heavily influenced as his rewards from it were many times over compared to the Dark Universe!","The increased Universal Fortune and Destiny...the explosively forming Marks of Antiquity!","Days passed as a new reality settled into the Primordial Cosmos, with many more Hegemonies that were in the far reaches of the Cosmos or had secluded themselves finding out about the actions that Chronos and a few other Hegemonies had taken.","The new reality of 9 Universes was made clear as the Universal Constructs within each of them continuously pulsed with an eerie red light, gathering the very essence of the Universes while reinforcing the tight restrictions it placed on them!","Such scenes caused many Hegemonies to turn somber, and the auras of many Hegemonies could be felt clustering around the Elysian Universe as Oathkeeper had called forth a Universal Banquet to gather information and look for solutions to these recent actions!","Today was the day of this fantastical Universal Banquet, many beings making their preparations and making their way over to the Elysian Universe as a mixture of powerful beings was about to occur.","Within the Dark Universe, Valentina was shaking her head at the incredulous sight in front of her as she truly saw tens of thousands of Marks of Antiquity constantly forming around Noah every second, the events of the Animus Universe continuing to follow their conclusion as many beings became his Vassals and his influence stretched throughout the Universe!","He had kept the forming Marks of Antiquity hidden these past three days as he didn't want to show off, but Valentina had asked him about it before they set off for the Elysian Universe as he decided to reveal it.","When the Hegemony saw such a scene, a deep blow was dealt to her psyche as she saw this being make the progress she made in years in a matter of hours!","The confidence of a Hegemony that considered herself a one of a kind genius who could even birth a unique Dao was shattered on this day in front of the sight of the existence that was Noah Osmont!"]},{"number":1006,"title":"Chapter 1006: Chapter 1005 - Just Some Random Hegemonies!","paragraphs":["The flowing Marks of Antiquity died down as Noah made them invisible, even the rivers of Fortune that were turning into seas around him fading away as he opened his eyes.","With the recent events of the Animus Universe, he was able to bring his total number of Dao Galaxies from the 40 plus million to over 400 Million- a factor of over 10 times within a short time span as the Animus Universe held significantly more beings than the Dark Universe, and ones with even greater levels of power!","One also couldn't forget Noah's influence in the sequence of events of Universal Amalgamation, this also contributing to the ?bs??n? amount of Marks of Ruination he was able to condense and then fuse them into him to form the Dao Galaxies.","His strength felt boundless at this moment as he shook away the feeling and focused on what was at hand. He looked at those around him- at the beings that would be accompanying him to the Universal Banquet occurring in the Elysian Universe!","The prideful Hegemony of Summoning that had her psyche shaken as she saw things she shouldn't have, her identity as a Universal Realm Hegemony of course granting her entrance into the esteemed banquet.","Noah himself could bring a plus one as among the many beings he could take with him...the figure of a blue haired Ice Queen stood near Valentina with calm eyes and a smile that was enough to shake the kingdoms of men!","Adelaide had a reserved expression as even with a Hegemony nearby, she didn't feel an ounce of fear or apprehension as her eyes seemed to only focus on Noah.","There had been a furious battle in the past three days for the position of who would accompany Noah to a meeting with powerful existences of the Primordial Cosmos, Barbatos and Anna threatening war before they were calmed down, the figures of Elena and Athena being seen around the Universal Core with depressed expressions as they sighed endlessly for being left behind!","It was the reserved Adelaide Belmont who took the spot as at this moment, the Realm of this alluring woman was elevated to a PARAGON after being pumped heavily with the Cores of this rank that Noah had looted in abundance and then duplicated from the Universal War.","PARAGON!","She didn't even care what level her Realm reached as her goal was to always just be near Noah, but he made her enter a Time Space and absorb the cores so that there wouldn't be any mocking or any events where powerful Hegemonies would focus on her as a being that was only at the level of a Great Sage.","\"Everything is ready?\"","Noah's voice rang out light as his main body remained still, his Primordial Ruination Clone appearing in front of Adelaide as he took her hand, Valentina coming to stand beside them with a sigh while steel reeling from her destroyed pride.","The body of the Primordial Ruination Clone was meant to be a dragon in human form, Noah utilizing the Dao of Subterfuge to still release the aura of the Tyrant Dragon while taking on the form of a devilishly handsome man in his 20s, not taking the form of his actual face as he didn't know whether a being like the Cerulean Hegemony he had fought with in the Dark Universe would be one of the beings to make his way into this Banquet.","The bodies of Adelaide and Valentina were both clones as Noah also had this Hegemony learn the Blood Lord Skill Tree, the route of survival and preservation being taken to the extreme as even on an event like this Universal Banquet, clones were sent forth!","Mana began to bubble around their three figures.","The essence of a Cosmic Dao descended down as Noah used the feature of his Cosmic Treasure to wrap its essence around their bodies with their target being a direct teleportation to the Elysian Universe.","WAA!","With a burst of light, their figures disappeared as only their main bodies were left behind in the Dark Universe, their clones shuttling through space as within seconds, they were teleported into the Elysian Universe!","The bright and beautiful Universe where even the chaotic void shimmered gold, the essence of laws around the environment abundant as the mere void of this Universe made one feel they were somewhere special.","\"I'll take it from here.\"","Valentina spoke out lightly as another light of teleportation wrapped around them, taking them from the area Noah brought them to and bringing them closer to a certain location.","It was a bright glimmering galaxy that was surrounded with enormous Golden Chains, looking extremely holy and majestic as even Chronos was not granted entrance into this Galaxy when he came over to the Elysian Universe last time!","When the three of them appeared, a golden light shone from the Galaxy as it seemingly scanned them, a door being created seconds later where they could pass through and enter the galaxy as they were granted an audience.","Their three figures pushed on forward as Adelaide remained tightly close to Noah, Valentina floating in front of them with a serious expression as they stepped into the galaxy that was the birthplace of the special being known as Oathkeeper- it was the Astraeus Galaxy!","It was a planet that was known as the Hallowed Astral Star, a glorious planetary body with incandescent beauty that Noah could see even from afar!","The auras of a ridiculous amount of Universal Experts could be felt on this Planet as behind them, Noah felt an aura of a Hegemony near and pass them as the figure turned around to curiously observe Valentina and then the auras of 2 Paragons behind her before he continued forward onto the Hallowed Astral Star.","Valentina spoke lightly at this scene as they also made their way forward.","\"Many of the Hegemonies you meet are beings that have lived for hundreds of thousands if not millions of years. They have a high level of pride about themselves that Paragons or even those below do not even come into their eyes. I would tell you to be careful in conducting yourself...but I really don't know what you'll do!\"","Valentina felt like she was only getting to know Noah after the past few days, but even she wasn't sure how he would act when he faced the powerful identities of the Hegemonies that were coming from all corners of the Primordial Cosmos.","At her words, Noah only smiled as he spoke lightly.","\"It's just some random Hegemonies we've never even heard of. We don't need to put them in our eyes if they don't put us in theirs!\"","RUMBLE!","His shocking words caused Adelaide to laugh as she looked at him with even more loving eyes, Valentina only shaking her head at the crazy words as they floated towards the Hallowed Astral Star where they could feel the auras of many Hegemonies already there."]},{"number":1007,"title":"Chapter 1007: Chapter 1006 - A Meeting of Distinguished Existences! I","paragraphs":["Within the Hallowed Astral Star.","It was a paradisiacal scene as a lush golden forest filled with mystical vegetation and harmless creatures flew about.","The atmospheric essence within this planet was extremely dense as rivers of essence could occasionally be seen flowing in the bright skies!","Within the skies of this golden planet, an enormous chunk of earth was freely floating as on top of it, the auras of a great deal of Hegemonies could currently be felt.","Many were discussing with each other as the mood was somewhat somber, but there were unique creatures flying about carrying foods and remarkably shimmering drinks that made the mood into one that fit a banquet more.","These creatures held bright gold wings on their back as they were only about a meter in size, commonly known within the Elysian Universe as the Race of Halcyon Fairies!","Their eyes bubbled with joy as they filled the long stretches of tables on top of the floating landmass of the Hallowed Astral Star with appetizing foods, occasionally tending to the Hegemonies that called onto them for specific things.","Within this floating landmass that was a few miles long, Hegemonies from all corners of the Primordial Cosmos were continuing to fly in as many became reacquainted with old friends, other even meeting enemies they had bad memories of as it was a mix of many beings!","Existences at the Universal Realm rarely stepped out of their Universes, being more worried about their own strength and power as they strove to influence many beings in any way they can while collecting marks of Ruination and finding the way forward.","An example was a particular Hegemony we had come to know before, a being letting out a powerful aura as he shone bright blue from head to toe- a cerulean blue crown rotating majestically atop his head.","With an expression filled with dissatisfaction, the Cerulean Hegemony looked around at all the Hegemonies as not a single one seemed to enter his eyes!","The only thing he paid attention to were the conversations, a particular one nearby catching his attention and managing to bring up bad memories.","\"I respect Oathkeeper, but what use is there in gathering us all here? We just need to break the authority protecting those Universes and we can solve all of this!\"","A Hegemony that looked entirely transparent as glass spoke to a humanoid Hegemony as its body trembled with unknown power. The humanoid hegemony only shook his head at the words, replying soon after with a calm tone.","\"I don't think it's just this. There was also the death of the Lost Universe not too long as our Cosmos lost a part of itself, and these actions by Chronos and the others that deal with isolating other Universes...its something even I cannot fathom no matter how much I peer into destiny!\"","RUMBLE!","The reply of this Hegemony made many beings turn to look in his direction, but it caused the Cerulean Hegemony's mood to turn even more sour as he remembered a particularly detestable creature that had stood before him not too long ago and took away his chance to gain a Cosmic Treasure!","The arrival shouldn't have been different than any of the others, but they caught the eyes of the Cerulean Hegemony and multiple other Hegemonies the moment they appeared as within the sea of powerful Universal Realm Hegemonies, they actually saw two Paragons being escorted by a Hegemony.","Paragons!","The figures of the bewitching Valentina and Adelaide walking with Noah's confident and tyrannical demeanor caught many eyes, these three beings landing on the floating landmass as the buzzing of conversation stopped to stare at them.","Noah took in all these gazes with a smile as Valentina's expression became annoyed, pulling Noah and Adelaide towards the food as with her identity as a newly rising Hegemony, she didn't have too many connections here!","\"...I didn't think they let any tom, d??k, and harry come to such important events like this.\"","\"...\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Cerulean Hegemony rang out clearly as Noah turned his eyes towards him, looking towards this being that didn't see through him with great surprise as his eyes scanned him up and down.","The being that had tried to fight with him for a Cosmic Treasure! The being that had briefly crossed the Sea of Ruination and survived...the being that he had planned to rip apart whenever he gained enough power and time to do so.","Noah didn't think it would be this same being that would find trouble with him!","Valentina turned her head towards the direction of the Cerulean Hegemony as she was already in an annoyed mood today after having her genius shattered by Noah, gazing coldly towards the glimmering blue Cerulean Crown as she spoke dismissively.","\"I didn't think so either, but here you are.\"","...!","WAA!","The eyes of many Hegemonies constricted at the fiery reply, the Cerulean Hegemony's face becoming cloudy as power began to emanate from his body in droves. He didn't think any random Hegemony would even dare to reply to him like so, much less when it came to 2 mere Paragons!","The surroundings turned icy cold as the Halcyon Fairies surviving food began to tremble, Valentina's eyes sparking powerfully when she felt the essence the Cerulean Hegemony had begun to release as she seemed fearless.","When it seemed like things were abou to boil over and erupt...","\"Alright, let's settle down and get things started. Many of us are already here.\"","THRUM!","Beside Oathkeeper, another being descended with him as this being received just as much attention- and this was because it was another heavy weight at the same level as Oathkeeper and Chronos!","One of the most powerful beings of the Primordial Cosmos!","This existence was an archaic creature that was born with a unique physique that was made up entirely of the essence of chaos, his entire figure looking like a dark elemental that drew in any surrounding light. Wings that palpated with chaos and destruction unfurled freely behind him as his face was a black hole that could suck in the souls of weak beings if they stared for too long.","It was an archaic Hegemony that had lived far longer than many other Hegemonies- even preceding Oathkeeper himself. The creature that was the first to comprehend the Cosmic Dao of Extinction, the Universal expert that was known as The Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1008,"title":"Chapter 1008: Chapter 1007 - A Meeting of Distinguished Existences! II","paragraphs":["The history of the Primordial Cosmos was something that was known by very few beings.","If there ever existed a being that could give you a thorough history of the millions of years that had passed within the Primordial Cosmos, that being would be the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","A creature born with the unique physique of the very essence of chaos as his figure was a pulsating mass in a humanoid form, vibrant obsidian wings inlaid with archaic runic circles as his head was a swirling black hole.","Such a being had entered along with Oathkeeper as it brought all conversations to a halt!","OOOM!","The surroundings palpated as Noah looked over at this being with sharp eyes.","Even while using Eyes of Truth, this being only had an overabundance of question marks as he couldn't find out much, but he was able to see the Daos this being held that he could use as a target for Protagonist's Bookmark if he wished!","The Cosmic Dao of Extinction, The Cosmic Dao of Chronos, Annihilation...this being was stacked with powerful Daos as he was no lesser than Oathkeeper, possibly even being more powerful in some areas as all the eyes of powerful beings collected themselves around these two figures.","They stood amidst everyone calmly as Oathkeeper was the first to speak.","\"Time is of consequence, so I will not waste yours or mine.\"","The eyes of Oathkeeper shone with a light of power and conviction as he continued, speaking towards tens of Universal Experts that stemmed from many regions of the Primordial Cosmos","\"I called this Universal Banquet here because of the actions of Chronos and multiple other Hegemonies that worked with him to hatch machinations that even now we do not fully understand. One of the purposes of this Banquet is to share information...the other will become apparent after the first is accomplished!\"","...!","Cryptic words left Oathkeeper as his eyes focused on all Hegemonies, eventually coming to land on Noah's calm figure that was one of the only 2 Paragons amongst the sea of Hegemonies!","At this moment, Noah was ridiculously not focused on the discussion that was being carried out, the eyes of many beings coming to land on him only to see him finish putting the savory foods lying on the long tables around them on his plate as he seemed more intent on eating!","\"...\"","Oathkeeper ignored all this as he spoke towards Noah.","\"You were at the center of this when it began. You'll be the first to share.\"","THRUM!","While being stared down by the gazes of these powerful beings, this Paragon didn't sweat one bit as he began to talk..while taking bites of the glimmering golden foods on his plate! Valentina and Adelaide stood beside him with a somber expression as the recounting of the events in the Animus Universe occurred.","Minutes passed as Noah gave out the information he could without compromising any of his information, finally finishing up after nearly 15 minutes as he even put his plate down to give his closing words!","\"All in all, the activated Universal Constructs that have linked together the 9 Universes through Amalgamation are currently drawing in immense reserves of Universal Essence, their goal being a form of unification or...a summoning ritual!\"","RUMBLE","A summoning ritual!","Such words caused the minds of all those listening to buzz as when these aged existences thought about what such a summoning could entail, and their guesses were horrendous, to say the least.","After Noah, Valentina was given the spot light next as she talked about Ambrose and how she nearly destroyed one of the Universal Constructs, more and more information being released on the Universal Amalgamation that had occurred within the 9 Universes as after her, Oathkeeper called upon multiple other Hegemonies that had gone to observe the changes within the Liberated Universe, Necrotic, Microbial, Automaton, Chthonian, Euthenia, Omicron, and the Abyssal Universes.","The discussion lasted for more than 2 hours as the gazes of many Hegemonies were somber at the end of it!","This was when the atmosphere of the banquet changed as everyone's gazes landed on Oathkeeper.","Now what?","WAA!","The pressure Oathkeeper released became even greater as he looked at the powerful Existences around him, his gaze also landing on the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos that was standing behind him.","\"We have to proceed forward, but before we do so, we have to realize that Chronos, Ambrose, Dark Shadow...all of these were Hegemonies we thought did not know or even ?ssociate with each other- and yet they carried out this plan together.\"","...!","\"It means that there is a very real possibility of there being more allies of Chronos and the others in our midst!\"","RUMBLE!","\"What?!\"","Essence vibrated dangerously as the golden sky trembled, the gazes of many Hegemonies turning chilling as Oathkeeper kept his calm and commanding expression.","\"This was the other reason I called you all here...it is because it is time for another Oath! An Oath that lets us know we can trust each other to be on the same side in the future to come...an oath that will tell us if there are any enemies among us that we have to look out for!\"","...!","Many eyes shined brightly as even Noah nodded his head in commendation at such an action!","\"We gathered once before to swear an Oath that gave order to our Primordial Cosmos...we are gathered here again to do the same thing. This time, It will be an oath that is judged based on truth...where as the creator of the Dao of the Oath Keeper, I will know whether you truthfully stand with us or if you are within the camp of Chronos!\"","RUMBLE!","\"We will find out here and now if there are any other beings hiddenly working behind our backs, and only then can we move forwards with a solution.\"","...!","An oath!","The purpose of the Universal Banquet was actually to swear an oath and see who among them were traitors and who stood with them!"]},{"number":1009,"title":"Chapter 1009: Chapter 1008 - The Book of Oaths!","paragraphs":["A buzz of discussions broke out the moment that Oathkeeper finished his words, many Hegemonies having differing opinions about this!","THRUM!","Yet the figure of the Oathkeeper released a terrifying pressure at this moment as his body shone with gorgeous splendor, his voice ringing out again.","\"The Oath is very simple as there is no harm in it and we all only benefit from the security knowing there are no enemies among us. Any Hegemony who shows unwillingness towards this...has something to hide and will be labeled an enemy to be killed with extreme prejudice!\"","WAA!","...!","Overbearing!","Dominant!","The Oathkeeper let out such an aura as all discussions stopped!","He effectively told them that either they agree and make the Oath, or they would be labeled an enemy.","What an awe inspiring sense of power!","This was something that only Hegemonies at the level of Oathkeeper, Chronos, and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos would be able to do. It was restricted to beings that controlled unique Cosmic Laws that others couldn't even dream of.","OOOM!","Mana overflowed from the Oathkeeper's body as in front of him, a golden book materialized as it swirled with a unique dao.","The appearance of this book caused the eyes of many beings to turn reminiscent as it reminded them of years long gone, when many of them broke into the Universal Realm at the moment of their ascension, Oathkeeper appeared in front of them soon after as they swore an Oath with the very same book they were seeing right now!","The process of connecting all of the Galaxies within one's Origin and birthing a Universal Seed was a magnificent affair, the aura of every newly appearing Universal Realm Hegemony when they bloomed their Universal Seed being an event that was sensed across nearby Universes.","Now, this book had appeared in front of the Hegemonies once more!","This was the Book of Oaths that kept all the Oaths under the Dao of the Oath Keeper, a book that had a simple mechanism of requiring a being to place their hand on a single page as they swore an Oath.","The eyes of the Oathkeeper shone with power and might as he glanced at the direction of the nearest Hegemonies, his voice ringing out majestically as his golden hair and bright wings vibrated powerfully.","\"Make the Oath.\"","RUMBLE!","It wasn't a request anymore as it even seemed like a command, yet the common Hegemonies nearby could not deny as they began to step forward!","The first ones were the Hegemonies that were close allies with the Oathkeeper to begin with, beings that he had called upon when the chase with Dark Shadow first began. They stepped forward as the first one placed their hands on a page of the book, calling out loudly.","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos!\"","THRUM!","Like a procession of beings, every single Hegemony went towards the Book of Oaths and made an oath that they weren't enemies or colluding with Chronos and his group!","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos!\"","WAA!","All the Hegemonies nearby had gone as Noah and Valentina's party was up next, Valentina had a sharp light crossing through her eyes before she went forward and placed her palm on the floating book in front of the Oathkeeper.","Her words were light.","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos.\"","...","The page shone gold. The Oathkeeper nodded his head as Valentina stepped aside. The gaze of this domineering being that even commanded Hegemonies then landed on the figures of Noah and Adelaide.","Noah had a light smile as the gaze of this terrifying being focused on him, walking forward with light steps while holding on to Adelaide's hand. The pair of figures looked more at peace than even the hegemonies here, as if they were merely a couple on a sightseeing trip!","And it was actually so for Adelaide as she didn't put any of the powerful beings aside from her man in her eyes, her fair hand being the first to land on the Book of Oaths as she would actually be the first existence at the level of a Paragon to lay their hand on this book.","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos.\"","The book shone gold as the same Oath that was said by everyone else rang out from Adelaide, her figure stepping back as Noah stepped forward while staring at the glimmering golden book. His eyes glimmered with an unknown light as even he was curious how this would turn out!","Adelaide had no care for the events of the Primordial Cosmos as she didn't even know who Chronos was, so he wasn't worried about her.","What about him though? What about the holder of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination that directly opposed the nature of the Primordial Cosmos?!","'Let's see'","With an expectant gaze, Noah's palm landed on the Book of Oaths.","\"...I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos.\"","...","A second passed.","RUMBLE!","The eyes of many Hegemonies constricted as the body of Oathkeeper began to tremble with immense might!","The golden skies suddenly turned oppressive as the attention of everyone focused on Noah at this very moment. Among the groups of Hegemonies that had not yet sworn an oath, their eyes flashed with unknown lights as they seemed to hold confusion.","A change had occurred in those swearing Oaths for the first time today!"]},{"number":1010,"title":"Chapter 1010: Chapter 1009 - Ah! A Cosmic Treasure! I","paragraphs":["While the pages of everyone that swore an oath shone with a golden light, Noah's Oath was blank as it caused changes to appear on the expressions of many!","Valentina's eyes turned somber as she slowly began to step forward in case something happened.","Noah's eyes remained on the book as his palm sank even further into it, his heart calm as he repeated again!","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colluding with Chronos!\"","WAA!","The words rang out for a second time as it was only after a second passed did the book seemingly believe him, shining golden like it had for everyone else before!","\"...\"","The pressure emanating from Oathkeeper died down as his gaze locked onto Noah. Noah's eyes also turned up as he stared at the mountainous figure of the being in front of him as he seemed to have drawn even more attention to himself.","He gave a light smile as he nodded while stepping back, leading Adelaide back to where Valentina was. The Hegemonies in the surroundings su?k?d in their breaths at this scene as the Oathkeeper's eyes returned placid.","Any time the Book of Oaths shone gold, it meant that the being swearing the Oath was uttering the complete truth! White was undecided, and a crimson light meant they were enemies!","\"Continue.\"","His voice was unhurried as he called for the process to continue. Among the Hegemonies that had yet to go, one in the back seemed to have decided something after watching the scene of Noah, this being stepping out as his eyes flashed with an intense light!","His steps were unhurried as he came in front of the book and placed his hand while calling out.","\"I am not an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos, nor am I colludi-\"","RUMBLE!","Before his words even finished, a terrifying crimson light shot forth from the Book of Oaths!","The face of the confident Hegemony rapidly deteriorated and changed!","The golden skies became tinged with red.","The eyes of Oathkeeper became filled with utter coldness as his essence flew out and descended down like tides.","\"Hold on...!\"","BOOOM!","Essence exploded from the Hegemony that had caused a crimson light to rush out of the Book of Oaths before his oath even finished, his body erupted with the essence of many grand daos as he began to move back!","Yet!!!","WAA!","A golden clock appeared in the skies above them as its light focused on him, his figure coming to a halt right after as he couldn't even move.","\"Hegemony Firespark.\"","Oathkeeper's voice rumbled out like an archaic creature bellowing out to lesser beings full of anger, his gaze on Hegemony Firespark being filled with immense coldness and disappointment as the golden Clock in the skies released an intense light to wrap around this being tightly, the Hegemony not even being able to his strength to defend!","\"For colluding with Chronos and holding malicious intentions towards the Primordial Cosmos, only death awaits you!\"","RUMBLE!","...!","\"He shall be held in a Time Prison for interrogation while this procession continues!\"","WAA!","The dominating voice of the terrifying Hegemony that had been able to overwhelm another Universal expert in mere seconds rang out as it shook everyone out of their stupor.","This was the power of the Hegemony that was renowned in the Primordial Cosmos!","One of The Three- beings of utmost power that had the most chance to reach Antiquity!","Chronos, Oathkeeper, and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos.","Even Noah's eyes shined brightly at the scene that played out as aside from the Dao of Chronos and a myriad of other Daos that Oathkeeper had just utilized to render a Universal expert defenseless, he sensed another Dao that he couldn't identify.","A dao that even he couldn't see when he looked in the details of Oathkeeper under the Eyes of Truth!","Such a shocking possibility caused Noah to focus greatly on the next set of events as there seemed to be much more than what meets the eye when it came to this terrifying being!","When Oathkeeper raised his eyes again to stare at the remaining Hegemonies that had yet to swear their oaths, his eyes were filled with a deadly light that caused the bodies of the Hegemonies to tremble fearfully, especially those that had hidden intentions.","After seeing a Hegemony being so helpless in front of the power of Oathkeeper, the remaining beings didn't step forward as a particular Hegemony shining cerulean blue crown holding a cloudy expression couldn't help but speak out!","\"Oathkeeper, you know we all respect your strength, but what if you are wrong? The light didn't activate for the paragon before as something happened, and now a red one shone from Hegemony Firespark as you acted without even hearing him out, where the fates of those of us who cannot resist you will be doomed if the Oath is mistakenly incorrect!\"","THRUM!","The Cerulean Hegemony's words got the agreement of the remaining Hegemonies that held apprehension after seeing the Oathkeeper's decisive actions, but his words only made the gaze of this terrifying being even colder as it focused on him.","Yet the Cerulean Hegemony seemed relentless as his eyes shone brightly, continuing to speak out.","\"Those of us that do not stand on the same level as you cannot resist even if you are wrong, why don't you have someone of your level swear the Oath next?!\"","RUMBLE","The existence with a swirling black hole as a head, his humanoid form seemingly made of a Sea of chaos as his sheer presence palpated with power!","The eyes of all beings turned towards the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos.","The gaze of the Oathkeeper seemed Impartial as while focusing his gaze on the Cerulean Hegemony, he spoke out.","\"The Order of who swears the Oath matters not. Goliath, pacify them and have your Oath done next!\"","OOOM!","To Oathkeeper, it truly didn't matter who went first or last as long as everyone here swore an Oath and they knew who their allies and enemies were!","So the eyes of all beings focused as they waited to see whether the last two times were mistakes, wanting to see exactly what color would shine from a being as terrifying as Oathkeeper swearing an Oath.","Noah's eyes also landed on the terrifying personage with a black hole for a head as an instant later, his colorful eyes shook as the immense fortune and destiny he carried told him something, a light of shock coursing through him!","Oathkeeeper had turned around as the Book of Oaths was ready to accept another palm, everyone expectant on the Goliath to step forward!","RUMBLE!","Seconds passed.","The Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos did not take a step forward.","The black hole atop his head seemed to vibrate greatly, a discernible light of Extinction coursing through it as this powerful existence did not take a single step!","Next, an ancient sigh could be heard.","Oathkeeper's strong expression that had never faltered all this time actually changed, an expression of shock and then anger soon entering his eyes as he stared at the non moving figure of a being that had even preceded him in age!","Thereafter....all hell broke loose!"]},{"number":1011,"title":"Chapter 1011: Chapter 1010 - Ah! A Cosmic Treasure! II","paragraphs":["A sigh that came from an ancient being!","The sigh seemed to be filled with melancholy, holding a great deal of age and vicissitude as the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos lit up with colorfully enticing lights.","The many Universal experts felt their hearts shaking at such a scene, their expressions turning from incredulous to utter shock in the next second as a scene they never would have expected in their wildest dreams began to play out!","The enticing lights that had formed around the Goliath were of course, the lights that represented the essence of Extinction.","Extinction!","Just what did a being need to do to comprehend such a Cosmic Dao?","How stars, Realms, or galaxies did they have to bring to extinction just to gain minor accomplishments within this Dao? What more did they have to do to achieve full comprehension?!","Over the millions of years, just how many civilizations had fallen under the hands of this unique being to bring him where he was today?! The answer was unknown!","But the essence of this being erupted out fully as the moment he chose not to step towards the Book of Oaths, a shocking reality was revealed that even the Oathkeeper couldn't believe.","\"Preposterous! You...you...!\"","Disbelief.","Doubt.","Incredulity!","Even the Oathkeeper was in disbelief as out of everyone within the Primordial Cosmos, the being he least expected to be involved with Chronos and doing something that harmfully affected the Cosmos was the Goliath in front of him.","Yet reality proved different as this shocking scene came to life!","Why? Just why would someone of his caliber move like so? Just what was Chronos doing that he even pulled in a being such as this?!","The events about to play out happened nearly instantaneously when one truly understood the strength that Universal Experts could wield, that in the next seconds the positions of Hegemonies vastly shifted as the scene became clear.","The figure of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos was stretching out its chaotic hand towards the Oathkeeper, the horrendous essence of Extinction palpating dreadfully as it threatened to wipe out whatever it touched.","But this wasn't all!","Behind the back of the turned Oathkeeper that was looking towards the Goliath with unbridled surprise and wrath, there was also something else occurring that others b?r?ly noticed until it fully played out!","It was the figure of the Cerulean Hegemony that had challenged the Oathkeeper and actually called for the Goliath to next, bringing this whole situation to fruition.","It was the figure of Noah's old enemy that had spent 100,000 years to try and obtain a Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, happening to fail at the last moment due to a native with ridiculous abilities.","The cerulean blue crown atop this Hegemony shimmered as it undulated on his body, his mouth opening unnaturally wide while he grew to become over 10 meters tall instantly!","His opened mouth gushed out large waves of water as from this passage, the aura of a single shocking being stepped on the raging blue waves, his arms outstretched as a purple clock had already formed in front of him, his figure entirely coming out of the mouth of the Cerulean Hegemony as it was....Chronos!","He wasn't given entrance into the Astraeus Galaxy as this time around, he snuck in with the invited Hegemonies as a unique ability of the Cerulean Hegemony was utilized to hide his aura until now.","Oathkeeper had called this Universal Banquet to quell out those he couldn't trust, while Chronos was using it as an opportunity to get rid of the being he considered the biggest enemy to the succession of his plans.","Just who would come out the victor at the end of it all?","THRUUM!","The essence of Extinction was striking at him from the front as the chaotic hand of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos had nearly reached him. A pulsing purple clock behind him as the Dao of Chronos was filled with a killing light behind him.","All of it...thundering towards a single Oathkeeper as his eyes were currently filled with wrath! His closest allies were looking at this scene with incredulity as their essence coursed through their bodies, already shooting towards the enemies surrounding the Oathkeeper as they hoped to be able to provide some support!","But...","\"PREPOSTEROUS!\"","BOOOOOOM!","The golden skies shook and sundered.","Such immense and palpable wrath coursed through him that even those glancing at his figure didn't even bother looking for too long, but they couldn't turn their eyes away!","This was because a terrifying aura far superseding that of the Goliath and Chronos appeared at this very moment.","This was because on top of the skies above Oathkeeper, a pristine white disk had appeared.","A hollow disk that looked like a ring of light, shining with immense pure while ?uster as from it, every single creature could feel a type of essence they only came in contact with when they underwent the process of Purification.","It was the Primordial Essence that very few got a chance to come in contact with, and yet this disk was overflowing with it as its intense light washed down on the Oathkeeper and everyone around him, nearly everything coming to a halt!","Many beings looked to the skies in shock as Noah was the one to receive the most shock with his eyes honing in on the enormous white disk.","\"Ah...!\"","This was because he was reminded of an aura of a certain treasure his main body had reforged not too long ago, and this white disk reminded him of it greatly as it was a treasure that stood directly opposite to it in nature!","\"A Cosmic Treasure!\"","Noah unconsciously uttered the words as the incredulous minds of many of the Hegemonies that didn't even know what was happening shook.","As an ?ssassination was about to be carried out, a Cosmic Treasure appeared in the golden skies of the Hallowed Astral Star!"]},{"number":1012,"title":"Chapter 1012: Chapter 1011 - Unbridled Might!","paragraphs":["A Cosmic Treasure!","Noah stared at the shocking treasure that had eclipsed the skies, the pure white disk pulsing with the purest Primordial Essence as it washed down in droves towards the Oathkeeeper.","Towards the outstretched hands of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos and the deadly shimmering purple clock that Chronos put forward, there was just an explosion of white light!","Pure, unadulterated while light that represented the essence of the Primordial Dao as it smashed against both Chronos and the Goliath!","BOOOOOM!","A horrendous sound occurred as normally, space would have torn and shattered as everything became chaotic, but with the appearance of the rivers of Primordial Essence...space was as stable as it could be as this essence that made the Primordial Cosmos truly had shocking effects.","WAA!","Two powerful auras were pushed back from the droves of Primordial Essence rushing down the pristine white disk, crashing onto the bodies of the Goliath and Chronos hundreds of times in the tenth of a second as their own bodies pulsed with the essence of many Daos just to push back the singular Primordial Dao!","When the scene cleared, only Oathkeeper remained standing, his gaze showing immense wrath and disappointment!","His golden hair waved in the sea of white Essence as his golden wings pulsed, his image this time striking itself into the hearts of all beings as he looked too damn dominating.","\"Why?\"","THRUM!","He spoke with unbridled wrath and might as the white disk descended down, beginning to spin crazily as many beings felt like the very air was squeezing around them.","Amidst all of this power, even Noah felt like a leaf just following the deadly winds constantly raging about, his current level of power not being able to do anything about it!","This was the type of effect one could portray when they utilized the might of a Cosmic Treasure to its fullest!","Even against 2 beings at the same stage as him, he was still able to bounce them off!","The figures of Chronos and the Goliath were heavily pushed back as their bodies felt the strain from the shocking Primordial Essence constricting around them, Oathkeeper's eyes focusing on the Goliath.","\"Why?!\"","RUMBLE!","The surroundings only quaked more as the Oathkeeper continued to ask, the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos letting out an aged sigh as he spoke out, the essence of the Daos of Extinction and Chronos weaving around his body swiftly at the same time as he fought back against the Primordial Essence.","\"For Antiquity.\"","....!","THRUM!","It was all for Antiquity!","Even the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos had sided with Chronos due to this as this old being also wanted to grasp Antiquity.","\"I see.\"","The eyes of the Oathkeeper shimmered with an intense ?uster as he spoke.","\"Then...you can die for Antiquity. [Primordial Enclosure]!\"","WAAA!","Essence wildly raged as shockingly, a phenomenon occurred not on this Hallowed Astral Star where the shocking set of events was occurring, but the Astraeus Galaxy itself!","The golden chains that surrounded the Astraeus Galaxy all this time disappeared.","They disappeared as they materialized around the Hallowed Astral Star, their golden exterior shaking and falling off as if it were false gold, a pristine white being seen underneath as it let off intense waves of Primordial Essence!","At this sight, the faces of Chronos and the Goliath changed as Chronos could be seen letting out a sigh.","It was a sigh of melancholy, of a being that had tried to get their way so many times but they still couldn't!","This was actually true as Chronos had lived through multiple lives where he got to this point...and not once had he been able to achieve his goal of taking out the terrifying Oathkeeper and having him out of the equation.","Now in this life, even with him getting the Cerulean Hegemony on top of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos to side with him and bring this opportune scene into a reality, it still didn't change anything!","The first few times when he came to this point in history, his body and soul were ripped apart purely with Oathkeeper's power alone.","A few times after that, he comprehended many more Daos as he became more proficient in the Dao of Chronos, and his power had just b?r?ly been able to cause the Oathkeeper to release his Cosmic Treasure to deal with him.","This was how he ridiculously found out that Oathkeeper was in possession of a Cosmic Treasure!","Now, multiple lives later, he was trying a different path as he got past the point that Oathkeeper summoned the Cosmic Treasure and destroyed all enemies, the power of the Goliath proving to be a tough one as for the first time in all his lives, he saw a new phenomenon where after the Cosmic Treasure appeared, the Golden chains that were tightly wrapping around the Astreous Galaxy were actually long chains of condensed Primordial Essence.","THRUM!","\"Since you are chasing Antiquity with such fervor, you can die for it! Primordial Disk....reduce them to cinders!\"","...!","WAA!","Immense power and might rumbled out as Chronos sighed even more, the light of Extinction around the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos only increasing as he received a message from his compatriot.","'Oathkeeper is just too much. We have failed and shouldn't stay here for too much longer!\"","\"...\"","The Goliath heard these words as a sharp light crossed through his eyes.","They were all of the same levels. So why?... Why was the gap between Oathkeeper and him so large?","No answer could be found as Chronos appeared beside the Goliath with somber eyes. Since they couldn't win against the terrifying Cosmic Treasure and the white chains that threatened to keep them here, they had to retreat!","They then spoke at the same time.","[Extinction Tree of the End Times].","...!","RUMBLE!","A tree with boundless strength of Extinction and the abstruse concept of Chronos began to erupt out and spread its trunk and branches wildly.","It bounced off the pristine chains of Primordial Essence as they dug through the Hallowed Astral Star and stretched towards the space above it, threatening to drown everything out in the decimation of time and Extinction as Oathkeeper would have to focus on this ever growing tree!","Just to make their retreat, Chronos and the Goliath had actually used a fused skill that combined the essence of two shocking Daos!"]},{"number":1013,"title":"Chapter 1013: Chapter 1012 - A Dreadful New Reality!","paragraphs":["In the vast Primordial Cosmos, there were many things that remained a mystery.","One of these mysteries was the concept of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination that one needed if ever they wanted to traverse outside of the Cosmos.","Something that very few thought about though, was the type of essence that birthed the Primordial Cosmos- the essence that purified every single one of the beings within it when they began achieving high enough levels!","There was a Dao of Ruination, and naturally there was the Primordial Dao!","A Dao of utter regality and majesty that as of this moment, the only person to comprehend it within the Primordial Cosmos was the dominant Oathkeeper.","The only reason he did so was because he got his hands on a Cosmic Treasure...on the Primordial Disk that currently covered the skies and sent its pressure down on every living thing within the Hallowed Astral Star!","Even two of the most powerful Hegemonies could not stand against him as they utilized a fusion skill of truly powerful Daos that caused the eruption of the [Extinction Tree of the End Times].","The tree dug through the Hallowed Astral Star the moment it bloomed, beginning to spread out towards the space of the Astraeus Galaxy soon after as it threatened to spread the light of extinction on everything it touched while the light of Chronos threatened to cause everything to fall to the vicissitudes of time as they deteriorated!","It was an attack of wanton destruction as the golden hair of the Oathkeeper flowed calmly, his eyes capturing everything that the moment this tree began budding, he commanded the Primordial Essence to wrap and protect all the guests of the Hallowed Astral Star, his eyes then gazing at the ever growing Extinction Tree as his Cosmic Treasure pulsed to release even more Primordial Essence to wrap around and contain it.","Around this time, the figures of a few Hegemonies began to silently disappear as the Chronos was first, followed by the Cerulean Hegemony and three others as the last to leave while the Oathkeeper was containing the wanted damage of Chronos and Extinction was...the Goliath!","The swirling black hole this being had for a head vibrated with power as he released another sigh, his figure fading away soon after.","RUMBLE!","Essence wildly spread out as a few seconds passed before the shocking growth of the Extinction Tree of the End Times was stopped by the Primordial Essence, this pulsing tree having entirely torn the Hallowed Astral Star in half as its length alone stretched out tens of thousands of miles!","It was a skill cast to bring immense and wanton destruction, but the Oathkeeper that could wield the Primordial Disk and command the essence of the Primordial Dao had an impassive expression as after he contained the growth of the Tree by wrapping it with Primordial Essence, he began to grind it down and cause it to disintegrate at a very rapid pace as tens of thousands of miles of length were eradicated in a second.","An instant later, the Extinction Tree disappeared entirely!","When the Hegemonies looked around in shock and incredulousness, they only saw the shattered Hallowed Astral Star around them as the figures of multiple Hegemonies were missing along with the Goliath and Chronos.","They had many traitors among them it seemed, but they had all been uprooted from this single event as the power of the Oathkeeper was reinforced as the strongest in the Primordial Cosmos!","His power was about to be expressed even more as with a flutter of his hands, it felt like time was moving in reverse as droves of Primordial Essence wrapped around the shattered Hallowed Astral Star, its pieces beginning to come back together as Noah and the other Hegemonies that were still wrapped in a protective light of Primordial Essence watched this same shocking essence weave around a destroyed planet and put it back together as if it was never shattered!","THRUM!","It was a scene of utter majesty and power as within seconds, it was like pieces of a puzzle were coming together as the torn apart pieces of the planet they were on came back together, the golden chains that had become white disappearing as they returned to wrap around the Astraeus Galaxy once more.","\"...\"","Noah looked at this scene with shining eyes as Adelaide grasped onto his hand tightly.","Valentina and the other Hegemonies looked towards the Oathkeeper with slight apprehension and awe at his show of power as the wings of this being vibrated with power, Primordial Essence swirling around him as the scene of him calling the Primordial Disk to reduce in size and fall into his palm was inscribed in the minds of every single being!","Surrounded by a sea of Primordial Essence, he looked like an archaic being from ancient times as with his command, everything was brought back to calmness.","\"...\"","Not a single being spoke as they saw the eyes of the Oathkeeper open, a tremendous amount of pain and wrath hidden within as at this moment, this being felt like the weight he carried on his shoulders had just increased by an even larger amount.","A being he even looked up to and considered a friend...a being even older than him had sided with the enemy side as at this moment, he felt alone!","Yet...he wielded tremendous power as even they could not do a thing against him, not while he was in this Astraeus Galaxy anyways.","Not while he had the chains of Primordial Essence wrapping around this galaxy, the very same weapon that had caused the plans of Chronos to miss once more in this lifetime as they had to run.","But the end of today's events made one thing clear.","The power shift in the Primordial Cosmos had rapidly changed, and they now entered the reality where everyone knew the strongest being of the Cosmos wielded an unstoppable Cosmic Treasure, while the 2 strongest beings that followed him were chasing after Antiquity as they used 9 Universes as sacrificial lambs for something yet to come!"]},{"number":1014,"title":"Chapter 1014: Chapter 1013 - The Start of a Universal Conquest! I","paragraphs":["A new reality was upon them all as Noah was one of the first to witness it, the gazes of all Hegemonies still looking towards Oathkeeper as this being seemed to come out of his melancholy and loot at all of them.","\"That is the threat we face.\"","RUMBLE!","\"False dreams being chased by Chronos as even Goliath was pulled into them! Their chase of Antiquity will most likely just call forth a terrifying force that will not even grant them what they want, but merely cause us all destruction!\"","WAA!","\"That...is what we have to stop!\"","\"...\"","The hearts of all those listening trembled as their eyes were somber, the Oathkeeper continuing with his words as he waved his hands to call forth the Book of Oaths once more.","\"Let's finish this first, and then we can have a brief intermission as I prepare some things.\"","The process of swearing the Oaths continued as there were no traitors after beings like the Cerulean Hegemony disappeared with Chronos, the few remaining Hegemonies all having a golden light shining when they made the oath as it finished just minutes later.","OOOM!","Golden lights of destiny and fate weaved around as this was finished, the Book of Oaths closing and disappearing as a bright golden light began to erupt from Oathkeeper to cover everyone.","\"A change in setting for the allies around us, enjoy the amenities and abodes. We shall resume after a day.\"","The golden light that erupted from him and covered Noah and all the Hegemonies in the surrounding carried with it a spatial light, these beings trusting the Oathkeeper immensely after all this as they let the spatial light carry them to another destination!","When they opened their eyes, they found themselves in the skies of a breathtaking place, a hazy color of golden clouds floating in the skies above them as ambrosial golden mountains stretched out below them.","Upon these mountains were exquisitely designed castles, each of the Hegemonies appeared near one of these castles as the voice of Oathkeeper rang out.","\"This is my Elysian Realm. Choose an abode and relax in here for a bit while I prepare some things. We shall resume tomorrow!\"","The shocking aura of Oathkeeper then disappeared as the Hegemonies looked at each other with different expressions before they shot down towards nearby castles. Many of them had to think about a myriad of things as this paradisiacal environment was as good a place as any, and a few of them felt their hearts needed rest after undergoing such a shocking set of events!","Amidst all this, Noah had a domineering thought that would cause commotion if others ever heard it!","'Well, it's only slightly better than some areas of my Universal Core...'","WAA!","Auspicious essence shone around them as Noah took in the sights while thinking of the shocking set of events that just happened. As if his thoughts could be read, the Cosmic Treasure that was connected to him and had seen the things his Primordial Ruination Clone saw voiced out in his mind.","[That's a portion of what someone at the Universal Realm can do with a Cosmic Treasure. But of course, if one simply goes by its name...it's a treasure to be truly used by beings at the Cosmic Realm!]","A Cosmic Treasure could naturally only be fully utilized by a being in the Cosmic Realm! A being that had become an Antiquity as the might they could display was something unimaginable.","\"Ah...!\"","The breathtaking action of a Cosmic Treasure they just experienced! The paradisiacal Elysian Realm that they just entered!","All of it caused Noah's heart to tremble with excitement as he thought of the future and the fact that he had a night to spend, he looked at Adelaide beside him as he quickly carried the Ice Queen in a princess carry while flying down to the golden castle that was designated as their abode below them.","\"Ah...!\"","Adelaide let out a surprised shout as her cheeks turned rosy, the Ice Queen not expecting Noah to be so bold, even ignoring the fact that Valentina was still around them also enjoying the paradisiacal sights of the Elysian Realm.","The Hegemony of Summoning had her attention taken from the sights as she saw this scene, her face becoming surprised when she saw the eyes of the carried Adelaide look towards her while beckoning for her to also come!","Her!","A Hegemony!","The Ice Queen didn't even leave room for misunderstandings as a second later, she sent a mental message to Valentina before her and Noah's figure disappeared into the golden castle.","\"Come over and join us, there should be nothing better to do in this paradisiacal realm other than this...\"","...!","The powerful figure of the Universal Realm existence stood floating in the skies in a stupor after this, the images of Noah carrying the alluring Adelaide into the castle playing in her mind as she...","---","After the brief respite from the shocking events, the night in the Elysian Realm that was the home of Oathkeeper was that of peace as when morning came, the meeting resumed!","The Hegemonies left the golden castles they were cooped in as from one particular castle, the figures of two magnificent women flew out while Noah followed from behind.","Adelaide had a light smile as Valentina maintained her regal expression, while Noah had a smile of a man that seemed to be at the top of the world!","This was a smile that was being portrayed by a normal clone that had arrived within the castle at some point in the night, the figure of the Primordial Ruination Clone having actually left the Elysian Universe entirely as at this moment, it had teleported into another Universe.","Not the Animus or Dark Universe, but another Universe entirely as at this moment, the light of Conquest was brilliantly shining in the eyes of the Primordial Ruination Clone as he arrived in the Necrotic Universe!"]},{"number":1015,"title":"Chapter 1015: Chapter 1014 - The Start of a Universal Conquest! II","paragraphs":["As the meeting resumed in the Elysian Universe, Noah was already moving forward as the Primordial Ruination Clone was sent into the Necrotic Universe to begin the mission of Universal Conquest.","He was moving relentlessly for his goals as the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos proposed their own methods to battle the risen group of Chronos and the Goliath that were chasing Antiquity!","Oathkeeper reappeared in front of them as he handed out a unique object, this being the item he was preparing the past hours. It was a golden set of wings that fit in the palm of one's hands, a unique type of item that had a shocking usage.","[Wings of Primordial Destiny] :: A Ultimate Dao Weapon forged with the essence of the Primordial Dao as the base, a myriad of other Dao Essences completing it thereafter. It has a communication function of sending an instant message to all other holders of a similarly forged Wings of Primordial Destiny, as well as a spatial function that allows for the instantaneous Teleportation of a few specified beings.","...!","An Ultimate Do Weapon...and Oathkeeper had forged hundreds of them in the span of a single night as he handed them to all the Hegemonies that were now considered allies, as well as Noah and all others that had sworn the Oath.","It was for the purpose of quickly sharing information while being able to call for aid at any moment that one came in contact with the forces working with Chronos!","The mission that everyone left the Universal Banquet with after that...was to gather information on the 9 affected Universes as they looked for methods to enter and find a way to destroy the 9 Universal Constructs that were currently the fulcrums on the continuing Universal Amalgamation.","As for Noah...his plan was to gather a crazy amount of Marks of Ruination through the conquest of the affected Universes, forming his own Universal Seed as when this point came...he could boldly be like Oathkeeper and reveal his Cosmic Treasure, overpowering the shockingly powerful beings like Chronos and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","But...this was thinking too far ahead as at this moment, Noah's Primordial Ruination Clone stood floating in a corner of the Necrotic Universe.","It was dreary and cold in the chaotic void of this Universe, the aura of the law of Death being abundant as this entire universe was an endless land of death!","Terrifying Liches, Abyssal Undead, Ghouls, Galactic Zombies...a terrifying amount of undead permeated throughout as this was a Universe that didn't have any organization, quintillions upon quintillions of Undead spread out across the expansive Universe as very few regions held any organizations.","These were the areas where powerful Lich Emperors or the existences that had stepped on the path of the Cosmic Dao of Necromancy made their homes, causing for clusters of trillions of powerful Undead to crown on Galaxy Clusters and Dead Star Systems.","The Hegemonies of this Universe who comprehended the Cosmic Dao of Necromancy couldn't touch him due to the restrictions of the Universal Constructs...so all his enemies were just the myriad of Undead Paragons spread throughout the Necrotic Universe!","He had to subjugate all of them and make the forces below them pledge fealty, causing the number of his Marks of Ruination to spill over a Billion as at this moment, he was infinitely close.","The trillions more beings in the Animus Universe that had sworn fealty after the battle had ended and his clones and Animus Summons helped spread his influence to the far reaches of the Holy Lands of all the Bloodline Races, the number of the Marks of Ruination had exploded even more as he nearly achieved 1 Billion at this moment!","Nearly 2% of his 50 Billion Marks of Ruination that he could use to forge Dao Galaxies and form enough connections to birth a Universal Seed!","His body vibrated with power as he thought about all this, this figure of the Tyrant Dragon changing as an aura of death began to spread from Noah, his skeletal outline changing as he gradually changed to become a titanous crimson skeleton that had golden flames burning in his sockets.","An obsidian robe draped over him an instant later as a crimson skull staff appeared in his hands- Noah looking like a massive Undead Lich Emperor at this moment as his crimson staff smashed on the deathly chaotic void.","DING!","A ringing of a bell that seemed to be inviting something, and it was the calling of the Nether Lich Emperor under Noah's command, this terrifying Lich rising from the chaotic void as it released a horrendous aura of death, its rise only followed by the auras of millions more of undead beginning to emerge from the void!","KEKEKE!","It released the dreadful aura of a Paragon as its obsidian flames bowed reverentially towards Noah, its staff glowing brilliantly with the essence of two Cosmic Daos that Noah infused this skill with as this Nether Lich utilized [Sagely Necrolords] to call forth 100 beings below its level.","This meant that in the next few seconds, the auras of 100 Abyssal Undead Monarchs of various types began to rise up, the numbers of undead continuing to balloon up as gradually, a vast legion was forming!","But this wasn't all.","For this instance, Noah had prepared himself to utilize some of his Billions of Skill Points on a truly special tree that would be suited for the conquest of a Universe filled with Undead.","A skill tree that Noah designed just for the conquest of a single Universe!"]},{"number":1016,"title":"Chapter 1016: Chapter 1015 - The Rise of the Tyrannical LiChapter Emperor! I","paragraphs":["A skill tree that cost 12 Billion Skill points- and one that held a skill that seemed to make it possible for Noah to call forth more than 1 Lich Emperor.","But was it truly so?!","...Yes! It was so!","The mere descriptions of the skills within the [Tyrannical Lich Emperor] skill tree were absurd, to say the least.","[Summon Lich Emperors](5/5)(ACTIVE):: The user is capable of calling forth a maximum of 5 Lich Emperors at the same stage, their Parameters increased to be 200% of the caster's maximum power.","[Undead of Ruination](5/5) (PASSIVE):: All of the summoned Undead the Tyrannical Lich Emperor are branded with an Undead Ruination Aura. The Undead Ruination Aura grants +100,000% Ruination Damage, +100,000% Poison and Vitality Decay Damage, +100,000% Increased Resistance to All Laws and Daos, 20% of All Damage is Converted to Health, and it allows for the collective bearing of all damage dealt to be distributed to the entire Legion.","[Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death](5/5) (PASSIVE):: A constantly swirling ring of death filled with the essence of the Daos of Ruination, Annihilation, Decadence, Destruction...and the Dao of Withering begins to rotate around any Undead Legion that the Tyrannical Lich Emperor called forth. The greater and more powerful the number of Undead, the more potent and deadly the Necrotic Ring of Death will be.","[Endless Torment](5/5)(PASSIVE):: Any poor soul that manages to fall within the bounds of the Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death is burned to fuel the power of the Ring of Death even more, every additional being that dies within it adding 10% Increased Damage and area of effect for upto a maximum of 1,000,000% for 60 seconds.","A gorgeous skill tree!","A single Active Skill with the rest of them being Passive, one that didn't just give Noah the capability to call forth 5 more PARAGON Level Lich Emperors- but also brought to life something that Noah considered a method that would put to shame most killing machines.","Without a delay, he started by casting [Summon Lich Emperors].","THRUM!","KEKEKEKE!","Eerie sounds began to permeate throughout, Noah waving his staff madly as he lost himself in the wonders of playing with fearsome Undead creatures, constantly pouring his mana out as after the Lich Emperors at the level of Paragons rose up, their bodies lit up with the glorious light of death as they smashed their staff into the chaotic void- causing the auras of 100 Monarchs to rise from each of them and below them, thousands of Abyssal Undead Great Sages and tens of thousands of Undead Sages began to rise.","It was the grand Symphony of Death ringing loudly once more as Abyssal Skeleton Kings, Dullahans, Undead Dragon Emperors, Unholy Phoenixes...a myriad of Undead rose from the newly summoned 5 Lich Emperors and the initial one that stemmed from the skill tree of the Nether Lich Emperor!","Hundreds of thousands turned to millions as very soon, millions turned into hundreds of millions as a truly large number of undead permeated around Noah as he cackled wildly.","This was because as the Legions of Undead formed, the skill of [Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death] passively came online as a storm of essence containing coagulated forms of blood and bones rose around the Undead Legions like a rotating cloud of death!","It truly and majestically was a Necrotic Ring of Death forming, the essence of all of Noah's currently comprehended Daos beginning to swirl in a circular motion as with the dense aura of death, bones and skulls could be seen within the swirling ring of death that threatened to drown out any enemy it touched.","\"Ah...!\"","Noah's heart felt fulfilled as he looked at such a scene- as if he had fully accomplished a skill that could grind down any enemies he touched the moment they even came across his Legions of Undead!","THRUM","\"Move out and lay Devastation...any fallen enemies will only elevate the strength of the Legion!\"","OOOOOH!","The jaws of an innumerable number of undead vibrated as the Lich Emperors let out gleeful cackles.","KEKEKE!","The Lich Emperors burned with a light of death and ambition as they waved their skull staffs forward, bellowing out grandly as their voices reverberated across the chaotic void.","\"Spread the glorious light of death!\"","WAA!","\"For the will of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor!\"","OOOOH!","\"For death and destruction!\"","OOOOH!","\"For the Legion!\"","RUMBLE!","...!","With a Legion capable of swallowing and decimating entire star systems just from the Necrotic Ring of Death swirling around nearby miles, Noah advanced forward as he led them all at the forefront.","He was ready.","He was ready to give the offer of eternal Death to the Undead of the Necrotic Universe...or the choice of Fealty!","---","Hidden within the folds of space within the Necrotic Universe, the Hegemony of Necromancy that was the terrifying Lich who attacked Valentina along with Ambrose not too long ago was watching the appearance of a single Lich that multiplied to become more than 6 Paragon Undead Emperor Liches, a horrendous Undead Legion of ridiculous size forming as the collective pressure it released was something even the Hegemony of Necromancy had not come across before.","It's terrifying sockets burned with wrathful flames as it was currently situated next to the Galaxy Cluster that the Universal Construct of this Universe was anchored to, continuing to watch the movements of a certain being that had become one of the centers of focus that he and the people he worked with had to look out for!","It was the being that had become the most influential existence within the Animus Universe in the span of a few days, establishing his dominance over the Supreme Bloodline Races as at this moment, all the forces of the Universe would be consolidated by him in due time.","Chronos had told them to pay more attention to this being if ever he moved within the Universes they protected, and the Hegemony of Necromancy had picked up on the aura of the Tyrant Dragon seconds after its arrival as he watched this creature transform into a genuine Lich Emperor as soon after, entire Legions of terrifying Undead surrounded him!","\"Dangerous!\"","Yes! This was the word that came into the Hegemony's mind when he saw this being that was just a Paragon.","The prowess and mystery surrounding him was too eerie as even when Dark Shadow had moved against him, this creature still did not die!","And they could not even personally move against him due to the restrictions they themselves laid down with the Universal Constructs, so all they had to utilize at hand...were the most powerful Paragons of their Universes.","The essence of Necromancy pulsated from the Hegemony dangerously as a raspy voice came from it.","\"Don't let this force make a landfall in the Necrotic Universe. Gather all the Abyssal Undead and Ancient Undead near the Death Void Valley region and stop them before they even begin to spread!\"","RUMBLE!","The essence of Death ran rampant as a Hegemony stood far above every existence within the Necrotic Universe, and they were currently moving many pieces as they played a game of chess with a Tyrannical being that was known to simply mess up all the rules of the board!"]},{"number":1017,"title":"Chapter 1017: Chapter 1016 - The Rise of the Tyrannical LiChapter Emperor! II","paragraphs":["Important Author Note- Revised the ability of [Endless Torment] to have a cap of +1,000,000%. Thanks to a reader for pointing it out!","----","Across the uncountable number of Galaxies in the Necrotic Universe, the Death Void Valley was a region that held hundreds of barren Galaxies structured to form an ascending Valley across the deathly chaotic void.","Across this Death Void Valley, a unique clan of Ancient Undead Titans was the ruling class- these powerful and gigantic Undead commanding power and awe among all the Undead occupying the Galaxies of the Death Void Valley!","At this moment, the Legions of the Ancient Undead Titans formed an uncountable number of lines as they occupied large regions of the chaotic void, moving outward from the Death Void Valley as they led all the other Undead Clans within this region under the command of the Hegemony of Necromancy.","OOOOM!","The essence of death and decadence permeated throughout the billions of Undead clustering together to form the Legions, but it was the thickest around 10 areas- and this was where the Paragons that led the clans of Undead were at!","Among these 10, the densest area of death surrounded an Ancient Undead Titan PARAGON that sat on a throne of regal purple bones, his figure being over a few miles long as he was truly enormous!","His body was filled with tout steel like muscles that wrapped around his entire skeletons, his skull being the only thing showing its obsidian bones as a purple crown of bones gracefully floated atop it.","The other Undead Titans behind him were of slightly less similar stature, their Legion looking extremely imposing as it was the largest out of all those here. This being sitting atop the floating throne of bones was Lich Emperor Agobo, and he had been born in death...and molded by it!","He knew death so well that he very easily ?ssimilated the Dao of Decadence in a short period of time, and at this moment he was already speedily advancing in the Dao of Necromancy, but he had yet to see death in the form that he was currently observing.","Even when he put aside the overpowering auras that the Paragons within the enemy forces were releasing, what was most distressing was the fact that in the surrounding miles of the enemy Legions, there was a dense and destructive cloud of essence and bones rotating dangerously.","It seemed like this cloud would be destructive for anyone even coming across it, but the Lich Emperor Agobo did not know exactly by how much!","But...","\"It matters not.\"","RUMBLE","\"At the end, death shall consume all.\"","OOOOOH!","The aura of the Lich Emperor Titan flew out wildly as the Legion before him bellowed, other Undead Legions following as billions of Undead that formed mountains began to move forward in the chaotic void.","To their relentless advancement, the enemy responded by sending forward one of terrifying Undead Paragons, a Lich Emperor burning with golden flames in its sockets as its expression was that of pure arrogance!","Even with no facial muscles, the domineering stature of the being that sat on the multicolored throne had developed could instinctively be felt as he teleported from hundreds of miles away, coming a few miles away from the Legions that Lich Emperor Agobo led as he voiced out.","\"Before we begin I shall tell you all...that you can avoid eternal Death by bending the knee at this moment and pledging Fealty to me, not some Hegemony that cannot even do a thing with this Universe!\"","...!","\"This is a way out from you following the words of a selfish being bent on searching for Antiquity that will bring destruction to us all.\"","RUMBLE","The aura of the Undead Paragon spread out majestically as the essence of a Cosmic Dao pervaded throughout.","Lich Emperor Agobo looked at this as he stood up from his regal throne of bones, his ancient voice ringing out flatly as his eyes began to shine with a powerful purple light!","\"There is no need for words between the Dead. Let us simply fight to see which side is more proficient in death!\"","WAA!","At such words, Noah laughed brilliantly as he tapped his skeletal hands on the throne, the Undead Legions behind him moving forward with fervor!","When they moved, the swirling Necrotic Ring of Death moved with them as Noah teleported back into their ranks, keen to see the results of the wondrous skill tree.","The words of the Lich Emperor Agobo rang out in his mind as he was given a lesson for the Undead- all that mattered was who would be more proficient in death.","And when it came to this...","He really thought nobody could match him!","THRUM!","The hundreds of miles were quickly covered as the forces were about to clash, Agobo's hand thrusting out along with multiple other Paragons as their essence flew out powerfully to wrap around the edges of the Ring of Death before the contact between the two sides happened.","But...","They began to experience the ridiculousness of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor first hand as the over 1 mile Necrotic Ring of Death that surrounded the now billions of Undead Noah led come in contact with the forces of Undead under Agobo seamlessly, the essence they threw out not being able to hinder it!","They ranged from Entities and all the way to Monarchs and Paragons, and they saw how the essence of Agobo and others meant to stop the cloud of death from enveloping them was useless, simply passing through the swirling ring of death as if it wasn't even there, the swirling ring covering over 100,000 Undead a second later.","The scene that occurred thereafter was extremely crucial to understand.","It dealt with the particular ability of Endless Torment that was just freshly created!","[Endless Torment](5/5)(PASSIVE):: Any poor soul that manages to fall within the bounds of the Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death is burned to fuel the power of the Ring of Death even more, every additional being that dies within it adding 10% Increased Damage and Area of Effect for up to a maximum of 1,000,000% for 60 seconds.","The skill of [Endless Torment] granted +10% Increased Damage and Area of Effect for every creature that died within it for up to a maximum of 1 million percent. 1 million!","The Necrotic Ring of Death was already deadly enough as no Entities or Sages could withstand the constantly rotating cluster of all the Daos Noah comprehended- which included two Cosmic Daos!","When the Ring of Death covered just a few tens of thousands of Undead, the first Undead Entity to fall granted the 10% increase in Damage and Area of Effect. Instantaneously, the Ring of Death became larger as it expanded to cover a slightly wider area.","Then the second...third...one hundredth...","Within the span of milliseconds, over a thousand Undead fell from the terrifying cluster of sharply rotating flesh and bones mixed with the Essence of too many Daos!","AOE!","The area of effect was also increased by 10,000% as it covered over a hundred miles instantly and continued to expand, every single death causing it to propel outwards at a ridiculous pace as over one fourth of the Legions that the Lich Emperor Agobo led become covered in the Necrotic Ring of Death instantly!","A millisecond later, it had covered such a large region that the numbers dead bloomed to millions!","THRUUUUUM!","The deathly chaotic void began to tremble as a shocking phenomenon was about to take place- all of it due to the fact that in just a second, the 1,000,000% cap of Increased Damage and Area of Effect of the Necrotic Ring of Death was reached!"]},{"number":1018,"title":"Chapter 1018: Chapter 1017 - Billions Dead in Seconds!","paragraphs":["It truly happened too fast that even Noah was caught off guard by it.","The mountains of Undead that the Lich Emperor Agobo covered tens of thousands of miles as if one were to look at from a far distance, they would almost mistake the mass of creatures for moving planetary bodies!","All of these beings numbered in the billions and over ten Paragons and hundreds of Monarchs were among them.","When the Necrotic Ring of Death spread out, it bloomed beautifully as the chain reaction of deaths and expansion of the area of effect caused it to hit 1,000,000% in a few seconds, and this 1 million was enough for the circular dreadful Ring of Death to occupy over a million miles...covering the entire Legions of Billions of Undead!","...!","Lich Emperor Agobo trembled as he felt the swirling tide of death instantly spread out to even reach him, his purple throne of bones becoming decimated an instant later as he felt a heart rending pain from the swirling Daos within the rotating Ring of Death.","\"OOOOOOH!\"","He bellowed out painfully as his body lit up with a gorgeous obsidian purple ?uster, this essence covering his body protectively as he could do nothing else but focus on defending!","Mind you, the +1,000,000% was also an increase in All Damage. If Paragons were having trouble dealing with it as they fought for their lives...","Agobo b?r?ly raised his titanous body as his flaming eye sockets looked around, the flames within flickering incredulously as he saw the Monarchs that were beside him were already turned into nothingness!","The Great Sages...just a pile of bones that joined the Necrotic Ring of Death!","The Sages and Entities...were even the first to die as they helped bring this terrifying reality to fruition.","When one pulled really far back and looked at the area where the Legions of Undead that Lich Emperor Agobo led, they would only be able to find a terrifying swirling mass of bones and Dao Essences destroying everything within over 1 Million miles of the chaotic void!","The only thing visible was 10 PARAGONS that were b?r?ly hanging by as every passing second the cloud of swirling death tore apart their defenses, the light of protection seeming like a flicker in the night as it could go away at any second.","So out of the billions of Undead that formed the Legions Agobo led with the command of the Hegemony of Necromancy...only 10 Paragons remained alive.","\"...\"","Silence.","Stupor!","Horror!","RUMBLE!","Billions were dead in an instant.","Entire Legions of Undead!","The watching Hegemony of Necromancy that was getting ready to observe a long and drawn out battle to better understand this enemy that Chronos and the others couldn't figure out found his skeletal jaw nearly falling off.","The newly summoned Lich Emperors that Noah called forth who were about to lead their forces to attack...even they were silent as the flames in their eyes stared towards the being that had summoned them in shock!","Mind you...none of the Undead from Noah's Legions had even attacked their enemies, they only came within a mile of them before the Necrotic Ring of Death met the first enemies and then expanded to cover over a million miles just seconds later.","But it wasn't just the Hegemony of Necromancy and Lich Emperors that were shocked, even the caster and the creator of the skills that brought everything to fruition...even Noah had no words as he watched this shocking scene!","This...this was a bit too powerful!","Maybe a tad bit overpowered!","\"Hmmm...\"","Noah sat on his throne of Dao Essences with his skeletal hands propping up his chin, seemingly lost in thought as he had risen to a stage where he wiped out hundreds of millions of Entities, Sages, and Great Sages within seconds- Monarchs taking just a bit longer as only Paragons remained while fighting for their lives with the overwhelming damage that the Necrotic Ring of Death was dealing!","The skill tree bordered on the side of balance shattering as even Noah was taken aback, recalling the 12 Billion Skill Point price tag for this skill tree.","As for its effects of decimating all of the enemy forces in seconds?","Well, he needed to have at least some of his enemies alive for them to swear fealty!","Nothing would come out of him erasing billions in seconds except instilling a deep sense of fear, and this thought reminded him of the 10 Paragons that were about to have any spark of life extinguished as they faced eternal Death.","His golden flame within his eye sockets flared as his essence moved, a prompt appearing in front of these 10 Undead Paragons as Noah tried to salvage the situation!","RUMBLE!","The prompt appeared brightly in the minds and vision of the Paragons that nearly had their lives snuffed out from the ridiculous skills, Lich Emperor Agobo being the first to look upon this prompt as his mind sent his thoughts forward soon after.","He had told something to Noah before the battle began less than a minute ago that was very clear in his mind.","'There is no need for words between the Dead. Let us simply fight to see which side is more proficient in death!'","No words needed and which ones were proficient in death!","The being that even the Hegemony he followed told him to stand against...was too damn proficient in Death.","\"I Swear Fealty to the Tyrannical Lich Emperor.\"","THRUM!","The strongest lich Emperor took the first step, the remaining 9 followed before their lives were snuffed out by the terrifying swirling mass of death and destruction!","...!","Similar to the Legions of Undead Noah brought that weren't affected by the Necrotic Ring of Death, these Undead Paragons now joined the same ranks as they enjoyed the perks!","Lich Emperor Agobo's purple flames shook as he stared towards the Tyrannical Lich Emperor sitting upon an enormous multicolored throne.","The Ancient Undead Titan fell to his knees a second later as he called out reverentially.","\"Tyrannical Lich Emperor!\"","RUMBLE!","The first Undead Paragon kneeled as the other 9 soon followed, a shocking scene playing out in one corner of the Necrotic Universe as many of the beings watching it found themselves watching a stupor.","Noah himself was given a bit of a shock at what he had done as his skill creation this time had been a tad bit too broken, his first battle within the Necrotic Universe ridiculously finishing in seconds as only 10 of the strongest beings were able to pledge Fealty!","It was the birth of an Ultimate skill tree that could be used to end all battles, the birth of a set of skills built for brutal Conquest!"]},{"number":1019,"title":"Chapter 1019: Chapter 1018 - Know your place!","paragraphs":["The Hegemony of Necromancy watched the kneeling of 10 Paragons with a cloudy face as the flames within his eye sockets burned dimly.","He questioned the reality that just played out as the essence of Necromancy swirled around him, and even he could not make heads or tails of it!","The enemy seemed unrivaled within the same level as even when faced against beings at the same stage as them, they still managed to wipe them out in a ridiculously short period of time.","And yet he, the Hegemony of Necromancy with all of his power...could not move against this Paragon!","RUMBLE","His essence bubbled forth as he sent a message across Universal Boundaries to a certain person.","\"Chronos, this Paragon might prove to be a greater problem than expected. His power seems unrivaled on the same stage!\"","...!","The message traveled far as it reached the calculating Chronos that just had a major set back and was currently watching the Universal Construct within the Microbial Universe while being accompanied by the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos along with the Cerulean Hegemony and a few other Universal experts.","They were observing the absorption of Universal Essence by the Universal Construct as it released a pulsing crimson light every second, the treasure that looked like an object gradually beginning to form a material around it that would make one think of a cocoon!","Chronos received the message from the Hegemony of Necromancy as his eyes became even more somber, turning to follow the path of the Universal Essence being absorbed by the Universal Construct as it wasn't just from the Universe itself, but the inhabitants of it themselves!","This was a secret that even Noah didn't fully know, the fact that one of the mechanisms of the Slaughter Star Monoliths was to also draw in the essence of the beings that were following the wills of the Hegemonies that had their Origin Essence branded into these Universal Constructs.","This was why the Hegemony of Slaughter, Ambrose, had worked so hard to establish his dominion in the Animus Universe, and it was also why Chronos had recruited a Hegemony or two from each of the 9 affected Universes and had them increase their influence and dominion over its vast populations for the past hundreds of thousands of years!","It was also why the Universal Construct within the Animus Universe was currently drawing in the least amount of essence out of the 9 Universes- because Ambrose had his influence shattered completely within this Universe as it could only draw a small portion of essence from the Universe itself.","He began in the Animus Universe, and now he had started in the Necrotic Universe as well.","\"Tyrannical Emperor, huh?\"","Chronos called out lightly as he looked within the memories of all of his past lifetimes and confirmed he had never come across this being before.","His words caused the Goliath and the other Hegemonies to look towards him as the irritated Cerulean Hegemony spoke out lightly.","\"Still the same Paragon causing us problems? You always think of everything, don't tell me you didn't account for a powerful Paragon appearing in the targeted Universes and causing you problems.\"","RUMBLE!","The Cerulean Hegemony that was still irritated by all of his plans to obtain a Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Dao of Ruination to go up in flames was gradually revealing his true nature as he lost all decorum even with those he worked with!","His voice carried a hint of a mocking tone as he continued.","\"The Great and powerful Chronos actually has something he didn't account for after all this time, who would have thou- Huk!\"","An eruption of essence exploded out an instant later as the blue crown atop the head of the Cerulean Hegemony trembled, inexplicably finding his body drawn towards Chronos as an instant later, his neck was clasped by him tightly!","WAA!","A horrifying pressure released from Chronos as he turned his calm eyes towards the Cerulean Hegemony.","\"I've put up with your attitude for many years that you may have forgotten, you are not one of the three goliaths of these Primordial Cosmos.\"","BZZZT!","The horrendous and overpowering essence of Chronos flowed out freely as the Cerulean Hegemony could not break out of the grasp, his eyes turning red as he saw the eyes of other Hegemonies around them look towards this humiliating scene, with the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos not even turning to look as the back hole atop his head continued staring at the pulsing cocoon forming around the Universal Construct.","\"You are slightly powerful from other Hegemonies, but that is it. You need to know your place and not step out of your bounds!\"","RUMBLE!","A shockingly domineering set of words came from Chronos as he released the Cerulean Hegemony, the glimmering blue of this expert dimmer as he looked extremely angered by this action but he...did not retaliate!","This was because the person who put him in place was too terrifying, and he had long ago agreed to work with him and his group as after his loss of the Cosmic Treasure of Ruination, all he had left was the promise of Antiquity that came from one of the Universal Constructs in front of him.","So he stayed in line as he moved back, not meeting the eyes of the other Hegemonies as he simply looked ahead.","\"...\"","This was power!","Chronos didn't bat an eye at this as he spoke.","\"The Paragon going on a path of Conquest is a minor problem that can become a big one. He's only just begun, but he's disrupted the flow of essence in the Animus Universe, and now he's moved on to the Necrotic Universe.\"","...!","\"His power is great that he is unrivaled among Paragons, and we cannot personally attack him with the strength of Hegemonies so...we will just devise a plan for something that can!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1020,"title":"Chapter 1020: Chapter 1019 - The Burning Light of Conquest! I","paragraphs":["As the group with Chronos monitored and planned, another group was also observing Noah's movements carefully!","The group of Hegemonies that had all sworn an Oath under Oathkeeper were keeping watch over the happenings of the 9 affected Universes, and two Hegemonies were doing so for the Animus and the Necrotic Universe.","They had seen the nearly completed Conquest of the Animus Universe, and now a Hegemony watched the movements of a certain Tyrannical Lich Emperor as it began Conquest in the Necrotic Universe!","Through the [Wings of Primordial Destiny] that the Oathkeeper had just forged, a message was sent as this situation became known by many Hegemonies.","Not too long after, a spatial light erupted out from the Wings of Primordial Destiny that the Hegemony currently outside of the boundary of the Necrotic Universe held, the oppressive and domineering powerhouse that was Oathkeeeper himself appearing soon after!","His eyes squinted as his golden hair flowed beautifully, looking at the scene in the small corner of the Necrotic Universe where a terrible swirling mass of death surrounded billions of Undead that just shattered entire Legions in seconds.","Oathkeeper looked at this as he raised his Wings of Primordial Destiny and spoke into it.","\"Is this your work in the Necrotic Universe?\"","The message crossed the vast distance as it reached a singular being...Noah himself!","He had stashed away the Wings of Primordial Destiny into his Expansive Space as it rang out and he heard it clearly, his brow rising up at the straightforward manner of this powerful being as he replied with but a single word.","\"Yes.\"","RUMBLE!","He hadn't particularly tried to hide what he was doing, and he had no need to do so as with the current reality, no Hegemonies could touch him!","The ones in the 9 targeted Universes could not, and he used his clones for any time he traversed in the Primordial Cosmos. His main body was stashed away in the Dark Universe that was floating peacefully in the Sea of Ruination, and he even had a Save Point active in case of any mysterious or sudden deaths.","Simply put...he wasn't afraid!","But he also didn't want to border on the side of arrogance and shoot himself in the foot, so he took things as they came and evaluated them while changing plans along the way.","The plans of Conquest...they would in no way be affected by the fact that others knew it was him doing it.","It would actually be even better if his notoriety spread, where even the Universes he targeted next would know of him so that his might can be something as magisterial as beings like Oathkeeper, Chronos, and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","With a mention of their names...even Hegemonies turned somber!","So he replied simply towards Oathkeeper, and as for the reason he was going from the Animus Universe and then the Necrotic Universe in a campaign of Conquest?","He would just bullshit his way across as they didn't know he was doing it to collect Marks of Antiquity!","\"Yes, this is my method to help take down Chronos and his followers...to reduce the influence they hold over the natives of all 9 universes as this should reduce their power over the Universal Constructs- as it seemed influence was very crucial to even begin the Universal Amalgamation!\"","Noah's words caused Oathkeeper's eyes to shine brightly as what he thought was just a pile of bull was actually very close to the mark! They seemed so logical that Oathkeeper nodded his head as he recalled the scenes of the Universal War in the Draconic Holy Lands, and now this same being began to wage war in another Universe as he seemed to be on a path of Conquest!","\"Conquest...\"","Oathkeeper uttered these words slowly as he became lost in thought, coming back to focus a second later as he sent back a message to Noah before he disappeared from the boundary of the Necrotic Universe.","\"Share this type of information with others earlier as we're all going for the same goal. Also, the natives of the 9 Universes...they are existences with homes and families as well, I hope you can bear the responsibility of your actions depending on how far you go with your Conquest!\"","...!","Noah received the message clearly as his eyes glimmered with a bright light of conviction and strength.","Conquest leading to Marks of Antiquity.","Marks of Antiquity leading to a Universal Seed that would bloom into a Universe!","From a Universe and into a stage nobody had reached in the Primordial Cosmos...it was the Universal Filamanets that would pave the way towards Nirvanic Antiquity, towards the Cosmic Realm!","RUMBLE!","His eyes turned up as he saw his rivers of Fortune and Destiny still as bright as ever, the Marks of Antiquity continuing to increase at an even faster pace as this was around the time that the Emperor Penguin, Barbatos, Morgana, the Sword Emperor...all of his Subordinates- it was around this time that they fully dominated all of the densely populated Clusters of Galaxies within the Animus Universe.","Every location they went to, the call of Fealty spread as Noah's clones were there overseeing everything, where the majority of powerhouses within this one Universe could now be considered under Noah.","That was an uncountable number of trillions!","WAA!","Around the figure of his main body in the Dark Universe, a glorious amount of golden Marks of Antiquity raged as Valentina looked at this scene while shaking her head at its sheer ridiculousness.","They weren't alone as their setting had changed in the Dark Universe, the rigid mind of Valentina being won over by a relentless Adelaide as at this moment, Noah was sitting down in a meditating position at the roof of a high rise building that was made entirely of glistening diamond glass that he designed with the [Architecture] feature of the Universal Core.","It looked like a building one would find in a technologically advanced world far in the future, Noah currently being on the highest floor of this high-rise building as one could see a wide pool lined up by glass that was filled with hot steaming water!","Not too far from the steaming pool was a table containing an overabundance of fruits, and an enormous fluffy bed that could fit over 10 people was on another side of the roof of this high-rise building that touched the pristine clouds in the skies.","Within this roof, one could see the figure of the original bodies of Barbatos enjoying the steaming pool with an annoyed expression, Adelaide lying on the bed alluringly as Valentina was dressed with a graceful white robe while staring at Noah's figure as he was submerged with the Marks of Antiquity!","At this time, Noah opened his eyes as he looked towards Valentina with a smile and asked.","\"The Conquest of the Animus Universe can be considered complete. You want to get started with the probing attacks?\"","...!","A devilish smile could be seen on his face as he said this, revealing another part of his plans aside from Conquest as it involved utilizing the Hegemony that had become a part of his forces!","Valentina now held many things as part of his forces, but the most important one remained the fact that she could now utilize clones.","The other method Noah planned to use to dismantle the Universal Constructs and the plans of Ambrose and Chronos involved Valentina using her clones to rush into the only Universe she could enter as she laid out relentless attacks, where even the deaths of the Clones were inconsequential as all she would need to do was to wait until her mana reserves refilled to Summon more clones and hound the defending Hegemonies within the Animus Universe constantly!","Valentina stared at Noah with shining eyes as she nodded, her body buzzing with essence as she seemed ready for war! Her face was filled with a light of someone that didn't accept defeat as she spoke while waving her fingers forward, releasing an attractive force as Noah's figure began to be propelled towards her as she spoke.","\"I'll have the clones make a move but during that...I don't believe the stamina of a Paragon can compare to a Hegemony!\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking scene that would be the envy of all beings played on within a high rise building somewhere in the Universal Core of the Dark Universe, Noah's original body and the original bodies of those close to him enjoying their time in an isolated Universe as their clones were the only ones moving in the Primordial Cosmos!","It was multi-tasking to an extreme as many things were being done while the Conquest of many Universes was underway...."]},{"number":1021,"title":"Chapter 1021: Chapter 1020 - The Burning Light of Conquest! II","paragraphs":["Aside from the conquest Noah was carrying out and the attacks of Valentina's clones that had yet to play out, there were also Noah's subordinates that finished their work in the Animus Universe.","The Emperor Penguin came in front of one of Noah's clones as he was followed by Kazuhiko and many others, the prideful Penguin being the first to speak as his voice rang out clearly!","\"Master, the conquest of all the Bloodline Races has finished, what shall we do now?\"","RUMBLE!","The voice was sharp and filled with strength, being that of a Peak Monarch that seemed ready to become a Paragon.","The Emperor Penguin was among many that were shooting through the ranks, where they could breakthrough into the ranks of Paragon at any time as Noah found and duplicated more PARAGON Level Cores.","Noah looked at these beings filled with the light of strength as he smiled and spoke out.","\"That's just one Universe, there are many more. I'll leave you guys with the goal of Conquering another Universe under my name!\"","Yes! The forces under him would also be put to use as with the Conquest of the Animus Universe, he actually expanded his forces greatly as he could now utilize not just his subordinates from the Dark Universe, but he could also put to work the Paragons and Monarchs of the Bloodline Races.","The powerful Dragon Race, the Galaxy Devouring Serpents, Golden Crows...there were a myriad of Races that were now his Vassals as he could utilize them all for the Conquest of Universes!","Noah looked at his summons and Subordinates as he voiced out magnanimously.","\"What Universe do you all want to explore and conquer?\"","...!","A domineering question that would frighten others, but those around him only had shining eyes as discussions broke out, and out of all the 9 Universes aside from the Animus and Necrotic Universe, the decision came down to the Automaton Universe!","\"I'm curious of such a place where mechanical existences reign supreme...\" Barbatos's clone spoke out languidly while the others had eyes blazing with conviction, Noah giving a slight nod as in the next few hours, a selection of who would be descending onto another Universe being made as multiple Legions were formed.","They were easily put into the division of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines, 9 powerful Legions of beings floating in front of Noah as his subordinates from the Dark Universe could be seen at the very forefront of these Legions.","The Emperor Penguin was situated next to the Paragons of the Golden Crow Race that shone with a golden glimmer, feeling like these beings were more like him as Kazuhiko chose to stand next to the Dragon Race with Tiamat and Paragon Quinnie!","It was the cast of [Instantaneous Universal Teleportation] as the essence of the Cosmic Treasure and Primordial Clone flowed from Noah's many bodies and into the clone in the Animus Universe, this cast being something that other beings would not be able to handle due to its sheer mana requirements to send entire Legions of beings across Universal Boundaries, but for Noah...he could just say fu?k all that!","The Hegemony stationed to keep watch over the Animus Universe and even Ambrose and Solerno who were still standing protectively in front of the Universal Construct in the Bloody Battlefields Galaxy Clusters all turned their eyes towards the region where boundless waves of mana were being utilized.","Ambrose and Solerno couldn't move to do a thing against them as they had already reduced the essence that the Universal Constructs could draw in to a minimum, and the Hegemony outside of the boundary watching this only reported it to Oathkeeper and the others as they also only watched Noah's actions!","WAA!","The sea of spatial essence disappeared along with the 9 Legions, the eyes of all watching Hegemonies constricting as they sensed they didn't just teleport within the Animus Universe...but they had disappeared from it entirely.","...!","\"Universal Teleportation of hundreds of Billions of beings...!\"","The watching Hegemonies were shocked as they sent messages to see where the teleported Legions that the Paragon who was recently making his name known had sent, a reply coming to them soon after as the Hegemony on Ambrose and Chronos's side who was protecting another Universal Construct in the Automaton Universe confirmed with them the appearance of billions of beings in a certain region of this Universe.","The Hegemony allied with Oathkeeper and others outside the boundary of the Automaton Universe also confirmed their appearance, the eyes of all of these Universal experts shining with shock and surprise as they very well knew what it took to traverse across universal boundaries...and even they as Universal Experts knew they could not teleport across universes with a vast number of beings, much less billions of them that formed Legions!","\"This...\"","\"The mana requirements for this are astronomical, even Hegemonies can't....!\"","Alarm rose in the minds of many watching Hegemonies as once more, news of Noah's movements were sent to the most powerful beings of the Primordial Cosmos, Oathkeeper and Chronos having to focus their attention towards Noah once more.","Once more, his name was forced to take center stage just from a single nonchalant action of his!","His actions were under watch by many of the important beings of the Primordial Cosmos, the Hegemonies that could peer into the universal boundaries being able to watch the actions occurring within as nearly all of them could actually not even make a move.","All they could do was be witness to a burning light that seemed to only be beginning.","A burning light that many of them would go on to remember as the start of an undeniably relentless conquest that by the end of it....would produce a being they could only term with nothing else but the Hegemony of Conquest!"]},{"number":1022,"title":"Chapter 1022: Chapter 1021 - Notoriety!","paragraphs":["WAA!","Overflowing mana released billions of beings in the Automaton Universe, 9 Legions that were filled to the brim with powerhouses from the 9 Supreme Bloodlines of the Animus Universe as at the lead were Noah's Animus Summons and subordinates from the Dark Universe.","Their forces left behind a terrifying presence as their eyes looked at their surroundings, many of them coming in contact with the unique Automaton Universe for the first time!","Automaton simply meant a machine that is capable of acting independently, and this Universe was one where the machines reigned supreme as they controlled every aspect of life with all the creatures within this Universe.","Over its long history, two Hegemonies had risen from this Universe as one was termed the Hegemony of the Steel and the other was known as the Mechanical Hegemony!","Currently, both of these powerful beings were watching the entrance of Noah forces as interestingly, one was outside of the boundary of the Automaton Universe as the other was stationed in front of a Universal Construct.","One of the Hegemonies had chosen to follow Chronos as the other knew nothing of it, the Hegemony of Steel being the one outside the boundary as his literal made of steel figure was extremely somber while looking at the longest friend that had betrayed him, as well as the new forces of the Paragon he and many others became acquainted within the Universal Banquet!","Like many others, he could only watch the events about to play out!","Within the Automaton universe, the golden beak of the Emperor Penguin shone brightly as it reflected the gigantic mechanical Galaxy that wasn't too far away from them.","It was extremely vast in size as it bordered over half a million light years, the entire mechanical galaxy shining with an obsidian purple glint as it released a piercing pressure to the outside void!","It looked like an expansive fortified fortress as planetary sized Pulsar Cannons thousand of meters in size shone dangerously in the boundaries of this Galaxy along with Mana Combustors and Void Rippers that could tear apart the very void itself.","The whole Galaxy looked like a moving mechanical giant as from it, they could feel the terrifying auras of robotic beings as within seconds, they began to see them step out in droves.","Enormous in size and each of them shining with a purple glint, terrifying looking robotic figures began to swarm out of the mechanical Galaxy as beings like Kazuhiko looked at this scene with an excited light!","\"Robots...fucking living and moving robots at the Monarch and Paragon Ranks! Who the hell would have thought...!\"","Those from Noah's homeworld were looking at this scene in incredulousness and excitement as a second later, they were reigned in by the singular voice of the Queen Dowager.","\"Focus! We're not just here for sightseeing or even a war...our goal is to spread the influence of a single being!\"","OOOOOOH!","Bellows resounded throughout as the Bloodline Races thrummed with power, Noah's subordinates moving through these Legions with a light of dominance as the planetary sized figures like the Cthulhu stood out the most!","In the Automaton Universe, Noah's 9 Legions began to move as unique life forms flew out to meet them!","---","Far from this new Conquest, at the boundary of the Animus Universe.","WAP!","Valentina's figure appeared close to the Hegemony tasked with keeping watch over the events of the Animus Universe. Her gaze was filled with a sharp light of confidence and strength that only beings connected to Noah would come to express!","It was the mentality one gained after coming across an overpowered being that had too many cards on his hands, and Valentina had gotten her hands on some of them as today, she planned to utilize them fully.","\"I'm about to take a probing action against them with this body that is a clone. Don't be shaken by any result that happens!\"","RUMBLE!","She spoke to the watching Hegemony outside of the boundary as they could nod in a stupor, Valentina's figure disappearing as she made her way towards Ambrose and Solerno who were still guarding the Universal Construct!","\"You limp d??ked old men, who said you can be so relaxed?!\"","...she might have also been listening to Barbatos's foul mouth recently as this regal Hegemony picked up a new method of insulting others, her figure teleporting in front of the two Hegemonies guarding the Universal Construct as she released horrendous attacks!","There were many moving pieces taking their steps throughout the Primordial Cosmos, but the central one remained the same as with dominance and authority, they were making their moves not in the Animus or Automaton Universes, but in the Necrotic Universe.","His forces moving throughout three Universes of the Primordial Cosmos had placed him on the spot light as many Hegemonies turned their eyes towards him, his notoriety rising as he was becoming known to many at a rapid pace!","But to Noah himself...none of this mattered.","OOOOH!","Strong bellows resounded throughout as his Legions of Undead moved across the Necrotic Universe, the defeated Undead Paragons giving him more knowledge of their Universe and where all the quintillions of Undead were clustered at.","The clans of Undead Specters, Undead Dragons, Undead Vampyres...there were a myriad of races stretched throughout the Necrotic Universe as many of them heeled under the boot of the Hegemony of Necromancy, while a few powerful ancient clans of Undead retained their autonomy.","Noah would move across all the regions of this deathly Universe as at this moment, they were stepping out of the Death Void Valley as they crossed the chaotic void towards a region that held Clusters of power not under the Hegemony of Necromancy- it was the Alcyoneus Spectral Galaxy Clusters where the Ancient Undead Draconic Vampyres ruled!","You read that correctly! Ancient Undead Draconic Vampyres that were Unique existences brought to be by death were some of the strongest Clans existing in the Animus Universe, their power being something Noah could not wait to taste as this time around, he didn't plan on decimating billions in seconds.","It was a Dao that would cement his title as the future Hegemony of Conquest.","It was, of course....the Dao of Conquest!"]},{"number":1023,"title":"Chapter 1023: Chapter 1022 - Making Daos is Easy!","paragraphs":["Out of the Daos that Noah had designed, the first was Subterfuge as it acted to mask and hide his Essence of Ruination along with giving him any identity he chose, while the Dao of Fealty was an even more crucial one as it opened the way for him to efficiently harvest the Marks of Antiquity like never before.","Fealty indirectly and directly increased the level of his strength as it granted him an even larger Destiny and Fortune with the number of beings he influenced, while him obtainings the Marks of Antiquity meant that he could forge Dao Galaxies that directly increased his damage output and also paved the way towards creating a Universal Seed!","The next Dao he was designing was something similar to Fealty, with the increase in strength applying more solely to him as out of the many ideas he calculated, the one that fit the current situation the best and would provide him with the most benefits...was Conquest!","THRUM!","Essence was already bubbling wildly within the Universal Core, Noah's body floating extremely close to the core as all around him were seas of essence from numerous universal laws as well as...dense Ruination Essence.","The main essence of the Dark Universe had been changed to become the Ruination Essence, so of course this was the densest that one could find within the core of the Universe!","As for what major changes Ruination brought, Noah was still observing everything as for now, all he cared for was the fact that he could easily birth Daos. This one would be his last one for who knew how long, just until whatever requirements needed for him to birth more Lesser Daos or possibly Grand Daos were met.","WAA!","His multicolored hair flew around wildly as he had freely drenched it with too many law and Dao essences, but it still retained its dark color as streaks of gold and red dominated, the others colors much dimmer. But his devilish handsomeness only continued to increase over time as with his overflowing Fortune and Destiny, he unconsciously let off an aura that would draw anybody towards him in time!","His 100 Billion Galaxies shone brightly as from the illusory image on his ?h?st, over 1.5 Billion of them were Already Dao Galaxies. The power pulsing from them was immense as in conjunction with his Universal Core, mana flowed freely as a character soon rose from the core of the Universe.","The character was shining a pristine white color and was extremely beautiful in ?uster, expressing but a single meaning in all languages.","CONQUEST!","RUMBLE!","The Dao Character rushed and fused into Noah's origin, making it his third birthed Dao as he closed his eyes to enjoy the sheer feeling of it while the description of the Dao appeared before his eyes.","LESSER [Dao of Conquest] :: A Lesser Dao birthed by the Universal Core of Noah Osmont. As the Dao Architect, Noah Osmont can comprehend and ?ssimilate the Dao at 10 times the normal speed. Conquest is Dao which enhances the strength of the User based on their path of Conquest. It will birth the Star of Conquest that passively increases the power of the user when undertaking Conquest and within the lands they have conquered. Conquered lands will always allow the user to display triple their power while fighting within them, while their strength will always be doubled when they are in the process of Conquest. It also provides the essence termed the Light of Conquest that can be used to Empower current abilities and elevate them to much greater forms. The effect of Empowerment varies based on which abilities or aspects of existence that the Light of Conquest is used on. Initial Comprehension of the Dao of Conquest grants the user the capability to Empower their attributes and normal skills. Complete Comprehension in the Dao of Conquest grants the user the capability to Empower Unique and Ultimate Skills, as well as the Essence of the Universal Laws they comprehend. Full Assimilation of Conquest grants the user the capability to Empower Absolute Skills as well as the essence of the Lesser Daos they Comprehend, along with their power being quadrupled in Conquered Lands and tripled while in the process of Conquest. Elevation of the Dao of Conquest to the Grand and Cosmic Levels will open up even grander possibilities....","A Dao made for the exact situation that Noah was currently in! One that doubled his strength effectively anytime he stepped out to conquer, and then tripled his power when he fought within the bounds of conquered lands like the entirety of the Dark and Animus Universe. With it fully ?ssimilated, these numbers jumped to being quadrupled in Conquered Lands and bring tripled when he was in the process of Conquest.","And aside from all that...there was the Light of Conquest that gave him the capability to further enhance other aspects of himself!","He had made all the specifications as at this moment, Noah did not delay. The techniques to comprehend the Dao were already made as he directly began to cultivate it through his clones in the Ruination Realm that had the one thousand to one time ratio.","As the Architect of Conquest, he could traverse through the Dao at ten times the speed. The ridiculous scene of him comprehending the Dao in minutes and ?ssimilating it a few minutes later played out at this moment as nobody was there to witness such a stupendous occasion!","At full comprehension, one could use the light of conquest to empower unique and ultimate skills among other things, but at full ?ssimilation- one could even empower Absolute Skills as well as the Lesser Daos that they carried.","As for the light of conquest that one would gain from this Dao? Noah began to feel it surging the moment that he finished ?ssimilating Conquest!","RUMBLE!","How could it be described? It seemed like an abstruse essence that was far different from any other type of essence he had come across, and this one uniquely grew from the actions that the holder had carried out and was still carrying out.","For Noah, the action of Conquest was something he had been doing for the past days and months, and he was even carrying out conquest as of this very moment as the Light of Conquest he received...","It was simply glorious as from his body, beautiful pristine white light erupted out in a dazzling fashion!","It was strongest right above his head as an instant later, a white star-shaped object appeared in a dazzling fashion.","It was....the Star of Conquest!"]},{"number":1024,"title":"Chapter 1024: Chapter 1023 - The Dao of Conquest!","paragraphs":["The Star of Conquest began to spin brilliantly as it pulsed with immense white light that washed over Noah endlessly.","Pure white! This was what the Dao of Conquest could be best described as! It seemed to be condensing from the atmosphere and rushing into Noah's origin through the brightly spinning white star as it bathed his Galaxies in a wondrous white splendor, the surrounding few miles turning pure white as it granted Noah the Light of Conquest for his action in the Dark Universe, the Animus Universe, and now the Necrotic and Automaton Universe.","Even though he had only created the Dao now, he was already in the process of Conquest and had even taken multiple Universes with it!","So the Light of Conquest he gained...gushed out in droves as the pure white light of Conquest permeated throughout the surrounding miles and continued to emanate out!","From the deepest corner of the Universal Core, trillions of beings turned towards a certain direction as they noticed an awe-inspiring white light shine brightly for a few seconds.","The light seemed extremely domineering as none of them knew exactly what it was yet, but those living this deep in the Universal Core of the Dark Universe had long since learned to ignore the crazy and ridiculous events that occurred throughout it every now and then!","So it was only Noah alone that experienced the droves of the Light of Conquest surrounding him and sinking into his Origin as the light show died down soon after.","Multiple Universes' worth of the Light of Conquest, where exactly would he put it? What could he Empower with the gathered Light of Conquest that nobody had actualized before?!","In the future, he would be using the Light of Conquest to empower many things like the newly created Tyrannical Lich Emperor skill tree, but his most immediate target of Empowerment was actually an Absolute Skill!","It was, of course, the Absolute Skills of the Seven Deadly Sins that he passively used to strengthen himself as they contributed to the crazy boosts he currently held. Out of the many options he looked at when he stared at his vast number of skills in his Status Panel, this one shone with a brilliant golden ?uster as he trusted himself enough to go ahead and carry out the process.","He spoke out lightly as the pristine white essence around him reflected in his eyes, the Star of Conquest above him shining from a visible to an invisible state as he could choose for it to appear or disappear.","\"Let the Light of Conquest flow into the Seven Deadly Sins.\"","RUMBLE!","His words only just finished as the Star of Conquest shone brightly, the pristine white essence beginning to permeate and fuse into specific portions of his soul- it was the areas where the Absolute Skills of the Seven Deadly Sins were inscribed in!","To better visualize it, Noah stared at his extremely long Status Panel where his many Absolute Skills lay. Those under <<Absolute Sin>> had begun to shine with a brilliant white ?uster in the blue status panel, Noah feeling his Soul buzzing with a unique power as soon after, he saw the appearance of an identical set of words from every single Deadly Sin.","The word read....<Empowered>!","<strong>{Seven Deadly Sins- Sin of Gluttony} <Empowered> :: One of the Seven Deadly Sins unique to the Dark Universe. After becoming Empowered with the Light of Conquest, the skill is capable of manifesting itself under the commands of the holder of the Absolute Sin Skill...</strong>","<strong>{Seven Deadly Sins- Sin of Wrath} <Empowered> :: One of the Seven Deadly Sins unique to the Dark Universe. After becoming Empowered with the Light of Conquest, the skill is capable of manifesting itself under the commands of the holder of the Absolute Sin Skill...</strong>","...","Every single one of the powerful Seven Deadly Sins skills was bathed with the Light of Conquest as they became empowered to do something they had never done before!","Manifestation.","This was the fantastical capability that Noah's skills had gained after they were enhanced with the Light of Conquest!","Noah didn't know whether this would be the major effect every time that he Empowered something with the Light of Conquest, but he sensed the bright Star of Conquest above him shine weakly as a major portion of the Light of Conquest was utilized, the star still rotating brilliantly as it released a powerful pressure.","Noah's eyes shined brightly as he stared at it with his main body, his eyes reflecting this Star of Conquest in multiple different universes as at this moment, his Primordial Ruination Clone in the Necrotic Universe was at the forefront of the Undead Legion as above it, a brilliant white Star was shining gorgeously!","The pressure that the Tyrannical Lich Emperor released doubled as it became even more horrifying, being something that even the strongest Paragons could not compare to.","KEKEKE!","A cackle came out of his skeletal skull as this Tyrannical Lich Emperor would be the one to test the Absolute Skills empowered by the Light of Conquest.","\"Sin of Gluttony!\"","WAA!","His call reverberated across the deathly chaotic void as in the next second, a hellish-looking demonic runic circle appeared in the void of space, spreading out to be over a hundred meters in diameter as it shone with a brilliant red light!","\"Huuu...!\"","A deep and ancient voice reverberated from this demonic-looking runic circle, a figure beginning to descend from it as it looked like a terrifying mass of flesh was coming down.","THRUM!","A brilliant crimson light later, whatever was called out came to fruition as a horrifying Manifestation of the Sin of Gluttony made its appearance for the first time.","\"Huuuung....!\"","A distorted humanoid shape with huge rolls and mass of flesh that looked like an oversized abomination, its over 100 meter tall stature looking extremely grotesque as deformed limbs shot out from multiple areas of its body...and one could see multiple sharp toothed mouths twisting horribly all over its body.","The utter manifestation of gluttony made its appearance in a terrifying fashion as it released a peak aura of a PARAGON, its bellows resounding out across the Necrotic Universe!","\"HUNGRY...!\"","RUMBLE!","This...was just a single manifested Sin.","There were still 6 more!"]},{"number":1025,"title":"Chapter 1025: Chapter 1024 - The Star of Conquest Shines Brightly! I","paragraphs":["In a certain region of the Necrotic Universe...a horrifying aura that seemed to devour space itself arose as for the first time ever, the skill of the Sin of Gluttony was manifested as a terrifying creature came to be.","Across the Universal boundaries though, there was another holder with the title of Gluttony that Noah had appointed with his authority as the [Harbinger of Sin]!","Barbatos felt her Origin rumbling with strength as one of the strongest powers within her seemed to get even stronger. The manifestations of Noah's Seven Deadly Sins through the Empowerment didn't just elevate his strength and allow for the current terrifying reality to be playing out, it would also elevate the strength of those he appointed specific sins to months ago!","RUMBLE!","After the appearance of the Sin of Gluttony, the Tyrannical Lich Emperor continued to call out madly as his body thrummed with wild mana, the Star of Conquest above him shining brightly as the next names were called out consecutively.","\"Sin of Pride!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Sin of Wrath!\"","WAA!","\"Sin of Lust!\"","\"Sin of...!\"","One after another, the six remaining Sins were called out as 6 crimson runic magic circles shone brilliantly in the deathly chaotic void, figures of all shapes and sizes appearing as in the following seconds as even the summoned Lich Emperors and the recently subjugated Agobo quietly remained behind without making too much noise.","For the wondrous and magisterial Sin of Pride, the100 meter tall humanoid figure of a being made solely from golden flames could be seen, the surrounding void burning slightly as this creature domineeringly carried a deadly golden axe that seemed to be empowered by millions of suns!","The Sin of Wrath and Lust on the other hand were devilishly handsome to look at. Starting with Wrath, the figure was that of a graceful looking being with crimson red skin and even more crimson hair, a smile of limitless wrath appearing on its face as it gazed around with murderous intent.","Meanwhile, the Sin of Lust could more closely be described as a Succubus that had proportions no man should see, her 100 meter tall stature that was the same as all the other Sins being something that meant all her blessings both in front and back were being seen very clearly in her scantily clad appearance!","Her gaze was alluring as even the Undead behind Noah shivered when this Sin of Lust flashed an amorous smile towards them, feeling any essence they held into their origin nearly leave their bodies.","The Sin of Sloth was extremely unique as a chubby looking figure that did not even have its eyes open appeared, thunderous snores being heard in the chaotic void as this was its method of expressing its arrival. The fat on its 100 meter tall body seemed to tremble with every snore as its entire body was wrapped in a warm blanket, a unique energy carrying it forward as it was the most inconspicuous sin there.","The Sin of Envy on the other hand dyed the chaotic void near it a terrible green color, a figure of a being with the upper body of a human and the lower body of a snake appearing as Noah could only describe it as a Naga!","Lastly, there was the manifestation of the Sin of Greed, the ridiculous figure of a 100 meter tall human wearing a tight neat red suit that was inlaid with gold lines appeared. Around it, red-gold chains flew calmly as they wrapped themselves all over his body, a terrifying aura leaking from this creature as it released a horrendous light of avarice.","OOOOOH!","But at this moment, the Star of Conquest was shining brightly above his head as out of all the Paragons surrounding the Undead Legions, the aura that Noah released was the most terrifying with the tripling of his power by the Star of Conquest.","Its bright white ?uster washed over him gloriously as it drew in the gazes of two watching Hegemonies that instantly reported something shocking to their respective camps!","\"The problematic Paragon is showing a never before seen Dao Essence...!\"","\"The problematic Paragon is showing a never before seen Dao Essence...!\"","Shockingly, both the Hegemony of Necromancy that reported to Chronos and the Hegemony outside of the boundary of the Necrotic Universe that used his [Wings of Primordial Destiny] to report to Oathkeeper both called Noah the same way.","A problematic Paragon!","Both of them had noticed the unique essence flowing around the Tyrannical Lich Emperor from the shining Star of Conquest, these knowledgeable beings that had lived for many years actually not recognizing this type of essence.","This could only mean...it was a type of essence from a Dao they had never come across before!","The implications this had were tremendous as both camps very quickly focused on this issue.","All of the Dao of Fealty would have its essence erupt around Noah's main body as he enjoyed the Marks of Antiquity that brought about this unique dao's ease of conquest! But now, a type of Dao Essence erupted from Noah's Primordial Ruination Clone that was the Tyrannical Lich Emperor, and it was there to stay as the Hegemonies very quickly saw it!","Of course if it was shown, it also meant that Noah didn't bother to hide it- and this was simply the case. To start building his authority and power in the Primordial Cosmos until it reached or even surpassed beings like Oathkeeeper, Chronos, and the Goliath, he would simply start by leaving behind bread crumbs for others to follow.","For him, the things he considered bread crumbs were Lesser Daos that even Hegemonies only dreamt of designing to fruition!","On this day, aside from his continuing conquest with a Dao being created with the same name- he would also be revealing some of his power!"]},{"number":1026,"title":"Chapter 1026: Chapter 1025 - The Star of Conquest Shines Brightly! II","paragraphs":["Above Noah's head, the Star of Conquest shone brilliantly in the Necrotic Universe as he looked at the glorious and grotesque appearance of the Manifested Seven Deadly Sins.","It was putting another 7 Existences at the same level as him on his ??p, and the auras of these beings were unlike any other PARAGONS as it was even more oppressive than the Lich Emperors!","Now, Noah just needed to test them against his enemies as he marched forward in the Necrotic Universe while outside of it, word had begun to pass around the allied Hegemonies as even Oathkeeper stopped what he was doing to once again pay attention to a certain Paragon.","A brand new never before seen Dao had appeared, something that puzzled many as nobody had sensed the birth of a new Dao in the Primordial Cosmos since the most recent birth of an artificial Dao by the Hegemony of Summoning- Valentina!","The birth of a Dao was always a showy affair, its essence reverberating out across a Universe as it was knowledge that would be spread quickly. So in seeing a brand new type of Dao they had never come across on top of the body of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor, it was an affair that was taken seriously as its mere implications were stupendous.","Actually, they weren't even wrong with the belief that any artificially birthed Dao would cause a huge commotion during the time of its birth, it was just that when Noah created his Daos...the commotion was spread among the single Dark Universe that was floating far from the Primordial Cosmos!","SHAA!","The figure of Oathkeeper used the wondrous capabilities of the [Wings of Primordial Destiny] as he teleported near the Hegemony keeping watch outside the boundary of the Necrotic Universe.","His powerful eyes honed in on the shimmering white star above the moving Lich's head as they shone sharply, even someone of his caliber confirming that this was a brand new Dao Essence they had never come across before!","This meant that either a Universal Hegemony had created a Dao they didn't know about and Noah was using it, or the even more impossible possibility of the Paragon before them being the Architect of the Dao.","\"Valentina, have you designed another Dao that we don't know about that the so-called Tyrannical Emperor is utilizing?\"","THRUM!","His voice traversed across the boundaries of the Universe as it reached Valentina who had her clone in the middle of something fantastical, while her main body experienced something even more wondrous in the Dark Universe.","Before Oathkeeper's words came through to her, she was staring at the unbelievable scene of the birth of a new Dao as in the depths of the Universal Core, she could see Noah's main body be showered in the cascade of white light that represented a new Dao!","She had not been there for the birth of the first or second Dao, but she was there for the third one as even then, she could scarcely believe what she saw.","'He's using a genuine Universe as an intermediary to design Daos...'","Her mind was in turmoil at such a scene as beside her, a sigh could be heard from Barbatos as her small but voluptuous figure shook majestically while she spoke.","\"You have to just accept his ridiculousness after a certain point. If you try to question or understand how he does what he does, you'll be sitting there for days without getting anywhere.\"","It seemed like the voice of a big sister giving advice, rousing the powerful mind of the Universal Hegemony as she looked at the figure of Barbatos who stared at the depths of the Universal Core just like her as Valentina...took her words seriously!","She received Oathkeeper's words around this time as she knew by this point Noah had the Dao of Subterfuge capable of masking the essence of any Daos. If Oathkeeper and the others were seeing his clones displaying a certain Dao, it meant that Noah wanted them to. And who was she to stand in the way of the being with seas of golden fortune?","So a short reply came from her as she received lessons on everything to do with the Dark Universe and Noah from the unreliable Barbatos, while her clone continued with her current mission in the Animus Universe!","\"No.\"","The short reply was sent across Universal boundaries and reached the astounded Oathkeeper soon after.","\"No?\" Even the Oathkeeper didn't expect such a short reply as he asked once more but the answer was...","\"No\"","...!","With this being the case, the eyes of this aged being shone ever brighter as they landed on the figure of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor itself that held a shining white star above it. Was it truly possible for a Paragon to do something only those at the Universal Realm could do?!","Could this being in front of them really be something they could fully utilize against the forces of Chronos and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos? When a being such as this became a Hegemony, his power would just...","RUMBLE!","\"You...have successfully created a Dao?\" Oathkeeeper seemed to be asking this with utter incredulity as even a being as old as him couldn't believe it!","What exactly would the Paragon that had begun making waves recently say?","What reason could he possibly give to explain such a shocking phenomenon?! Would he deny or would he...","\"Yes?\"","\"...\"","...!","A clear cut and unexpected answer came out that caused the minds of all who heard it to buzz with stupor. Noah didn't even bother to hide it as he replied, making Oathkeeper have no words to retort as through the Wings of Primordial Destiny they were speaking through, the other Hegemonies holding this unique dao treasure could hear their conversation as they were all silent!","Noah's voice came out once more a second later.","\"Why are you asking about this? You guys have also created your own Daos, right? It's not that hard.\"","\"...\"","Oathkeeper's ancient face turned sour as the listening Hegemonies felt their overall knowledge become twisted as their hearts were rumbling with anger!","It took Oathkeeper a few seconds to compose himself before he spoke out again.","\"How is this possible? There has never been an instance in history where a Paragon had been able to design and successfully birth a Dao.\"","WAA!","His reply made the many powerful listening Hegemonies nod vigorously, but Noah's reply knocked them down again a second later!","\"Well, after the first one, it gets easier.\"","RUMBLE!","\"...!!!\"","Silence!"]},{"number":1027,"title":"Chapter 1027: Chapter 1026 - Fine, Ill do it myself! I","paragraphs":["A shocking conversation that landed on the ears of many powerful Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos was playing out, one that would be etched into the recesses of all their memories for the years to come!","\"Well, after the first one, it gets easier.\"","WAA!","Noah's reply to Oathkeeper caused essence to grind to a halt in the Origins of the powerful Universal experts who heard it.","Not a single reply came towards Noah from the other side as those listening had the area around them shaking as they unconsciously released their terrifying auras!","\"...You've birthed more than a single Dao before you established a Universe within your Origin?\" Oathkeeper's voice was the only one to return as this powerful being kept searching for more information to understand this newly rising power within the Primordial Cosmos.","\"Naturally, I couldn't stop at the first one after seeing how smoothly it went. The second one was even more expertly designed, but the third one...Ah!\"","THRUM!","Noah felt an intense wave of essence release from the Wings of Primordial Destiny within his Expansive Space, a devilish smile appearing on his face as he continued.","\"The third one is the glimmering white star you all can see above my head in the Necrotic Universe. The Dao of Conquest...\"","...!","The angered and envious eyes of many hegemonies trembled as those that had arrived near the boundary of the Necrotic Universe honed in on the figure of Noah that had a rotating Star of Conquest above him!","A Paragon had actually gone ahead and birthed 3 Daos- something that should in no way be possible for a being at his rank to do, much less to do it three times! Even most Hegemonies birthed 1 Dao, or at most two if they had lived long enough and been just as lucky.","Yet this being...","They felt like they shouldn't listen to his words anymore or they would find themselves not capable of finding the will to live, many of them stopping their input of essence in the Wings of Primordial Destiny as they stopped listening!","\"I created this Dao of Conquest for the occasion of the 9 Universes, maybe I'll design a fourth one when the time comes to tear down the Universal Constructs that Ambrose and the others are protecting...\"","RUMBLE!","\"...\"","Even more Universal Hegemonies stopped inputting their essence into the Wings of Primordial Destiny as soon enough, only the Oathkeeper was left behind listening to Noah's ruthless words.","But to his words, nobody replied! At a certain point, Noah stopped his train of thought as he sent his voice into the Dao Treasure to see who was on the other side.","\"Hello?\"","\"...\"","\"Is anyone still there?\"","\"...\"","\"Alright, I'll head back to the mission on hand.\"","\"...\"","THRUM!","A Paragon that could create their own Dao...what could they even call him?","Normally, when a Universal expert birthed their own Dao, they were referred to by that name as Valentina was known as the Hegemony of Summoning, or a being like Ambrose was known as the Hegemony of Slaughter.","But...they couldn't really term this Paragon the Hegemony of Conquest as he had not even reached the title of a Hegemony yet!","As for what his power would signify when he reached the Universal Realm? The many powerful Hegemonies were actually expectant, but at the same time they didn't hold too many feelings attached to Noah.","This was because they needed to solve the problem of Universal Amalgamation and whatever Chronos and the others were calling forth now. It was a time s?ns?t?v? issue! To become a Hegemony, it took the brightest geniuses over 150,000 years- and an example of this was Oathkeeper himself.","The youngest being to reach the stage of a Hegemony in history, that title was held by the glorious Oathkeeper!","For such a time s?ns?t?v? issue, could they really rely on a powerful Paragon that had limitless potential which could only be unlocked tens of thousands of years into the future? To them, the answer was no!","So while they looked at Noah as a unique existence to appear in their Primordial Cosmos, they still didn't think he would be a deciding factor for the challenges to come...","---","At this moment though, they could not even put their focus on him as something was happening within the Animus Universe!","It was...the attack of the Hegemony of Summoning that had returned into the Universe as one of the few beings who still had access to it as she was within its boundaries when the process of Universal Amalgamation began.","BOOM!","Valentina's face was that of utter coldness as a planetary sized phantom of herself struck down towards the somber figures of Ambrose and Solerno. Similar to before, hundreds of hands seemed to bloom from the body of this phantom as they all struck down towards the two Hegemonies, threatening to smash into the red barrier protecting the Universal Construct if they weren't stopped.","\"Foolish woman!\"","Ambrose bellowed out strongly as his Cosmic Essence waved around him, Solerno also moving with a grim expression as his body ballooned up to a planetary size as well.","But...similar to before, we knew the end result of this battle!","Against the enhanced Valentina that had her mana reserves expanded by over a hundred times, these two Hegemonies could not stand her! Last time, Chronos had appeared and saved the Universal Construct and the Hegemonies protecting it, Valentina running away before she fell into his grasp.","This time, a clone of Valentina was making the attack as she had no worry for her life, her hands ever closer to reaching the crimson barrier protecting the Universal Construct!","\"Sigh.\"","An ancient sigh reverberated out from the Animus Universe.","The purple aura of a certain disastrous Hegemony bloomed.","But this time...Valentina didn't run.","Soon after, a brilliant white star began to shine brightly on top of her!"]},{"number":1028,"title":"Chapter 1028: Chapter 1027 - Fine, Ill do it myself! II","paragraphs":["After the Hegemonies were left in a stupor from listening to the words of a certain Paragon, they turned their attention towards the Animus Universe where they saw the appearance of the Hegemony of Summoning standing against Ambrose and Solerno!","Her shockingly powerful attack could not be withstood by the two Hegemonies, the many palms she threw out sinking into the body of the planetary sized Solerno as he was smashed back towards the crimson barrier protecting the Universal Construct.","As for Ambrose, the essence of a Cosmic Dao was dismantled in seconds from the sheer quantity of Annihilation from Valentina, his figure ultimately also smashing back as ten of palms were left free to smash into the barrier around Universal construct!","BOOOM...CRACK!","As if space itself shattered, the crimson barrier broke.","Universal experts watched the next second with shining eyes as the phantom of Valentina's fair hand tumbled towards the unprotected Universal Construct.","This was when the ancient sigh was heard. This was when the purple ?uster of Chronos appeared once more but...it was also when a glimmering Star of Conquest began to shine atop Valentina's head!","Even with the appearance of the regal purple essence, she was unhindered as she continued with a strong expression!","But...","\"Absolute Reversal.\"","In front of a Dao that stood above many other Daos, what could one do?!","At the words that manipulated the Dao of Chronos, time moved back.","The shattered crimson barrier began to reform as if it shattered glasses coming together, while Valentina's figure was inadvertently being pushed back as even while she released more mana, she still could not stop herself!","RUMBLE!","The color of the regal purple essence spread throughout as Chronos appeared once more in the flesh within the Animus Universe, this time his gaze first landing on the figures of Ambrose and Solerno as his eyes seemed to carry a light of disappointment.","His compatriots failed him for a second time as Chronos appeared, this time intending to finish things himself as he looked towards the valiant looking figure of Valentina that remained floating before him, her aura beginning to rise ever higher as the Star of Conquest above her rotated majestically!","One must recall the boosts a being received for becoming a Vassal under the Lesser Dao of Fealty- among the many things, access the Laws and Lesser Daos of the Tyrannical Emperor was one of them!","Her aura rose madly as Chronos stared at her, his voice coming out calmly.","\"You did not run.\"","WAA!","\"No, I did not!\"","At the end of her words, Valentina's eyes shone with a brilliant ?uster as under the gazes of the recently appearing Oathkeeper behind the boundary of the Animus Universe as well as many other Hegemonies, she actually made a move against Chronos.","One of the giants of the Primordial Cosmos!","A being that only Oathkeeper and the Goliath could stand against- Valentina was fearless as she called out vibrantly.","\"[Efflorescence of Annihilation].\"","In front of her, enormous droves of essence were utilized as the essence of Annihilation erupted out, forming into blooming illusory flowers that trembled with the destructive forces of hundreds of thousands of galaxies!","Yet, power could not so easily be scaled when it came against beings with such powerful Daos that they had even lived multiple lifetimes!","WAA!","A purple clock appeared above everyone, this clock being over ten thousand miles in size as it released a glorious purple light that washed over everything.","Even the figures of Ambrose and Solerno came close to Chronos as they avoided this shower of purple light, the voice of the terrifying being that had reincarnated countless times ringing out.","\"[As it was, so shall it be].\"","...!","A set of words that Ambrose and Solerno had uttered before multiple times, but this time they were cast in the form of a skill under the Dao of Chronos.","For other beings with this same Dao, the effects of this skill could be easily negated. But for those that did not comprehend Chronos?","\"What...!\"","Oathkeeper looked at the scene with cold eyes as even though this was something a being like him could defend against, he knew that others couldn't. This was the difference of quality between some Daos.","In just a second, the planetary sized phantom disappeared no matter how much mana Valentina churned the essence of Annihilation to defend against it, eventually only leaving her 2 meter figure behind as the purple essence of Chronos wrapped around her as well!","Her body still burned all the mana it could to try and defend, but it was useless as one could shockingly see her figure was getting increasingly older. From her upper 20s to looking like a woman in her 50s. Wrinkles appeared everywhere as ancientness began to leak from her body.","Her back became hunched as she very quickly looked over a hundred!","Eventually, her skin began to crack and turn grey as very soon...her body split into countless particles of ash.","As it was, so shall it be!","Nothing could escape the ravages of time.","Under the Dao of Chronos, a being could choose to instantly age a being until they turned into dust, or regress them in age until before they were born.","A terrifying ability, and one that Chronos displayed fully today as after he finished, he gazed towards the figures of Oathkeepers and others that just watched the scene of him \"killing\" a Hegemony in seconds!","But...","\"Hmph!\"","A harrumph rang out clearly as outside the universal barrier of the Animus Universe, the figure of Valentina who should have died from the hands of Chronos appeared once more.","...!","A clone had died, so an immense amount of mana was used to make another!","This creation of a clone with the battle power of a Hegemony was extremely taxing, such that Valentina would utilize half of all her mana with every creation. The mana regeneration thereafter could range a few hours until her Universe was fully revitalized even with the immense boosts she received as a vassal.","So her second clone appeared as the observing Hegemonies had their eyes shake at such a scene, Valentina not even glancing at them as the figure of her clone shot through the Universal barrier seamlessly, the star of conquest above her shining brilliantly as she spoke out while prepared for battle once more.","\"I wonder...do you get tired, or can you last as long as a certain someone?\"","RUMBLE!","Valentina continued her probing attacks in the Animus Universe as the goal the being she pledged Fealty to wasn't just to try and break the Universal Construct, it was to also learn about the abilities of their enemies as today, they had been able to draw out the terrifying Chronos and make him reveal his skills!","For the future, Noah was preparing heavily as he planned to cover all his bases as he moved against the powerful existences within the Primordial Cosmos..."]},{"number":1029,"title":"Chapter 1029: Chapter 1028 - The Goliath Makes a Move! I","paragraphs":["The capability to form a clone wasn't an exclusive or never before heard of ability within the ranks of Paragons or Hegemonies.","In most instances though, it was an ability that could only create something half as strong as the Original, and the few that could do it didn't focus on such an area of their ability as the mana requirement to call forth a clone at the same stage of a Universe were simply too taxing!","So many Hegemonies focused on other aspects of their power, but they had their eyes open as they glanced at the image of Valentina's second clone crossing the Universal barrier as she thundered towards the figure of the calm Chronos once more.","Towards the lifeform that had reincarnated too many times and thought he knew everything, but this development of Valentina that should have never been a possibility was now plaguing him along with a certain problematic Paragon!","As he saw the figure of Valentina coming down with intense might a notch higher than many Hegemonies, his body circulated with essence as the enormous purple clock swirling in space moved.","THRUM!","The essence of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos permeated throughout once more as Valentina's fearless figure approached them, her body exploding into many dazzling attacks as she tried to get through the powerful might that Chronos displayed unsuccessfully!","Even with her power being increased multiple times over, she couldn't get over the boundary of the type of Daos that her enemy cultivated!","After the death of the second clone of Valentina within the Animus Universe, things seemingly became calm again.","Chronos's eyes were languid as he stared at the beings outside the boundary, Oathkeeper staring back at him with utter coldness as his body vibrated with power.","The being releasing the regal purple aura then focused onto Ambrose and Solerno who were still healing from the attacks of the first clone of Valentina's.","\"That woman has become proficient in cloning and will continue to return to this Universe. Since the two of you cannot stand her, go and oversee the Chthonian and Liberated Universes for now, I will stay here.\"","...!","He sent a mental message towards Ambrose and Solerno as the two beings nodded with grim looks, the Hegemony of Slaughter looking particularly wrathful as he imagined countless ways he could destroy the figure of a certain woman!","SHAA!","Their figures disappeared as a second later, only Chronos was left in front of the enormous Universal Construct, his eyes carrying a trace of regality and wisdom as he looked like a being that was carrying the weight of many Universes on his shoulders.","Outside the boundary of the Animus Universe, Oathkeeeper and a few other Hegemonies watched this scene while listening to a message that Valentina sent out to them at this moment!","\"I'll keep on forging clones and sending them over into this Galaxy to hinder them and learn about their skills as much as I can in the future. I'll let everyone know in advance if you all want to observe and come up with methods to stand against these beings!\"","...!","Valentina spoke with strength and power as she was one of the few Hegemonies who could do anything against Chronos and his people at the moment, her words being taken seriously as Oathkeeper's figure flashed away from the boundary of the Animus Universe while he continued to send messages to Valentina to discuss a few more things.","This instance created for a new reality where Chronos alone guarded the Animus Universe while Ambrose and Solerno were spread to the Chthonian and Liberated Universes, the only existences being able to make significant moves being Valentina and a certain Paragon bent on Conquest!","The seas of Universal Fortune above Noah churned as his Destiny shone brightly, a devilish smile apparent on his face as his eyes shone with the reflection of events in the Necrotic Universe.","There, the Tyrannical Lich Emperor made its way across the deathly chaotic void of this Universe filled with Undead as at this moment, he led the terrifying presences of the Manifested Seven Deadly Sins along with the terrifying Undead Legions that had a swirling ring of death around them!","The clans of Undead he met...had no path of resistance as even the terrifying Undead Draconic Vampyres could do nothing but fall as their Paragons alone could not withstand the terrifying sight of the abomination of the Sin of Gluttony crossing the chaotic void to devour everything- even she void itself.","The terror of the Sins spread amongst the Undead from Noah's battles as while he moved and conquered vast regions of the Necrotic Galaxy without a single existence being able to stop him, a week passed!","Over 7 days of Noah relentlessly moving within the Necrotic Universe as his terrifying force of Undead had grown to ridiculous numbers, the Sins acting as Generals as they fought at the very forefront.","Noah had traversed through half of the Necrotic Universe in this period of time, taking over the Galaxy Clusters of many regions at the terror of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor had spread throughout, and Noah wasn't the only one as his Subordinates were also making progress within the Automaton Universe!","It seemed like everything was going smoothly for them as in a short period of time they would break the influence of the Hegemonies within these Universes and greatly decrease the amount of essence that the Universal Constructs were drawing in.","But...were things ever that easy?","In response to Noah's and the movements of his forces, certain beings had also been making plans and progress in the past week.","Across the Universal boundaries, there was a certain existence that was currently hidden in the Microbial Universe. This being had a swirling black hole for a head as his entire body was entirely a mass of the essence of chaos, his power shaking the very surroundings his body occupied!","At this moment, this being raised his head as in front of him, the terrifying image of miniaturized forms of himself that numbered in the hundreds were displayed- their bodies releasing a unique power as the Goliath spoke out in a raspy voice.","\"It is done...\"","....!"]},{"number":1030,"title":"Chapter 1030: Chapter 1029 - The Goliath Makes a Move! II","paragraphs":["\"It's done.\"","Chronos received a message in the Animus Universe as his eyes flashed, a regal purple clock being controlled in the void of space above him as the figure of another one of Valentina's clones was aged until it became nothing but dust!","\"You've confirmed things multiple times with Fate and Destiny?\" Chronos's eyes flashed with a powerful purple light as he asked, a reply coming from the Goliath a second later.","\"I wouldn't make a move if I wasn't sure. Let's get this over with.\"","RUMBLE!","The words were filled with irrevocable might as Chronos nodded while he replied.","\"Good. We can begin with the Necrotic Universe and the Automaton Universe. Let's nip both of these problems in the bud right away.\"","WAA!","A horrendous plan was given the go ahead as Chronos's eyes flashed brightly, a light of wisdom coursing through them as another one of his ideas that he came across in a previous lifetime would be instituted today!","It was something that didn't come to full fruition in a certain life time until hundreds of thousands of years from this time point, during an era where Chronos moved behind the scenes and waged a Cosmic War.","In the current life time, there was actually a being that had also begun dabbling with this method, and it was the Cerulean Hegemony that had actually used this method when he was chasing after a Cosmic Treasure!","The terrifying Lich would move across the Necrotic Universe as he faced forces from multiple Galaxy Clusters, moving his horrible abomination of Sins as they wrecked havoc across the Legions as he then forced them to submit.","Those that submitted became a part of his force as his Legions grew ever bigger, and as for those that did not submit? The even more terrible Undead Legion that had an expanding Necrotic Ring of Death would move forward as any that denied his authority would be decimated with a swirling storm of bones within seconds, the only surviving existences being the Paragons that would be given a way out if they pledged their souls to him!","It was an extremely ruthless sight that even though the Hegemony of Necromancy was wrathful at the fact that he couldn't stop this being, he had to commend him for his methods as a Lich that thrived on death himself.","The entrance of the Goliath caused the Hegemony of Necromancy to turn towards him with shining eyes as one of the giants of the Primordial Cosmos waved his hands, causing for the appearance of 100 miniaturized forms of himself that were b?r?ly 5 inches in size to appear.","His voice rang out chillingly soon after.","\"Have the Paragons under your command consume these. They will gain power far exceeding that of Paragons but...their small Origins will not be able to handle it as after a month passes, they will perish!\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words left resounded out from the being that had a black hole for a face, the Hegemony of Necromancy nodding with fervor as he asked carefully.","\"These are...\"","\"A Compendium of my power. Those consuming them will have their Origins vitiated as they can display a portion of my power, gaining access to a sliver of the Daos of Extinction and Chronos for a few weeks as after that, their Origins will no longer be able to bear it and they will die. Because of this, it is absolutely vital that they choose to consume them of their own free will.\"","...!","\"It is the method to bypass the restriction of us not being able to act against creatures of the lower Realm. It will always be these Paragons themselves moving, their power simply elevated to levels no Paragons can reach. You can call them...Incarnations of Chaos.\"","RUMBLE!","Incarnations of Chaos!","This was the answer that the Goliath had come up with after he was designated to deal with the problem of a rampaging Paragon that was standing in the way of the smooth accumulation of universal essence by the Universal Constructs.","For his goal of Antiquity...the Goliath produced a method that caused the Hegemony of Necromancy to shudder as he took the 100 seeds of Incarnations of Chaos and disappeared, teleporting to a nearby Galaxy Cluster with Undeads under his command that the Tyrannical Lich Emperor would come across soon enough!","WAA!","The aura of majesty spread out from the Hegemony of Necromancy as he appeared in the depths of a certain Galaxy. Mountains of bones filled the starry space as the auras of 3 Paragons could be picked up in the middle of an Undead Legion, the newly appearing Hegemony waving his hands as he threw out 3 seeds of the Incarnations of Chaos while speaking out commandingly.","\"The Tyrannical Lich Emperor's path will soon reach here. If you absorb this treasure...you will be able to stand against him and take him down!\"","\"But...if you will and Origin is too weak to withstand the power, you might also perish. Are the Undead Rulers of our Necrotic Universe weak enough to perish?\"","His air of death spread out as it enticed the minds of the powerful Undead, the Dao of Necromancy pulling the strings as thereafter, the Hegemony let them make their own choice as he disappeared.","The three Lich Emperors looked at each other and then at the obsidian glowing figures in front of them, they deathly flames in their eye sockets blazing with light as their jaws opened, consuming the seeds of the Incarnations of Chaos as a second later, overbearingly powerful auras began to skyrocket within the deathly Galaxy!"]},{"number":1031,"title":"Chapter 1031: Chapter 1030 - Overwhelming Strength! I","paragraphs":["When the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos left the Necrotic Universe and left behind 100 seeds of the Incarnations of Chaos, he then appeared in the Automaton Universe and did the same thing with the Mechanical Hegemony that was overseeing things there!","With such actions, the rivers of fate churned as destiny began flying in a different direction. Yet, the being that was the cause of it had simply too much Universal Fortune and Destiny, so what exactly would be the result of it?","What would come of Paragons becoming Incarnations of one of the strongest beings in the Primordial Cosmos as they gained access to unique Daos such as Extinction and Chronos? How infinitely close to the power of Hegemonies would they be?!","The answer, as always, could only be seen in time.","---","Within the Necrotic Universe.","OOOOOH!","The Sin of Gluttony let out horrendous wails as its many mouths chewed on the surrounding chaotic void, actually devouring this space itself as its body thrummed with power! This creature had been swallowing entire dead Galaxies as Noah's Legions moved across the Necrotic Universe, its horrendous actions making its aura the strongest out of all the Sins in the field.","Behind it, Noah was seated upon a throne built from the essence of multiple Daos, this throne currently inlaid with glimmering bones as it fit the demeanor of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor too well.","Even further behind Noah, there were an uncountable number of Undead Legions that had moved from Billions and were currently in the Trillions, the sea of Undead seeming like moving planetary bodies when one looked at them from far away!.","The pressure they released was something no enemies could stand against as with over half of the Necrotic Universe conquered, Noah expected the remaining half to be fully ?ssimilated into his forces within another week or two.","This was because he knew towards the end of the conquest of this Universe would be the time that his enemies fought back the most! It would be around this time that they would not sit still as the Hegemonies that Chronos worked with made grand moves! Due to this...Noah wanted to prepare.","Even though he had a Legion that swirled with an unbeatable Necrotic Ring of Death that even Hegemonies could not stand against. Even though he had Seven Manifested Deadly Sins whose power exceeded that of normal Paragons!","Even with all this...","\"Maybe I can get just a bit stronger?\"","Because of this, Noah had been busy designing the next grand skill that covered an area he considered himself to be currently weak at.","He seemed to excel in many things, but when it came to the area of Cosmic Daos...he thought he lacked something in this region!","He could cultivate and ?ssimilate any Grand or Lesser Dao that he wished for just from defeating his enemies and obtaining Dao Crystals, but Cosmic Laws fell under different rules as even with the defeat of Paragons that comprehended them, no Dao Crystals for Cosmis Daos were given!","It was something so abstruse and out of reach that as it was mentioned in the details of Ruination before, it had to be comprehended and ?ssimilated with the efforts of the being themselves as no outside items or treasures would have an effect when it came to Cosmic Daos.","Given this information...Noah wanted to design a skill that still made it possible for him to comprehend and ?ssimilate Cosmic Daos! To bring such a skill to fruition, Noah looked at the accumulated skill points after the conquest of the Animus and now the Necrotic Universe.","[Skill Point(s)] ::...139,534,357,149","139 Billion Skill Points!","Fantastically, the idea he had in mind would make him a poor man as it would utilize the entirety of these Skill Points, but it would bring to fruition something that would make it possible for him to obtain Cosmic Daos in another way besides just from [Protagonist's Bookmark]!","He looked at how this ability allowed for him to obtain a Cosmic Dao, and everything lied in the fact that he took the comprehension of another being and made it his own. Unlike when he just designed the skill tree to comprehend the Dao of Summoning many weeks ago in the past Nexus Galaxy of the Dark Universe, such a thing wasn't made feasible to him through [Skill Creation] as it required Skill Points in the Trillions to bring to fruition.","It wasn't that it was impossible- he just couldn't pay its price!","But he could pay the price of tens of billions of Skill Points to produce a skill that had many requirements that had to be met, but at the end of it...a Cosmic Dao awaited him.","The skill actually had the cost of 500 Billion Skill Points when he first put its specifications in [Skill Creation], but this number dropped by 150 Billion when he secluded the Dao of Ruination. It then dropped by another 150 Billion after he dropped the Primordial Dao that the Oathkeeper was the only one to comprehend!","After adding many more restrictions like a cool down, mana requirements, and a few other things...the skill of [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] was born.","[Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] :: A skill that allows the user to integrate the Essence of the Cosmic Daos they come across as after a sufficient value is reached, the emergence of the Cosmic Dao would bloom within them. The essence of only a single Cosmic Dao that the user comes across and selects will undergo the process of integration and emergence. After every successful emergence of a cosmic Dao, 7 Cosmic Days have to pass before the process can begin with another Cosmic Dao. The process of integration requires a sufficient amount of mana to be used in order to deconstruct and analyze the Essence of the Cosmic Dao, necessitating the mana output of the full mana reserves of a Universal Realm existence for every second of integration. If an insufficient amount of mana is provided, the Cosmic Essence under integration will cause an implosion of the user's Origin. Cosmic Daos such as Ruination and Primordial are excluded from the effects of this skill. Cost of Skill Creation: 130,000,000,000","A glorious method of obtaining Cosmic Daos was born on this day, Noah thinking he was lacking in an area as he sought to get stronger!"]},{"number":1032,"title":"Chapter 1032: Chapter 1031 - Overwhelming Strength! II","paragraphs":["[Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence]!","An ability that made him an extremely poor being as nearly all of the Skill Points that he gained from the conquest of two Universes were spent, but the results were stupendous as they brought to fruition a way for him to gain access to other Cosmic Daos!","Although the method of usage of this skill...was a bit unique as Noah had to take in the essence of the Cosmic Dao from others into his own Origin.","This method could be from a being willingly infusing the essence of the Cosmic Dao they studied to Noah, or it could be from an enemy that Noah faced who was throwing attacks that contained the Cosmic Dao he wanted to integrate!","He just had to receive the attacks of an enemy with a powerful Cosmic Dao as after he absorbed enough of the Cosmic Essence they threw out and integrated it- he would actually gain access to the very Dao himself. The skill mentioned that a certain \"Value\" had to be met before the essence of any Cosmic Dao could be fully integrated before Noah himself was given the comprehension of this Dao.","The restrictions of a cooldown were negligible, but the restriction on mana meant that aside from Noah...nobody would be able to utilize this Skill even if he put it in the [Library] feature of his Universal Core.. It needed the output of the full mana reserves of a Hegemony every passing second, such a thing being something that only a creature with endless mana could even dream of...or an existence of a much higher level than the Universal Realm that they could consider their mana reserves negligible!","WAA!","Mana began to swirl around Noah powerfully as from his throne, his golden flames locked onto the figure of Lich Emperor Agobo that he had subjugated first when he arrived in the Necrotic Universe.","He planned to test the [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] skill on this being first as the Lich Emperor had begun comprehending the Cosmic Dao of Necromancy! He would see just how fantastical the effects of this Cosmic Dao would be on the undead as the conquest of the Necrotic Universe would become an even smoother task.","\"Agobo, come!\"","He called out to the Lich Emperor that was moving just behind the Sins in the chaotic void, this being nodding and heading towards Noah as the first test of [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] was about to begin.","But...","THRUM!","A second later, Noah's body erupted with a flood of the golden essence of Destiny as far away from the Necrotic Universe, the vast seas of Universal Fortune above his main body churned!","His eyes released beams of golden light as he stopped his actions, knowledge coming to him that an even grander opportunity for [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] was coming on the horizon!","Ah!","It truly was on the horizon as an instant later in the Necrotic Universe, the Undead Legion of Trillions that Noah led came to a stop, sensing a horrendous wave of power appearing thousands of miles away as it was barreling towards them at insanely high speeds.","The wave of power was soon accompanied by another, and another...over 20 shockingly powerful auras that far exceeded any PARAGON appeared on the horizon, bringing with them waves of immense power as at the speed they were coming at, they crossed the few thousand miles in an instant as they appeared in front of Noah's Legions in a stellar fashion!","WAA!","20 figures appeared majestically in the deathly chaotic void of the Necrotic Universe as Noah's eyes began to shine brightly at them, the auras they gave off making the surrounding void shake as shockingly- it was 20 Undead Paragons that held various forms but were connected by a singular factor.","All around the bodies of these figures, the illusory outline of a certain expert Noah had seen before was convulsing in and out of existence constantly, this being the source of the immense power that these existences were currently releasing.","It was the form of a being that held a black hole for a head- the form of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","RUMBLE!","Noah's eyes shined brightly as he utilized [Eyes of Truth], a set of details appearing in front of him that caused his bones to begin trembling in excitement!","[Lich Emperor Zadon](Incarnation of Chaos) :: A powerful Lich that has roamed the Necrotic Universe for half a million years, leading many Legions over the millenniums. This being has swallowed the Origin Essence of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos and gained a portion of his power, being able to display great proficiency in the Daos of Extinction, Chronos, Purity, Annihilation, Necromancy, Phantasm...","...!","\"No way...\"","Noah couldn't help but utter out loud as he looked at the beings releasing the terrifying essence of numerous Cosmic Daos from their bodies, each of them literally vibrating with power it didn't seem they could contain as their eyes were all locked onto him menacingly!","His heart was actually trembling in excitement at this moment as when he read over the details of these beings, he actually found that one of the most powerful beings of the Primordial Cosmos had given away a small portion of his Origin Essence that contained his comprehensions of his Daos...and he gave these to Paragons to come stand against him!","Paragons that exceeded all scales of power of such a level- beings that held a portion of power from a Hegemony.","And it wasn't just any Hegemony...but one of the strongest ones in the Cosmos!","All of these factors should have caused any being to shit their pants in fear but in front of Noah...his eyes were those full of joy as he stood up from his Throne.","\"Ah...!\"","The bright flames in his eye sockets raged powerfully as towards his joy, the 20 newly arriving Incarnations of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos roared out.","OOOOOOH!","BOOOM....CRACK!","They roared out grandly as the surrounding chaotic void shattered apart, half of their figures beginning to move towards Noah as streaks of light while the other half raised their hands to the skies and summoned Legions of Undead.","The body of this powerful Sin shone with glorious golden splendor as it raised its enormous axe that carried the might of millions of exploding suns towards the rushing enemy, his expression that of utter arrogance and might as he uttered out.","\"Who said you could make a move under my gaze?!\"","RUMBLE!","A golden ?uster flashed across the deathly chaotic void as it signified the start of the first warfare that would involve the Incarnations of Universal Experts!"]},{"number":1033,"title":"Chapter 1033: Chapter 1032 - Hit Me! I","paragraphs":["\"Who said you could make a move under my gaze?!\"","WAA!","The bellow of Pride reverberated across the chaotic void as he appeared in front of a Paragon letting out horrendous waves of power, the essence of Extinction actually erupting from this Undead Lich Emperor as with a cold look, his bony fingers smashed onto the glimmering golden axe that carried the force of a million suns!","BOOM!","The strength of Paragons that had power far exceeding this level clashed as the result was horrendous, with the body of Pride actually trembling as the terrifying essence of Extinction threatened to tear apart his golden age and ravage his body, the void around him having already been ruptured.","Yet...","The body of Pride remained floating at the same position as he didn't even move a step back, his body glowing an ever brighter shade of gold as his expression was that of ardent superciliousness and arrogance as even while every part of this sin was trembling, he called out majestically.","\"Did I give you permission to push me back?!\"","RUMBLE!","Pride released a bellow filled with dignity and superiority while looking at the Undead Paragon, seemingly disgusted that such a creature had even thought of standing up against a being such as he! He released the golden axe within his hands to the chaotic void, the axe glimmering brightly as his body gushed out droves of golden essence that represented pure Pride.","An instant later, the released axe began to multiply until hundreds of golden axes filled the void, each of them 50 meters in size as they trembled with strength that could wipe out entire galaxy clusters!","THRUM!.","Pride glanced domineeringly at the Undead Paragon that was reflecting the golden gleam covering everything, his voice ringing out as it was nearly as arrogant as a certain Tyrannical Lich Emperor.","\"I shall not let you have an easy death!\"","WAA!","The myriad of golden axes were then commanded to come down towards the enemy whose body began to light up with the essence of many cosmic daos!","Daos of too high a stature could not be defended against unless a similar one or one even higher in ranking above it appeared.","The Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination stood at the very peak of all Cosmic Daos, so in terms of quality...it was above that of Daos like Chronos and Extinction!","The Oathkeeper had shown an example of this when he faced both Chronos and The Goliath at the same time in the Elysian Universe, and these beings had to retreat against him alone.","But currently, these same Daos were being used by existences that had become tainted with the origin essence of a Universal Realm Hegemony, the power they could portray against those in the same level being something that was actually very hard to quantify as it didn't exist before!","BOOOM!","An uncountable number of golden axes fell.","Each of them worthy of the explosive force of millions of suns caused the entire area of the chaotic void to melt and deform as the first battle of a shocking war started off with a bang!","When the 10 Incarnations of Chaos moved, Pride was able to stop one of them through sheer will power and strength as the 6 other Sins all stood against six enemies respectively, their bodies lighting up in a myriad of colors as after the strength of their sin was amplified, their bodies erupted with Ruination Essence to resist the terrifying Dao Essence of Chronos and Extinction.","SNORE","\"Hrmm?\"","The eyes of the Sin of Sloth slightly lifted as it looked lazily at the figure of an Undead Paragon that had its body still vibrating. Even the effort of raising its eyes seemed like too much as the chubby looking figure draped the blanket it had on to cover even its head completely.","But different from its lazy demeanor...tentacles of essence shot out of its sleeping body in a terrifying manner as they covered everything, a world of tentacles of Ruination blooming in front of this Incarnation of Chaos!","Off in another region, the entire area was dyed pink an amorous figure of the Sin of Lust showed off its extensive curves while blowing a kiss to an Undead that wouldn't even be able to do it if they wanted!","The powerful Incarnation of Chaos had its vigorous flames waver slightly, their figure coming to a halt briefly before the essence of Chronos and Extinction filled up its mind and it shot forth like a cannon ball once more.","In another region, Gluttony's many mouths spread throughout its body had tried to devour the enemy Paragon right away, this Incarnation sensing danger as it pulled back soon after, only to wave its skeletal hands above it and cause the appearance of a regal purple Clock that released waves of the essence of Chronos!","\"Get over here!\" Gluttony was maddened at the creature that seemed like the most enticing feast escaping, rushing towards it as it seemed to be returning to its old position a second later...as if it were placed on a time loop.","Shocking battles like this erupted in front of ever scene as the crimson figure of the Sin of Wrath and Sin of Envy faced their own Paragons, the areas around them colored red and green respectively as their own unique essence spread out on top of the support of Ruination Essence that Noah provided for them!","Atop each of them...a star of conquest shone brightly as the Sins moved to prove their worth!"]},{"number":1034,"title":"Chapter 1034: Chapter 1033 - Hit Me! II","paragraphs":["Many of the sins were capable of standing their ground against these terrifying Incarnations that held a portion of power from a Hegemony, but some sins were being pushed back from their immense might and usage of the Daos of Chronos and Extinction!","THRUM!","The Power that the Incarnations of Chaos displayed was extremely overbearing, where even as 7 were hindered by the Sins, 3 rushed towards Noah with wild abandon while 10 more stayed behind with their bodies glimmering with the essence of a myriad of Cosmic Daos, these beings calling forth Legions of Undead that pulsed dangerously.","But against all of this, Noah's mind only focused on the 3 Undead Paragons rushing towards him.","OOOM!","The Star of Conquest above his head glimmered pure white as the surroundings were brightened, his majestic figure put on full view as while he left his throne behind, the unseen essence of Ruination rose from him like waves- this essence currently masked to look like the essence of Annihilation.","With utter calmness, his eyes followed as the three Undead Paragons surrounded him an instant later, their figures becoming incomparably clear!.","All 3 towered over 10 meters in size as their bony exteriors were as black as night, bony wings being seen gloriously spreading out on their back. These were the race of Primal Winged Undead Emperors that didn't excel in the summoning of large legions of Undead, and they were instead extremely proficient in strengthening their own bodies to crazy levels as even the feat of shattering galaxies with a flick of their bony fingers wasn't an impossibility!","They were one of the strongest Undead Paragons one could come across in the Necrotic Universe, and each Primal Winged Undead Emperor was commonly referred to as a One Man Army due to their shocking close combat and body strengthening capabilities.","This was the identity of these three Paragons that released maddening attacks towards Noah as his response to all of it...was only an eruption of Ruination Essence to wrap around him protectively!","Their strikes released the bountiful essence of Extinction and Chaos as they shone with a distinct purple ?uster, the chaotic void being the first to give out.","BOOOM!...CRACK!","Space quaked and shattered as in the next second, only 4 figures remained floating in the rapidly healing void of the Necrotic Universe. A single being whose body was surrounded by a protective crimson shield, and three Primal Winged Undead Emperor that looked at the fact that their strikes didn't smash him to bits even with the use of high tiered Cosmic Daos!","The crimson light around Noah even shone brighter as he withstood the attacks with his bony exterior creaking dangerously, but his flaming eye sockets released a wondrous burst of light as the moment the attacks hit him...a prompt appeared.","[The user has been exposed to the Cosmic Dao Essence of Chronos, Extinction, Purity, Phantasm...which essence do you wish to integrate?]","\"...\"","A deep smile bloomed from Noah's skeletal structure.","'Integrate Chronos!'","WAA!","His command was received as the essence that should have been ravaging his body disappeared into his Origin, beginning the process of Integration as a Value appeared in the corner of Noah's eyes.",".1/100","...!","His eyes shone ever brighter as their gaze fell upon the 3 Paragons that had their bodies still buzzing with power, his bony smile making these beings pull back a little as they scrutinized him carefully, his next words causing the Primal Winged Undead Paragons to move with even more care!","\"You all...hit me some more!\"","...!","WAA!","He was extremely ecstatic as it stemmed from the feeling of getting something you weren't even thinking of, and yet others handed it to you on a platter.","He was about to use his newly designed ability on his own Vassal and obtain the Dao of Necromancy, but his enemies just had to go ahead and scheme, one of the most powerful Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos utilizing his Origin Essence to create Incarnations of Chaos- existences that had swallowed the Origin Essence of the Goliath as they could display a semblance of his power and the Daos he comprehended for a short period of time!","Then...his enemies sent these terrific new existences to him as it was actually the most perfect gift that he didn't even ask for.","Yes, they were extremely powerful.","Even at this moment, the Sins were b?r?ly struggling with these Incarnations of Chaos that vibrated with the essence of Cosmic Daos like Chronos and Extinction, the only reason they could continue to stand against them being their unique nature and the fact that they were reinforced by Noah's essence of Ruination!","Similar to the battle between the Hegemony Chronos and Valentina's clone...there was an interplay with the quality of mana in use! But in Noah's case, the essence of Ruination stood at the same level as Primordial Essence, being even higher than Chronos and Extinction as against creatures utilizing these two types of essence...Ruination prevailed.","But there was still the newly gained force that contained strength from a Hegemony! From a being that had forged their own Universe! This was why the Incarnations of Chaos boasted such tremendous power that normal PARAGONS wouldn't even be able to stand against them.","Noah Osmont...was not a normal Paragon.","RUMBLE!","\"Come on, hit me! Hit me!\"","...!","Their deathly flames wavered when they looked at the enthusiastic bony expression of Noah before these powerful Incarnations felt the Origin Essence of the Goliath burn inside them, their Origins trembling as they moved their bodies as if they only had half control!","WAA!","In front of Noah's glimmering eyes, a deathly sickle that pulsated with Extinction bloomed from one undead Paragon and swung towards him, a dark purple clock appearing behind another Paragon as time began to be tampered with, and the last Primal Winged Undead Emperor simply threw out a fist filled with the essence of both of these Daos.","BOOM! BOOM! CRACK!","Pristine bones shattered as the sickle thundered down, the pure force of the Paragon paired with the force of Extinction breaking Noah's collar bones as a second later, the essence of Chronos pervaded towards his Origin to try and decimate him from the inside out!","THRUM!","A second later, a strong life force erupted from Noah as the broken bones healed, the essence of Chronos that had been trying to age his Origin inconspicuously disappearing into the same Origin it was trying to destroy as his devilish bony smile only deepened.","\"..Ah!\"","The Tyrannical Lich Emperor let out an eerie sound as he gazed towards the Undead Paragons with fervor, his eyes even honing in on the Undead Legions being formed due to the 10 remaining Undead Paragons that stayed behind- wanting them all to come towards him at once as he had goals that they couldn't even begin to imagine!"]},{"number":1035,"title":"Chapter 1035: Chapter 1034 - This Paragon is Eccentric! I","paragraphs":["As Noah got in contact with the Incarnations of Chaos for the first time, his Subordinates also met them instantaneously as the results here were slightly different in the Automaton Universe.","\"Go for its core!\"","THRUM!","Kazuhiko bellowed out loudly as his figure was a streak of dark light fighting against a gigantic mechanical race that were known as Automaton Sentinels- creatures with bodies harder than many known metals as they could only be defeated when the core hidden somewhere within their bodies was destroyed!","Above Kazuhiko's head, the Star of Conquest shone brightly as the Steel Mikhail was the one to answer his call and materialize behind the Sentinel, their attacks landing on this mechanical being from two sides as the hidden core within its body was destroyed.","BOOM!","A shower of scrap metal later, the two beings looked at each other and laughed as they glanced at the battlefield around them.","It was filled with Automaton Sentinel shooting of laser blasts and nuclear bombs throughout, while the existences with the stars of Conquest above their heads moved ardently to break apart as many of these Sentinels as possible!","They numbered in the billions as the area where most destruction was occurring was where Noah's summons were moving across, the figures of Tiamat and the twin Draconic Serpents Ava and Olivia wreaking havoc and ripping apart Automaton Sentinels at a shocking speed as above all of this, there was a singular figure that was drawing the eyes of many beings on the battlefield.","The figure held a bowtie as its golden beak shone in the light, its flippers flung back as it put on the airs of a sagely looking being while speaking out..","\"Pledge fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor and you shall be saved...\"","RUMBLE!","The clone of the Emperor Penguin acted like an apostle of a ridiculous false religion as the words reverberated out across the metallic battlefield that shone with a brilliant purple ?uster, with the reply normally being the intelligent automaton races with their own free wills choosing Fealty over death!","But this time...this time it was different as right after the call of the Emperor Penguin, a streak of purple light tore through the void and appeared in front of it an instant later, a fair hand being lifted as a terrifying plasma ray that contained the essence of a myriad of Cosmic Daos blasted right in front of the Emperor Penguin...eradicating its unprotected body as it couldn't even react at the shocking speed!","WAA!","A single attack...and the clone of the Emperor Penguin was erased.","The plasma ray filled with the essence of cosmic daos tore apart the chaotic void as the figure of the existence that shot it was revealed to all. A humanoid body that looked fair and slender, its palms showing a terrifying plasma gun receding into the hand as its whole body pulsed with immense power. With the same figure of a human but with significant modifications...it was the race of Androids that stood as one of the strongest forces in the Automaton Universe!","The vibrant essence of Chronos and Extinction radiated off of this Android in waves as it looked coldly and calculatingly at all the enemies, computing the best possible move before its figure disappeared again towards another direction.","It wasn't the only one as seconds later, similar terrifying auras that far exceeded what paragons could display began to appear en masse, the battlefield becoming tumultuous!","Noah's Animus Summons looked at this as they received an overabundance of information from Noah at the same time, their bodies lighting up with Ruination Essence as they were the first to rush towards the newly coming Incarnations of Chaos.","An innocent looking boy with a cerulean blue crown spinning atop his head licked his lips off to the side, his figure melding into the folds of space as his eyes were those that screamed intense hunger while looking at these exceedingly powerful Incarnations.","It had a hope and a dream of devouring Hegemonies in the future, never did the Blue Slime think bite sized portions of Hegemonies would actually come to him at such a stage as the aura of this creature disappeared entirely, just waiting to strike within the folds of space!","A terrifying battle would unfold here as the battle to follow would be the first one where the clones of Noah's subordinates would actually begin to fall as they fought terrifying battles with beings that exceeded all parameters of power!","Far off from the Automaton Universe and even the Primordial Cosmos in general, the figure of the main body of the Emperor Penguin was vibrating with a golden ?uster in the Universal Core of the Dark Universe, another clone being formed in front of him as his wrathful voice rang out.","\"They dare to kill me first like some minor character? Me?! The holder of Pride?!\"","RUMBLE!","The Manifested Sin of Pride in the Necrotic Universe and even the Emperor Penguin that held the abilities of this Sin himself were offended at such a reality, the battles to come being something they would shine in the most through the sheer uniqueness of the power they held!","---","The two Hegemonies were some of the beings Oathkeeper considered his strongest allies, their power just being a notch below Chronos and the Goliath!","One was a Hegemony from the Galactic Microbial Race- which were creatures the size of an unseen microbe that held power at the GALAXY Realm the moment they were born. Below the Goliath, this race was one of the most unique ones you could find across the Primordial Cosmos.","The other Hegemony was from the Chthonian Universe, and it was an existence that stemmed from the Amorphous Blasphemers Race that could move into horrifying monstrosities far larger than any planets seamlessly!","These two beings and Oathkeeper were watching the unfolding battles within the Necrotic and Automaton Universe that they didn't put too much emphasis on before, but they now scrutinized them with utter care as the appearance of the Incarnations of Chaos changed many things!"]},{"number":1036,"title":"Chapter 1036: Chapter 1035 - This Paragon is Eccentric! II","paragraphs":["\"For the Goliath himself to do something like this...it means that what this Paragon mentioned before might actually be true- where the inhabitants of the Universes are closely tied with the efficiency of their Universal Constructs in achieving their goals!\"","WAA!","The booming voice of the Hegemony from the Amorphous Blasphemers Race that was known as the Hegemony of Old Chaos reverberated out, Oathkeeper nodding with an impassive expression as he scrutinized the Incarnations of Chaos even more.","\"Using his own Origin Essence and placing it in the body of Paragons...they are keen on stopping him!\"","...!","\"We can't let it succeed. If true, then this is the only method that has actually been working against them, and we brushed it off this entire time...\" The Hegemony from the Galactic Microbial Race spoke out, this being holding the title of the Microscopic Hegemony..","Oathkeeper nodded at the words as he stood up, his golden hair waving gloriously as his voice resounded out while staring at the paradisiacal realm around him.","\"They've managed to bypass the restrictions set up for this...and so can we.\"","RUMBLE!","The light of Destiny swirled around him as he raised his hands to the skies of the Elysian Realm, the sky freely splitting apart as Primordial Essence began to gush out and flow towards the Oathkeeper!","The Microscopic Hegemony and the Hegemony of Old Chaos looked at this scene with envious eyes as while surrounded by a swirling mass of pristinely white Primordial Essence, Oathkeeper spoke out with a mystical voice.","\"I'll need some days to experiment and see if we can do what the Goliath did and its feasibility. Holding the Origin Essence of a Universal Real Hegemony in a small Paragon...it might have a disastrous cost!\"","WAA!","The Primordial Essence flowed around him like mild rivers as this being let of tremendous waves of power, his eyes glimmering with light as the white essence only receded after a few minutes, his hands waving as he called forth the [Wings of Primordial Destiny] to communicate with a few certain beings while staring toward the illusory screens showing fighting scenes.","The Microscopic Hegemony and the Hegemony of Old Chaos also turned their eyes towards the scenes containing Noah. They focused on the Paragon in question, their expressions hardening as they saw the scene of this being screaming out grandiose words with a fevered expression as he faced the terrifying Incarnations of Chaos.","\"Come on...hit me! Hit me!\"","...!","\"...\"","His expression didn't seem right as against the beings that held power far above any Paragons...he was bellowing out for others to attack him!","Oathkeeper and the two other powerful Hegemonies had no words as they observed and looked for solutions, a single thought crossing their minds as they paid attention to the unfolding battles in 2 Universes.","The singular thought was that this Paragon in question...he was a bit eccentric!","Meanwhile, the auras of Incarnations of Chaos were raging wildly in the Necrotic Universe, the 10 that had stayed behind to Summon Legions of Undead having called forth Billions of terrifying creatures that shone with flames containing hints of Cosmic Daos.","To call forth such armies, Noah could see that a huge strain was placed on the Incarnations, their Origins constantly creaking as they felt like they had swallowed something they couldn't digest!","The flames on their eyes were burning brightly, but they seemed to be the burning flames of a dying ember that could go out at any moment.","\"I see.\"","Amidst his excitement, Noah spoke out slowly as the three Undead Paragons near him let off any reservations and continued to attack him with powerful skills.","\"Eternal Death is guaranteed to you all after accepting this power into your bodies...\"","RUMBLE","\"Just be sure not to die before you give me what I want!\"","...!","If they fought terrifying battles where their Origins were strained as they wildly used the unfamiliar power...they would be running towards death at an even quicker pace!","What would such beings even be thinking at this moment?","Beings that knew eternal death was coming for them, and they were doing it to themselves?","WAA!","It was only a thought from Noah, but he didn't truly care.","At this moment, there was an eruption of essence.","From Noah's body, demonic essence began to crawl out as he used a skill he normally had no need to use- an ability that vastly enhanced his defensive and attacking parameters when he faced truly powerful enemies.","[Arch Demon Lord Transformation].","BZZZT!","The essence of Ruination and Annihilation weaved into the cellular components of this new body as the base was built from the essence of Cosmic Daos, the power actually being something even more wondrous than what Noah could normally display when he used [Arch Demon Lord Transformation]!","...!","At the end of it, a glorious existence appeared.","Having grown over 100 meters in stature as he was slightly bigger than the Seven Deadly Sins, the skull being the only thing not filled with muscle as all portions of his body were covered with tout steel like muscles that seemed indestructible!","The skull...it took an entirely crimson color as golden flames still remained on its eye sockets, and there were now two demonic horns rising from the skull as they twisted and came close together, the moment they touched causing a spark of crimson flames to appear as this flame...went on to cover the entirety of the skull.","A titanous Undead with a crimson flaming skull and golden flames burning fiercely in its eye sockets...it was the first appearance of the Demonic Lich Emperor as his aura...nearly touched upon the same level as what the Incarnations of Chaos were releasing.","Nearly!","Without any need for him to swallow a portion of an Origin from a Hegemony!","THRUM","...!","A golden light flashed onto the titanous figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor.","[Strength of the Weak]...[Envy the Mighty]...[Galactic Devastation].","RUMBLE!","Since the enemies he met were truly powerful this time around, Noah had no problem buffing himself to the extremes and somewhat going all out!","With such a transformation and overlaying of boosts...he could fearlessly take in all the coming hits of Incarnations of Chaos as he watched the Value of Chronos just climb towards 100..until he obtained this Cosmic Dao!"]},{"number":1037,"title":"Chapter 1037: Chapter 1036 - I Wont Lift A Finger!","paragraphs":["A titanous Demonic Lich Emperor with a flaming crimson skull.","This was the image that the 20 Paragons that had ingested the Origin Essence of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos saw as all their eyes focused on it.","The 7 that were battling the Sins momentarily lost their focus as some suffered injuries, the three that were around the Demonic Lich Emperor feeling his aura the closest as the 10 that had stayed behind to summon Legions of undead also felt it very clearly!","They felt an aura...that was no less than theirs.","...!","This naturally caused some heavy feelings to rise deep in the hearts of these Undead Paragons, the reality that a being had naturally reached the same stage of power that they reached through their own sheer strength alone- not having to do what they did and become Incarnations of another existence.","They weren’t fools. These Paragons had lived for too many years, and even with the influence of the Dao of Necromancy that the Hegemony of Necromancy used when he gave them the Origin Essence for them to absorb, it was still their choice to do in the end..","First, they believed in themselves and their power, thinking that their origin would be able to handle the essence of a Hegemony if it was just a small portion of it.","Second was the fact that they knew sooner or later...the Tyrannical Lich Emperor that had its forces conquer over half of the Necrotic Universe would make its way towards them as well. When that time came, they would have to choose to either face eternal death or pledge their fealty to another being!","Instead of this...they chose another path as they ingested the origin essence for even greater strength, only for them to find out they truly were not able to handle this power within their Origins, and that in a matter of time, eternal death would come for them.","This was the price they had to pay to achieve a level of power no other Paragons could even dream of!","Yet...","RUMBLE!","The aura that the Demonic Lich Emperor released was no less than theirs, the flames within the sockets of these 20 Paragons waving somberly as they wondered.","Just how was he so different from them? What did he do differently that even without sacrificing his life, he could reach the same power as them?","No answer came.","Spatial essence wrapped around the figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor as he disappeared from the 3 Undead Paragons that were surrounding him, his terrific aura appearing behind the 10 Undead Paragons that had stayed behind to raise entire Undead Legions.","His flaming skeletal head seemed to forcefully pull the attention of all beings towards him as it held a sense of regality, his figure appeared in the middle of the vast armies of billions that the 10 Paragons had summoned, his voice coming out calmly.","\"Let me measure the resolve of the beings that have subjected themselves to eternal death.\"","THRUM!","His hand that was wrapped with steel forged muscle pointed towards them as his finger beckoned for them to come, the flames on his head blazing calmly.","\"I won’t be lifting a finger. I’ll just see what one can achieve by taking the easy way out and ingesting the Origin of a Hegemony.\"","WAA!","His words seemed to pierce into the only things that these Undead Paragons cared about now, their Origins flaring out with power as the Origin Essence they ingested churned out madly. Anger rose within the hearts of the Paragons that knew death was coming for them, the words of the Demonic Lich Emperor making them rush towards him as their bodies lit up with the essence of Chronos and Extinction!","Even the 7 that were facing the Sins had tried to bypass them and attack the majestic looking titanous Demonic Lich Emperor, but their enemies gave them no leeway as only 13 Undead Paragons made a beeline towards Noah.","The 3 Primal Winged Undead Emperors and the 10 Undead Lich Emperors all burned with power as their bodies lit up bright red and purple, 13 magisterial clocks appearing behind each of them as a bubble of purple clocks was soon created in the surrounding miles.","The clocks rotated wondrously around each other as they released a terrifying swirl of Chronos and Extinction to surge towards the lone figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor that at this moment, stretched his hands out and raised his skeletal head, merely waiting for the destructive burst of attacks to land on him!","His body that was reinforced mainly by Ruination Essence vibrated with power, the enhancements and boosts from many skills overlaid together causing his body alone to cause the surrounding space to tremble as a second later, the full power of 13 Incarnations of Chaos smashed into his body.","BOOOM!...CRACK!","The attacks were so potent and horrendous as even the void was shredded apart like paper, the two essences of Extinction and Chronos working hand in hand as their goal was to reduce everything they touched to ash where it was through the factor of time for Chronos or simply pure extinction!","But for Noah, none of this mattered.","For him, what mattered was just the reality that these attacks were filled with the vibrant essence of the Dao of Chronos.","WAA!","Amidst the raging flames of extinction that remained after the essence of Chronos was sucked up, Noah’s bright eyes glanced at a certain number within his Status Panel.","[Chronos Integration Value] :: 17/100","The flames surrounding his head blazed every brighter as space began to stabilize.","The void folded and healed as the scene cleared, the flames within the sockets of the Undead Paragons blazing up somberly as after everything cleared, they still saw the scene of the Demonic Lich Emperor spreading his arms out as his body...was spotless.","...!","It actually seemed to vibrate with an immense amount of power that was nigh endless, the attacks of Incarnations that exceeded any Parameters of Paragons actually not being able to pass through him!","Only his voice rang out as it caused the minds of the Undead Paragons to buzz with activity.","\"A few more minutes. I still won’t lift a finger against you all.\"","RUMBLE!","His figure remained floating in the void as he spoke out domineeringly, the existences that had given away their lives just to reach the same realm of power as him bellowing out as they rushed towards him like flies!"]},{"number":1038,"title":"Chapter 1038: Chapter 1037 - CHRONOS I","paragraphs":["Outside of the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, there was first a single Hegemony watching the scenes of the shocking battles within and broadcasting them to others.","After a few minutes passed since the first appearance of Incarnations of Chaos, even more Hegemonies from the vast array of Universes within the Primordial Cosmos appeared outside the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, their gazes upon the new form of horrendous warfare they had not come across before!","Creatures ingesting the Origin of Hegemonies as their power far exceeded anything that the rank of Paragon had to offer!","Yet...","What about the Paragon that had not ingested any Origin Essence of a Hegemony and was somehow still releasing the same battle power as these existences known as Incarnations of Chaos?","What exactly gave him the strength to propel his power to a level no other Paragons in the Primordial Cosmos could reach?","The Hegemonies watching right outside of the Necrotic Universe looked at each other with somber expressions as they had no answer.","Those observing the broadcast from illusory screens in far away universes looked at those around them silently, not having the slightest idea why as one thing was confirmed on this day.","The Paragon that many had dismissed before or didn’t give too much attention to in the past had stepped into their spot light today!","As Many Hegemonies looked at his regal figure that was taking in attacks from 13 Incarnations of Chaos, they couldn’t help but burn this image deep into their eyes!","BOOM!","In the Necrotic Universe where the terrifying battle was taking place, 13 purple clocks were floating permanently in the skies as their purple aura covered the 13 Paragons, their bodies flitting through the river of time as they appeared to attack Noah from different time points with every single move..","It was extremely hard to describe the workings of the Dao of Chronos into words, but the Paragons were shuttling through time with a difference of a few seconds as from the current time, they appeared a few seconds in the past and released shocking attacks, and some appeared a few seconds in the future to release even more deadly attacks.","It meant that when time came together, the figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor would be receiving attacks from the past and the future as such attacks...were not ones that an existence could defend against!","That was... unless they had the dao of Chronos as well and they could also shuttle a few seconds in the future and the past to defend against attacks they didn’t even know of.","It meant that with utter precision and accuracy, their deadly attacks all landed on the Demonic Lich Emperor as he could only take them from three different time points, with the only thing he was capable of doing being to just defend with his body!","This method...would have worked and worn down any Paragon as after just a few seconds of receiving unseen attacks from different times would have shattered their defenses and brought them that much closer to death.","But against Noah...it mattered not whether they came a few seconds in the future, past, or present as his Arch Demon Lord Form and boosts from a myriad of different skills were still active during this time as none of them could penetrate his defenses!","All that mattered to him was a certain value.","[Chronos Integration Value] :: 68/100","His eyes lit up with immense fervor every time this value rose, his body still feeling the tingling pain from the strikes of beings that were exceeding the Parameters of Paragons!","But he himself was already on the process of exceeding the power of Paragons long before them, as he was already connecting the galaxies within his Origin at a rate that they couldn’t even begin to imagine.","The Conquest of the Necrotic Universe was already half complete as his subordinates had also covered a significant portion of the Automaton Universe.","He had left behind many Galaxy clusters with trillions upon trillions of Undead Clans that pledged Fealty to him, only taking a few Paragons to add to his Undead Legion as at this moment, all of them were still on stand by with the Legion that held a swirling Necrotic Ring of Death behind Noah and the Seven Deadly Sins!","The uncountable number of undead that had pledged Fealty had now also contributed to the Marks of Antiquity he formed, these Marks going on to create another 1.5 Billion Dao Galaxies as the total number now came to 3 Billion as they were still rapidly increasing.","His Origin was bubbling with power as this contributed to the reasons why he could withstand the incarnations right now- he was already making great strides towards forming his Universal Seed as he was 6% of the way there!","BOOOM!","Space twisted again as the purple clocks above the void circled endlessly, attacks seemingly coming from all sides at this moment as his body got thundered with them even more vigorously, his tough skin and muscle made from the very essence of Ruination beginning to crack and tear.","But even to this...he only smiled as he saw the essence of Chronos sink into him deeper!","[Chronos Integration Value] :: 81/100","The Value he was looking at so dearly continued to rise as he could almost taste a new Cosmic Dao, his flaming skull rising up jovially as during the magisterial scene of being swarmed by 13 Undead Paragons with the colorful waves of Cosmic Essence flying out all around him...he laughed boisterously.","KEKEKE!","The dreary laugh of the Demonic Lich Emperor rang out clearly as it caused the Origins of the 13 Incarnations to tremble with wrath, one of the Primal Winged Undead Emperors bellowing out as his body lit up brightly, the purple clock he controlled shining brightly as getting even larger as he was utilizing an enormous amount of mana for an ultimate skill that utilized the Dao of Chronos!","But...","CRACK!","A second later, a horrendous sound rang out that could be heard across all the explosions resounding across the deathly chaotic void.","It came from the Paragon that was just bellowing out and utilizing enormous amounts of mana, the flaming eyes of this existence looking down on its chest as it peered deep into itself and saw that its Origin...had an enormous crack bisecting it in half.","...!","The Incarnation had overworked his Origin until it could no longer handle the Origin Essence of the Goliath within him!","Due to his anger and wrath at the Demonic Lich Emperor that laughed at the face of their attacks, he had actually brought the death that was supposed to come a month later as it arrived on the same day, the strain on his origin being too much as this would be one of the first beings who would literally die from anger due to the words of a certain Lich Emperor.","CRACK...BOOOM!","With an expression of shock, the Origin of this Paragon imploded as the powerful Paragon was turned into countless bones shooting out everywhere, the center of explosion leaving behind a pulsing unstable obsidian mass that seemed used up and nearly depleted!","...!","All that he left behind was an unstable Seed of Chaos!","The other Incarnations of Chaos looked at this scene with somber expressions as their hearts trembled, seeing the fate awaiting them as the fast pace at which they churned their mana within their bodies were slowed down unconsciously.","As all of them merely stared at the unstable mass of Origin Essence that had imploded a Paragon apart, only a single being could still move with clarity.","WAP!","The figure of the cackling Demonic Lich Emperor appeared at the spot where a Paragon had just perished, his eyes shining brilliantly as his hands reached out towards the unstable and nearly depleted Origin Essence of a Hegemony!","He was moving naturally as he only had a single thought in his mind.","’This should work as well, right?’","Just an instinct...but he followed it to completion!","[Devouring].","...!","THRUM!","A black mass erupted from Noah as it took in the unstable Origin Essence under the ability of the Sin of Gluttony, very quickly breaking it down as a vast amount of differing Dao Essences within this unstable origin were broken down into pure mana and vitality.","All Dao Essences...except for the one that Noah was currently integrating!","It was seamlessly sucked into his Origin as under the shocked gazes of Paragons and Hegemonies, Noah alone saw two prompts appear in front of his eyes.","[Chronos Integration Value] :: 100/100","...[Commencing the process of the Emergence of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos.]","\"...\"","Noah’s eyes glimmered with light as he felt as if all sound became blocked out at this moment.","As if he was alone in a world of silence, only a singular light beginning to bloom in his eyes!","At this moment...","A regal purple light shone!"]},{"number":1039,"title":"Chapter 1039: Chapter 1038 - CHRONOS II","paragraphs":["Across the Primordial Cosmos, there were three beings that had comprehended the Cosmic Dao of Chronos.","Each of them were stretched across the Cosmos but at this moment, all of them raised their heads towards a certain direction.","\"What?\"","In the Elysian Universe, the regal expression of Oathkeeper was replaced with shock for the first time.","\"...\"","In the Automaton Universe, the black hole taking the place of the head of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos swirled with shocking power as he looked in the far away direction silently!","\"Impossible!\"","Only a single other being showed more emotion, and it was the one that was even given the title of the Hegemony of Chronos.","This being looked towards the direction of the Necrotic Universe where just like Oathkeeper and the Goliath, he sensed a blooming purple light that signified Chronos being comprehended by another being!","THRUM!","In front of the Universal Construct within the Animus Universe, Chronos rose up with a grim expression as he looked far away, his mind buzzing with activity as yet another thing that shouldn’t have happened...was occurring.","In the many lifetimes he lived through, not once had another being comprehended Chronos. Not until many years from now when the situation within the Primordial Cosmos would be vastly different.","Yet...","WAA!","\"Old Man, what’s got your panties in a bunch?\"","At this moment, the voice of valiant looking Valentina rang out as cosmic Dao essence spilled from her, the task of her clone continuing to descend down the Animus Universe continuing as even while she was defeated by Chronos multiple times, she never gave in as she continued to call forth more clones!","Chronos only gazed at Valentina’s clone with impassive eyes that flashed with a purple light, a gigantic clock appearing behind him again as it shot out with a killing light.","---","Meanwhile, in the Necrotic Universe.","The dazzling glimmer of purple caused many eyes to turn towards it in shock, but this purple color eventually began to be tinged with red!","When Chronos and the Goliath utilized this dao, it was tinged purple with all of their attacks. When the Oathkeeper used the Dao of Chronos, the huge clocks he summoned were tinged gold.","Now that Noah was undergoing the process of emerging a new Cosmic Dao within him, it became his own as different from the purple or golden luster, it became a beautiful purple-crimson color that melded together into a beautiful picture!","THRUUUM!","From his body, waves of Cosmic Essence of Chronos began to leak out madly as they permeated throughout the chaotic void, a purple-crimson clock of ridiculous proportions beginning to form above everyone.","The aura caused every single being in its shadow to shake at its sheer power and majesty, the obtainment of this Cosmic Dao by Noah at this moment being something of great importance!","He of course held the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, a Dao that when he utilized it fully as he had hiddenly done so before- he could actually wipe out any creature on the same level as him in a matter of seconds.","But he didn’t use it freely as until now, this was a card that would be kept secret as knowledge of it meant others also knowing he held a Cosmic Treasure of the directly opposing nature to the Primordial Disk that Oathkeeper held.","So the wondrous and overpowered Dao of Ruination wasn’t utilized openly or frequently in Noah’s battles.","Now, he had obtained the Cosmic Dao of Chronos. It was only a level below Ruination, but it was a Dao of ridiculous power that stood above many other Cosmic Daos, the power it could display being something only the three most powerful powerhouses of the Primordial Cosmos understood!","Since he obtained it in front of everyone’s eyes, he would utilize it to its fullest possible extent as at this moment, the purple-crimson clock had stretched out for tens of thousands of miles as it passed the size of normal planetary bodies, and it was still spreading out.","RUMBLE!","At the center of it all was Noah Osmont.","He comprehended the pristine Dao of Chronos as knowledge of how he could very easily manipulate time filled his mind, numerous scenes flitting through his mind at this moment!","The scene of when he obtained his Cosmic Treasure.","The scene of him defeating Aldritch after he tore open the boundary of the Novus Galaxy and invited outsiders.","The scene of him obtaining the Rank S [Volcanic Eruption] in the Blessed Empire and using it to decimate a Mephitic Turtle as Elizabeth and other hunters watched in awe and shock!","The scene of him...obtaining a Rank F [Fireball] after he used up all of his savings, right before he awakened to see a blank value next to his [Focus]!","All of these scenes played out in front of Noah’s eyes as he shockingly found that uniquely because of his Infinite Mana...he could actually return to any of these times!","...!","Chronos couldn’t do this! Oathkeeper or the Goliath couldn’t do this!","This was partly because they lived in the Primordial Cosmos as the most powerful beings, and any single one of them reversing time would mean they were not just doing it for themselves, but for the entire Cosmos they were in.","The essence required for this...was too much!","They could utilize the Dao of Chronos to jump back in time a few hours or a day at most, but their mana reserves wouldn’t allow for anything more.","An example was when Noah had utilized the Dagger of Time to jump back barely a few days in when he was moving in the World of Cultivation and the Demon World. His mana was more than enough, and the affected area was very small.","Affecting an entire Cosmos...even for Oathkeeper and the others, it was too hard!","But the existence that held Infinite Mana could do many more things with time.","THRUM!","Even more mystical knowledge rushed into Noah’s mind at this moment as the comprehension of Chronos settled in.","Time!","The abstruse and ridiculous concept of time!","Time actually didn’t follow a linear path...!","It wasn’t a straight forward concept of going from A to B as there was much involved with it!","Those capable of jumping through time held great power as the things they did could vastly change entire realities.","Even for Noah who was capable of jumping through time at this moment, even to the very point right before he awakened as a Hunter...at any point that he did something vastly different than what he did in the original time, things would be greatly changed as this would actually create a branch in time...it would create a whole new reality!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1040,"title":"Chapter 1040: Chapter 1039 - Phenomenal Power! I","paragraphs":["A single action different from the Original Timeline creating a branch in time that would bud into a whole new reality!","Such a concept caused Noah’s heart to tremble as after the comprehension of Chronos, his mind could see a vast and endless River of Time that seemed to stretch endlessly. This river of time occasionally had smaller rivers stemming from it, and these were all points in time where beings utilized the law of time or the Dao of Chronos to do something.","But eventually, all of these small rivers of time merged back with the main one that churned endlessly forward.","The Original Timeline!","Noah looked at the image of the river of time, seeing the path of his current timeline of him growing up, of his parents falling to the first Beast Tides when the Apocalypse began, of him obtaining a Rank F Fireball skill book up until now when he obtained a Cosmic Dao.","It had many paths and possibilities, but they all led to where he was right now!","He...could not change this.",".","Any grand changes he made would only put him on another branch of time, something he still didn’t understand the consequences of!","Even though he had the mana requirements to go back to even the point before he obtained the Rank F Fireball Skill Book, he did not do so as he still had not fully understood Chronos and Time! He didn’t know the effects it would have on everything, and what would happen when he left the Original Timeline he was currently in, or what effects it would have on this timeline!","From his Novus Galaxy to the Dark Universe, and now to the Primordial Cosmos where 9 of its Universes were currently under lock in a process initiated by some of the most powerful beings within the Cosmos...and wherever this would lead.","Maybe when he had fully assimilated Chronos.","At that time, maybe he would understand more about branching timelines and realities, and whether he could truly move without shattering everything.","Maybe when he understood things even more after he obtained the Cosmic Dao of Reincarnation and how that was different from Chronos. Was the Hegemony of Chronos Reincarnating in the Original Timeline this whole time? What about the timeline before he reincarnated? What about..","BZZT!","Noah’s mind buzzed with possibilities as he found no answer, only a single word permeating his mind as he calmed everything down.","Maybe...","RUMBLE!","His eyes twinkled with a purple crimson luster as he came out from his thoughts and glanced at the enormous purple crimson clock that his endless mana had created, this clock strengthening out for hundreds of thousands of miles as it caused the vast Legions of Undead and all their Paragons to look at it in awe.","This clock was the manifestation of Chronos, something that Oathkeeper and the others also called forth as they used it as a medium to affect anything to do with time. Now, Noah had called it forth grandly as he unreservedly let it grow with a constant input of mana, giving it its current size that even blinded the eyes of the faraway watching Hegemonies!","Noah stared at this vibrant clock as he thought about its usage.","He was filled with knowledge on how to manipulate time and could do so with a wave of his hands, but he didn’t have established skills he could utilize to easily affect time at the utterance of a word.","He didn’t have them, so he would just make them.","A few billion of his remaining skill points were used as a simple skill tree with five abilities that could utilize Chronos was created!","As for the name, Noah simply termed the skill tree [Wielder of Chronos].","[Wielder of Chronos] :: A skill tree geared towards a basic application of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos. Abilities include [Temporal Looping] (5/5), [Instantaneous Age Regression and Progression](5/5), [Temporal Manipulation Perception](5/5), [Temporal Halt](5/5), [Temporal Inversion](5/5)","[Temporal Looping] (5/5) :: Depending on the mana used, the user can place a certain area or being on a temporal loop that is extremely hard to escape from. Only those capable of releasing strength to shatter the effects of time itself or beings proficient in the workings of time can seamlessly escape Temporal Looping.","[Instantaneous Age Regression and Progression](5/5) :: The user can cause the instantaneous age regression or progression in a selected target.","[Temporal Manipulation Perception](5/5) :: The workings of time are filled with mysteries, with this passive ability allowing for the user to sense when time has been manipulated and the exact point of its occurrence.","[Temporal Halt](5/5) :: The user can cause a temporal halt around a certain area or being, causing time to come to a stop. The larger the affected area of Temporal Halt, the greater the chance of creating a branch in time.","[Temporal Inversion](5/5) :: The user can inverse the time around a certain area or being, causing time to flow in reverse. The larger the affected area, the greater the chance of creating a branch in time.","\"...\"","Terrifying abilities that were all under the [Wielder of Chronos] skill tree that had the definition of basic application of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos!","Noah looked at the set of skills with careful eyes as when it came to Chronos, it was like someone had handed Noah a truly dangerous bomb that he could freely change the size of, the effects he could display being extremely terrifying as he himself had to be careful how he used it.","The [Temporal Manipulation Perception] ability was working passively so that he didn’t need to worry when others manipulated time. So he himself...would begin slowly studying the Dao of Chronos with the active abilities he created!","His flaming eyes gazed at the 19 Undead Paragons below him that still glanced towards him with utter shock, his figure capturing the eyes of all as at this moment, he floated above everyone as a gigantic purple crimson clock rotated magisterially in the chaotic void above him.","They saw his eyes turn towards them as they shivered unconsciously.","They then heard his words ringing out clearly as to the shock of all, Noah began to use the essence of Chronos wildly for the first time!","[Temporal Halt].","BZZZZT!","The enormous purple crimson clock released a flood of essence of Chronos as it went to watch over just the 1 mile area where Noah, the Sins, and the 19 Paragons were fighting in.","Just a single mile.","But everything within this mile...came to a halt at this moment.","Everything but the terrifying figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor that floated serenely!","He had obtained what he wanted as he had not made a move all this time.","Under the shocked gazes of many beings, he now made a move!"]},{"number":1041,"title":"Chapter 1041: Chapter 1040 - Phenomenal Power! II","paragraphs":["[Temporal Halt].","The Hegemony of Necromancy was watching the appearance of the purple crimson colored clock that was hundreds of thousands of miles in diameter while shuddering with utter shock and stupor.","He had only utilized 20 of the 100 Seeds of Chaos to create 20 Incarnations of Chaos that he sent forward, but never would he have thought that the result of it was somehow their enemy becoming capable of utilizing the Dao of Chronos!","How?!","Could someone just comprehend a Dao as mysterious and abstruse as that so easily?!","Could someone do it just because they wished to do so?!","The flames on this Hegemony trembled with shock as a second later, he watched as a time stop was placed in a region of a single mile. But everything within this mile except the figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor had come to a stop due to his single command.","\"...\"",".","The Trillions of Undead Legions outside could move, and they even edged back from the frozen space temporarily as it seemed they didn’t even want to be near it!","Within the frozen space, the 19 Incarnations of Chaos could consciously feel this Temporal Halt as they trembled with fear, but they held the essence of Chronos within them as well due to the Seeds of Chaos they swallowed, so the purple essence erupted around their bodies as they fought to move in the stopped time.","But...","In terms of the essence of Chronos, just who would be the winner?","Logically, even the Hegemony of Necromancy still in a stupor thought the enhanced Incarnations of Chaos would come out on top at the end of it, breaking past the Temporal Halt as they fought a life and death battle with the enemy that had somehow comprehended a Cosmic Dao that they could only utilize the essence of due to the Seeds they ingested.","Yet the 19 Incarnations seemed to be struggling as the purple essence of Chronos tried to protect their bodies, while the figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor had waves of purple-crimson essence still coming out front the enormous clock above the chaotic void endlessly as if mana was not a limited utility for him!","This...was actually the moment in time that the many watching Hegemonies would begin paying attention to Noah based on the amount of mana he was using, as many of them understood the reality of the Dao of Chronos and how much it would require of someone.","Yet the being before them...he was calling forth an endless amount of the essence of Chronos as even against 19 other beings that could utilize this essence as well, he overpowered all of them!","19 beings at the same stage as him, 19 beings that were actually Incarnations of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos.","\"...\"","\"The mana required for this...impossible!\"","RUMBLE!","The Hegemony of Necromancy was the first to utter this as other Hegemonies followed. In the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, even more Universal Experts came to observe this shocking scene as before they could even get past the shock that a Paragon was seamlessly utilizing the essence of Chaos, they then saw his pure utilization of Mana as he called forth endless amount of this Cosmic Essence as if he had mana reserves of tens of Hegemonies.","The 19 Paragons were overwhelmed with the essence of Chronos Noah used to reinforce the Temporal Halt, none of them being able to move as a second later, this terrifying Demonic Lich Emperor called out another skill.","[Temporal Inversion].","Under a Temporal Halt, he actually tapped his fingers in the void carefully as the churning seas of Chronos essence rushing from the slowly rotating purple-crimson clock turned into rivers of light that only wrapped around the 19 Paragons.","The Time Inversion...was only focused on these beings themselves as Noah actually considered that he was doing something simple.","From the vast River of Time that he could now gaze upon, he was naturally able to see a few things. His focus on the 19 Paragons let him know that whatever grand change that had occurred to make them Incarnations of chaos happened not too long ago!","And this...was the target of his Temporal Inversion.","He was simply inverting the time of these Paragons, the state of their bodies and of their Origins- just an hour back!","An hour back before they became Incarnations of Chaos.","RUMBLE!","At certain levels of power, one didn’t need to use brute force as many ingenious methods existed they could utilize.","Noah getting his hands on the Cosmic Dao of Chronos opened many methods for him as at this moment, many eyes watched in shock as the bodies of 19 Paragons became fully surrounded by the rivers of essence of Chronos as they formed into a bubble of crimson-purple light that swirled around them!","With this circular bubble of light, the bodies of the 19 Paragons were showing an eerie scene of twisting back and forth, their time of their bodies and Origin being inverted in a shocking fashion as those who didn’t have deep comprehensions in the concept of time wouldn’t even be able to understand what they were seeing.","THRUM!","A brilliant flash of light occurred after a few seconds from the 19 bubbles of crimson purple light, piercing screams ringing out from the Undead Paragons as they felt something overbearing be pulled apart from their Origins and Souls.","WAA!","Noah tapped his hands once more as the [Temporal Inversion] around their bodies was stopped, the scene around the Undead Paragons becoming clear for all to see.","Their bodies looked ragged and essence fluctuated around them weakly, but there was another thing beside their bodies that drew the eyes of all those watching. The Hegemony of Necromancy was one of the first to have their eyes drawn towards it, his body beginning to tremble as he waved his hands to observe the 80 Seeds of Chaos he still had with him as when he turned back to the 19 Paragons...he saw the same 19 Seeds of Chaos that he had induced them to ingest some time ago!","...!","\"This...!\"","An impossible scene!","A shocking reality!"]},{"number":1042,"title":"Chapter 1042: Chapter 1041 - The Apex Paragon! I","paragraphs":["19 glimmering Seeds of Chaos floated beside the bodies of the 19 Paragons as after a Temporal Inversion, their state returned to a time before they ingested them and became Incarnations of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","It was a mind bending ability that others could not even fathom, those watching feeling breathless as the ones who truly understood it all had somber expressions.","The scalp of the Hegemony of Necromancy tingled as he drew in a sharp breath, merely watching as Noah waved his hands and the Seeds of Chaos that could create Incarnations that far exceeded the power that Paragons could display..simply land on his hands as he looked at them curiously.","\"...\"","The field of battle turned silent.","Not a single soul moved as only the whirling Necrotic Ring of Death surrounding the Trillions within the Undead Legions that weren’t even mobilized made terrifying sounds.",".","The Seven Deadly Sins had long since received Noah’s command as they pulled back and watched the magisterial scene of his power without making any moves against the Undead Paragons they were facing.","The flames within Noah’s eye sockets blazed brightly as the essence of Chronos that was gushing from the expansive crimson-purple clock stopped momentarily. The Temporal Halt and Inversion came to a stop as the 19 Paragons all turned their eyes towards Noah with utter shock.","The 19 Seeds of Chaos that had seamlessly separated from their Origin floated in front of him as he looked at them calmly, his voice being the only thing ringing out in the vast chaotic void.","\"I have saved you from the certain death that these terrible seeds of Origin Essence would have brought you.\"","RUMBLE!","As he handled a portion of Origin Essence from a genuine Hegemony, Noah spoke out simply towards the 19 Paragons that had their bones begin trembling with shock!","\"Something like this is not the path to true power. With them, you would have become mere sacrificial lambs under the aims of someone else...it is not power!\"","BOOOM!","His voice boomed out majestically as even the Hegemonies watching from illusory screens from far away Universes or those that had appeared outside the boundary of the Necrotic Universe had their attention pulled in.","\"Let me show you true power...kneel and pledge Fealty to me as I show you what true strength is!\"","...!","The 19 Paragons gazed towards Noah’s figure that stood above them with utter stupor, his figure seemingly covered with a brilliant white luster as a star of conquest shone above him majestically- making him look like an ancient primal being out of pure fantasy.","Their skeletal hands unconsciously reached out to him as after feeling his immense power- after experiencing him actually inverting time and bringing them back to before they ingested the time bombs that would have shattered their Origins...their very essence seemed to reach out towards him as when a certain prompt appeared in front of their eyes, they called out softly.","\"I pledge Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor...\"","\"I pledge Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor...\"","\"I pledge...\"","RUMBLE!","The star of conquest above Noah shone brightly as the 19 Seeds of Chaos before him were put away, the eyes of all beings witnessing the scene of him alone standing against 19 Paragons at the same stage as him, stripping them of all their power...and then making them kneel as they pledged allegiance to him.","...!","The hearts of many Hegemonies were jolted at this moment as a set of words appeared in their hearts, but they still couldn’t bring themselves to utter it out loud.","A set of words flowed through the minds of all Hegemonies!","It was a set of words, or more so a title, that was given to a being that absolutely stood over all other beings at the same stage.","In the millions of years of recorded history of the Primordial Cosmos, existences given titles such as these were few and far between, with others claiming these titles only to lose them as they faced defeat soon after, and others not being able to keep their lives when they advanced to the Realms above.","At this point in time, only two existences were still alive in the Primordial Cosmic who held a title such as this, these existences namely being the Oathkeeper...and the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos!","Before they advanced to the Universal Realm, they were unrivaled in the level of Paragons as no beings in their universes or those that could cross the boundary of Universes could match them.","Now, as they looked at a being who stood against 19 Paragons that had ingested the Origin Essence of a Hegemony and showed power that far exceeded any bounds of Paragons...as they watched this being so seamlessly and easily take down all 19 of them at once as a second later, they were kneeling and pledging their fealty to him...this title rose in their hearts!","THRUM!","The Wings of Primordial Destiny of one of the Hegemonies outside of the boundary of the Necrotic Universe shone as an instant later, the magisterial figure of a golden haired existence with glimmering wings appeared, his entrance brightening up the surroundings as his golden eyes gazed upon the figure of Noah and the shocking scene of 19 Paragons kneeling towards him.","What others could not utter, he could.","After all, he had obtained such a title in the past as well.","\"Apex Paragon...\"","RUUMBLE!","Golden waves of destiny and fortune exploded out at the mere mention of this title, the surrounding Hegemonies turning their eyes to look at Oathkeeper with solemn expression before they returned to a being they had to now pay attention to!","The Apex Paragon!","In this era, he was the only one to rise and take this title as the Oathkeeper and the Goliath had long since lost it the moment they rose to become Universal Realm Hegemonies.","But on this day, all of them saw the birth of a new Apex Paragon- of an existence that in the ranks of Paragons was unrivaled!","If he met any others of the same rank, he could dispatch them with ease as his power was already edging towards that of a Hegemony!","WAA!","The only other Apex Paragons to break through to the Universal Realm had become 2 of three Existences that stood at the very top of power in the Primordial Cosmos.","The eyes of many powerful beings gazed upon the fearsome figure of a being that had glorious white essence cascading down from a glimmering star, an enormous clock thrumming with the essence of Chronos far above him as they wondered...just what would happen when this Apex Paragon achieved the Universal Realm as well?"]},{"number":1043,"title":"Chapter 1043: Chapter 1042 - The Apex Paragon! II","paragraphs":["Within the Necrotic Universe, a spatial fluctuation occurred near the Hegemony of Necromancy as the form of a being with a swirling black hole appeared beside him.","Having just returned from delivering more Seeds of Chaos in the Automaton Universe, the Goliath looked at the scene of Noah standing above 19 Paragons that his Origin Essence had just been occupying, and then looked at the 80 Seeds of Chaos that were yet to be utilized.","A sense of pervasive silence seemed to descend around them as the Hegemony of Necromancy also continued to gaze at the 80 Seeds of Chaos!","20 of them had already been used against their enemy, and yet this being had seamlessly taken care of them as the remaining 80...it was a wonder to the Hegemony of Necromancy on just what they should do with them!","The Goliath had a silent expression as his awareness focused on the figure of Noah far away.","At the vibrant Essence of Chronos that stood above the chaotic void still swirling endlessly.","Seeing such a development and being stumped on exactly what to do, the period of silence between the two Hegemonies continued until a voice transmission entered their ears at this moment.",".","\"An Apex Paragon should not have appeared to stand in our way, and yet it has. It is simply the tricks of the Primordial Cosmos trying to veer us off course, but it will not work.\"","RUMBLE!","All the way from the Animus Universe, the voice of Chronos rang in their minds as it continued a second later.","\"All of it just means we’re on the right path...and that our mission will achieve our intended results if we are getting this much interference. Antiquity is within reach sooner than any of us can expect, and this should become apparent in a few hours...\"","...!","The eyes of the Hegemony of Necromancy shone as the Goliath remained impassive, the voice of Chronos entering their minds for the last time.","\"After all these days, the accumulation has reached a milestone as it can be considered one-fourth completed, with a portion of the essence of Antiquity from the Universal Constructs spreading out across the affected Universes!\"","\"When that time comes, use the Seeds of Chaos again...!\"","THRUM!","A shocking revelation came from Chronos as even when it seemed many things were stacked against them, he voiced out that in a matter of hours, the situation would change as the Universal Constructs would bring them all to a whole new stage.","They were the only ones with this knowledge as the powerhouses opposing them were still reeling from the fact that an Apex Paragon had appeared, and that this being had somehow comprehended the Cosmic Dao of Chronos that very few Hegemonies got their hands on!","Outside the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, Oathkeeper pulled out his [Wings of Primordial Destiny] as he spoke into it carefully, his target being the Apex Paragon below them that was waving his hands and reassembling his armies.","The other Hegemonies in the surroundings perked their ears as they listened with solemnity.","\"You’ve gained the title of an Apex Paragon after standing against beings with power exceeding this stage and still defeating them. How exactly did you manage to do this?\"","Oathkeeper and the others all wanted to understand Noah- they all wanted to know what this Paragon that was leading the charge against their battle with beings that wanted to harm their own Cosmos had that made him this unique and powerful!","Within the Necrotic Universe below, the figure of the Demonic Lich Emperor waved his hands and called forth the Wings of Primordial Destiny as he seemed to adopt an utterly serious expression while getting ready to reveal a shocking secret.","The Hegemonies saw this atmosphere as they listened closely, the voice of the Apex Paragon ringing out soon after.","\"...with enough hard work and dedication, anything is possible.\"","\"...\"","RUMBLE!","Tumultuous fluctuations of essence buzzed out around the Hegemonies, the eyes of the Oathkeeper remaining impassive as even with such an answer, he continued to send another message.","\"The Cosmic Dao of Chronos...it is something that even Universal Realm Existences cannot easily grasp, how did you comprehend it?\"","\"...\"","Many beings listened breathlessly as their gazes towards the Apex Paragon varied.","This being seemed to be too eccentric as even his answers weren’t reliable, and after recalling how he conversed when they found out he designed Daos himself and his most recent reply, they seemed to already know what was coming as they prepared themselves!","Below them, Noah grasped onto the Wings of Primordial Destiny as he looked at the crimson purple clock still swirling above his head. His hands tapped towards it as it shimmered brightly, the enormous clock reducing in size instantaneously as it very soon came down into barely a few inches of a clock that descended on his hands, the essence of Chronos potent as it showered his body with power.","While controlling such a Cosmic Dao, he spoke lightly as he seemed to be revealing a profound truth.","\"I’ve always been called a genius since I was young, so this must have something to do with it...\"","\"...\"","\"After seeing you, the Goliath, and that Chronos use the Cosmic Dao of Chronos so many times and now these Incarnations of Chaos utilize it too...I was unconsciously able to pick it up.\"","RUMBLE!","The words were like a thundering strike of lightning that smashed into the Origins of the listening Hegemonies, all of them turning mute as even the Oathkeeper did not ask any more questions!","They were just receiving constant reminders of how ruthless the mouth of the Apex Paragon was, simply left to look at his actions in awe without understanding exactly how he was able to do it all.","They could merely observe this being’s movements from afar as a single being was still focused on him very deeply.","It was the one that had brought Order among the vast powers of the Primordial Cosmos, the being that held a profound Cosmic Treasure that could control the very Primordial Essence that made the Cosmos around them!","At this moment, Oathkeeper’s gaze focused deeply on Noah as many thoughts crossed his mind, a sharp light of destiny coursing through them as thoughts of great immensity coursed through..."]},{"number":1044,"title":"Chapter 1044: Chapter 1043 - A Mere Glimpse Of Antiquity! I","paragraphs":["The Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos had given 100 Seeds of Chaos to the Hegemony of Necromancy, and he had gone to the Automaton Universe where Noah’s subordinates were moving to give a hundred more to the Mechanical Hegemony.","The races of mechanical beings within the vast Automaton Universe were more closely interconnected as there would even be entire galaxies where a single central machine mass produced the Androids or Automaton Sentinels. Naturally, the Paragons moving throughout were much more interconnected as well, the number ingesting the Seeds of Chaos and becoming Incarnations also being 20 for the first wave that the Mechanical Hegemony sent forward!","The Android and Automaton Sentinel Paragons to arrive on the battlefield had shown immense battle power as the Clones of Emperor Penguin, Anna, the Sword Emperor...the clones of many of Noah’s subordinates were wiped out before the battlefield was brought under control by no other beings than Noah’s own Animus Summons.","Being connected to Noah, each of them could display the Cosmic Dao of Ruination when his clones fused with them, his summons being the only combatants that could withstand the robotic Incarnations of Chaos that utilized Lasers filled with the essence of Extinction and nuclear photon bombs that blew apart entire regions a few seconds in the past and future as they utilized the Dao of Chronos to land sure hit attacks!","Only Noah’s summons could handle them at this moment, and even they were put on the defensive for the first few minutes of the battle as they alone kept the attention of 20 Android and Automaton Sentinel Incarnations of Chaos. That is...until Noah underwent the process of Emergence and obtained a brand new Cosmic Dao..","A glorious set of events unfolded thereafter, but we actually only need to focus on a single one.","It was the actions of a certain being that was even declared a taboo in the Primordial Cosmos, a being that could disrupt certain rules that very few could even imagine breaking!","RUMBLE!","In the vastness of existence, there were certain absolute laws and rules that held everything in place- things that existed to make possible a semblance of balance in the wide expanse of chaos.","An example of this was the concept of Cosmic Daos, and how they could only be obtainable through certain methods as they held extremely heavy restrictions around them!","For Noah to be able to bring to fruition the [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] ability, he utilized the quantifiable essence that he gained from reaping the lives of billions of other existences- the 130 Billion skill points...to bring this ability to fruition.","It was a hard and terrifying number to wrap one’s head around, but it gave Noah a backdoor to bend the rules and give him the capability to obtain Cosmic Daos in a relatively smooth manner.","But...there existed other beings that had the potential to be even more terrifying than Noah.","Beings that possessed ridiculous abilities innately as they could overturn the balance of many things...and it just so happened that one of such beings was contracted to Noah!","RUMBLE!","The cerulean blue eyes of the childish figure of the Universal Emperor Slime hid in the folds of space as he watched the scenes of the shocking power of the Incarnations of Chaos- Android and Automaton Sentinel Paragons that had swallowed a portion of the Origin Essence of a Universal Hegemony.","This Blue Slime had a skill unique to its race and its race alone, a skill that made them existences with terrifying potential! It was of course, their ability of <Universal Devouring> that was starkly different from the [Devouring] that the Sin of Gluttony held, so different that they were many classes apart!","<<Universal Devouring>> :: Any life form that is devoured will be fully assimilated seamlessly as their abilities, Realm, Law Comprehensions, Dao Comprehensions, and anything else within their existence will be obtained. This is an ability unique to the Universal Emperor Slimes.","This was the description of the skill that Noah had read when he first contracted with the Blue Slime, and it remained the same at this point in time as it held wondrous implications when he gazed at the Incarnations of Chaos in this Automaton Universe.","Their bodies glimmered with a metallic glint as the Automaton Sentinel Paragons were massive, their faces being a blank metal canvas that shone with a deadly luster. The Automaton Android had humanoid bodies that would change every so often to reveal deadly weapons hidden throughout.","They battled with the other Animus Summons as the assassin hidden in the dark was ready to make a move.","The Universal Emperor Slime looked at these existences with a hungry gaze that could only be satiated after something was devoured! And the chance for this had arrived as a brand new Cosmic Dao had just landed on Noah’s lap.","One of Noah’s clones was fused to the body of the blue slime as he wondered, just what results would come out of this creature utilizing <Universal Devouring>?","As the skill description stated, would it truly do what it said? Was the innate ability of this Blue Slime that terrifying?!","It was a question that had to be answered, so the master and summon moved forward as they instantly appeared behind an Automaton Sentinel, the small hands of the Blue Slime waving mystically as he was the first of the Summons to use the essence of Chronos through Noah and cast a [Temporal Halt]!","BZZZT!","From the bodies of Tiamat, Calamity Bear...and all the other summons, the glorious luster of the essence of Chronos also erupted out as they targeted the other 19 Incarnations of Chaos.","In front of the Blue Slime, a gorgeous color of purple and red erupted out around the body of the Automaton Sentinel. Its figure creaked and shook powerfully as the essence of Chronos had already begun to erupt from it as well, but the Blue Slime only needed barely a second of this being staying in place for him to do what he wanted.","WAA!","A glimmer of blue shone as the body of the blue slime ballooned rapidly, instantly covering the enormous figure of the Automaton Sentinel Incarnation of Chaos that held within it...a portion of an Origin Essence of a Hegemony!","Something that Noah nor this Blue Slime would have ever had the chance to even come across if the Goliath had not done what he did!","The Sentinel’s red eyes merely shook as its senses told it of a horrendous future that it could not stop.","<<Universal Devouring>>","WAP!","...!","A bright blue light shone out.","An Incarnation of Chaos disappeared.","The childish body of a blue haired boy reappeared calmly in the void of space as a second later...something even more terrifying was born!","From its body, there was the eruption of the unstable auras of the essence of the Cosmic Daos of Chronos...Extinction...Phantasm...all of the Dao Essences present in the Seeds of Chaos that the Incarnations ingested.","All of them. All of them without question!","...!"]},{"number":1045,"title":"Chapter 1045: Chapter 1044 - A Mere Glimpse Of Antiquity! II","paragraphs":["A lull appeared on the battlefield as a terribly overpowering Incarnation was devoured, a singular figure taking on the stage as everyone’s eyes focused on him, his childish features being extremely deceiving as the body of this being was currently trembling with overpowering waves of power!","He had just devoured a minuscule portion of an Origin Essence of a Hegemony, and true to its function...the ability of <<Universal Devouring>> that was unique to the Universal Emperor Slime truly seamlessly assimilated everything devoured.","But the portion devoured was truly too minuscule as the essence of many Cosmic and Grand Daos vibrated from it body in an unstable fashion, its Origin being the one thing undergoing the greatest changes as 100 billion glimmering galaxies began to form hundreds of thousands of connections right away...this existence making its way towards forming a Universal Seed!","That was how domineering the ability of <<Universal Devouring>> was!","Seeing the unstable aura of the Blue Slime, Noah’s clone had a grim expression as even though it seemed like the Cosmic Daos were already within its grasp, the myriad of differing essences weren’t setting down.","The consciousness of the clone reached into the expansive space that was shared with the main body and the rest of the clones as within it....there were 19 pristine and unused Seeds of Chaos.","The events between the Necrotic and Automaton Universe happened nearly simultaneously, with Noah’s battles beginning first as the Incarnations within the Automaton Universe only appeared later!","By the time that Noah defeated the 19 Paragons with Temporal Inversion and put away the 19 Seeds of Chaos extracted from them, they were removed by the clone in the Automaton Universe right away as he brought them out one by one and had the Blue Slime silently use <<Universal Devouring>> on them directly.","THRUM!","One Seed of Chaos after another...were directly devoured by the Blue Slime as the aura surrounding his figure became more and more monstrous while also stabilizing.","The vibrant essence of many daos swirled majestically around his small figure, the comprehensions of a myriad of Cosmic Daos ridiculously being obtained by this Universal Emperor Slime at once!","Normally, such a reality where an existence like him at the level of Paragon gaining access to the Origin of a Universal Realm Hegemony that had comprehended many Cosmic Daos would never have come to fruition, but The Goliath and Chronos had simply hatched a scheme that benefit certain beings too much!","BZZZT!","After the 19th Seed of Chaos was devoured by the Blue Slime, the auras of Cosmic Daos around him fully stabilized as the childish cerulean blue eyes opened with a bright light, a sense of shocking power hidden within as every single existence on the battlefield looked towards it in awe.","The expression on the childish face was that of utter fulfillment as the hands of the Blue slime were raised up, the skies quaking as the essence of Extinction and Chronos erupted out gloriously, ready to target the 19 remaining Android and Automaton Sentinel Incarnations of Chaos as aside from it, the other Animus Summons also trembled with the essence of Chronos that Noah’s clones were channeling through them!","Outside the boundary of the Automaton Universe, a Hegemony was holding a Wings of Primordial Destiny within his hands as they trembled, not even being capable of sending the message of what he was seeing across as after they saw and heard about an Apex Paragon rising as he comprehended the Dao of Chronos, he was now seeing a cerulean figure release not just Chronos, but the essence of Extinction and a myriad of other Cosmic Daos as he was followed by the commanders of the Legions also releasing the essence of Chronos.","Had Cosmic Daos become so easy to comprehend nowadays?","Could anyone just pick them up whenever they wished?","Just what was going on with these beings that all held the shimmering Star of Conquest over them?!","RUMBLE!","There were many questions with no answers, but news of the shocking developments in the Automaton Universe quickly spread as many Hegemonies also turned their eyes to this direction as well.","This fantastical development reached Oathkeeper as he grasped onto the Wings of Primordial Destiny where he could communicate with a certain being, recalling his biting words not too long ago as he expected this eccentric Apex Paragon to do something similar!","But he couldn’t not ask!","\"The existences leading the Legions of the 9 Supreme Bloodline Races in the Automaton Universe that are now utilizing the Dao of Chronos among many other Cosmic Daos...\"","His question didn’t even finish as from the Wings of Primordial Destiny, the Oathkeeper received a reply from Noah halfway through his question.","\"Oh, them? They’re just my contracted summons. They’ve been slacking in power recently, but now one of them has even comprehended Extinction before me...Ah!\"","...!","\"...\"","The reply was nonchalant as it seemed he was both proud and pained that his summons had achieved a Dao that he had not been able to comprehend himself.","Even though Noah was currently fused with the Blue Slime, all of its gains from the racial <<Universal Devouring>> were for the Slime alone as it felt like a barrier existed for Noah when he tried to gain access to the new Cosmic Daos it just comprehended. Just like how he could use Ruination Essence within the bodies of his summons and they never learned or comprehended the Dao of Ruination, his Summons could use their comprehended Daos as they were their own!","After listening to Noah’s reply, Oathkeeper did not continue asking anything else as he only looked at the scenes of the fantastical events taking place in the two Universes, his thoughts being his own this powerful being soon adopted a decisive look, glorious golden light erupting from his eyes at this moment!","For the ongoing battle thereafter, everything proceeded smoothly as with the help of his Summons, the Incarnations of Chaos in the Automaton Universe were brought down as their reign of Conquest continued unhindered.","Similar to Noah in the Necrotic Universe...they didn’t face another set of enemies or Incarnations after that as it seemed there was no response to their shocking actions from Chronos and the others!","But...it wasn’t that there was no response, it was just a delayed one as from the words of Chronos to the Goliath and others, the Universal Constructs had reached a certain stage as a shocking effect would soon be revealed."]},{"number":1046,"title":"Chapter 1046: Chapter 1045 - A Mere Glimpse Of Antiquity! III","paragraphs":["Since the process of Universal Amalgamation began, more than a week had passed as the progress had reached a significant milestone.","Chronos considered this milestone being one fourth of the way there, which gave the shocking timeline of another three or four weeks at most before enough accumulation of essence had occurred and then....","Antiquity!","THRUM!","There was a vibration of essence from the Universal Constructs located in the 9 Universes currently under lockdown. The Hegemony of Necromancy and the Goliath still remained in the Necrotic Universe as they watched Noah’s Legions continue forward after defeating 20 Incarnations of Chaos.","Their eyes looked towards the Universal Construct that the Hegemony of Necromancy was tasked with protecting as at this moment...the cocoon like structure of the Universal Construct began to thump like a beating heart as with every beat, there was a rapid awakening of a shocking power that nobody in the Primordial Cosmos had come across before!","In the Automaton Universe, in front of the Universal Construct that the Mechanical Hegemony protected while keeping 80 Seeds of Chaos close at hand....a similar phenomenon occurred as a pulsing heart beat began to resound from the Universal Construct.","This phenomenon occurred in all 9 affected Universes as they brought with them a shocking feeling of awe and power, Chronos staring at the cocoon like Construct in the Animus Universe as his eyes shone with a glorious light!","\"It is here...\"","THUMP!!","The gaze of Chronos was that of utter fervor and might as a terrifying aura pulsed from the Universal Constructs that very closely resembled cocoons at this moment, these cocoons pulsing as if they were resonating to a heart beat as with every thump, waves of crimson light were released across the vast Universes!","THUMP!","The heart beat faster and faster as it seemed like a symphony about to reach a crescendo, this sound spreading to every living thing within the Universes as Noah’s figure gazed towards the direction of the Universal Construct in the Necrotic Universe with a somber expression.","THUMP!","The star of conquest above his head pulsed with power, washing down pure white essence unto him as at this moment, a crimson essence began to come out in waves along with every single beat of the Universal Constructs.","His legions came to a stop as they observed this phenomenon with immense somberness in the Necrotic and Automaton Universe.","The Hegemonies outside of these Universes also felt this shocking phenomenon as many were alerted, Oathkeeper having already been closely observing the Necrotic and Automaton Universes when the phenomenon began as his body had already begun to light up with Primordial Essence!","WAAA!","The sounds of heart beats reached a crescendo as each of the Universal Constructs began to glimmer with a brilliant crimson light that went on to spread out and cover every single corner of the 9 Universes.","When this light passed through planetary bodies, void of space, and galaxies, they shuddered from its sheer pressure!","When they passed through living beings...something even more shocking occurred as many would not be able to understand what was happening, but a certain someone who had a system that could quantify many things was able to understand most of it right away.","Noah was one of the many beings to feel the crimson wave of light emanate from a far away Universal Construct and wash over everything, a unique phenomenon occurring within his body as the moment this light passed...he felt as if a large number of shackles were placed onto him!","Shackles!","This was the only way he could describe it as it wasn’t until a second later that a blue text box began to buzz with words in front of him, gradually spitting out what was occurring as Noah’s eyes opened wide with shock at every word he read.","[Under the Influence of a portion of the aura of The Great Usurper. The effects of Corruption of the Usurper, Malignant Madness, and Heretical Malediction are applied.]","...!","THRUM!","Noah’s eyes shone with shock as he felt the surroundings drastically change, his body seemingly constricted on all sides at this moment as the first blue text box went away, his eyes focusing on a few select words on it as more information appeared in front of him!","[Corruption of the Usurper](Initial) :: Those not under the protection of the Great Usurper gain the Corrupted Status directly on their souls as their Mana and Health Regeneration are reduced by half, the Damage Taken from other sources is increased by 10,000%, -10,000% To All Laws and Dao Resistances, -10,000% Comprehension and Assimilation Ability to all Laws and Daos, -50% Life Force, -50% Reduction in All Attributes, -50% Effectiveness of All Abilities, -50% Mana Reserves, -50% Movement Speed, -50% Attack Speed, -50% Cast Speed, -50% Efficiency of Mana Conduction and Usage, and 50% Chance of Skills Failing on Cast.","[Malignant Madness](Initial) :: The Pressure of the Great Usurper coils around you, reducing the strength of your Soul by half and granting the status effects of Fearful, Enfeeble, Maddened, Weakened, Impotent, Demoralized, Petrified, Debilitated, Wasting, Webbed, and Overwhelmed.","[Heretical Malediction] :: Once one remains in the presence of the aura of the Great Usurper without protecting themselves from it invading their Origins, a Malediction blooms within their souls as it will eventually devour them and cause the emergence of the Followers of the Usurper. Heretical Malediction causes a metamorphosis of the body and soul that is unchangeable once it has taken place. The time of initial change is around 14 Cosmic Days.","...!","A shocking set of debuffs brought about by a mere aura of an existence that was being called out to by Chronos and the others!","The corruption of the Usurper...he could not even defend against it as anyone within the boundaries of the 9 Universes had this effect applied directly to their souls. One could not even defend against it!","It stemmed from the cocoon-like Universal Constructs, but as mentioned from the status effects Noah was seeing, it was merely an aura of a being. A mere portion of it.","At this moment, those living within the 9 affected universes felt the shocking wave of a mere portion of an aura of Antiquity. Just a mere glimpse of Antiquity that nearly caused every existence in the 9 Universes to fall to their knees!","Just a glimpse!"]},{"number":1047,"title":"Chapter 1047: Chapter 1046 - Encumbrance!","paragraphs":["\"Finally...\"","THRUM!","Chronos felt the waves of crimson essence land on him as the effects were much different compared to what Noah and the others felt.","Whatever negative effect the beings within the 9 Universes received, they were oppositely positive when the aura of the Great Usurper landed on the bodies of Chronos and others similar to him!","All of the Hegemonies that had branded their auras to the Universal Constructs, all of the beings that were under the influence of these Hegemonies and thus had the protection of the Great Usurper instead of being its enemy...all of these beings experienced an enhancement in their strength as the terrifying reality of what would come in the future was slowly revealed.","Chronos had a light smile on his face as he seemed to be reminiscing, his hand landing on the pulsing cocoon as he felt the beating of the powerful heart that released the crimson wave with every thump.","His smile became even brighter as he turned around thereafter, staring at the shocked figure of Valentina’s clone not too far away that he had placed on a Temporal Lock. His eyes shone with a sharp light as he sent a voice transmission to a certain being at this moment.",".","\"Ambrose, come back to the Animus Universe and face this annoying fly that continues to come back. The Cerulean Hegemony will take your post in the Liberated Universe.\"","...!","A shocking message that was followed through as soon after, the astounded figure of Ambrose appeared in the Animus Universe while feeling the immense burst of strength from the pulsing Universal Construct.","Chronos waves his hands as a purple clock unwound, the Temporal Lock around Valentina’s clone fading away as her figure bubbled with power while she looked at the two enemies with a deadly glare.","\"What have you fools done now?!\"","THRUM!","Her body glimmering with powerful light as the Star of Conquest above her spun powerfully, shooting towards Chronos as this time around, they wanted to test the effects of a portion of the aura of the Great Usurper on their enemies!","Ambrose was the one to go meet Valentina’s attacks as Chronos watched from the side, his eyes shining with a sharp light as when he watched the battle unfold...the shocking reality of the edge that Valentina showed against Ambrose had disappeared, and the Hegemony of Slaughter was actually controlling the pace of the battle once more as his expression became excited.","BOOM!","Not even putting the effects of [Malignant Madness] into account, just the [Corruption of the Usurper] was enough to change the tides of power for many beings!","Damage Taken being increased by 10,000% while the resistance to all laws and Daos was reduced by the same percentage...just this effect from the Corruption of the Usurper was enough to demoralize many beings. But there were even more on top of all this as Valentina was the first to taste the results of the new reality against an enemy she could overwhelm before.","\"Haha!\"","After 10 minutes, Ambrose laughed out boisterously as he shattered the clone of Valentina with a storm of Annihilation, this being taking too much pleasure from this action as the light of slaughter within his eyes shone brightly!","Even though it took Chronos a few seconds to dispatch one of Valentina’s clones under normal circumstances, it had still taken Ambrose over 10 minutes to do the same even while under the effects of the aura of the Great Usurper.","This was a difference in power in terms of Cosmic Daos being shown yet again!","Chronos looked at the celebrating Ambrose as he nodded, his figure beginning to fade away into particles of spatial light as he sent multiple messages towards Ambrose and a few others.","With this progression, he had no need to oversee the Animus Universe constantly as Ambrose could now take care of the only enemy Hegemony capable of descending within this Universe, and Chronos could move again to fully control the many things occurring across the 9 Universes at this moment!","Antiquity...it wasn’t too far away as he could already taste it!","---","\"These fuckers are getting bolder and bolder...\"","In the Dark Universe, Valentina spoke in an annoyed manner as Barbatos listened to her words with a proud expression, taking credit for the gradual change in the language of this pristine Hegemony.","\"But this aura coming from the Universal Constructs...\"","Valentina turned her eyes towards Noah after she felt the connection between her and her clone destroyed yet again, this time by a being that couldn’t defeat her before!","She could only turn to the being that had shattered her world view time and time again, her gaze and the gazes of Barbatos, and Adelaide all turning towards Noah’s figure that was floating off the ground as his body was surrounded by a storm of Universal Fortune and golden waves of Destiny.","He opened his eyes soon after as he gazed towards them while speaking lightly.","\"Just a small portion of the aura of Antiquity! It comes with too many status effects as it should heavily cut off the battle power of many beings. What I’m most worried about is the [Heretical Malediction] that permanently changes weaker beings into Followers of the Usurper. That’s trillions upon trillions of beings that are already Vassals and even future possible Vassals...!\"","His eyes were filled with an unknown light as Adelaide appeared beside him with a smile while hugging his back.","\"You can just transport all of them to the Dark Universe. After that, the rate of accumulation of those Universal Constructs you mentioned should be heavily reduced, right?\"","The Ice Queen spoke lightly as Noah raised his brows while feeling the two soft blessings land on his back, trying his best to stay on schedule as Parallel Mind and a myriad of other abilities kept him focused on the serious subject at hand.","\"There should be less than two weeks before the effects of [Heretical Malediction] kick in...we’ll conquer as many Universes as possible before then and migrate however many beings required if need be! But the battles from now on will be much harder...\"","Noah thought of the restrictive status effects that his Primordial Ruination Clone was currently facing as his eyes shone with a grand light of destiny, wanting to know just how the Chronos’s group would move after the spread of this aura of the Great Usurper!","He seemed to be the only one worrying though as Barbatos also walked towards Noah while clapping her hands.","\"Ok so, the other issue at hand- that Athena, Anna, and Elena walking around all depressed this whole time and bringing the whole mood down...you have to fix that mess and take responsibility! It’s not like you don’t have endless mana and clones to take care of everything...\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s expression changed as an even harder task was placed on the plate of his main body, his Primordial Ruination Clone and other clones left to deal with the shocking developments of the 9 affected Universes in the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1048,"title":"Chapter 1048: Chapter 1047 - Relentless! I","paragraphs":["Within the Necrotic Universe.","The fearsome presence of the Goliath vibrated powerfully as his voice rang out towards the Hegemony of Necromancy.","\"...Now use the remaining 80 Seeds of Chaos. All at once.\"","...!","After the spread of the terrifying aura of the Great Usurper, the Goliath and others in the same camp naturally weren’t affected by this as they had their auras branded onto the Universal Constructs. Now, they would only be using this as a chance to wipe out the fearsome Apex Paragon making his way across the Necrotic Universe!","The Hegemony of Necromancy nodded as his figure disappeared, going into the depths of the remaining Clans of Undead in the Necrotic Universe as he planned to utilize all of them to take down the coming enemy.","Not a portion of the forces remaining in the Necrotic Universe...but every single Paragon and Monarch he could find as long as he could entice them while utilizing the Dao of Necromancy!","He would make this Apex Paragon that had now fallen under the effects of the aura of the Great Usurper and had their power greatly reduced face the remaining force of an entire universe that were led by 80 Incarnations of Chaos!","---","\"The Great Usurper...\"","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone repeated these words over and over again in his mind as he familiarized himself with this unknown enemy.","The Undead Legion behind him was filled with over 50 Paragons at this moment, all of them leading sections of hundreds of billions of creatures that waded through the Universe in search of more existences he could conquer as he now had even more reason to rapidly increase the Marks of Antiquity!","At this moment as he neared the completion of the conquest of the Necrotic Universe, he had gained a few billion more as the number was currently edging towards 8 Billions Marks of Antiquity.","He expected for him to hit the 10 Billion Mark with the complete Conquest of the Necrotic Universe, leaving behind only 40 Billion more before he could completely connect all of the 100 Billion Galaxies within his Origin and form the Universal Seed!","When that time came...!","RUMBLE!","Noah’s eyes flashed with power at this thought as he focused on the present. To complete the conquest of the Necrotic Universe, Destiny told him he would have to overcome a perilous battle.","A battle where he was under horrendous debuffs from the mere aura of an Antiquity, where the power that his Subordinates could display was reduced by a large amount!","But when it came to him...","Even if the debuffs made it so that he had -10,000% Comprehension and Assimilation Ability to all Laws and Daos, so what? He had tens of thousands of percentages when it came to this area!","Even if he could receive +10,000% more damage, so what? He had the Purification of both Ruination and Primordial Essence that had long since spilled over 1,000,000% to all Parameters, granting him that same percentage in defense, health, mana conductivity...everything!","Even if they cut his mana reserves by half, what was half of INFINITY?!","RUMBLE!","A glorious flash of golden light shot out from his eyes at such a thought, raising his head as he looked towards a certain direction where a storm of essence was gathering.","He was currently situated upon an enormous throne of essence and bones as he kept his form of a Demonic Lich Emperor, moving at the forefront of the Legions of Undead that swirled with the Necrotic Ring of Death.","The Seven Deadly Sins pulsed with immense power as they moved right behind Noah, each of them carrying an aura of malevolent power as even with the debuffs, they seemed even more intent on battling their enemies!","The over 50 Paragons were behind the sins as they led trillions upon trillions of Undead that ranged from Dullahans, Dragons, Draconic Vampyres, Titanous Undead...all the myriad of Undead Races at the ranks of Entities and above filled the Undead Legions that seemed to cover the distance of a Galaxy.","Undead Legions covering millions of miles in diameter!","Ah!","Against all of these forces, Noah raised his gaze as he noticed the storm of essence hundreds of thousands of miles away gathering, the auras of tens of Paragons beginning to light up as they came closer and closer.","These auras were extremely unique as they were not just those of Paragons...but they exceeded this level as they infinitely neared the ranks of Hegemonies- it was the aura of Incarnations of Chaos!","OOOOH!","Against the rising auras of powerful beings, Noah’s forces felt their oppressive pressure tens of thousands of miles away as the Paragons stopped their forces and had them brace themselves, the Paragons on his side bellowing out as the trillions of Undead followed.","OOOOH!","The bellows reverberated across the chaotic void as even with the oppression of an Antiquity, Noah’s forces still seemed to vibrate with power.","The auras of Incarnations of Chaos came even closer after a few seconds, Noah remaining on his throne as he gazed calmly at their appeared figures.","WAP!","A spatial essence vibrated out as 10 appeared soon after.","WAP!","Then twenty.","WAP!","Fifty.","WAP!","Eighty!","RUMBLE!","The pristine and domineering aura of 80 Undead Paragon Incarnation of Chaos appeared grandly as behind them, for millions of miles...were the auras of undead that looked as vast as an unending sea.","They towered majestically before Noah as the endless sea was actually hundreds of trillions of undead, promising for a shocking battle to come as all of them were led by powerful Incarnations at the very forefront!","Some of them were Lich Emperors as their skeletal figures blazed with blue flames, standing atop Undead Qilins and Dragons.","Other Incarnations were Abyssal Undead Emperors as they were the size of Planets, holding in their hands swords and spears in the form of Dao Weapons as a single swing from them could shatter a star!","The majesty and honor of the Races of Undead were all present at this moment as they all stared silently at Noah’s calm figure that was still sat on the imposing throne of bones.","THRUUM!","Essence flew around the battlefield madly as not a single side spoke, an oppressive silence descending in the chaotic space as both sides seemed to just watch each other.","Outside the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, there were also a few Hegemonies watching this battle as inside the Necrotic Universe itself, the Hegemony of Necromancy and the Goliath were also watching near the Universal Construct.","Many eyes watched this singular unfolding battle as the pervasive silence was needed for the shocking storm to come.","One side was under heavy debuffs as a single Demonic Lich Emperor led over 50 Undead Paragons and Sins, the other side had 80 Incarnations of Chaos leading hundreds of trillions of Undead!","In the tense standoff of power, a singular prominent being on a throne moved first.","He raised his palm grandly as a glorious star of conquest shone over him, a crimson purple clock blooming from his palm at this moment as it expanded to cover everything!"]},{"number":1049,"title":"Chapter 1049: Chapter 1048 - Relentless! II","paragraphs":["Under the influence of heavy oppression from an aura of an Antiquity, one had to be reserved as they moved with care.","This was the belief that the Hegemony of Necromancy and any others held when they thought about the many existences within the 9 affected Universes.","This was the belief they had when an army unlike any other had been prepared, 80 Incarnations of Chaos being produced as the result of them facing a heavily oppressed and weakened enemy should naturally be a one sided massacre.","Yet...","RUUMBLE!","A single being defied their expectations as while calmly situated upon a throne, he began to wildly release waves of mana, the essence of Chronos being at the forefront as a crimson purple clock bloomed in front of everyone’s eyes!","It expanded to cover thousands of miles in an instant, and continued to stretch out even further as when this being clenched his hand, this clock began to shine with a gorgeous glimmer of intense light!","...!","The Incarnations of Chaos looked at this scene as their bodies vibrated with the essence of Chronos, Extinction, and many other Cosmic Daos.","Their figures looked like 80 shining spots of light in the darkness of the chaotic void, burning intensely as they all moved towards Noah in unison.",".","THRUM!","The chaotic void shook as in response to the relentless advance of the figures glimmering with light, a 100 meter tall humanoid Sin of Pride flickers to the very forefront as the golden axe within its hands glimmered brightly.","The darkness was lit up even more in the next second, millions of miniaturized suns bloomed behind the golden axe as the Sin of Pride swung down with an expression of deep arrogance!","WAA!","The Sin of Pride moved first, but the rest of the sins soon followed as their bodies lit up brightly to release their own uniquely shocking attacks. One must recall...they should all be under heavy restrictions from the portion of the aura of Antiquity!","After them, the over 50 Paragon Undead behind Noah lit up with the essence of death, their Legions moving as the Necrotic Ring of Death began to expand.","It just had to touch and start killing a small portion of the enemy forces before it quickly bloomed to 1,000,000% increase in the Area of Effect and Damage of the Necrotic Ring of Death!","Many cards were ready to be played, but the main one remained the same.","It remained the Demonic Lich Emperor situated upon the throne of bones.","RUUMBLE!","His eyes blazed with an intense light as the clock that now covered everything shot out with a deadly light of Chronos!","---","Time continued to churn as many existences moved. Apart from the Necrotic Universe, there was also the Automaton Universe where Noah’s subordinates were leading the Conquest under his name! Similar to Noah, these beings had also invited the force of 80 Incarnations of Chaos after they took down the 20 initial Incarnations.","They did this with Noah’s power of course, but there was also a singular figure that had taken the spotlight recently. It was the figure of the Animus Summon that could somehow wield the Daos of Extinction and Chronos among many!","This existence moved like a whirlwind of death as with the essence of such pristine Daos surrounding him, he dispatched even the strongest Incarnations of Chaos in mere seconds!","But that was before the descent of the aura of the Antiquity that came with the [Corruption of the Usurper]. With such a thing weighing down this being, they should not be able to even stand against an Incarnation at this moment, right?","This was the thought process of the many Powerful Monarchs and Incarnations of Chaos from the Automaton Races and the Sentinels as at this moment, Noah’s subordinates were facing an army very similar to the same one he faced.","80 Incarnations floated opposite to them, the glimmer of deadly weapons and Vessels with nuclear plasma bombs being seen from the distance!","Facing them were the hardened figures of the clones of the Emperor Penguin, Kazuhiko, Barbatos, Steel Mikhail...and many others who were actually heavily affected by the [Corruption of the Usurper] as they were relatively normal existences that existed in the scope of understanding!","Backing all of these beings while borrowing Noah’s power was the Animus Summons, the images of the Obsidian Panther, majestic Golden Crown, the planetary sized Colossal Helios Leviathan...all of them were led by Tiamat and a singular cerulean figure at the very forefront.","The cerulean figure was an enormous Blue Dragon, this being the form that the Blue Slime had taken as he displayed ridiculous might with Cosmic Daos such as Extinction and Chronos under his belt!","The eyes of this Universal Emperor Slime at this moment were firm as they were even filled with an unshaken belief and resolve.","It was the resolve of the being that felt like he would soon attain enough power to ask certain questions and hold a few powerful beings responsible.","The resolve of a being to ask...why all of its race had to be massacred as it was currently the last of the lineage of the Universal Emperor Slimes!","The Blue Slime was normally nonchalant and even childish in nature, but it was still an existence that bore immense hidden pain that very few could ever experience. This was because very few would ever happen to live and realize they were the last of their whole race. Much less understand that they were hunted and had to live while hiding who they were all this time.","The Blue Slime was waiting until it reached the precipice of power as a Universal Realm Hegemony as it would then ask the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos- why did they do what they did?!","He wanted to question all of them- no matter if it was someone like Chronos or even Oathkeeper! He would ask them why all his brethren deserved to die!","If the answer was not sufficient, he might just choose to devour everything for recompense.","RUMBLE!","Noah’s clone was currently fused with the Blue Slime as he felt its tumultuous emotions, letting this unique being choose itself as Noah had an idea of the mystery behind the genocide of the Universal Emperor Slimes from Valentina.","But his subordinates weren’t just blank beings he could just forcefully move and command. They were their own existences that shouldered their own burden and pain, and Noah would let them seek their own justice.","The Blue Slime seemed to hear his Master’s feelings as the enormous body of the Blue Dragon trembled with power, Cosmic Essence leaking from him as he roared out towards the Automaton Incarnations of Chaos before him, his figure flickering with glorious light as he was the first to move!","ROOAAR!","It was a roar of immense power and resolve as at this moment, the body of the Blue Dragon lit up with the terrifying essence of Extinction, the image of a cerulean blue clock appearing behind the Blue Dragon as it moved to freeze everything in Time!"]},{"number":1050,"title":"Chapter 1050: Chapter 1049 - Where Is He Getting All This Mana?! I","paragraphs":["Glorious scenes of battle were hard to come across so frequently, but some beings could just create shocking scenes that deserved to be memorialized for eons and watched by all.","A force of 80 existence nearly reaching the power of a Hegemony was extremely frightening for one to face, and yet a certain being moved fearlessly to match them.","10 of them shook with power as they went to surround the seven deadly sins. 25 of them each faced 2 Undead Paragons as it came out that they matched all the 50-something Paragons that were leading Noah’s Undead Legions.","1 Incarnation of Chaos could easily match two or three normal Lich Emperor Paragons, and they boldly chose to do so as their main focus on this battle was a singular being. It was the Demonic Lich Emperor that had risen from his throne of bones and was already moving towards them!","After the division of 35 Incarnations, it left behind 45 of these powerful existences to move against a singular being.. Where it was Lich Emperors standing upon terrifying Undead Dragons shining with a gorgeous blue light or titanous sized Undead Titans wielding Dao Weapons capable of fracturing stars with a mere flicker- 45 of them surrounded a singular being as their bodies lit up with glorious waves of power.","A mere Paragon, under heavy debuffs at that, facing 45 Incarnations of Chaos. Yet Noah wasn’t flustered or fearful, his gaze placing as in the midst of all of this, he quickly tapped his fingers 45 times in the chaotic void as he looked at all the Incarnations coming towards him.","[Temporal Halt].","BZZZT!","From the space above them, the enormous crimson purple clock churned as it gushed out droves of the essence of Chronos, the bodies of the 45 Incarnations Noah faced blooming with circular swirling light as all their figures came to a stop!","Their own bodies lit up brightly to offset the effects of the singular skill cast by someone, but they found to their and the shock of many beings watching that the amount of essence of Chronos that Noah was releasing from the enormous clock above superseded each of them singularly...and then it went on to supersede them all together as droves of the essence of Chronos continued to wash down and wrap around them under Noah’s command!","These powerful Incarnations...actually could not break the Temporal Halt they were placed on as they all came to a stop.","All 45...stopped by a single being!","Noah’s gaze was still calm and free of worries.","To him, it mattered not whether it was 20 Incarnation of Chaos or 100.","The question remained whether they would be able to withstand when he utilized the Cosmic Dao of Chronos that could put beings in a halt in time. To do this, a mere Seed of Chaos and the small comprehensions it had on Chronos was not enough for mere Paragons to be able to break out of the shackles he placed on them!","This was because they lacked not just in how much of the quality of the Dao of Chronos they could utilize, but also the quantity of it.","Even at this very moment, he was converting mana into the essence of Chronos as it gushed out endlessly from the crimson purple clock, making it that even the large force of 45 Incarnations could not break free from his temporal shackles after he placed them!","This gave birth to the glorious scene that deserved to be memorialized for eons, a scene of a single being merely tapping their fingers in the void as a glorious eruption of light occurred, and then 45 beings of immense power were all brought to a halt from such an action!","Thereafter, his calm eyes that seemed extremely demonic and terrifying to all only gazed upon them all as he called out softly.","[Temporal Inversion].","Simple. Methodical. Precise.","What worked before can always work again.","His fingers tapped out 45 times once more as the dazzling essence of Chronos bloomed out beautifully, enticing all of those watching in a stellar fashion as it would put many beings in dismay!","---","The eyes of many watching Hegemonies were filled with somberness as they watched the unfolding scenes.","They were powerful beings that had lived for a great deal of years, and they knew very well about the concepts of mana usage, this type of subject even being something crucial that all experts focused on as it could decide life and death during battle.","Normally, not many beings would pay attention to estimate or count just how much mana reserves another person has, such a thing becoming readily apparent based on their actions during the course of the battle!","They would show signs of exhaustion or they would hold back on the skills they cast as they waited for their reserves to regenerate.","But as they looked closely at a certain being in past battles and even now, they came to realize something that they didn’t pay too much attention to in the beginning, something that other Hegemonies unconsciously questioned when they first viewed Noah’s battles.","It was the question of mana!","As they watched this being face 80 Incarnations of Chaos and wildly display many skills to stand against them, these powerful beings finally began to strictly pay attention to Noah’s usage of mana as when they did, their hearts began to shake at the mere reality of it as they noticed something.","It was the fact that on top of wildly throwing out a great deal of skills that utilized the essence of Chronos without worry, there was another area where this being was using mana freely in a way that they shouldn’t. To see this, the Universal Hegemonies that had noticed the situation used their power to simply observe the flow of mana, and this was when they came across the shocking scene of seeing thin lines of mana connections from the body of Noah’s Demonic Lich Emperor to the terrifying Seven Deadly Sins as well as...the over 50 Paragon Undead moving across the battlefield!","The Hegemonies didn’t know this, but this was Noah sending out the essence of Ruination and Chronos to wrap around the bodies of the Sins and the Undead Paragons to reinforce their power and protect them from the Cosmic Essence of their enemies.","To their dismay and shock, they found out that this being wasn’t just freely going around casting skills like the concept of mana didn’t exist, but he was also releasing mana to constantly reinforce tens of beings at the same stage as him!","As if he had so much mana for himself that he was free to even reinforce and give it to others!","As if mana...truly wasn’t a problem for him!","In the boundary of the Necrotic Universe, the Microbial Hegemony’s body was shaking with utter awe as he was the one to ask as many beings noticed the blatant waste and horrendous usage of mana from Noah.","\"How is it possible for him to even share mana with so many others? How is he capable of doing all of this? Just...where is he getting all this mana from?!\"","RUMBLE!","A simple question was asked, but there was no answer.","It was the question that would bring to attention the minds of many on the subject of mana and a certain being.","It was a point of focus that would give birth to one of the many titles that the Apex Paragon would come to hold. It was the point of focus for the eventual birth of the title Antiquity of Mana!"]},{"number":1051,"title":"Chapter 1051: Chapter 1050 - Where Is He Getting All This Mana?! II","paragraphs":["The process of accumulation was proceeding well even with the reduced gathering of essence in the Animus Universe.","It had proceeded to the point the aura of the Great Usurper had begun to leak and affect these Universes and the beings within, and yet...","BZZZT!","The horrifying scene of a single being standing up against 45 Incarnations that had power exceeding anything in the stage of a Paragon was playing out!","Chronos was watching this scene with somber eyes personally in the Necrotic Universe, joining the Goliath and the Hegemony of Necromancy in watching this spectacular battle near the Universal Construct within this Universe.","He left behind the task of defending the Universal Construct in the Animus Universe back to Ambrose as this Hegemony could now stand against Valentina’s clones with the aid of the aura of the Great Usurper.","But as he watched the glimmering clock that represented the tool one used to utilize the essence of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos, this being that was titled with the name of this Dao had somber eyes as he was reminded of a heavy pressure..","What he did was something that went against the natural law.","He knew there would be resistance and he would have to fight and claw his way out, but he never expected for such a ridiculous existence to exist as he believed this Apex Paragon appeared just to stand in his way!","As a being that had lived for too long, he knew the Cosmos weren’t just an inanimate object with no consciousness.","Doing what he did was an action harmful to the Cosmos, and he had faced resistance from such actions many times in the past.","But he had accounted for many things this time! Using the experience from all his past times, he had moved with care as he was even able to get one of the oldest beings of the Cosmos on his side!","Yet...how could the Cosmos be as ridiculous as to blatantly drop a being out of thin air to stand against him?! There should have been immense restrictions and limitations as such blatant interventions should not be possible.","Chronos was not just thinking these thoughts without merit. He was a being that had lived multiple lifetimes. In the many lives he led before he reincarnated, he had faced enemies that never had to face the hardship he faced to achieve power- enemies that got their position through sheer luck as if it was appointed for them to obtain it!","An example was the existence of the Oathkeeper.","What did this being do to deserve having a Cosmic Treasure? How did he even obtain it? Among the myriad of quintillions upon quintillions of existences, why did he end up with a Treasure capable of affecting the Cosmos?","Now, apart from a being like Oathkeeper, there was another existence that quite literally dropped out of nowhere.","Literally appeared from thin air as if he wasn’t even from the Primordial Cosmos until he just needed to be when Chronos was undertaking his plans!","An Apex Paragon that had battle power to take down Incarnations of Chaos that were infinitely nearing the power of a Hegemony...and this being could still display this power to its fullest even while under the oppressive aura of an Antiquity!","How?","\"How?!\"","RUMBLE","Chronos couldn’t help but utter out as The Goliath and the Hegemony of Necromancy beside him remained silent.","Their eyes tore across the void of space as they laid their eyes on the stellar scene of a being that merely tapped the space before him, bringing to a halt 45 Incarnation of Chaos!","The enormous spinning clock above everything then spun as the area and Origins around these beings began to undergo an inversion in time.","It was the fantastical [Temporal Inversion] that unless the enemy could dispel with sheer strength and power or the usage of immense quality and quantity of Chronos...they could not escape it.","The Incarnations of Chaos had the essence of Extinction and Chronos...and yet they could not break out of the Temporal Inversion! This was due to the scene that all of them were watching with rapt attention...the scene of endless essence of Chronos gushing from the Clock that the Apex Paragon had summoned above everything!","The Apex Paragon was beating everything with pure quantity, exchanging his mana for the essence of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos in insane amounts as it caused them all to question the source of his mana reserves.","The Hegemony of Necromancy could not help but utter and his breath as he watched.","\"Is he accessing the mana reserves of a fucking genuine Universe or something...?!\"","...!","He unconsciously uttered this as he watched the repetition of Seeds of Chaos being separated from the bodies of the Paragons, the number this time being double that of before as the Apex Paragon still did it as if it took the same effort.","As if it didn’t matter if he faced the crazily powerful Incarnations of Chaos when they were 20 or 45!","RUMBLE!","The chaotic void flashed with a glorious light as with a wave of his hands, the Apex Paragon called the 45 Seeds of Chaos now standing beside 45 weakened Paragons.","The field of battle turned silent.","The 35 Paragon Incarnations of Chaos that had gone to face the Seven Deadly Sins and the Undead Paragons within Noah’s Legions turned towards this scene with stupor as they didn’t know what to do!","45 of them had been wiped out with a mere tap of this beings fingers, what would 35 of them do when at this moment, some of them were even struggling with the Seven Deadly Sins they could barely hold up against?!","WAA!","An air of majesty spread out as the Demonic Lich Emperor caused the 45 Seeds of Chaos to disappear with a wave of his hands, his gaze placid as if he didn’t just incapacitate half of the enemy Champions in seconds.","His calm eyes that seemed capable of shaking the void itself landed on the weakened Paragons that just had something shocking separated from their Origins, his voice ringing out as it shook their very souls!","\"Fealty...or Death.\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1052,"title":"Chapter 1052: Chapter 1051 - A Single Minute! I","paragraphs":["\"Fealty...or Death.\"","RUMBLE!","Domineering!","Magisterial!","Tyrannical!","The void shook at the sheer dominance and tyranny of this Apex Paragon as his hand rose to up, ready to tap at any time as this simple action scared the Undead Paragons that had lived for hundreds of thousands of years!","A tap of his fingers had caused a storm of Chronos Essence to wrap around them as time was halted, a few other taps later and they were forced to go through an Inversion in time as they returned to the states they were in over an hour ago. Just what would another tap of his fingers do?!","Prompts appeared in front of the eyes of the 45 defeated Paragons.","Their Origins were locked onto the gaze of the terrifying Demonic Lich Emperor as one by one...",".","\"I pledge fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor...!\"","RUMBLE!","The eyes of Chronos shone with a somber light as he watched this scene.","The Hegemony of Necromancy was filled with disbelief as the Goliath continued to watch in mutely.","They had no words!","After the Paragons that had come to wage war very quickly bowed down to their enemy, the 35 Incarnations that remained felt a chill run down their bony spines as thereafter, the eyes of the Demonic Lich Emperor turned towards them.","The 45 Undead Paragons that were Incarnations of Chaos just a minute before also turned their gazes towards the Legions they themselves brought!","But...this was when a certain Necrotic Ring of Death came into the perimeter of the front most Legion.","Recall the effects of these wondrous skills!","[Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death](5/5) (PASSIVE):: A constantly swirling ring of death filled with the essence of the Daos of Ruination, Chronos, Annihilation....The greater and more powerful the number of Undead, the more potent and deadly the Necrotic Ring of Death will be.","[Endless Torment](5/5)(PASSIVE):: Any poor soul that manages to fall within the bounds of the Unstable Necrotic Ring of Death...adds 10% Increased Damage and area of effect for up to a maximum of 1,000,000% for 60 seconds.","There were thousands of Entities and Sages within such a legion as the moment that the Ring of Death touched them and the horrifying damage from the swirling chaos of bones and essence reaped their lives...it exploded in its area of effect and damage.","BZZZZT!","A few thousand beings died as the percentage very quickly reached +13,000% Damage and Area of Effect!","As it expanded to cover even larger regions and deal even more damage, the Undead within its folds fell even faster as in the next second, hundreds of thousands fell as its boost reached half a million just 2 seconds after the first death due to the Necrotic Ring of Death!","After the 3rd second...the full +1,000,000% cap of Damage and Area of Effect was reached as the Necrotic Ring of Death had already spread to cover over a million miles in diameter.","Within this area, there were trillions of Undead.","In the next second...","\"Ah...\"","Pure horror ensued as the Undead began to fall by the Billions!","BZZZT!","The Necrotic Ring of Death was too powerful, and after it moved to cover over 1 million miles...it allowed for the singular achievement of a being reaping the lives of a few trillions in a few seconds.","\"...\"","A pervasive silence descended as a terrifying Necrotic Ring of Death howled madly!","The 35 remaining Incarnations of Chaos felt the astounding strength of this Ring of Death as while surrounded by it, they couldn’t stand against the Seven Deadly Sins and the Undead Paragons on Noah’s side that weren’t affected by the terrifying effects of the Necrotic Ring of Death, these Incarnations beginning to be ripped apart!","\"...\"","A state of utter awe and horror descended on the battlefield.","Over half of the trillions of Undead collected in the Legions that came with the 80 Incarnations had fallen in a matter of seconds.","Trillions!","A single being bore the weight of it all as his eyes remained placid, the star of conquest shining ever brighter as the number of Skill Points he held exploded into over 200 Billion and they were still climbing.","The aura of Death from the instant wipe out of trillions pervaded the battlefield as even the undead that didn’t fear death began to shake and have their wills shattered!","As 35 Incarnations were being ripped apart from the effects of the Necrotic Ring of Death and the Seven Deadly Sins, the few trillions remaining in the Legions of Undead that stood opposing Noah lost their wills at this very moment!","Noah saw this scene as the effect of the Necrotic Ring of Death was simply too heavy, his eyes shining brilliantly as the Dao of Fealty burst from within him and descended to the Undead that had lost their will to fight.","[In exchange for a portion of his power and salvation, bind a portion of your soul to the Tyrannical Lich Emperor and become his Vassal. Choose between Death or Fealty!]","A prompt appeared in front of the shaken masses.","They gazed towards the powerful Lich Emperor and the terrifying Necrotic Ring of Death that was only a few miles away from them as the remaining trillions of undead...","\"I pledge Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor...!\"","RUMBLE!","It was the ridiculous reality of all beings kneeling towards the enemy they faced just minutes ago!","Actually, it wasn’t even minutes as during the time that the 80 Incarnations appeared and their legions soon followed, and taking into account the time of Noah merely tapping his fingers in the void of space and causing and using seas of the essence of Chronos to cast a Temporal Halt and a Temporal Inversion, and then the expansion of the Necrotic Ring of Death with the death of Trillions...barely a minute had passed.","Barely a minute as the last war for the control of an entire Universe...was finished in this period of time!","45 of their strongest commanders were incapacitated in seconds as the remaining ones were currently being ripped apart, and the majority of their army had been decimated in seconds as the remaining were pledging fealty!","In just a bit over a minute, such a Universal War that many sides thought would have very different results ended as the horrendous effects of the aura of an Antiquity did not seem to do a single fucking thing!","A minute to end a Universal War.","A minute to decide the fate of a Universe!","Ah!","How glorious!","How magisterial!"]},{"number":1053,"title":"Chapter 1053: Chapter 1052 - A Single Minute! II","paragraphs":["Who could do something as grand as end a war in a minute? Who could dominate so profoundly that Hegemonies were left scratching their heads at the mere possibilities of their actions?!","Only the Apex Paragon could do so!","THRUM!","His essence seemed boundless as the clock swarmed with the essence of Chronos still swarmed around him madly, his eyes watching the now struggling 35 Incarnations as this war for the Necrotic Universe...could be considered as good as won.","Noah’s eyes left the Incarnations of Chaos being defeated as he then turned towards a certain direction where these armies had come from. It was the area where the Universal Construct within this Universe laid in, the area where he could sense the terrifying auras of 3 Universal Powerhouses that had their gazes in his direction!",".","There, Chronos and the Goliath stared back at him, while the Hegemony of Necromancy had his eyes aflame with anger and rage.","The flames within the eye socket of this Undead Universal Expert burned brightly as he gazed upon the Universal Construct that was a tinge dimmer than before, his voice ringing out.","\"Ever since his conquest began, the rate of Accumulation of Essence has been getting gradually reduced in this Universe as at this point in time...its effectiveness has been reduced by 80%!\"","...!","Those branded with the Universal Constructs could sense such things, and nobody knew this more than Chronos as his eyes shone with an unknown light while he also turned towards the cocoon like Universal Constructs.","\"A few days of delay have been added until the descent of the Great Usurper. If we allow him to continue at the pace he has been going...the days will turn to weeks and the weeks will turn to months as eventually, even the Universal Constructs might break down!\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words came from Chronos’s mouth, but his expression was placid as while the Hegemony of Necromancy turned grim, the black hole of the Goliath focused on Chronos with immense sharpness as the air turned immensely cold.","The guttural voice of the Goliath rang out as it reeked of ancientness and age.","\"I betrayed a life long friend and left behind all that I built because you promised me to come in contact with Antiquity. To break out of the shackles of this single Universe as I pave my way to establish a Cosmos. Now...you’re telling me all of it is in jeopardy because of a mere Paragon?\"","BZZZZT!","The air shook heavily as the essence of Extinction so potent that the Seeds of Chaos could not even compare erupted out, the flames on the Hegemony of Necromancy flickering dimly as only Chronos remained unwavering!","\"I even designed the Seeds of Chaos from my own Origin to do my part, and even that has barely done anything. So let me ask, what exactly are you doing?\"","...!","Friction seemed to be occurring among the experts with the same goals due to the action of a single being.","A being stages below them in power and yet...he just seemed unstoppable!","As the air around the three beings changed and it seemed like a shocking conflict was about to break out...a smile appeared on Chronos’s expression as he glanced at the shocking might emanating from the Goliath with ease.","\"Naturally, there are a few things I can do.\"","RUMBLE!","He spoke with utter calm and majesty, the Hegemony of Necromancy breathing out a sigh of relief as the Goliath looked towards him to continue!","---","Schemes and plans began to unfold on one side, but the last battle of the Necrotic Universe was wrapping up as many eyes still paid immense attention to its details. But in the fast pace of it all, there were still some very important details that others entirely missed.","A detail that some seemed to forget was the fate of the 45 Seeds of Chaos that Noah obtained seconds after the battle began. He waved his hands and put them away as the actions that followed were too much that many beings momentarily forgot about these precious treasures!","Wondrous items containing a portion of the Origin Essence of a Universal Hegemony as they were filled with the essence of a myriad of Cosmic Daos.","These treasures naturally went to the only being that could fully utilize them at this moment...it was a certain blue slime standing at the forefront of a battle with Automaton Sentinel Incarnations in the Automaton Universe!","Enormous robotic beings with heavy weapons and machinery that shot out blasts of the essence of Cosmic Daos...the Blue Slime was in the shape of a Blue Dragon as he faced the pressure and power of these beings with Tiamat and the other Animus Summons beside him.","Similar to Noah, the essence of Chronos vibrated intensely around the body of the Blue Dragon as in the skies, a cerulean clock that washed down waves of the essence of Chronos rotated madly as the Blue Slime wanted to recreate even a portion of the majesty that Noah showed in the battle in the Necrotic Universe!","But the power that the Primordial Ruination Clone could display was of course multiple times higher than the Slime, especially since this clone stemmed from a Cosmic Treasure and could display 200% more strength compared to even Noah’s main body, as well as having a skill like [Ruination Essence Skill Conversion and Amplification] that vastly amplified any skill he cast with Ruination Essence.","So against a force of 80 Incarnations of Chaos...there was a small sense of struggle as currently, they were kept at bay with the stupendous power of the Summons and the surging essence of Extinction and Chronos!","This sense of struggle only lasted briefly though, as seconds later...the clone that the BLue Slime was fused to brought to light 45 Seeds of Chaos.","The eyes of the Blue Slime flashed with might and joy.","<<Universal Devouring>> was cast seamlessly.","45 Seeds of Chaos were devoured as the aura of the Blue Slime exploded and began to shoot through the roof!","RUMBLE!","The figure of the Blue Dragon roared out majestically at the forefront of the battle in the Automaton Universe, his body erupting with an aura that reached what the Incarnations were releasing..and then surpassed it!"]},{"number":1054,"title":"Chapter 1054: Chapter 1053 - Insuppressible Destiny! I","paragraphs":["A being that had not devoured the Seed of Chaos achieving a level of power even higher than those who did!","The racial ability of <<Universal Devouring>> was so powerful and potent that it went against the normal and established truth of progressing through ranks. When the Blue Slime devoured a Half a Step Great Sage, he obtained that exact realm.","When devouring a Paragon, he would become a Paragon! If he somehow devoured an Antiquity...he would obtain the power that Antiquity held! That was the domineering nature of the ability that the race of the Universal Emperor Slimes possessed!","So when this being devoured tens of Seeds of Chaos that held a portion of the Origin Essence of a Hegemony, his realm was elevating at a stupendous rate as he quickly shot past even what power the Incarnations could display.","Within the vibrant origin of the Blue Slime, 100 Billion Galaxies were fully formed as countless lines of connections were being formed every second.","After the 45th Seed of Chaos was devoured, hundreds of millions of Galaxies flashed with connections, the total number of all connected galaxies reaching 10 Billion!","10 Billion!","Aside from Noah, this creature was the one in the foremost position to reach the stage of a Universe as its racial ability was simply that insane.","It was an existence that deserved to be the main character of their own story just how unique and overpowering their abilities were!","As the aura of the Blue Slime climbed over the Incarnations, it meant another creature that was excelling among Paragons had risen.","It was the birth of another Apex Paragon as a second later, the blue clock releasing immense essence of Chronos flew out in waves as the targets were over 50 Incarnations of Chaos.","Extinction was mixed with Chronos as the Blue Slime felt a tinge of bloodlust, going for the kill and to devour as his draconic figure flashed with immense might!","A gorgeous cerulean blue light flashed across the Automaton Universe, drawing with it rivers of blood as a unique creature with immense power moved!","Amidst all of these shocking actions...they all came back to a certain being.","He was safely tucked away in the Dark Universe as even while playing in a field filled with danger, his main body always remained safe in his Universe that floated peacefully in the Ruination Sea!","A Universe not bound to a Cosmos.","A Universe not utilizing Primordial Essence at its core as it was something unique out of the vastness of existence!","Within this Universe, the seas of Fortune above Noah had grown immensely vast as at this time, he was on the cusp of obtaining 2 more Universes fully under him as the majority of its experts were either being defeated or fully under him.","Waves of pristine destiny washed over him endlessly as at this moment, Marks of Antiquity were forming at an impossibly fast pace!","The seas of Fortune and Destiny seemed to rile up the marks, the number very quickly passing 13 billion at this moment as Noah collected them at an unprecedented rate.","His Origin just continued to buzz with ridiculous power as he was getting ever closer to his goal of a Universal Seed.","13 Billion Marks of Antiquity meant 13 Billion Dao Galaxies that he could then connect with 13 Billion normal galaxies to form a total of 26 Billion connected Galaxies.","At this moment, he was truly one fourth of the way there!","Just 74 Billion more connected Galaxies, just 37 Billion more Marks of Antiquity...and the rank of Hegemony was within grasp.","RUMBLE!","His eyes flashed with magnetic power as when he looked above him to see the vast seas of fortune and destiny, he wondered...just who might stand on his path? If even the aura of an Antiquity could not suppress him, just what would his enemies do now?","He was close to fully having the Necrotic and Automaton Universes under his grasp as in a matter of days, he expected to extend his reach onto the remaining 6 Universes.","If things stayed as they were...he would at most just need days to wade through the vastness of a single Universe and conquer its most powerful beings!","Given that there were approximately over a billion Trillion planetary bodies and Realms within the stellar Galaxies on each of the Universes of the Cosmos, the uncountable Quintillions of beings on each universe would be ones that take Noah the most time to conquer.","But the moment that the strongest experts were under him...all that Noah had to do was spread out the essence of the Dao of Fealty across the Universe as the Quintillions of weaker beings within them could only acquiesce!","When he repeated this for the remaining 6 Universes...37 Billion Marks of Antiquity would be under his grasp.","So he wondered...just what possible tricks could his enemies pull to stop him?!","---","Noah would ponder and try to anticipate what his enemies would do...and his enemies would still move to act regardless in the meanwhile.","Near the crimson protective boundary around the cocoon like Universal Construct of the Necrotic Universe.","BZZT!","Space was torn apart as Chronos created a doorway leading to an isolated hidden fold in the void, voicing out to the Hegemony of Necromancy calmly.","\"Continue observing the progress of everything here. If the Necrotic Universe is lost just like the Animus Universe, that’s that. We just have to plan better for the future...and that begins now.\"","...!","Chronos was beckoning towards the Goliath to follow him into the hidden fold in space, leaving behind the Hegemony of Necromancy with a somber message as the torn space faded soon after the two beings went in it!","The gaze of the skeletal Hegemony went towards Noah as with the fold of space that Chronos and the Goliath disappeared to, a shocking reality was about to unfold.","\"...what are you doing?\"","The Goliath’s ancient voice came out as in the hidden space, he saw Chronos lying down with a calm expression without explaining what he planned to do.","\"A contingency plan I didn’t expect to use, but one that it seems I must use regardless. I’ll need you to use your essence of Extinction...to bring my Origin and Soul to a state of near death.\"","...!","RUMBLE!","\"You what?!\"","The black hole of the Goliath shone with a terrifying luster at such words, but Chronos replied back calmly.","\"A state of near death, but not quite dead yet. Someone of your calibre should be able to do it with ease. I won’t put up any defenses and allow your essence of Extinction to do as it wishes.\"","...!","\"Interesting, isn’t it? My life and death in the palm of your hands? Just be careful not to completely kill me, otherwise everything will be for naught!\"","...!","Chronos spoke out calmly as he didn’t mention that he just didn’t want to Reincarnate so quickly and accidentally!","But the mere mention of this idea seemed preposterous to the Goliath as he asked somberly.","\"Why?\"","\"...\"","A period of silence came as while lying down, Chronos opened his eyes lightly as he replied.","\"It’s the only way for me to communicate with the Great Usurper...with the Antiquity we are trying to call forth!\"","\"...!\"","Yes!","Chronos had to be in a state of near death to communicate with the Antiquity in question as he had to be in a state where the Dao of Reincarnation was about to initiate once more.","This was because Chronos only became aware and came in contact with the Great Usurper in a prior lifetime! Only through the Dao of Reincarnation that he singularly alone possessed in the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1055,"title":"Chapter 1055: Chapter 1054 - Insuppressible Destiny! II","paragraphs":["There was silence in the hidden fold of space as the Goliath looked towards Chronos with unknown thoughts crossing through his mind.","After a certain period of time, his raspy ancient voice rang out.","\"For how long?\"","Yes! For how long must he play the game of keeping a Hegemony like Chronos in a state of near death? A task that seemed to be filled with paramount dangers as a small mistake could rip apart everything!","\"For as long as it needs to be. Don’t worry, you’ll know when I’ve gotten what I need and I’m coming to.\"","Chronos replied passively as he closed his eyes. The overbearing and powerful waves of power that always protected the bodies and Origins of Hegemonies slowly faded away from him as his aura seemed like that of a normal man.","This powerful Hegemony actually lowered all of his defenses next to another, the Goliath moving in front of the body laying down as his obsidian hand wavered in front of it....a burst of the terrifying essence of Extinction erupting out!","BZZZT!","In calm waves, it wrapped around the body of Chronos as the fair white skin outside his body quickly deteriorated and became sunken, an aura of death hanging over him as the essence of Extinction went even deeper as it came to wrap around his Origin.","His brilliantly shining Universe that swirled with purple essence, 100 Billion Galaxies closely intertwined together and connected as they formed a powerful Universe!","They seemed to sense the feeling of death at this moment as the vibrant Universe vibrated, a burst of golden blue essence that was hidden deep within this Origin bursting out at this moment as it quickly spread to even permeate over the essence of Chronos in the Origin, overcoming everything.","The Goliath looked at this new essence he had never come across with somber eyes as he sensed it was the essence of a unique Cosmic Dao, but it was one that he had never come across before! It was the essence of Reincarnation that a single being in the Primordial Universe comprehended!","The black hole atop the body of the ancient being shook with a powerful luster as he carefully controlled the input of the essence of Extinction, putting Chronos in a state of near death as his part was done.","As for Chronos himself? The moment that the essence of Reincarnation erupted from his Origin and covered everything, his mind became extremely active as an enormous river of Time appeared within it. It stretched out endlessly from one end to another, and there should have only been a single one of such a vast river of time!","This was, after all, the scene that Noah himself had seen when he comprehended the Dao of Chronos. A scene of an endless river of time that represented an untouched Timeline of the Primordial Cosmos that he lived in.","Yet in front of the eyes of Chronos...there was a different sight as he couldn’t just see a single endless river of time, but it seemed like there were countless ones lined up cylindrically around each other!","As if they were reflections of each other in a mirror, multiple rivers of time stretched out endlessly!","The mental form of Chronos appeared extremely minuscule in comparison to these vast rivers of time that seemed identical, and yet they each had their differences.","The essence of Reincarnation wrapped around him as he consciously moved away from the river of time he was in, floating forward with purpose as his eyes found what they were searching for soon enough. It was the image of an obsidian colored river of time, the eyes of Chronos lighting up as he went towards the vast river and then placed his palm on it!","BZZZT!","A painful feeling coursed through Chronos’s mind when he came in contact with it, almost as if such a thing was not supposed to happen. An impenetrable barrier existed around the obsidian river of time as while bearing the immense pain, Chronos called out powerfully.","\"Usurper...!\"","...!","\"Usurper...!\"","His voice echoed and boomed out in waves, this voice reaching a certain being as an instant later, the consciousness of Chronos disappeared in front of the obsidian river of time.","\"...\"","When Chronos came to again, he found his consciousness in a space filled with darkness, where the only source of light was something in front of him. It came ever closer as it became extremely clear, a terrifying figure that would be enough to cause the minds and souls of any Paragons to shatter materializing in front of Chronos!","The figure was extremely enormous compared to the small consciousness of Chronos, the size difference being over a thousand as Chronos felt like an insignificant thing standing next to it. It held a humanoid shape as it was entirely shrouded by murky smoke that roiled around its body endlessly, the power being felt from it being simply maddening as Chronos could only make out a single thing.","Pristine dark hair and gorgeously cerulean blue eyes that light up the darkness.","Everything else was covered with rolling smoke.","It was only silent briefly before a voice that seemed powerful enough to shatter Universes rang out.","\"What an extremely dangerous thing to do, Sargon.\"","RUMBLE!","The voice came from all sides as it smashed into Chronos’s figure, addressing him not by his title, but by his name!","Sargon!","The small figure known as Sargon remained placid in this terrifying wave of power, the golden blue essence of Reincarnation wrapping around him protectively as he looked up towards the figure a thousand times larger than him and voiced out.","\"Dangerous...but required. We are facing heavy interference from the Primordial Cosmos this time around, even though the impeccable aura of the oh so Great Usurper has already begun to permeate across 9 Universes.\"","RUMBLE!","The words of Chronos, or really Sargon, were actually not servile...even being slightly overbearing as he began conversing with an Antiquity!"]},{"number":1056,"title":"Chapter 1056: Chapter 1055 - Insuppressible Destiny! III","paragraphs":["\"Haha! This is why I always liked you, Sargon!\"","The voice of the Great Usurper shook everything in the unique mental space the two beings were in, a space that stretched across the rivers of spacetime and placed two unique beings together through their own methods.","The Antiquity wasn’t bothered by the tone of the Hegemony of Chronos as he even seemed amused, but one could still detect the tone as if it was an adult being amused by the actions of a child!","\"The Tools of Descent are acting properly, with my descent only being a few weeks away. Though I did notice a reduction in the rate of accumulation...what’s happened?\"","The voice returned to that of ancientness and majesty as Chronos nodded while replying calmly.","\"An Apex Paragon has arisen from nowhere, his existence hitting us specifically by the fact that we cannot act against him due to the restriction we ourselves imposed for the proper establishment of Universal Amalgamation.\"","\"This Paragon has been breaking apart the influence our Hegemonies have established in a matter of days as he conquers the Universes, to the point that even your released Aura and the power of Incarnations that have ingested a portion of an Origin of a Hegemony cannot take him down!\"","BZZZT!",".","\"If he continues without being stopped...the rate of accumulation will continue to reduce as nothing will be descending for months, the Universal Constructs breaking apart in a matter of time after that...\"","His words seemed like a clap of thunder in the unique area of Spacetime, a thoughtful look appearing on the clouded face of the Antiquity as his voice rumbled out.","\"An unbeatable Paragon...what name do they go by?\"","An unexpected question came as Chronos looked towards the titanous figure above him and replied quizzically.","\"Why does that matter?\"","\"Names are naturally very important. Across the many Cosmos and Dimensions...I’ve met a few beings with certain names that even I have grown to be wary of.\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking sentence came from the Antiquity as the consciousness of Chronos was jolted for the first time ever!","He thought carefully before he replied.","\"He loves the moniker of ’Tyrannical’, going by such names like Tyrannical Dragon Emperor and Tyrannical Lich Emperor in the respective Universes he is conquering. He is also a Paragon that has somehow birthed his own set of Lesser Daos before even reaching the rank of Hegemony, and he has comprehended the Cosmis Dao of Chronos.\"","All the information that Chronos knew was shared as the form of the terrifying Antiquity seemed to be thinking thoughtfully before his ancient voice came out.","\"There are many unique existences across the Cosmos, geniuses being able to comprehend Supreme Tier Cosmic Daos and even being capable of birthing Lesser Daos appearing here and there. This Paragon...you’ve never heard of him referred to as Aegon? Or Noah? Or Ezekiel?\"","RUMBLE!","A set of names came out from the Antiquity as Chronos only shook his head when he heard them. Yet, when the Antiquity mentioned these names, he seemed to give them a sense of importance and somberness he had never attached to anything else he had said so far!","\"No. This being literally appeared from nowhere just days ago. No mentions of Aegon, Noah, or Ezekiel surround him. Why these names especially? There should be quintillions of beings with such names, they shouldn’t have any significance.\"","\"My dear Sargon...once again, names have great significance! After all, I met a version of you from a previous Lifetime that you stole their Origin and Soul to Reincarnate. Only then did you know of me!\"","...!","\"As for the three names I mentioned, I’ve come across beings like that too many times. Each of them always turned out to not be worth the trouble, the Destinies of these existences being too ridiculous. If a being with such a name isn’t a prominent figure in your Primordial Cosmos...then it shouldn’t be a problem.\"","WAA!","Power and majesty leaked from the Antiquity as the cerulean blue eyes he held shone with arcs of unknown light.","In the mind space, Chronos’s expression was calm even while faced with such a shocking being, his words coming out calmly in a reply as he nodded.","\"If it is no problem, then I came here for a solution. I know there is no such thing as a free lunch in existence, and that you have your own aims for coming down to the Primordial Cosmos. I care not whether you want to dominate the Cosmos or destroy it...all I care for is the method towards Antiquity!\"","A cruel and calm light coursed through Chronos as these terrifying words were uttered, the Antiquity glancing at his minuscule figure with great amusement.","\"What a cruel existence you are...but I can understand your search for Antiquity! After all, the things I did to achieve it...oh well. I am bound by the Tools of Descent you call the Universal Constructs. The conditions I proposed will have to be maintained if I am to successfully descend and stay, so you have nothing to worry about.\"","...!","\"The path to Antiquity...I will show you the method that guarantees it in less than 10 Million Years!\"","WAA!","Swirls of terrifying essence and might roiled around the terrifying form of the Antiquity, his eyes blazing with an intense light as he stared at Chronos.","\"Antiquity...and even the untouchable Realms of Power those self righteous Existences have reached...that is my Destiny! I will go across Cosmos and do what needs to be done for it. Nobody can suppress it!\"","RUMBLE!","\"...\"","The raging storm of essence continued.","The eyes of Chronos were placid as if it didn’t matter to him what the Antiquity wanted, his voice simply coming out amidst the ancientness around him.","\"What is the solution, Usurper?\"","\"...Bring 9 Paragons into the cores of the Universal Constructs. Preferably those that have ingested the essence of a Hegemony. It will be an extremely costly price for me to mobilize my authority early...but I will do it regardless. I will give you 9 Existences that cannot be taken down by anything other than a Hegemony. I will give you Subjugations of the Usurper that will hold a semblance of my abilities.\"","...!","\"I’ll even reduce my focus on other Cosmos and put more attention to this Primordial Cosmos to accelerate the rate of accumulation. With all that...my descent should not be too far away.\"","Tides of essence moved chaotically at the words as Chronos nodded with shining eyes!","The essence of Reincarnation around him fluctuated at this moment, Chronos looking at his own body as he knew it was time.","The risk he had taken this time was a dangerous one, but it had paid off as he thought about the words of the titanous being before him.","’Subjugations of the Usurper that cannot be killed by anything other than a Hegemony, huh?’","A light of destiny and cruelty flashed across his eyes as even Chronos didn’t know the consequences of the events he was perpetrating!"]},{"number":1057,"title":"Chapter 1057: Chapter 1056 - Influence Across Universes! I","paragraphs":["A blank void isolated from space and time.","In this darkness, the enormous figure of the Great Usurper watched as the small shape of Chronos faded with a flicker of the essence of Reincarnation.","\"Reincarnation...\"","His ancient voice rumbled out as his form began to vibrate with an intense light. His eyes seemed reminiscent, but he quickly shook them as he focused on the direction that Chronos’s soul was flowing back to.","Back to a certain river of time far different than the one he currently resided in!","Within this river of time were 9 anchors that currently stretched out dimly across spacetime, stretching across the uncrossable sea of Ruination...stretching even across Dimensions as it was reaching out towards the Great Usurper.","They looked like thin strands that could break at any moment, but they held a stupendous amount of power as it also seemed they were unbreakable..","His essence had already bloomed from these anchors, these Tools of Descent- these Universal Constructs...as he had more leeway on what he could do at this moment!","His eyes flickered with thought as his huge hand moved, plucking onto each of the 9 strings as a mass of obsidian crimson essence began to flow from him and course through them.","\"At least it will be worth it...\"","His ancient voice rang out again as while he played with the 9 strings and allowed his essence to gush forth, he was looking in another direction as his eyes could already visualize something there.","It was actually multiple of them floating across the vast Seas of Ruination, the picture and names of certain Cosmos floating across the mind of the Great Usurper as his focus returned on the one in front of him soon after!","The Primordial Cosmos that was unique...as there was even a Cosmic Treasure born within it!","Among many things, this Ancient Antiquity was also aiming for this.","\"With a Cosmic Treasure capable of commanding Primordial Essence...I won’t have to use this long and tedious method to find more Cosmos. Oh, my dear Sargon...you truly don’t know what important tools your home has, searching for Antiquity when a method for it is right in front of you!\"","RUMBLE!","The cerulean blue eyes of the Usurper flashed with wild light as he focused on a singular Primordial Cosmos. On the place that his ravenous might would descend on next as he forged his path of power.","Not a single thing would be able to stand in the way of his insuppressible destiny!","---","BZZZT!","A colorful and glorious essence of blue gold color that had been buzzing around Chronos’s unconscious body began to recede.","The Dao of Reincarnation sunk back into the depths of the Origin of this being as he had not achieved a state of death and did not need to be reincarnated, the eyes of Chronos opening up soon after!","WAA!","The Goliath stopped his flow of the Cosmic essence of Extinction as he looked at the rising figure of Chronos whose dried and sunken skin began to rapidly heal.","The black hole swirling on the head of the Goliath looked over at Chronos mutely, this Hegemony that had just finished having a discussion with an Antiquity staring back at him as he opened his mouth slowly.","\"There shouldn’t be any issues. Tools capable of stopping the obstacle will be in place soon.\"","RUMBLE!","His words didn’t even finish before the space around them began to tremble and twist!","Even in the hidden folds of space they were in, they felt the unique pressure and might that occurred not too long ago to start spreading wildly once again.","One of the promises of the Great Usurper was that he would direct a large amount of his focus to the Primordial Cosmos, and this promise was on its way to being fulfilled right now.","From the 9 Universal Constructs, the menacing crimson light shooting out increased by more than double as terrifying, bloody webs erupted out to cover these Constructs that were larger than galaxies and formed even more pronounced cocoons!","THUMP!","They resonated with the beat of a heart as the 9 Universes they were connected to...actually resonated with their beat for the first time ever as something shocking happened.","The Universal Barriers around these Universes...trembled as they began to be squeezed into each other.","Squeezed! As if they were coming together, as if multiple circles that were near each other at this moment...began the process of fusing!","Amalgamation.","This term has been used many times in the past, but what did it truly mean?","It was the action or process of combining! Of merging and fusing! Since the beginning, the goal of the Universal Constructs was Universal Amalgamation, and this process had ensued in full at this moment as the might of the Antiquity allowed to release his authority fully displayed itself in the Primordial Cosmos!","The Inhabitants of these 9 Universes felt this terrifying might first hand as the pressure descended around every existence powerfully.","Noah was wrapping up the ridiculously short battle in the Necrotic Universe as he put away 35 Seeds of Chaos, his powerful eyes lifting up somberly to stare towards the direction of the Universal Construct that was a few light years away from his current position.","There, he could sense the terrifying waves emanating from these Constructs, as well as the aura of the Hegemony of Necromancy that was entirely unaffected by it all!","His gaze hardened as he felt the shackles around the Necrotic Universe wrap around everything ever tighter.","[Under the enhanced influence of the aura of The Great Usurper. The effects of Corruption of the Usurper and Malignant Madness are enhanced from Initial to Advanced]","...!","THRUM!","[Corruption of the Usurper](Advanced) :: Those not under the protection of the Great Usurper gain the Corrupted Status directly on their souls as their Mana and Health Regeneration are reduced by half, the Damage Taken from other sources is increased by 30,000%, -30,000% To All Laws and Dao Resistances, -30,000% Comprehension and Assimilation Ability to all Laws and Daos, -75% Effectiveness of All Abilities, -75% Mana Reserves, -75% Movement Speed, -75% Attack Speed, -75% Cast Speed, -75% Efficiency of Mana Conduction and Usage, and 75% Chance of Skills Failing on Cast.","\"...are you serious?\"","Noah looked at the terrible debuffs in front of him as his eyes began to blaze with a light of anger!"]},{"number":1058,"title":"Chapter 1058: Chapter 1057 - Influence Across Universes! II","paragraphs":["Anger!","His eyes were blazing with immense anger as he looked at the ridiculous debuffs that were enhanced by too much, to the point that they might even be capable of affecting him!","Yes, he had Infinite Mana. But taking 30,000% more damage from his enemies was entirely ridiculous.","That was 300 times the damage that he would be taking, which was extremely terrifying when one thought of the Incarnations of Chaos that could release power above what most Paragons only dreamed of. There was also the -30,000% to the Resistances of laws and Daos, meaning that the damage would come across even more as the future battles were bound to be tedious and dreadful.","This wasn’t to even mention the \"-75%s\" to multiple statuses that filled the Corruption of the Usurper and even the myriad of debuffs added under the [Malignant Madness](Advanced) effect!","All of these were terrifying to even look at, but as Noah read over them...his angered eyes flashed with an intense light.","’My enemies are squirming in impatience...’",".","Yes!","The recent actions just told him that his enemies were simply getting impatient as his actions against them were working!","It meant that he was such a big threat to their plans that just after he defeated waves of their Incarnations of Chaos, their reply was the terrifying might of the Antiquity to be released in droves.","’Very well. Squirm some More! Grow fearful! Meanwhile...’","RUMBLE","His body vibrated with essence as he bellowed out a roar of power, the hundreds of trillions of undead around him beginning to move towards the direction of the Universal Construct.","All the experts of the Necrotic Universe could now be considered under him as after the 80 Undead Paragons turned into Incarnations that the Hegemony of Necromancy sent his way were defeated, Noah was freely sending out waves of the essence of the Dao of Fealty.","He sent within these waves and prompt something unique that he could do as the Architect and Assimilator of this Dao, sending in memories of the shocking battles and the over 100 Undead Paragons under him as the essence he held stretched out across the folds of space of the Necrotic Universe!","To ever hidden Galaxy and Realm, to the billions of Trillions of stars...to every stretch of land where an existence lay.","All of them saw the shocking scenes of Noah and his path of Conquest, the number of Undead pledging fealty rising by hundreds of billions every second.","The Star of Conquest above him shone with a glorious white luster as the enhancement where his power was tripled became even more oppressive, his body gaining a quadruple enhancement at this moment!","It was the recognition that he wasn’t just undergoing the process of Conquest within this Universe...but that it was conquered!","THRUM!","His golden flames blazed from his eye sockets as he looked at the scenes around him.","The hundreds of trillions of undead that formed Legions that looked larger than Galaxies.","Legions that stretched out for millions of miles!","Legions filled with terrifying Undead Paragons, Planetary sized Abyssal Undead...all sorts of Abominations with the essence of death surrounding them.","Amidst all this, Noah sat on a throne of bones floating at the very forefront as he overlooked the deathly scene. His golden flames danced madly as he took the trillions behind him to cross the chaotic void of the Necrotic Universe while heading towards the Universal Construct, the essence of Fealty continuing to permeate from him endlessly!","The procession of the Tyrannical Lich Emperor drew in many gazes, the eyes of watching Hegemonies enamored by the enticing picture of Conquest as they sensed the terrifying aura of Antiquity plaguing the very same lands they couldn’t enter.","Over an hour passed as this terrifying procession continued, coming to a stop near the enormous Universal Construct that looked like a cocoon.","BZZZT!","A fluctuation of essence erupted out as an instant later, the image of a terrifying lich letting out waves of power at the level of a Hegemony appeared.","The Hegemony of Necromancy was without any pieces to play as he came out himself, similar to Ambrose who stood guard over the Animus Universe!","The Universe Construct behind the Hegemony of Necromancy pulsed dangerously as the cocoon-like shape thumped ever so often, releasing waves of horrendous power as a black veil of Death covered this Construct entirely.","This was the protection of a Hegemony that no being within the Universes could break.","Noah’s bony throne floated forward as his golden flames glanced at the powerful figure of the Hegemony of Necromancy.","While gazing at this majestic existence filled with power, the gaze of the Demonic Lich Emperor on the bony throne seemed to be filled with ridicule as his domineering voice rang out!","\"How weak you all must be...for a mere Paragon like me to be giving you all this much trouble.\"","...!","Maddening words addressed the powerful Hegemony of Necromancy as the deathly flames of this existence shone a mixture of colors before they settled on a deathly black, but he didn’t so much as give a reply to Noah!","\"The exemplary Hegemonies overlooking the Primordial Cosmos with strength and might as even Paragons cannot even dare to gaze upon you...look at you now.\"","BZZZT!","\"Cowering in 9 Universes like mere rats protecting cocoons of a foreign power...how proud ancient existences like you must feel for arriving at such a place!\"","...!","Noah’s words reverberated like a clap of thunder not just to the Hegemony of Necromancy, but also Chronos and the Goliath who had just begun to leave the Necrotic Universe to get things ready per the words of the Antiquity.","These words also reached the Hegemonies under Chronos who were watching the events in the Necrotic and Automaton Universe on illusory screens, their eyes blazing with anger as similar to the Hegemony of Necromancy standing right in front of Noah...these beings did nothing.","They could not attack any existence lower than their Realm of power in the 9 Universes. This was their restriction for keeping all others out!","So the flames of wrath in the sockets of the Hegemony of Necromancy only rose ever higher as the pristine obsidian skeletal body beneath the glimmering robe was revealed underneath.","As Noah released his biting words, his skeletal arms rose up as with his command, a bright crimson purple clock began to bloom above them, expanding millions of miles instantly as it moved to cover even the space above the Universal Construct that the Hegemony protected!","Faced against a Hegemony that could not attack him, his voice came out majestically as droves of the essence of Chronos mixed in with a myriad of other types of Cosmic Dao Essence began to leak from the enormous clock.","\"Let’s see whether cowards like you even have a tenth of the power and majesty you used to hold before you submitted yourselves to another existence...\"","The skeletal arms of the Demonic Lich Emperor swung down as they came with a storm of essence and a body bubbling with immense mana.","It was a strike to test out just how close he was to a Hegemony.","A strike to see what he lacked before he could stand against these beings and decimate them as he wished!","It was a strike of defiance against an existence that had forged a Universe!!!"]},{"number":1059,"title":"Chapter 1059: Chapter 1058 - Influence Across Universes! III","paragraphs":["A Paragon raising their hand to attack a Hegemony!","Such a scene was a rare one to come across, especially since the gap in power was simply too vast to cross.","Yet Noah...wanted to try!","This was because he held multiple Cosmic Daos, and he wanted to see if this would be enough to overcome the large gap in strength.","THRUM!","The enormous clock spun crazily as the essence of Chronos came down in droves, forming into a sharp point as it swirled dangerously in a serpentine fashion. It carried with it the desolate of time as anything hit with it would face the effects of [Instantaneous Age Regression and Progression]. Contained within this swirling strike was seemingly the crimson essence of Annihilation, but it was actually a mixture of Annihilation and Ruination as three Cosmic Daos twisted around each other to strike down the deathly figure of the Hegemony of Necromancy.","The genuine Universal Realm expert looked at this strike as the dark flames within its sockets flickered..","The obsidian barrier covering the vast Universal Construct behind him shone as it became even thicker, his own body obtaining a similar barrier as against the terrifying killing strike that would decimate any Incarnation...he did nothing but make the natural barrier of a Hegemony more prominent around his body!","BOOM!...BZZZZT!","The sharp cluster of three Cosmic Essences struck the obsidian barrier of the Hegemony as the flames in his sockets blazed brighter momentarily, but they calmed down soon after as even while space deteriorated and folded around him, this Hegemony remained spotless as his barrier wasn’t breached.","...!","Yet the mind of the Hegemony was shaken as they almost sensed a penetrative force stronger than anything he imagined to nearly devour a portion of the protective field he constructed that no Paragon should even be able to damage!","’The fuck was that?!’","His dead heart nearly beat faster for a millisecond before it calmed down.","The Hegemony did not know this, but this was due to the terrifying Dao of Ruination!","Noah looked at this scene with calm eyes as he called out slowly.","[Temporal Halt].","WAA!","[Temporal Looping].","...!","The essence of Chronos wrapped around the skeletal figure of the Hegemony of Necromancy as it threatened to bring the time around it to a stand still while putting him in a constant frozen loop of time!","But...the Hegemony had now learned to be careful as he didn’t underestimate this ridiculous being!","As the runic circles brimming with the essence of time swarmed around him to try and do their intended purpose...dark obsidian skeletal hands reached out as with the force that only Universal Realm experts could wield.","The skeletal hands touched the swirling runic circles of Chronos as they brought them to a stop, and then they ripped the essence of this Cosmic Dao apart as the surroundings of the Hegemony were soon filled with the Cosmic Essence of Necromancy!","...!","The pure force of a Universal Realm expert pulsed out as it ripped apart the Cosmic Essence utilized by a Paragon a level below!","Even though the quality of the Cosmic Dao was extremely high...it still could not withstand the force of an existence that could wield the force of a Universe within their Origins. Paired with them reinforcing their bodies with another Cosmic Dao, even if it was of lesser quality- they could seamlessly stand against Noah at this moment.","The enormous clock releasing the essence of Chronos glimmered above them as Noah stared calmly at the Hegemony after all skills were broken.","Even at this moment, the Hegemony did not make a move against Noah.","He could defend and set up barriers, but he could not attack!","Noah returned to his bony throne as he didn’t continue, even though he had other methods of attacking that he would have to reveal some of his major secrets if he employed.","He didn’t plan to utilize these yet.","When he did utilize them and expose his secret of A Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Dao of Ruination, he wanted to do it while guaranteeing the death of a certain Hegemony!","As of right now, with just pure power...he couldn’t break the might and defenses of a Hegemony.","Not yet.","Maybe even not him, as his eyes wandered to the Blue Slime in the Automaton Universe that was putting to an end the conquest of the third Universe within the Primordial Cosmos.","At this moment, this Blue Slime was Devouring the other 35 Seeds of Chaos that Noah just sent over, and there were 80 more that he obtained from the 80 Incarnations of Chaos that were sent into this Universe!","As Noah saw and felt the terrifying level of power of the Blue Slime that only continued to rise, as well as the number of connected Galaxies crossing 20 Billion this very second...he wondered if the first existence to become a Hegemony would even be him in the near future!","He wondered if he was the one with the Trait of [Protagonist], as this Blue Slime was rising in connecting his Galaxies even faster than he was without the need to collect Marks of Antiquity and form his Dao Galaxies yet.","At this moment, the Blue Slime was roaring out dominantly across the battlefield of the Automaton Universe where 80 Incarnations had fallen, its eyes glimmering with power as from its body and the bodies of the other Animus Summons Noah was fused to, the essence of the Dao of Fealty began to spread from them and emulate out to the surrounding millions of miles- stretching themselves for light years as the light of Conquest was closing in the Automaton Universe as well!","Without an enemy capable of standing against them in sight, Noah’s influence now extended across multiple universes as the Necrotic and Automaton Universes were brought into his fold.","The number of Marks of Antiquity such actions brought him were grand, his main body in the Dark Universe swimming in a golden luster at this moment as even his surroundings were tinted a gorgeous gold!","In the Necrotic Universe, the Primordial Ruination Clone returned to his bony throne as he stared at the yet to be taken down Hegemony of Necromancy, the skeletal hands of this clone rising up as he didn’t throw out another attack, but a unique spatial essence spread out from him as it went on to cover the trillions of Undead in the Legions behind him.","Many beings looked at his actions as he wondered what he was doing now!","A type of essence began to expand from the skeletal fingers at this moment as Noah’s voice rang out.","\"My attacks cannot reach you now...but this won’t be the case the next time that I attack you again!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Similar to how I can butcher Paragons and your Incarnations as if they were mere vegetables while I am in the same Realm...I will be giving the same treatment to Hegemonies like you when I establish my Universe.\"","...!","A promise!","A promise was uttered out in the eyes of all as in the next instant, the essence that Noah was utilizing was revealed as its target...was actually the Legions behind him, a spatial essence beginning to wrap around them!"]},{"number":1060,"title":"Chapter 1060: Chapter 1059 - Subjugations Of The Usurper! I","paragraphs":["Noah was still cognizant of the effects of the aura of the Great Usurper, thinking more closely about the [Heretical Malediction] effect that affected beings who couldn’t protect themselves against the mere aura of an Antiquity after a certain period of time.","That was why his next action after testing the irrefutable might of a Hegemony was to spread a spatial essence over the vast numbers of beings in the Legions behind him!","The show of a single being using ridiculous amounts of mana was about to unfold yet again at this moment, the action of a spatial essence covering trillions not just playing out in the Necrotic Universe, but also in the Automaton and Animus Universe!","Millions of Trillions were covered by a spatial light as they began to be teleported away, and nobody was the wiser on where they were going.","Many watching eyes looked at this scene in a stupor as a question of Mana rose up in the hearts of many, but they could only watch a shocking scene unfold as no answers were provided this time by the eccentric Paragon!","---","The Oathkeeper watched the unfolding scenes across multiple Universes, scenes of the vast number of existences being wrapped by a spatial light as they began to disappear.","Looking at the existence doing it all, he wanted to ask many things, but he knew that he wouldn’t get any answers!","The only thing he was searching for was answers.","So he simply moved as he went to find them.",".","His figure was warped by the Primordial Essence as he tore through the Universal layers to arrive in the Elysian Universe, and he further tore through multiple layers within this Universe as he accessed an unknown location that very few beings would be able to access!","The only way to even find and enter it required for one to use a Cosmic Dao at the caliber of the Primordial Dao, and the Oathkeeper already had prior knowledge of this hidden doorway within the Elysian Universe as he crossed it to arrive at a certain location.","Unlike the golden shimmering Elysian Universe or dark chaotic void of many Universes, the area that the Oathkeeper arrived in was pure white!","His brilliant golden wings were the only thing letting off any color as when the pristine white Primordial Essence faded from his body, it seemed to meld into the white surroundings.","There was a pervasive and deafening silence in this area.","At this moment, the expression of majesty and power that the Oathkeeper always held seemed to fade as his expression became soft. He looked around the blank expanse, as if waiting for something to come and face him...but nothing appeared!","After he waited for a few minutes in silence, he began voicing out in a tone that others would be shocked to hear, as it was nothing like the commanding and authoritative voice that the strongest creature of the Primordial Cosmos normally spoke with!","\"The Cosmos have been targeted by an Antiquity as even some of its natives have turned against us...and the power of the Antiquity spreads every day as it becomes more pervasive, seeming like only a matter of time before it comes to be.\"","THRUM!","\"I...I have thought of many possible solutions, but nothing is coming to be! There is even a Paragon that seems to be working more effectively than all of us, but against the ever increasing aura of an Antiquity and the Hegemonies protecting the tools calling him forth...what will he be able to do?!\"","\"Destiny says the possible arrival and change of everything could occur as early as two or three weeks...can that Apex Paragon reach the Universal Realm in such a short period of time? The solutions aren’t there! There are actually very few! Please...\"","His powerful body actually kneeled down as a golden light from his wings caused his figure to look extremely mesmerizing.","He called out ’please’ as if he was seeking the most sincere help from a specific thing!","\"Please let me know what I should do...please provide for me some guidance on what to do to save us all!\"","...","Silence.","Deafening and all consuming silence as nobody and nothing replied to the Oathkeeper whose expression had actually turned into a pleading one!","The demeanor of an expert was gone as he looked like a lost being simply asking for help and direction, but he received none.","He waved his hands as he caused a pristine white disk to appear before him, this disk nearly melding with the whiteness of the surroundings.","It was the Cosmic Treasure- the Primordial Disk!","\"You brought me here and gave this to me millions of years ago. I’ve used all the power it granted me to establish order amidst the churning Chaos. Yet as we are in the midst of a storm of chaos...why are you silent?\"","RUMBLE!","\"Why aren’t there any directions now as we are on the cusp of utter Chaos? Why...?!\"","The expression of this powerful being was actually becoming aggrieved after time passed, but even with all his calls, no reply came for him!","Whatever being or entity the Oathkeeper was addressing...not a single reply came as after a while, an expression of loss overcame this powerful being as he sighed while staring in the expanse of white.","He recalled the Primordial Disk that had nearly become lost in the expanse of a sea of Primordial Essence, his connection with it still being extremely strong even though he could only refine half of it as a Universal Hegemony.","His expression gradually had the sense of loss and sadness leave as it became strong and mighty once more, the demeanor of the strongest expert soon returning as his body to be covered with Primordial Essence once more!","He looked around the expanse of white for one last time before he disappeared.","When he left, the quietness remained, seeming even more oppressive as even the golden source of light that was the Oathkeeper was now missing!","A silent white expanse...and yet at this moment, in the depths of it...a flicker of light appeared.","Nobody was there to see it.","The light flickered gradually as it melded with the surrounding Primordial Essence soon after, calm returning into this blank space of white as this continued as it had always been!"]},{"number":1061,"title":"Chapter 1061: Chapter 1060 - Subjugations Of The Usurper! II","paragraphs":["As the Apex Paragon swore a promise after moving against a Hegemony and proceeded to wrap the existences of many Universes in a spatial light, many beings wondered of the resulting location of this spatial warp!","Their powerful eyes moved across the Cosmos as they wanted to see where, many thinking it would be the next targeted Universe under this Paragon’s conquest.","Yet...no movements could be seen in any of the 6 remaining Cosmos that had already begun to fuse with each other as the process of Amalgamation ensued!","So where exactly were all these beings going?!","---","In the vastness of the Ruination Sea, a simple Universe floated silently..","Its directional floating wasn’t without rhyme or reason, as the moment that Noah arrived in the Primordial Cosmos and sensed the vast difference of distance between this and the Dark Universe, he had already begun to change the direction of the Universe to go towards the Primordial Cosmos ever so slowly.","As for why? He had his own possible plans for this!","But at this point in time...","Thousands of Trillions of creatures began to enter the singular Dark Universe en masse.","Those that could survive the void of space arrived onto a glimmering new starry space. Those weaker who could only survive in the atmosphere of worlds and Realms appeared in such locations, with the vast majority of them actually being teleported into the extremely vast Universal Core that was the fusion of 100,000 Galaxies!","That was the population of multiple Universes...all of them flowing into the Dark Universe!","BZZZT!","Noah’s main body stood near the very center of the Universal Core as he was currently enshrouded by a majestic light, Marks of Antiquity forming all around him as his eyes were closed while he communicated with the Universal Core.","The effects of mass teleporting thousands of trillions of beings was much more crucial than many would believe, Noah seeing this first hand at this moment as he received multiple prompts and information from the Universal Core!","[One of the pathways towards the next upgrade of the Universal Core has been opened.]","...!","[When a large number of existences arise within the Universe, the possibilities of the Universal Core to birth another Universe increases substantially as it begins on the path towards a Cosmos. The current number of existences within the Universe: 33 Quintillion. The number needed before the possible advancement of the next stage is 100 Quintillion.]","\"...\"","The path forward was shown.","One must recall what the Universal Core and in extension the Dark Universe truly was. It wasn’t just a normally occurring Universe, being something that was on the brink of Apocalypse as its source of Primordial Essence nearly ran dry and it could protect itself from the Ruination Sea!","But after Noah made the move to prevent yet another Apocalypse, the nature of the Dark Universe changed as it became a Universe that didn’t depend on the Primordial Essence that birthed Cosmos...and it instead became a Universe supported by the essence of Ruination that endlessly spread out across a vast Sea of Ruination.","It stopped being a normal Universe as it became exactly what Noah obtained those many months ago from the Beast World when he first obtained the Spiritual Land.","It became a Unique Treasure.","A Universe...as a Treasure!","And with it becoming such a form of existence, boundless possibilities were opened to it.","As thousands of trillions of beings were ushered into this Dark Universe, Noah was able to find out the next method of advancement for the unique treasure Universe to go towards becoming a Cosmos!","To better understand this, one had to know what the numbers of trillions or quintillions meant. A Quintillion was a number followed by 18 zeros, or a million trillions making up a single Quintillions.","Noah had been ushering in thousands of trillions of existences these past few minutes into the Dark Universe, or it can be said that he was bringing in a few quintillion beings every few minutes!","The number had added up to 33 Quintillion in addition to the natives of the Dark Universe that were already here, and a measly 67 Quintillion was required before yet another Universe could be born from the Universal Core as it went towards becoming a Cosmos.","\"What are some boons to come from such an advancement?\"","Noah couldn’t help but ask the Universal Core amidst all of this, the reply being something that caused his golden seas of destiny and fortune to churn madly!","[The capability of birthing Grand Daos will be opened as well as an increase in the number of birthed Lesser Daos. The capability to fuse existing universes will also open up.]","RUMBLE!","A wondrous set of possibilities opened up in Noah’s eyes at this moment as they shone with utter brightness!","\"Good! Good!\"","He couldn’t help but call out multiple times as his body pulsed with even more golden luster, continuing the mass teleportations of beings from three Universes as he saved them from the [Heretical Malediction] of an Antiquity that threatened to devour their Origins and change them into something else.","With the introduction of vast numbers of existences into a single Universe though, Noah had to carefully plan and personally use his mental power to decide which regions the few Quintillion Undead would stay at, which region the 9 Supreme Bloodlines of the Animus Universe would occupy, and then which area the Automatons and Mechanical Races of the Automaton Universe would stay.","His actions would have far reaching consequences as the inclusion of all these beings and races would be something wondrous when managed well. The means of the beings from the Automaton Races could be incorporated to the technological advancement of the Dark Universe, the capabilities of the Bloodline Races of the Animus Universe and the Undead of the Necrotic Universe could also become incorporated to this Universe as the end result...","WAA!","Noah’s eyes released beams of golden light just thinking about it, imagining a future where he had a Cosmos that was a mixture of different systems of power that all came together to birth something no Cosmos had ever seen!","His goals and possibilities were limitless as all he had to do was get through a few problems first!"]},{"number":1062,"title":"Chapter 1062: Chapter 1061 - Subjugations Of The Usurper! III","paragraphs":["As Noah carried out grandiose actions that were watched by all, others conducted their in secrecy as tumultuous waves were made in the dark.","Within the 9 Universes undergoing Universal Amalgamation...9 Champions were chosen.","Chronos and the Goliath went around the 9 Universes as they collected unique existences under their Hegemonies...existences that they then fed Seeds of Chaos as they produced 9 powerful Incarnations!","Thereafter, these Incarnations were each brought towards the pulsing cocoon like Universal Constructs as Chronos used his singular highest authority to actually enter the core of these Constructs and then leave these powerful Incarnations of Chaos within.","All for the purpose and promise of immense power from the Antiquity that even Hegemonies were trying to reach!","The chosen contenders who would become Subjugations of the Usurper varied in shapes and sizes, but Chronos actually chose three of them to come from the Chthonian Universe, opting for the enormous planetary sized bodies to fill up more than 30% of the would be weapons of the Usurper..","There were two unique existences brought from the Abyssal Universe, 2 from the Liberated Universe, and 2 from the Microbial Universe!","At this moment, these Incarnations were placed into the 9 Universal Constructs within the 9 Universes as Chronos was monitoring everything while communicating with the other Hegemonies constantly on any changes.","The Goliath was beside him as they were watching the scenes playing out from the Chthonian Universe, the voice of the ancient being ringing out.","\"All of this for the promise of Antiquity...\"","The Goliath seemed to be reminiscing and thinking of many things as he was forced to think of his past and where his future was headed while he watched the fluctuating and pulsing cocoon like Universal Constructs.","Since they placed the Incarnations into each of them, the pressure they released only became more and more oppressive as at this moment, it even seemed to be rising to a crescendo!","Chronos only listened to the words of the Goliath with a calm expression on his face, waiting for the results of his actions as the initial steps seemed to vastly be heading on the correct path.","The supposed Subjugations of the Usurper though...just what power would they be able to wield that even with everything on the line, only Hegemonies could take them down?","THRUM!","Chronos did not have to wait long as soon after, the cocoon within the Microbial Universe and the cocoons in all the other Universes let out a brilliant light!","An awe inspiring aura emanated from each of them as they foreshadowed the coming of terrifying existences, much of the crimson light surrounding the Universal Constructs dimming slightly as the process was completed, a ray of light shooting out from the Constructs as after it faded...it left behind a pulsing ball of light.","This ball of light was a new existence in the Primordial Cosmos.","The 9 balls of light were the Subjugations of the Usurper!","RUMBLE!","Essence wildly flew from them as the respective Hegemonies guarding the Constructs of the 9 Universes looked at them with analytical eyes, Chronos looking at the Microbial Incarnation of Chaos that wasn’t even discernable with the naked eye, the power from this creature being immensely menacing as it was unlike anything that the Incarnations of Chaos could release.","\"Good enough?\"","The Goliath spoke out again as he also scrutinized the new existence.","He didn’t want another scene of surprise to appear when they inevitably were put against the singular Apex Parafon again!","\"Should be more than good enough. They hold a trace aura of the Great Usurper...which means the abilities and Daos they display are also things that stem from him.\"","...!","\"He is an Antiquity, while the Apex Paragon is a being that hasn’t even lived over a million years. It is like comparing a child to an adult! There should be no surprises.\"","Chronos spoke with a tinge of confidence as even if he didn’t believe in himself, he believed in the power of the Antiquity that could cross through the Timelines of other Cosmos!","\"No surprises...\"","The Goliath repeated the words again as these two powerful beings affirmed with each other that against such monstrous weapons that only Hegemonies could touch and defeat...the Apex Paragon would not make them stare in a stupor this time around!","---","Chaos churned as the Subjugations of the Usurper were born, Noah finishing his migration of a few Quintillion beings from 3 Universes and into his own as very few of his subordinates even remained in the Primordial Cosmos.","Noah planned to give a brief period of a few hours at most to his people before he sent them out on a path of Conquests once more, and this time he had hundreds of Paragons under his command as the conquest of the remaining Universes should be even faster!","Among the many boons gained recently, the biggest ones still remained the bountiful Marks of Antiquity, filling up the Light of Conquest once more, and most importantly...the Blue Slime.","The main bodies of Noah’s subordinates were all in the Universal Core of the Dark Universe as while marveling at Noah’s current actions, they could help but stare at the bubbly Blue Slime in utter envy.","Kazuhiko always spoke about what was on his mind as he voiced out without hiding the envy in his voice.","\"Why weren’t we born with a Universal Devouring skill? Even designing something resembling it costs trillions of skill points that none of us would be able to gather...\"","His voice expressed everyone’s emotions as they looked at the Manifested galactic filament of the Blue Slime that showed a terrifying scene.","The terrifying creature that had swallowed 200 Seeds of Chaos...200 portions of an Origin of a Hegemony!","His realm had been progressing at a crazy speed as at this moment...he actually already had 55 Billion Galaxies connected within his Origin.","55 Billion!","More than halfway towards birthing his own Universal Seed!","\"I thought Noah would be the only one I would have to chase after and never reach...never did I think a Slime would also stand above all of us...!\"","RUMBLE","It was a mystery to who said it, but a voice that showed the emotions of many of Noah’s subordinates rang out as many of them mingled among each other for a few others before they set off for whatever awaited for them next."]},{"number":1063,"title":"Chapter 1063: Chapter 1062 - A Paragon Descends As A Universe Trembles!","paragraphs":["The Dark Universe buzzed with activity at this moment as a myriad of different existences arrived and began to assimilate themselves in it.","The pressure from an Antiquity that constantly plagued them in the Animus, Necrotic, and Automaton Universe had entirely faded away as they weren’t under horrendous status effects that made them feel like they were suffocating every second!","They were in a brand new space that seemed to be filled with wonder and possibilities as one particular thing that made the settlement of all the coming beings fairly easy was the fact that they had all sworn Fealty to Noah.","Everyone was under the same banner and conflicts or wars were annulled!","A period of peace was taken, however brief it was- for beings to just recuperate and relax their minds at this moment.","Even if it was just for a few hours!","Noah Summons and powerful Subordinates mingled amongst each other, prominent beings like the Sword Emperor, Morgana, Paragon Quinnie, Lich Emperor Agobo....numerous beings from all walks of life were seen around each other as they took a moment to recognize their achievements before they rushed out for war once more.","Of course, others couldn’t help but initiate spars as the focus of many was around the Blue Slime, with Noah’s contracted summons and many other subordinates going towards the Slime for battle!","With the power of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos, Extinction...and many other ones while also being halfway through connecting the Galaxies within its universe though, the Blue Slime was unrivaled towards all those he faced!","BOOM!","Kazuhiko’s sorry figure tore through the sky like a bullet at this moment, the dark sword aura protecting him torn apart as he smashed onto a verdant mountain nearby.","His gaze was despondent as he sighed endlessly while speaking out, his eyes still locked onto the Blue Slime floating in the skies alone as he had knocked everyone else to the ground.","\"Ahh...can’t even defeat the Slime now!\"","BZZT!","Essence buzzed around his body even with the complaints, flying through the skies again as the figures of the prideful Emperor Penguin, Steel Mikhail, Anna, and many others all tried to get through the now ridiculous power of the Blue Slime.","As Noah had exquisitely designed verdant lush mountains and golden glimmering rivers around the area they were currently at, it was a scene of wonder and uniqueness that could not be found anywhere.","Valentina was looking at these scenes from a distance as she drank from a crimson cup filled with golden liquid, Noah’s main body situated in a meditative position behind her inside of a huge high rise glass building.","The elegance and power of a Hegemony could be felt even more powerfully from her as while everyone was momentarily celebrating or sparring, she was close to Noah as he had told her more of the current situation!","Her eyes twinkled with light as when she thought of what she could do, she always found her mind returning back to the image of the man behind her as she sighed.","As a powerful Hegemony, she was actually so weak as she had to depend on her man that was a rank below her! The being that actually did more against their enemies compared to everyone else!","She teleported at his position as she hugged him from behind, seemingly speaking out in frustration and in a pleading tone towards the being who opened his eyes soon after.","\"How can I display power like you at the same level? Or even like that Tiamat and Blue Slime? I feel stifled only being able to deploy my clones to harass Ambrose in the Animus Universe!\"","The Hegemony complained in a soft voice towards the being surrounded by golden light, her figure hugging onto him tightly as she was shockingly acting shy while asking Noah for how someone like her could gain even greater battle power. Others would be shocked if they heard and saw such a powerful being speak in such a tone towards an existence a rank below her!","The demeanor of an aloof Hegemony was gone as she revealed a certain side only to special someone! Others would only ever get to look at her as an untouchable existence with immense power, but Noah...he only raised his head while smiling lightly at her actions.","\"There are naturally many methods, I just don’t know if you’ll take them!\"","\"Oh?\" Valentina’s interest was piqued as her ears perked up, Noah replying to her with a sharp light coursing through his eyes.","\"When I establish my Universe, you can form a contract with me and just become bound to me...then I can merge with you and give you access to a myriad of Cosmic Daos and so much more!\"","RUMBLE!","A preposterous idea was given to a Hegemony as Valentina only let out a harrumph at it, her eyes swimming with possibilities as she actually gave it some thought before she replied.","\"Forget it...what are you doing next? Which Universe is the next target of Conquest?\"","She said this as she turned her eyes towards the shining Star of Conquest drizzling pristine white essence over Noah at this very moment.","Noah’s senses focused on this star as well, his mouth moving freely as he shared the sight of the Primordial Ruination Clone.","\"My clone has just entered the Chthonian Universe with the Cthulhu and other Terrors as we speak...\"","THRUM!","\"A Universe filled with Planetary sized existences as it boasts to be larger than most universes in the Primordial Cosmos...\"","Yes! The Chthonian Universe was an extremely terrifying one as the beings within were simply too different in size compared to other existences. Races of Chthonians and Titans thrived within this Universe as among the many Universes of the Primordial Cosmos, it was actually the largest as its size alone was twice as large as others!","Even though the existences within weren’t as numerous as other Universes, their sheer sizes made them pronounced and unique across the Primordial Cosmos. Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone had just arrived within this Universe right now.","\"Just you and the Terrors alone?\"","Valentina asked doubtfully as Noah replied with a smile.","\"We’re just an advanced party. Some will soon join me in this Universe as I’ll divide the clones of others to descend onto another Universe with the Blue Slime in the lead...\"","...!"]},{"number":1064,"title":"Chapter 1064: Chapter 1063 - A Paragon Descends As A Universe Trembles! II","paragraphs":["The gaze of Noah’s main body was piercing across spacetime as the scene of what the Primordial Clone was looking at reflected on his eyes.","He had to be relentless when it came to the 9 Universes and the Antiquity that was invited to make his way in, as everything truly was on a timer!","But after he finished the Conquest of the Necrotic Universe and the Automaton Universe, he was also speedily advancing forward as the number of Marks of Antiquity he held now towered over 18 Billion.","Not the 15 Billion he expected, but 18 Billion as at this moment, he transformed 18 Billion Galaxies into Dao Galaxies that were occupied with the Essence of Ruination. That was 18 Billion Dao Galaxies that could seamlessly form a connection with normal galaxies, and it meant that Noah now had 36 Billion fully connected Galaxies.","Terrifyingly, it was behind the Blue Slime even with all the work he was doing!","He had to Conquer quintillions of Beings across multiple Universes to get where he was, while the Blue Slime had to devour just over 200 portions of the Origin of a Hegemony to get over 55 Billion Galaxies connected. How unfair life was!","But with such a pace, Noah was on track to soon establish his Universal Seed.","’Now, it’s just a few more Universes...’","Noah had such a thought as while his main body enjoyed the company of a Hegemony, his Primordial Ruination Clone descended onto the Chthonian Universe as this time, he didn’t even use the Dao of Subterfuge to grant himself a new body, but instead used the Terror of Aether skill tree to obtain the planetary sized body of a Cthulhu!",".","As it was changed through the essence of Ruination as with every skill he cast, there were some modifications as he took on a terrifying form of a winged octopi-draconic humanoid being. An innumerable number of tentacles wriggled powerfully on the octopi-draconic head that shone with two crimson colored eyes, the entire body being actually colored galaxy black as it seemed like there were stars constantly moving throughout his figure.","Standing over 10,000 miles long, the body was larger than most planets as with the glimmering Star of Conquest above it, it made him look like a demonic saintly creature out of the most fantastical horror!","By his side, the real Cthulhu at the PARAGON Realm looked at Noah’s form and harrumphed as the purple aura around this Terror only became thicker, the millions of tentacles around it trembling with power.","Their gazes turned towards their surroundings as they took in the Chthonian Universe. A hint of red could be seen within its Chaotic Void that encompassed all of its Galaxies and other stellar bodies, and the unique thing with these stellar bodies was of course their sizes.","A Galaxy from an average Universe could be anywhere between a few light years to thousands of light years, with a single light year equating to 6 trillion miles!","In the space that Noah just arrived in, he could already see the outline of an enormous Galaxy within this Chthonian Universe that actually spanned over 100,000 Light Years!","To accommodate the planetary sized bodies of the Chthonians and Titans, some planets could span as wide as a few million miles, with some unique and well known Planets and Realms where the Ancient Old Ones lived spanning for over a Billion miles.","Ancient Old Ones!","The most powerful and oldest beings still living in the Chthonian Universe, their lifespan actually exceeding what most Paragons could handle as among the many existences- the Chthonians were the few that could exceed the 1 million life span before their Origins began to break down.","Some even had unique skills that allowed them to enter deep slumber, halting the progression of their life as they would wake up hundreds of thousands of years later to look for opportunities in another era!","This was the type of existences that Noah would come across!","His grand party had arrived into the Chthonian Universe at this moment, the sheer might they released frightening as their planetary sized bodies began to move forward seemingly causing their surrounding chaotic void of this Universe to quake as it was fearful of the future actions these beings would take!","In the Cthulhu form, Noah moved forward relentlessly as against an Antiquity, he didn’t waste any time.","As he moved forward at this moment, he didn’t know of the Subjugations of the Usurper that Chronos had prepared just for him!","---","The Primordial Cosmos was vast, and so was its number of powerhouses. Even though there was a significant amount of Hegemonies, many moved to protect the respective Universes they were born in, with some loving seclusion as they didn’t get out for millions of years.","Recent actions had caused a large number of Hegemonies to come out of the dark, where most were currently watching the unfolding scenes of the actions of Chronos and the Goliath, as well as the group they had following them!","Among those watching the unfolding situation, they actually paid great attention to the movements of a certain Apex Paragon as he was the only one moving freely within the Universes that were now filled with an intense aura of an oppressive Antiquity.","After the shocking actions of carrying out a Universal Wide Teleportation of Quintillions of beings in a few minutes, many Hegemonies first questioned the reality of all that they knew before they moved on to questioning where he went now.","They wanted to understand how a Paragon could have enough Mana to wrap up and teleport Trillions out from multiple Universes, something that even the combined Mana reserves of tens of Hegemonies would not be able to accomplish!","The methods of the Apex Paragon were too mind bending as they left behind too many questions, but the centermost was which of the remaining 6 Universes this being would appear in next.","The eyes of the Hegemonies were everywhere as soon enough, some were able to notice the glimmering white star of conquest of a few planetary sized beings in the Chthonian Universe.","\"The Chthonian Universe!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1065,"title":"Chapter 1065: Chapter 1064 - Ancient Old Ones I","paragraphs":["\"The Chthonian Universe!\"","WAA!","The location of the Apex Paragon was found as the eyes of many Hegemonies turned towards it, Oathkeeper obtaining this information himself as he had a thoughtful look on how to move.","After he had searched and pleaded with no answers, he looked towards himself for them as he soon found one!","It wasn’t something he would have ever resorted to doing, nor was it something a being like him would have been capable of thinking of in the past.","But certain circumstances required him to make a move.","WAP!","The glimmering golden body of the Oathkeeper was unlike the other Hegemonies that began to appear on the boundary of the Chthonian Universe or gain access to the happenings within from watching from afar, and he instead actually appeared in front of the Microbial Universe!","The Universe where he sensed the powerful auras of Chronos and the Goliath last frequent, as they were last here to watch the birth of the Subjugation of the Usurper that stemmed from a Microbial Incarnation of Chaos.","Oathkeeper didn’t know any of this as he came here for his own specific reasons.",".","He waved his hands in front of him as on his palm appeared a certain pristine white disk. It let out terrifying vibrations in the surrounding space as milky white Primordial Essence leaked from it, the Primordial Disk coming to be as Oathkeeper began to pour essence unto it!","BZZZT!","The surroundings began to shake as this Universal Realm Hegemony began to utilize a Cosmic Treasure, and it was truly a powerful one at that as it could mobilize the very essence that the Cosmos was birthed from!","Even if he could only use a portion of its functions as only a being at the Cosmos Realm would be able to utilize it fully, he could still do shocking things with it as one of them...","BOOOM!","Was to affect the very Universes that were built from the Primordial Essence.","A thin crack had appeared in the Universal boundary of the Microbial Universe as the strongest Hegemony holding the Cosmic Treasure capable of using Primordial Essence actually began to use it for the purposes of destruction!","Primordial Essence could build, but it could also disassemble the things it built.","The Oathkeeper searched for an answer and received none, and so he instead chose to do the only thing he could with a powerful tool in hand. He would break apart the barriers of the Universes he could not cross as he would rip apart the betrayers of the Primordial Cosmos with his own hands!","Primordial Essence endlessly rushed out from the Primordial Disk as it formed into a razor edge that began to eat up a Universal Boundary!","---","Under Noah’s fingertips, there were many cards to play.","He had an entire Universe’s worth of them, and so he went ahead and put them to use! To do so...he started off with himself and the Terrors in the Chthonian Universe.","Aside from this, he also had the forces of three genuine Universes under his fingertips, the forces of the fourth Universe being his native one as it was actually the strongest!","After he gave many of them less than a day to settle, he deployed them out into the Primordial Cosmos once more.","After all, the enemy was an Antiquity that had powerful Hegemonies moving around on his behalf. Noah could not tarry.","The first party was led by the terrifying Blue Slime, his strength actually nearing Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone as this Slime would actually lead half of Noah’s summons, subordinates, and Paragons of the Animus Universe to descend onto the Euthenia Universe!","The second party would be led by Tiamat, the Twin Draconic Serpents, and the rest of Noah’s Summons as they led the forces of Paragons from the Automaton Universe to descend unto the Liberated Universe that was filled with Heroes, Villains, and capped beings with grand allusions.","The third party would be led by the Manifested Seven Deadly Sins, Pride taking the lead as with them, the over 100 Undead Paragons from the Necrotic Universe would be under their banner for the conquest of the Abyssal Universe!","The Abyssal Universe was filled with unique races of Demonic beings, some nearly being as old and unique as the Titans and Chthonians of the Chthonian Universe. For this, Noah wondered how everything would play out when they faced the Seven Deadly Sins!","3 forces, 3 Universes.","And he had descended on the fourth one himself as at this moment, only the Omicron and Microbial Universes would not have his forces moving through them.","This was the rate he designed to be able to seamlessly bulldoze through the plans of Hegemonies and even an Antiquity!","In the Universal Core of the Dark Universe, Noah was now taking the behaviors of the Hegemonies that could not act within the 9 isolated Universes as he had three illusory screens that were showing the scenes of three different Universes.","They were showing all the events about to occur within not mainly for him, but for the main bodies of Valentina, Barbatos, and those around him who wanted to observe the happenings of the Universes!","As soon as Noah’s words traveled down to the Vassals, they moved as the Blue Slime was the first to arrive in the Ethenia Universe, half of Noah’s Animus Summons and the Paragons of the Animus Universe soon appearing behind him as he would lead their legions.","He took on the shape of the glorious Blue Dragon as burning blue flames shone in his eyes, reflecting the green luster that permeated throughout the unique Ethenia Universe that was filled with powerful Ancient Plant Races.","Treants, Dryads, Ents, Halflings...a myriad of Ancient Plant Races filled the Euthenia Universe as the beautiful verdant greenery about to be ravaged by war was extremely distinct!","Noah saw the beautiful scenes of this Universe as he made a mental note to go visit it later whenever everything was done and he could actually enjoy vacations as his eyes moved on to the scenes of the Seven Deadly Sins.","They had just arrived in the Abyssal Universe, the chaotic void around them tinged black and red as with the golden glimmering Sin of Pride leading the way, trillions of Undeads appeared behind them soon after as they began to move methodically.","It was a glorious scene as the terror of the Sins and Undead would entrench itself fully into the Demonic Races of the Abyssal Universe!"]},{"number":1066,"title":"Chapter 1066: Chapter 1065 - Ancient Old Ones II","paragraphs":["The last illusory scene Noah was displaying showed Tiamat and the remaining Animus Summons with the Emperor Penguin and a few other subordinates along with the Paragons of the Automaton Universe appearing near a Galaxy in the Liberated Universe that actually had a huge statue of a smiling human being posing gloriously as a cape stretched out behind him!","It was the glorified statue of a renowned Heroic Hegemony that was over a single light year large, many beings looking towards it for inspiration over the years.","All of those under Noah...experienced vastly different scenes in the Universes they descended on as some were about to meet Ancient Plant Races, others a myriad of Demonic Races, and others would even experience the unique atmosphere of heroes and Villains fighting for supremacy in another Universe!","As for Noah himself, his forces were moving towards the nearest Galaxy in the Chthonian Universe as he would meet monstrosities that others only thought of in their dreams.","With the request from Adelaide that found Noah’s actions the most interesting, the illusory scene of the movements of Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone and the Terrors was also made visible beside the other three screens as many more eyes turned towards it.","4 screens showing 4 different Universes, those watching it all being the main bodies of Noah and his subordinates as they were all clustered in an enormous movie theater like stadium at this moment, delectable foods and feasts being prepared as they watched the unfolding scenes of the Universes play out.","It was a hubbub of activity as many wondered how the events would go down in each of the Universes, and they would have feasts while they watched on. It was something that only these beings in the Dark Universe could do as under Noah, they felt an immense feeling of safety and companionship!",".","---","Within the Chthonian Universe.","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone in the Cthulhu form led the party of Terrors forward, their eyes set on the distant Galaxy that was so large that it covered everything for tens of thousands of light years!","The terrifying wings of Noah’s new form flapped as they released a unique force to move him even faster than lights peed, his enormous body that shone with the color of galaxy black shimmering powerfully as it made him seem like an ancient being.","He enjoyed this feeling of power and strength as he made his way across this terrifying Universe.","Among the many Universes out there, Noah was extremely curious about one’s like the Chthonian Universe purely based on how unique and different their inhabitants were.","They had their own Systems of power as when he thought of the Ancient Plant Races in the Euthenia Universe or the Microbial Races in the Microbial Universe, he wished he could’ve just had a laid back time touring all of these Universes!","But...the Universal Amalgamation would destroy it all as the end process of it was going to be the fusion of all the Universes with the Universal Constructs.","The merging of the cocoon like Tools of Descent as they became one and gave way to an Antiquity!","\"Let’s clean things before then, shall we?\"","Noah spoke likely as his senses caught movements from the Galaxy they neared. They were ready for battles of Conquest like always, and the bodies of the Terrors began to thrum with power as they prepared to face whatever terrifying Legions of Chthonians were released soon after!","But...","WAA","The magisterial and ancient auras of only 3 Paragons could be felt coming towards them. No armies, no Legions, nothing! Just three enormous planetary sized Chthonian that caused Noah’s eyes to glimmer with intense light.","One looked like a purely enormous squid, the tentacles from its body being even more numerous than the Cthulhu as its body undulated with a black aura. Another was an enormous circular ball of mass that looked like a planet, but the wriggling flesh that trembled with power gave away its status as a terrifying living being!","The third and the one leading the party of three was the most unique one in Noah’s eyes as this Chthonian actually had a humanoid shape, with his face being black as it held no facial features, and a glimmering crimson halo undulated powerfully on top of his obsidian colored head.","Something unique about these beings was their auras! They were at the levels of Paragons, and yet Noah could feel they were extremely powerful ones at that as their auras almost neared that of the Incarnations of Chaos!","His eyes glimmered as [Eyes of Truth] were activated.","[Ekurass] :: A creature from the race of Ancient Old Ones, unique existences capable of living a few million years no matter their Realm of Power. Such uniqueness is accompanied by the fact that the advancement into the next rank is hundreds of times harder than normal for those of this race. [Life History],[Habits]....","Boundless information opened up in front of him as Noah’s eyes glimmered with light!","Ancient Old Ones! Unique existences of all shapes and sizes, and the three in front of him were no smaller than his own planetary sized form as they released an ancient aura of oldness.","With Noah’s comprehension is the essence of Chronos, he could see a unique factor of time wrapping around these three beings as they came forward, their bodies not holding any battle intent as Noah didn’t attack.","The humanoid Chthonian at the forefront with the crimson halo ’spoke’ first, mental waves entering Noah’s mind.","\"We have long heard of you and your actions in the Animus and Necrotic Universe, Tyrannical Emperor.\"","WAA!","A voice that seemed synonymous with age rang out as Noah focused on the powerful being before him.","\"The Chthonian Universe is half divided under the influence of two Hegemonies, one siding with those searching for Antiquity, the other being the Great Old Nazzagath that is trying to protect us even now.\"","\"He has sent word to us that you might be descending here, and that adhering to your will would be the best option to fight against the beings holding our Universe hostage!\"","RUMBLE","\"So from us...there will be no need for war or bloodshed. Half of the Chthonians in this Universe will bend to your will whenever you so want.\"","...!","Noah looked incredulously at the Ancient Old One as he nearly laughed inside, seeing that the Conquest of the Chthonian Universe would actually be even easier than any of the past Universes combined!","The Star of Conquest above his head shone brilliantly at such a reality, but the words of the Ancient Old One continued.","\"I do have to warn you though, Apex Paragon. We Old Ones share unique abilities and on a deeper level, even consciousness. In the past day, from the Old Ones siding with the Usurper...three of the most powerful Paragons were forever removed from our lineage, their consciousness cut from us as it wasn’t the release of death, but something else!\"","...!","\"Before the connection between us was entirely cut off, we were able to first sense the essence of a Hegemony corrupting their souls...and then the essence of the Antiquity that plagues our Universe before the connection was cut off entirely.\"","...!","Noah’s eyes constricted at such information as his mind worked at high speeds.","Souls corrupted by the essence of a Hegemony- this should be an Incarnation of Chaos!","But...thereafter, these souls were Corrupted by the essence of Antiquity?!"]},{"number":1067,"title":"Chapter 1067: Chapter 1066 - Not Following The Plot! I","paragraphs":["Noah absorbed the words of the Ancient Old Ones as many thoughts and ideas flowed in his mind. The powerful Incarnations of Chaos...could Chronos and the Goliath have created something even more terrifying with the aid of the Antiquity?","Noah didn’t know the answer to this, but it didn’t matter to him at this moment as he merely nodded at the humanoid Chthonian before him.","\"You are?\"","\"Devour of the Deep, Zagadath.\"","The rumbling voice of the Chthonian Paragon replied to Noah as his body began to glimmer with the pure white light of conquest and Fealty.","\"Very well, you shall take the lead under me for the days to come as we make sure all the Ancient Old Ones and the rest of the Chthonians break free of the shackles of Chronos and his followers.\"","THRUM!",".","The moment his words finished, Noah had extended the essence of Fealty to the Devourer of the Deep in front of him as well as his two companions, the essence of Fealty going even further and extending into the vast Galaxy behind them!","From their words, these unique Ancient Old Ones under the lead of the Hegemony Great Old Nazzagath were ready to stand with Noah, with half of the Existences within the Chthonian Universe being told this as it made Noah’s job very easy.","The dao of Fealty extended far past the 100,000 Light-year galaxy before them as Noah continued to churn his mana out wildly, spreading it throughout the Chthonian Universe as he would gladly take the free pass of a few Quintillion Vassals!","As he made a move the moment he arrived in the Chthonian Universe...so did his enemies.","He wouldn’t have to wait too long as after his entrance, measures were taken by Chronos and the Goliath!","A present was already prepared for Noah, and it would come in a manner that he never expected!","---","Chronos and the Goliath were looking at two terrifying scenes at this very moment.","One was the fact that shockingly, the Oathkeeper was outside the boundary of the Microbial Universe as he was using a Cosmic Treasure to actually shatter the barrier of this Universe, nobody knowing the results of his actions when such a thing succeeded as Chronos’s expression became gloomy!","The other terrifying scene they were focused on were the 9 horrendously powerful beings floating before them- these being the Subjugations of the Usurper that had come out of the Universal Constructs not too long ago.","Three were planetary sized Ancient Old Ones that overshadowed everyone else, two were Microbial beings that could barely be seen by the naked eyes, two were terrifying horned beings from the Abyssal Universe, and 2 were caped Heroes from the Liberated Universe!","The 9 Existences were extremely unique, but they followed the commands of Chronos as aside from the Antiquity trying to descend, he was the being with the most authority of the Universal Constructs. Below him was Ambrose that initially designed everything...and the Goliath and others came after.","\"He’s made his landfall in the Chthonian Universe.\"","The Goliath spoke in a matter of fact tone as Chronos nodded beside him, his eyes shining with a sharp light.","\"We’ll be doing things differently this time around. Even with the confidence we have that a single one of these Subjugations of the Usurper will not be able to be defeated by anyone other than a Hegemony...we won’t be sending one after another or separate them into different Universes. We will focus on the Apex Paragon!\"","RUMBLE!","Chronos spoke in a domineering manner as the eyes of the Subjugations before them shone with an intense light. He wasn’t going about it in a round about manner as he followed the plot where they send waves upon waves of fighters against their enemies, only to learn them successively defeating them as by the end- they are left with nothing.","This happened just recently as 20 Incarnations were sent first against Noah, and it acted as a stepping stone for him to get even more powerful! Even though Chronos didn’t know this, he instinctively chose to make the move that granted the highest success of the Apex Paragon being wiped away.","\"All 9 of them shall descend onto the Chthonian Universe and wipe out the Apex Paragon first. Everything else can wait.\"","...!","It was a route that didn’t follow the traditional plot of waves of enemies being sent until they were all defeated!","A spatial light erupted from Chronos as it began to cover the existences releasing a terrifying light thereafter, the Goliath nodding as he still kept his attention towards the cracking Universal Barrier that was actually being disassembled with the Primordial Essence that made it.","\"And the Oathkeeper?\"","\"We’ll have to deal with him and hold him back ourselves, sadly.\"","OOOM!","The voices of the two powerful beings slowly faded as the 9 figures of the Subjugations of the Usurper disappeared from the Microbial Universe, their destination being the Universe where an Apex Paragon was already spreading out his Dao of Fealty freely!","---","In the Chthonian Universe.","To Noah, things had just been unfolding very smoothly as the words of the Ancient Old One before him held true, trillions of beings willingly agreeing to become his Vassals before he even shed any blood within this Universe!","His planetary sized body glimmered with the starry color of a galaxy as his crimson eyes blazed with light, the Star of Conquest above him letting out intense bursts of light as it seemed everything was under his fingertips.","As if everything was heading in the right direction.","But...","There would always be obstacles.","Life...would never be so easy!","THRUUUM!","Noah’s crimson eyes shook a second later as he turned his gaze towards a certain direction, 9 terrifying auras having suddenly appeared as for a brief second, Noah mistakenly linked it to the auras of Hegemonies!","But this caused his gaze to change drastically soon after as he corrected himself when he confirmed and realized they were not. But this realization...was an even more terrifying conjecture as the 9 blazing auras that could be mistaken for Hegemonies shot towards their position at a rapid pace.","The river of time churned as the seas of destiny and fate began to boil. A crucial juncture had appeared for the Primordial Cosmos as 9 Players stepped onto an already chaotic stage at this moment!"]},{"number":1068,"title":"Chapter 1068: Chapter 1067 - Not Following The Plot! II","paragraphs":["Above Noah’s main body, the golden seas of Destiny churned as his vast Universal Fortune began to erupt out wildly!","He had undertaken many actions in the past weeks, the growth of his Universal Fortune as an Architect of three Daos that were being utilized by the beings from over 4 Universes having grown to an extent that most Hegemonies could not even compare to.","Those with immense Universal Fortunes were the types of beings who could somehow overturn a horrendous and deadly situation to their own favor at the most crucial junctures, somehow finding hidden opportunities at a time when they would normally face death or suffer a major set back!","Noah...had no major risks of death as he had truly prepared too much, but he still had ways experience set back.","At this moment, the vast Fortune he held churned as for the first time ever, this fantastical concept sensed a coming set back that would befall on the being it coiled around. As there had been so few set backs, this Fortune churned wildly as it flew towards the vast rivers of Destiny, assimilating together before shooting into Noah’s head as he was filled with boundless information!","Information about a coming calamity! Information of what he could possibly do to bypass this Calamity!","WAA!","Glorious waves of gold covered Noah at this moment as the hundreds of beings in the theatrical stadium around him who were watching the illusory screens showing the scenes of 4 different Universes looked towards him in shock and wonder.",".","He didn’t say a single word as his eyes released golden beams of gorgeous light, a tremor going through his body as his eyes turned towards the screen of the Chthonian Universe!","The rest of his people also turned their eyes in this direction as they saw a blinding crimson light beginning to stretch out from 9 locations.","Noah looked at this light as he understood it represented a great calamity.","A calamity...but also a grand opportunity!","His Universal Fortune told him this much.","There were certain things he could do as if his Primordial Ruination Clone came out of this terrifying situation alive...there would be something beautiful waiting for him.","There was a possibility for a certain light to bloom.","There was a possibility of the glorious light of a Universe to bloom!","A possibility for Hegemony!!!","---","The Great Old Nazzagath floated outside the boundary of the Chthonian Universe as he looked at the vastly changing situation within, other Hegemonies that had found out the Apex Paragon being here staying a few miles away from him.","This being was titled a [Great Old] within the Chthonian Universe, being a powerful Hegemony that was only slightly behind Chronos, Oathkeeper, and the Goliath in terms of power. His figure was that of a crimson star shaped monstrosity, purple flames constantly burning throughout the wriggling mass that formed into the shape of a star!","In the Primordial Cosmos, he was known as the Great Old One, the Star of Destruction, and the Hegemony of Venerable Chaos.","Aside from the Goliath...he was the oldest being in the Primordial Cosmos!","He knew very well the renowned and powerful Paragons of the Chthonian Universe he was born in, even the ones that fell under the influence of the only other Great Old One that had now sided with Chronos.","So he recognized the three planetary sized Chthonians that came towards the Apex Paragon, even though it seemed their Original forms were greatly changed and the very air they released had become something else.","These were the very same Ancient Old Ones that had forever been taken from the collective consciousness connection of the Chthonians a few hours ago.","Two were very similar, their bodies being those that a majority of Chthonians took. They had the octopi-draconic features as their bodies leaned more towards the spherical shape, looking very similar to the purple Chthonian(Cthulhu) that the Apex Paragon had brought with him!","These were known as the Trepidities of the Deep!","They had two abyssal black eyes the size of small stars peeking out of the wriggling tentacles that covered their bodies that were over 50,000 miles long!","Recall that a small planet was only a few thousand miles long in diameter.","These two Chthonians had grown to the size that was tens times that of an average planet after their transformation, even the form of the Apex Paragon and his allies looking 4 times smaller in size!","\"Oh Varaxx and Kabulzan...what have you all done...?!\"","The Great Old Nazzagath couldn’t help but shake his head sadly, glancing at the third Ancient Old One that actually led the party of 9 terrifying beings.","The Chthonian Paragon who was most likely to become a Hegemony in the next 100,000 years. The being known as the Three-Faced Old One, being a unique Chthonian that was also circular in shape as its body had three pronounced faces that stretched for thousands of miles!","The Three-Faced Old One was currently over 60,000 miles in diameter, the star sized eyes on its three heads releasing a terrifying sense of loss as they didn’t actually release any light. They released a deep sense of loss as when Nazzagath looked at them...he couldn’t see the light of a soul within these eyes anymore!","The eyes were the key to every being, the light within them giving a glimpse of just who they were.","The Trepidities of the Deep had naturally abyssal black eyes as Nazzagath didn’t notice anything, but when he looked deeply into the eyes on the three faces of the Three-Faced Old One, he saw its utter blankness as his heart trembled in pain.","There was no soul there!","Whatever these transformed beings were...not just the three Chthonians but also the 6 other ones releasing a terrifying light of power- they weren’t who they used to be!","They were something else entirely.","They had become Subjugations of the Usurper!","Their bodies swirled with such immense and terrifying essence as even the watching Hegemonies rose up in shock.","It wasn’t power that any Paragon could wield.","It wasn’t a type of strength that any Paragon could stand against!","It was a strength that they truly believed had already neared if not reached the bounds of a Hegemony!","Such strength...emanated from 9 beings as they didn’t go one by one.","All of them and without a warning...thundered towards the singular Apex Paragon that had the form of a Chthonian shining with a colorful aurora of galactic light!"]},{"number":1069,"title":"Chapter 1069: Chapter 1068 - A Serendipitous And Inexorable Catastrophe!!! I","paragraphs":["Noah’s mind buzzed with a gorgeous light of power as he couldn’t help but repeat it to himself.","A possibility for Hegemony!","Sadly it wasn’t for him, but it was for a brilliantly shining Blue Slime with an unbeatable skill that could assimilate anything it devoured.","With such knowledge in hand, Noah began to move as he sensed the terrifying auras of 9 powerful beings nearing their location in the next three seconds.","Three seconds...but it was more than enough.","Firstly, the conquest of the 3 Universes aside from the Chthonian Universe was brought to a halt as Noah pulled back the Blue Slime and the rest of his Animus Summons, instantly teleporting them to float beside him in the Chthonian Universe.","BZZZT!",".","Essence then bloomed wildly as the body of the Blue Slime expanded, taking on an identical form similar to Noah’s of a humanoid Chthonian with an octopi-draconic head filled with a myriad of tentacles and shining with a colorful aurora of galaxy colored light.","The only thing different was that the Blue Slime shimmered bright blue as he looked exactly the same as Noah, his eyes hungry as thereafter...their enemies arrived.","WAA!","With grandeur and power, the beings Noah only sensed seconds ago to thousands of light years away appear before them.","Their mere appearance caused the surrounding space to quake as if it was placed under a strain, their soulless eyes locking onto Noah’s figure as they didn’t even stare at those around him!","At the same time, Noah was looking at his enemy as he received increased levels of shock.","Eyes of Truth was deployed as it brought back...","[Three-Faced Old One] (Subjugation of the Great Usurper) :: They have become entirely different existence as @$%#@ ....Abilities exceed parameters of all @#!%@$...Soulless @$%^@#$%...the instincts of the Usurper control the!#%#^@#%$...","[Trepidity of the Deep](Subjugation of the Great Usurper) :: They have become entirely different...","...!","Noah’s eyes constricted at the broken information he was receiving, coming across existences again that he could pull very little information about, but one thing remained clear.","Incarnations that had somehow become entrenched with the aura of the Great Usurper!","Beings that exceeded all parameters of Paragons!","And there were 9 of them as three were terrifying Chthonians nearly five times as large as Noah’s current 10,000+ mile form. 2 were actually normal sized humans, wearing caped costumes shining red and black as they had the stereotypical look of heroes Noah had only read about in comic books!","Then there were two existences that Noah could sense the overpowering auras of but could barely see them due to their small sizes, his eyes having to intensely focus before he could see the microbial sized existences.","Lastly were two demonic looking figures that had jet black bodies, demonic horns and 6 pairs of wings on their backs as they moved on four limbs as if they were beasts! They seemed like mixtures of demonic dragons as they were existences from the Abyssal Universe.","As Noah looked over all of them, the one singular thing he could say was that their eyes...were all the same.","As he read the very limited descriptions he could find, he saw that all of these 9 beings that exceeded anything to do with paragons were actually soulless creatures that didn’t even have their old minds, everything about them currently being controlled by pure instinct of an Antiquity!","The instant of their arrival, the three Ancient Old Ones that had come to receive Noah trembled as they sensed the overpowering auras of these beings.","The instant of their arrival, they moved without a single word as the chaotic void quaked, all 9 Subjugations of the Usurpers erupting out with what seemed like their strongest attacks right then and there!","They didn’t go one at a time.","They didn’t stop to talk.","All 9 attacked all at once and with shocking might that caused the chaotic space to howl and tear!","’Fucking hell’","Noah cursed out at these perfect killing machines as his body erupted with an intense light, multiple skills lighting up from him and his Animus Summons that were fused with his clones.","The bodies of Chtulhu behind him were even pushed back as Noah foresaw even these powerful Paragons would be shattered apart by a single strike of the 9 existences before him!","This was because on their bodies, there were a myriad of things he could recognize...but there were even more things he didn’t know of.","There was the Cosmic Essence of Extinction, Chronos, and Annihilation...but there were also other Cosmic Essences that he had not come across before!","From their bodies, there was also an intense feeling of a unique power that Noah didn’t yet understand, and it related to the aura of the Antiquity.","The Three-Faced Old One that was the largest of them all was at the forefront as his attack released itself at the speed of light, arriving in front of Noah’s Primordial Clone the moment that his cast of a myriad of skills finished!","The attack...came from the front face of this terrible beast, being a scorching obsidian ray of light that was over 20,000 miles wide in diameter. This ray of light shattered the very chaotic void itself as if it was paper, the three Ancient Old Ones that Noah had already pushed aside nearly feeling their skin burn even though they were from a far distance.","It wasn’t just enough to wipe out Noah, it covered enough distance that even the figures of the Blue Slime and others around Noah were all affected!","Mind you...this was just one of the attacks of the 9 Subjugations of the Usurper!","RUUUUUMBLE!","The attack came at the speed of light as it smashed onto Noah, his body and the bodies of his Animus Summons his clones fused with having already been under the enhancement and boosts of tens of skills when they received the attack.","Yet...","BOOOOM!","An explosive sound as if millions of galaxies had shattered exploded out.","The chaotic void was shattered as it remained that way, the area being thrown into deadly storms of destabilized space as even the void could not restructure itself!","When the scene cleared an instant later, a shocking scene was displayed.","There were multiple figures of Noah’s Summons surrounding him when the attack of the Three-Eyed Old One came.","When it finished , even the void was melted as one could only see the figures of Noah and the glimmering blue version of himself that was the Blue Slime remained.","The rest of the clones of his summons and even his own clones that were fused into them...were vaporized as something aside from the essence of Cosmic Daos invaded and tore everything apart!","Only the body forged by a Cosmic Treasure remained and the body of the unique creature half way through becoming a Hegemony were safe!"]},{"number":1070,"title":"Chapter 1070: Chapter 1069 - A Serendipitous And Inexorable Catastrophe!!! II","paragraphs":["A single attack, and all of Noah’s clones and the clones of his Animus Summons aside from the Blue Slime were wiped out!","Tiamat was no exception!","Nor the Kingly Calamity Bear!","Nor the two Draconic Serpent twins!","Vaporized by something that heavily reinforced the Cosmic Dao Essences that the Three-Faced Old One blasted out, and that something was the essence of Antiquity.","Only the Blue Slime and Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone could withstand it, and even then...one could see that on their bodies, there were jet black flames that were burning furiously trying to devour their bodies even now!","Noah’s eyes glimmered with a glorious light of power as even with such a development, he wasn’t hindered or maddened.","A single attack from just one of his 9 enemies had told him that at this moment, he faced an utterly oppressive and shocking force that might actually be possible of defeating him.","This was why his Universal Fortune had churned..","This was why his seas of Golden Destiny had roiled!","Because in such an impossible situation...there would be stupendous results if he came out on top!","The attacks of his enemies could move at a speed of light, but so could his.","From the bodies of both Noah and the Blue Slime, clocks filled with the essence of Chronos bloomed as an instant cast of [Temporal Inversion] was cast.","Not around a specific person, but over the entire area that his summons and himself used to be and were at this moment in time standing in!","Large droves of essence were utilized as the essence of chronos seemingly overflowed, a shocking scene displaying itself soon after.","The vaporized bodies of all of Noah’s summons reappeared as seas of mana were used to inverse the flow of time of their area and bring them back to an instant before they fell!","Yes.","Mana!","This was always Noah’s one and only true weapon!","Facing beings of utterly ridiculous power, it was the only thing he could wield to stand against them as he used droves of it for a temporal inversion and overcame an attack that could wipe out even his clones and summons!","But still, the enemies this time were at a whole other level.","Even as the bodies of Noah’s newly returned Summons and himself fully lit up with the essence of Ruination and Chronos, one must not forget that at this time, only the attack of a single one of the Subjugations of the Usurper had arrived.","There were still 8 more.","Each of them had attacked simultaneously!","As soon as the cast of Temporal Inversion finished, the attacks of the 8 other terrifying existences landed!","Some were terrifying rays of deadly light, others were purely physical attacks that came from the enemies themselves.","The figures of the red and black caped Heroes from the Liberated Universe appeared near Noah’s Primordial Clone on the left and right as they focused on him, their arms flying out as they merely threw out a punch.","A mere punch that formed a chaotic phantom of Cosmic Essence that tore apart the void it crossed as if it were weak glass, this phantom punch bearing the weight of an innumerable number of Galaxies!","Aside from these, there were also the attacks from the two existences that were the size of microbes, yet the damage they could release could wipe out galaxies in a blink.","Their figures released an aurora of rainbow colored flames that washed towards Noah’s figure and Noah’s figure alone, these beings making it clear their goal was to eradicate him at all cost as they didn’t even spare their glances at those around him.","The two monstrous demonic beasts with 6 pairs of wings had their horns shine a brilliant ray of gold, causing sharp and minuscule drops of rain sized spears to instantly appear above Noah as it felt like a cloud of gold was coming down.","Against any beings, these minuscule golden spears would pierce them and only leave holes behind!","Then there were the two Trepidities of the Deep besides the Three-Faced Old One.","Their figures shone with a purple luster as two flowers bloomed below Noah’s feet. The blooming of these two flowers came with it the eruptions of an innumerable number of tentacles that threatened to wrap and destroy everything.","\"...\"","It felt like time was moving in slow motion.","Noah alone faced the simultaneous attacks of the 9 Subjugations of the Usurper that even the strongest Paragons could not even handle being near of...but his heart was calm.","A Cosmic Treasure disappeared from the Origin of his main body as it appeared in the Origin of the Primordial Ruination Clone.","An authority that only the owner of this Cosmic Treasure could utilize was cast.","The Dao of Subterfuge was put to full use as it covered everything around Noah.","BZZZT...CRACK!","An instant later, the area around Noah’s enormous planetary sized body ’shattered’ as an oval area of utter darkness enveloped him!","It seemed like a dense black hole that appeared to cover him and the few miles around him because an instant later, all of the attacks that the terrifying Subjugations of the Usurper threw towards him were sucked into this black hole as they faded away.","Disappeared!","...!","The area of black then receded as if nothing happened.","Noah’s body reappeared silently, his figure untouched.","Silence pervaded the area.","The soulless eyes of the 9 Subjugations of the Usurper turned quizzical as something they didn’t understand happened for the first time!","The enemy didn’t withstand or block the attacks, it seemed like the void had just shattered as all the attacks were absorbed, and he came out spotless at the end of it.","But it shouldn’t be like so, right?","That didn’t make sense, right?","Noah’s gaze was calm as he didn’t bother explaining.","Of course, it was him utilizing the Cosmic Treasure he held to not just break apart the chaotic void, but to break apart the folds of the universe they were in entirely!","He tore apart only a small portion of it as he caused a rupture, this rupture having within it the dense essence of the Sea of Ruination that could eat up everything!","It could eat everything, so it ate up even the terrifying attacks of these existences!","With Noah covering up the crimson essence and making it indiscernibly black with the Dao of Subterfuge, the attacking Subjugations of the Usurper and even the utterly shocked Hegemonies watching everything had no idea what just happened!","Noah’s eyes blazed a crimson light as his body shone with the gorgeous color of a myriad of galaxies.","His voice came out as this body began to glow murderously, his voice resounding out.","\"My turn.\"","RUUUUMBLE!"]},{"number":1071,"title":"Chapter 1071: Chapter 1070 - Inconceivable! I","paragraphs":["BOOM!","Outside the boundary of the Microbial Universe.","BOOM!","Explosive sounds of utter immensity rang out as a being glimmering white and gold wielded a Cosmic Treasure and released droves of Primordial Essence that actually tore apart a Universal Boundary!","The being carrying out such shocking actions had an exceedingly cold expression at this moment, but when one looked at his eyes while he did such shocking actions...they would be able to see a tinge of pain coursing through with every hit.","As if he truly didn’t want to do what he was doing, but he was left with no choice!","His entire life believed he had the purpose of bringing order to these very Cosmos. And yet at this moment, he was ripping one of its Universes apart!","BOOM!","The Primordial Essence had disassembled over 80% of the Universal boundary in the distance of a few miles, the Oathkeeper raising his hands once more to land even stronger attacks to finish everything when...","\"What a hypocrite you are!\"","WAA!","The essence of Chronos and Extinction bloomed from the inside of the Universe as they seamlessly passed through the now thin boundary that had nearly broken, rushing towards the figure of the Oathkeeper as he simply looked at this coming destructive essence while wrapping himself in Primordial Essence.","BZZZT!","The attacks from the Goliath and the Hegemony of Chronos landed on the vibrant Primordial Essence as they were eaten up, The Oathkeeper staring daggers at Chronos that had begun disparaging his name as soon as he appeared.","\"The great protector who does nothing but establish order is actually tearing apart a Universe at this moment...just how far have you fallen?\"","...!","An enormous regal purple clock erupted from behind Chronos with these words, the Goliath saying nothing as his chaotic body began to tumble around with essence of Extinction, a shocking illusory image of a planetary sized eye beginning to form behind me as he uttered calmly.","\"Primal Eye of Extinction.\"","WAA!","Maddening essence rushed out as Chronos and The Goliath moved to stop the Oathkeeper from tearing apart the boundaries of the Microbial Universe.","The gaze of the golden glimmering being was still impassive, but as he stared at the two beings he had considered those alongside him, the wrath in his eyes was palpating as at this moment, another crucial junction for the Primordial Cosmos occurred.","Seeing the mocking expression on Chronos’s face, seeing the unrecognizable form of the Goliath that was even older than he was...seeing these two beings accompanied with the myriad of recent actions and loss of purpose actually caused the Oathkeeper to snap!","The reserved and calm pillar that stood among the peak of power in the Primordial Cosmos bellowed out at this moment.","\"OOOOOOOH!\"","With his bellow, the Primordial Essence around him raged as it burned furiously, coalescing together as it formed into a glorious righteous Sword of Primordial Essence.","Pristine white in appearance but carrying such shocking power that even the hearts of Chronos and The Goliath tremble!","\"Break for me!\"","Oathkeeper bellowed out as if he was giving a command, the pristine white Sword of Primordial Essence thundering down as the thin film of a Universal Boundary remaining for the few miles around him...","CRAAAACK!","Shattered!","BOOM!","As if a bubble had popped.","As if an unbreakable piece of treasure had been defamed.","A Universal Boundary was broken as a being gallantly shining gold and white put his hands forward, grasping onto the pristinely white Sword of Primordial Essence as with its tip in the lead, he plunged into the Microbial Universe!","The figures of Chronos and Goliath were in shock as their bodies glimmered with intense light, their shocking attacks being released to stop this terrifying being from advancing.","The 9 Universes were still under the authority of an Antiquity that repelled any foreign Hegemonies from entering.","At this moment, the Oathkeeper was forcing his way in as with the Sword of Primordial Essence in the lead, he tore apart the pressure that repelled Hegemonies from entering the Universe!","His gaze was locked onto the far away Universal Construct, where even the attacking Chronos and the Goliath that wanted to stop his advance did not enter his eyes.","The gold irises within them shone as they only focused on the far away Universal Construct and the pristine white Sword of Primordial Essence within his hands.","Filled with determination and rage, the monstrous Oathkeeper continued forward!","---","\"My turn.\"","WAA!","The voice was extremely chilling to hear, the Hegemonies watching the unfolding situation adopting solemn looks at this time as among all of them currently on the boundary of the Chthonian Universe, The Great Old Nazzagath was the one to speak.","\"These 9 monstrosities...their power is on the border of a Hegemony!\"","RUMBLE!","His voice caused the eyes of all others to shake as they looked at each other in affirmation, but one particularly grim Hegemony shook his head as he replied back with an even somber tone.","\"The power that a single one of them can release nears a Hegemony. When all 9 collectively release their power on a single being together...that strike should be no less than the might of a newly advanced Hegemony.\"","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the surroundings.","The reality set in as all the Universal Experts in the surroundings understood the meaning of the words.","The Apex Paragon in front of them...could actually withstand the force of a Hegemony and not perish.","How wild!","How outlandish!","How inconceivable!","Utter shock and wonder spread out as after such a thought was realized, next up was naturally whether such a feat could be repeated twice or three times.","To be able to stand against a force comparable to a Paragon once was an astonishing feat. But it must have taken everything he had as thereafter...would he really still be able to do the same?!","A great question! And one that wouldn’t take too long to be answered...."]},{"number":1072,"title":"Chapter 1072: Chapter 1071 - Inconceivable! II","paragraphs":["The events occurring hereafter have to be described as if they took place over a long period of time...but they truly took place in a matter of seconds.","Within the Chthonian Universe, Noah’s body trembled with unknown strength as his eyes moved at light speed to lock on to the 9 terrifying existences.","The Cosmic Treasure within his Origin rumbled excitedly as it felt waves of mana surging into it, Noah planning on using this treasure fully for offense against these unbeatable foes as he knew it would be very hard to hurt them any other way!","The Dao for Subterfuge was also churning wildly as the main objective remained to keep this trump card hidden no matter what.","The crimson color and oppressive demeanor of a Cosmic Dao was not shown as what Noah displayed to the outside world seemed like a black essence that was a mixture of Chronos and Annihilation, his mind moving rapidly to make sure everything was working as it should before he made a move!","BOOM!","Like a glorious arrow that had been shot forth from a bow, Noah tore across space faster than light as he flew towards the terrifying Three-Faced Old One.","His hand was outstretched as he was seemingly throwing out a mere punch towards the enormous Chthonian that was nearly 5 times his size!","But it was no mere punch as the moment of his arrival...the fabric of the Universe would be torn as this Subjugation of the Usurper would face the wrath of an emotionless Ruination Sea.","As Noah moved like a brilliant flash of light towards the Three-Faced Old One, his Animus Summons were shimmering with even more brilliance.","Around all of Noah’s summons, purple-crimson runic circles filled with the essence of Chronos revolved around them constantly.","This was so that even if their bodies were undergoing a process of destruction from the attacks of these terrifying enemies, they could instantaneously use [Temporal Inversion] as they would always go back to a period before they were being destroyed!","It was like the attacks of the Subjugations of the Usurper were bulldozers destroying a building, and yet the constantly usable casts of [Temporal Inversion] were always rebuilding the destroyed building before it entirely collapsed.","It was a process that nobody could utilize but a single being.","A process that required immense amounts of mana to use and keep constant at all times!","This was the power that surrounded all of his summons as the Blue Slime was the first one to take the lead, his cerulean blue eyes shining brightly as his figure warped in front of one of the Trepidities of the Deep.","The attack of this Blue Slime was straightforward as with the identical figure of Noah’s Cthulhu form, countless tentacles flew from its mouth as its jaws expanded terrifyingly, the light of Extinction and Chronos shining madly as the Slime went for a straightforward attack to try Devouring right away!","ROAAAR!","The bellow of the Queen of Dragons shook everything thereafter as the twin Draconic Serpents joined their aunt side by side, the dense aura of Dragons erupting out majestically as the three of them took on the other Trepidity of the Deep, their jaws releasing pillars of Dragon’s Breath that were filled densely with the essence of Ruination.","It was a glorious sight as colorful pillars of right from the many heads of Tiamat and the Draconic Serpents tore apart space, all rushing towards a single Subjugation of the Usurper.","Beside them, the Golden Crow released its wings majestically as the heat was enough to burn millions of galaxies, letting out a space shattering cry as burned with golden brilliance while smashing towards one of the enormous Demonic existences from the Abyssal Universe!","OOOOH!","The Kingly Calamity Bear was close at hand as at some point, a majestic obsidian crown had appeared above the head of this monstrous summons, its fur glimmering with white and black luster as it rushed forwards to arms outstretched towards the other Demonic Existence.","Meanwhile, the Oculothorax, Leviathan, the Galaxy Devouring Serpent, and the Obsidian Panther all turned into gorgeous streaks of light as they rushed towards the remaining Subjugations of the Usurper from the Liberated and Microbial Universes!","A deadly ray of extinguishing light filled with the essence of Ruination released from the golden eye of the Oculothorax as it threatened to obliterate even the Microbial existence that could barely be seen.","The figures of the Leviathan, the Galaxy Devouring Serpent, and the Obsidian Panther all glimmered brightly as they released terrifying attacks of their own that contained Ruination Essence, and all of the Summons collectively still had the swirling runic circles of Chronos that represented Temporal Inversions which could be utilized at any time!","All of this...happened as Noah’s figure tore across space at the speed of light, his form of a Cthulhu shining a brilliant galaxy aurora of colors as he shot towards the planetary sized Three-Faced Old One that had already opened its front facing mouth, releasing another pillar of chaotic light that was even larger than Noah himself to smash against his coming figure.","THRUUM!","Noah’s body lit up with an obsidian light at this moment as it seemed like a black hole had appeared around him, this black hole sucking in all of the chaotic essence released from the mouth of the planetary figure as the shocking scene of a black hole traveling through the deadly pillar of light was created!","...!","Noah’s figure wasn’t damaged as he traveled through this terrifying pillar of light that could tear apart any Paragon, his figure looking like a primal and unstoppable might that traveled across all odd as he reached the enormous body of the Chthonian soon after!","He had actually torn the fabric of the Universe around him as he moved, keeping it around his body as thereafter, he focused the process of the rupture of the Universe on his fist the moment he came in contact with the terrifying figure of the Three-Faced Old One.","A simple fist.","One that didn’t seem to have any sense of power within it.","But from this fist, the fracture of a Universe spread out as the Sea of Ruination...was actually the attack that the Subjugation of the Usurper faced.","From Noah’s fist, a maddening black light bloomed as his figure actually seamlessly entered the hard body of the Three-Faced Old One, entering one side as he shockingly came out the other!","WAA!","He entered from one of its faces, and he actually cleanly cut through as he appeared out the other!","\"...\"","Silence descended on the stellar battlefield."]},{"number":1073,"title":"Chapter 1073: Chapter 1072 Glorious and Undeniable Might! I","paragraphs":["What was the most destructive attack that a being could face?","Such a question was an extremely hard one to answer, and it was because it could be answered differently depending on the level of power the being in question was!","When it came to existences in the Universal Realm, attacks with something as unique as the essence of Ruination were extremely hard to defend against. When one further went ahead and brought the Ruination Sea itself into the equation...","RUMBLE!","The result could be seen as the current situation played out!","Noah’s 10,000 mile figure had gloriously smashed into the Three-Faced Old One as at the point of impact, he had utilized the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION to create a rupture in the very fabric of the universe they were in, and this rupture moved with him from one side of the creature to another.","So this being had truly faced an attack that ripped apart the fabric of the Universe itself, Noah closing up these ruptures as he moved as nobody was the wiser on the mechanics behind his attack.","As for the result of it?","...!","Every watching soul watched on in silence as a clean and crisp 10,000 mile cylindrical hole was torn through the enormous figure of the Three-Faced Old One.","THRUM!","Its enormous body trembled as if it had received shock coursing throughout, but it didn’t let out a single cry as even after all that...its pairs of crimson eyes were only filled with confusion.","Confusion as to how what just happened was possible!","BZZZT!","The body of the enormous Three-Faced Old One began to tremble unstably after losing one fifth of its body, and it was in a central area at that as mixtures of essence within it began chaotically moving.","Even amidst the shock, its focus was placed on Noah as it saw this being glimmering with the mysterious dark essence around his body, about to make another move that could force this unbeatable being to dire straits!","In this moment of great shock and focus, a twinkle of blue flashed out.","Something completely unexpected to everyone occurred as a certain being that was in an entirely different location had instantaneously changed courses and acted as by the time it was noticed, it was already too late.","The Blue Slime in the terrifying Cthulhu form had made its target one of the Trepidities of the Deep, its jaws and tentacles having been expanding rapidly as many saw the attack of the cerulean Chtulhu one that wanted to simply swallow the enemy in front of it!","But as the body of the Trepidity shone brightly and was about to blast the tentacles and jaws of the Blue Slime away...this being disappeared entirely.","This was because this Devouring attack of the Slime wasn’t meant for the Trepidity.","Master and Summon were working in synchrony at this moment as all this time...the target of the Blue Slime had always been the Three-Faced Old One!","It had always been the enemy that Noah would attack and keep its attention for even less than a millisecond...and this minuscule period of time was all that the Blue Slime needed to carry out a shocking action.","The moment that the Three-Faced Old One had a hope created through its body as it began to shake unstably and focus on Noah’s next attack, it found that a glimmer of a blue viscous mass suddenly appeared to cover all of three pairs of eyes.","’What was this?’","What was this. This was the last thought that the terrifying existence that had become a soulless Subjugation of the Usurper would have before in the next second, the jaws of a cerulean Chtulhu that had expanded to be 5 times bigger than its own body appeared to fully clamp around it in an instant- its momentary lapse in focus allowing for the terrifying reality about to play out!","<<Universal Devouring >>.","...WAP!","A flash of cerulean blue.","A 50,000 mile existence that could not be defeated by anything other than a Hegemony disappeared.","An existence that an Antiquity promised would not be something that Paragons would even dream of touching...was eradicated simply as Noah and the Blue Slime schemed against it!","The moment the Subjugation of the Usurper disappeared, the Hegemonies watching outside the barrier felt their brains buzz and go numb.","Many did a double take as they recalled what they just found out in the past seconds- the fact that these beings had battlepower that was at the border if not spilling into the Realm of a Hegemony, feeling like the Aped Paragon might finally fall for the enemy’s schemes!","But...","What was this?!","Just what had happened?!","BZZZT!","After the disappearance of the Three-Faced Old One, all that was left was the Blue Slime.","From the body of this creature...billions of lines from the Galaxies within its Origin began to connect as its body shone brilliantly.","The shocking aura it released began to shoot up crazily as it thundered towards the boundary of a Paragon.","It thundered towards the Realm of Galactic Filament as it strove to connect all 100 Billion Galaxies no matter what!","\"Huh?\"","Across the folds of space and the rivers of time.","In a place very few beings were capable of traversing, with those who could traverse it choosing not to as it violated certain laws...within this region, there was the consciousness of the Great Usurper that was actively increasing how much focus it gave to a certain Cosmos.","Other ventures were put on hold or aside for now as the Great Usurper pulled the strings ever tighter, and yet he found out at this moment that the other side had begun to fight back with even more ferocity!","First, the Authority of the Antiquity was challenged when this being sensed something piercing into one of the Universes that the Tools of Descent were drawing essence from, and now...the Authority he placed in his Subjugations was actually violated as one of them was quite literally wiped away.","Not defeated, not destroyed by a terrible Cosmic Essence...but simply wiped away as if it didn’t exist!"]},{"number":1074,"title":"Chapter 1074: Chapter 1073 Glorious and Undeniable Might! II","paragraphs":["His Authority was actually violated on two fronts as even with the increased consciousness and support, the Cosmos he wanted to descend unto actually fought back even harder.","RUMBLE!","His consciousness bellowed out powerful waves of power at such a juncture as his gaze became even more focused.","\"Merely a Cosmos that hasn’t even produced an Antiquity, and you think you can deny one?\"","WAA!","His voice was deep and ancient as his cerulean blue eyes shone dangerously, this being closing these brilliant eyes at this moment as he...took a deep breath.","Thus breath acted as a method to solidify the consciousness within this space, one being able to see many thin blue chains appearing from his body as they extended onto multiple directions towards the vast rivers of time this being could access!","When he took the breath, the blue chains that were spread out began to snap off one by one as in a matter of seconds, only a single line of a chain remained.","It began to shine brighter and grow larger than all the others as this line...was connected to the Primordial Cosmos.","The Antiquity released all other attachments and connections to who knew what destinations as within seconds, his focus fully came unto the Primordial Cosmos.","\"I will not let a Cosmic Treasure escape my grasp...such a thing is even a rarity to pop up in Cardinal Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE","The line connecting this consciousness to the Primordial Cosmos became even larger and brighter with his words, his blue eyes releasing rays of terrible light as in the next moment, terrifying waves of essence began to undulate from him in waves.","They traveled across the mirrored rivers of time as soon enough, they caused horrendous effects in the Primordial Cosmos.","In the next moment, the Universal Constructs across the 9 Universes shook powerful as a second later, they radiated immense rays of crimson obsidian light as the cocoons around these Constructs began to expand at a visible speed!","Ambrose, the Cerulean Hegemony...all the Hegemonies put in charge of protecting the Constructs were shocked at the development as they saw the thrumming Cocooca release terrifying waves that flew out to the ends of the Universes.","The 9 Universes then began to oscillate powerfully as with the permeation of the essence of the Antiquity, the Universal Amalgamation proceeded even faster as the fusion of Universes and the coming together of the cocoons within them...would only need a matter of days now!","Not a few weeks, but a matter of days if not shorter depending on just how profound the Authority of Antiquity being released was.","It meant that the descent of Antiquity was coming down much faster than many realized or expected!","As he tore across the Microbial Universe with a glimmering Sword of Primordial Essence, the Oathkeeper felt this change even more closely as his determination soared, the white Sword in his hands glowing ever brighter as he pushed back the figures of Chronos and the Goliath!","The Oathkeeper had not called any reinforcements over when he began his relentless attacks, but many Hegemonies had now divided their attention and gathered outside the boundary of the Microbial Universe after his shocking actions were known.","They could see the broken boundary of the Universe and the glorious figure of the Oathkeeper surrounded by the pristinely white Primordial Essence, tearing across the space of the Microbial Universe as he seemed to be walking across a viscous area that was hard to move in with every step.","The viscosity was of course the authority of the Antiquity that denied entrance to the Universes to anyone that didn’t have their auras branded, but the Oathkeeper was forcefully tearing this apart with the use of a Cosmic Treasure!","The Hegemonies watching his brilliantly shining figures could only continue watching as even when they tried, none of them had the capability to withstand the authority of an Antiquity and force their way in.","They could only watch the brilliance of one man as he tore across the void of the Microbial Universe, his eyes dead set on the shining Universal Construct there!","Within the Origin of the Blue Slime, the number of connected Galaxies very quickly surpassed 60 Billion with the Devouring of a single Subjugation of the Usurper.","BZZZT!","While essence was meant swirling around the Slime, Noah’s figure only left behind after images as he didn’t sit still!","The Unkillable existences...could be killed as long as there were some unique methods implemented.","What was shocking was that even after a being had fractures torn across its body as it received an attack that tore apart the layers of the Universe, they were somehow still alive as only after their scheme successfully worked did the creature fall.","Unless these existences were devoured entirely by the Ruination Sea, it was extremely hard for one to actually kill them!","But Noah...didn’t even dare to kill them.","This was because their value as nutrients were too astounding!","They held within them an authority of an Antiquity as their value was who knew how many times greater than the Incarnations of Chaos as at this time, Noah could feel from the Origin of the Blue Slime that a single Universal Devouring of these existences had granted it over 20 billion new lines of connections.","From 55 Billion to 75 Billion.","The Blue Slime actually just had to devour two more of these terrifying Subjugations of the Usurper...and he would be able to complete all 100 billion connections!","Thereafter, a Universal Seed would be created as with it, one could bring forth a Universe.","Hegemony!","Ah!","WAA!","As the Blue Slime shone gloriously while releasing horrendous waves of power, the tentacles of its Cthulhu form vibrated with happiness as its cerulean blue eyes locked on the remaining 8 Subjugations of the Usurper.","The looks that the Blue Slime was giving forth were filled with such immense longing that one could mistake it for him looking at his loved ones!","But there was no love there. It was only the greed of Devouring and grasping Hegemony!"]},{"number":1075,"title":"Chapter 1075: Chapter 1074 - A Dream Of A Universal Seed I","paragraphs":["The might of the Subjugations of the Usurper was undeniable.","The aura alone that they displayed was enough to terrify any Paragons as the shocking truth of their power edging towards Hegemony remained. Yet...","Why did it seem like the might of the beings with the glimmering white Stars of Conquest was much more maddened and relentless?!","Why did it seem like they all were putting everything they had on the line?!","BOOM!","The attacks of Noah’s summons landed on their respective targets as a glorious burst of color erupted out. Noah himself appeared in front of the Trepidity of the Deep as his body moved forward at the speed of light, his right arm outstretched as a single punch was what was leading the way.","The Cosmic Treasure was ready to be utilized at any point as Noah wanted to continue tearing apart just two more of these existences as that was the reason why he and his summons were maddened!","They were fighting as if their lives were on the line because they could almost smell Hegemony! Not for themselves, but they could see a glimpse of Hegemony for the Blue Slime as when this occurred...the power their side could display would rise by an insane margin.","The soulless Subjugations of the Usurper shook slightly at such unyielding might, but this was when the aura of the Antiquity began to madly spread across the Chthonian Universe as the Antiquity fully focused his gaze onto the Primordial Cosmos!","The auras of the 8 remaining Subjugations began to rise crazily as unlike everything else, these beings actually seemed capable of absorbing the essence of Antiquity that was spreading throughout the Universe.","The Trepidity of the Deep in front of Noah absorbed this aura as its tentacles rushed out madly with a glimmer of a myriad of Cosmic Essence, but Noah was unhindered. His gaze was placid as even with the shocking might these existences displayed, there was a single reality that didn’t change.","Existences of this level could not defend against an attack capable of tearing apart the very fabric of a Universe. They could not defend against the Ruination Sea!","Hegemonies could not do so!","Even those that had broken past the Universal Realm and began inching towards the Universal Filament Realm which was normally the stage where Antiquities began to pop up...even these beings only held enough power to survive in the Ruination Sea for a period of time, but that was all!","Unless they had something as unique as Ruination Essence or Primordial Essence, or they were powerful enough to have arrived at the stage of a Cosmos. It wasn’t until they reached the Cosmic Realm that one could somewhat defend against the terrors of the Ruination Sea!","Even though the beings before him were powerful, they had not even reached Hegemony.","So against the millions of tentacles that erupted from the Trepidity of the Deep, Noah only pushed forward his fist.","THRUUUM...RIP!","The Cosmic Treasure was activated as seemingly, a black hole surrounded Noah on all sides as it sucked in everything!","He expertly controlled the Cosmic Treasure to create a fracture of the Universe only around his body and erase them as soon as he left, and he conducted the same move that heavily damaged the Three-Faced Old One against the current Trepidity.","Like an unstoppable moving 10,000 mile blackhole, his figure moved through as the body of the Trepidity had a hole at this center soon after, Noah coming out the other side.","It didn’t matter that there was just an eruption in the essence that the Antiquity released, nor did it matter if they were strengthened!","Against an attack that ripped apart a Universe, they could not defend! This was the terror of a Cosmic Treasure.","This was just a glimpse of what one could do with it!","WAA!","As if on cue, the figure of the Blue Slime appeared a moment after the Trepidity was given a hole 10,000 miles large, its essence in chaos as during this period of time, the tentacles of the Slime wrapped around it as terrifying words were uttered soon after.","<<Universal Devouring>>.","WAP!","A shimmer of blue, and another Subjugation of the Usurper disappeared.","\"...\"","The scene could scarcely be believed, but it was a terrifying one as it caused the other 7 Subjugations to bellow out vigorously while their bodies poured out resplendent attacks!","Noah’s summons were at the forefront of these as the Chronos Essence swirling around them in the form crimson purple runic circles activated, the Damage their bodies were receiving becoming inverted soon after as their lives were not taken even if they faced stupendous abilities.","This was the Uniqueness in Daos such as Chronos!","OOOOH!","The figures of the 7 Subjugations glimmering bright crimson lights after seeing another one of them inexplicably disappear, their gazes transferring over from Noah and onto the Blue Slike briefly as they looked at this being.","As their gazes turned over, they ridiculously saw the ever rising aura of this creature as unbeknownst to them, the Devouring of a second Subjugation gave the Blue Slike another 20 Billion connections!","They could only blame themselves for being such good sources of nutrients as 200 Incarnations of Chaos had only been able to give the Slime 55 Billion connections.","Yet just two of them had given him 40 billion as when they now gazed at him, they were shocked to realize a unique aura was coming off this creature.","The Subjugations weren’t the only ones as the Hegemonies watching from outside the boundary of the Chthonian Universe were even more shocked, a feeling of familiarity being felt when they looked at the Cthulhu form of the Blue Slime.","The feeling of familiarity came from the aura...and it was the aura they were very in tune with.","It was the aura of a Hegemony, and it had begun to slowly erupt from the Blue Slime at this moment!"]},{"number":1076,"title":"Chapter 1076: Chapter 1075 - A Dream Of A Universal Seed II","paragraphs":["A trace aura of Hegemony!","It meant this creature would inevitably be able to form their Universal Seed soon as thereafter, it would bloom into a Universe.","But...","\"What the hell...\"","A Hegemony couldn’t help but curse when they watched this scene play out, the sequence of events being extremely shocking as the aura of this Blue shimmering Cthulhu was nowhere near what it was at the start of this battle.","But it then swallowed up two terrifying existences that could only be defeated by Hegemonie as at this moment, it seemed like just a few more connections were needed before an advancement could be made!","Such a scene confounded many as they scrambled to find answers that would make such a thing into a reality!","But this was when the face of the Great Old Nazzagath froze in a stupor as his aged eyes locked onto the cerulean figure of the Slime in Cthulhu.","He then unconsciously voiced out what put him in a stupor as his words were silent, but they rang like bombs into everyone’s ears!","\"That’s...the Universal Emperor Slime...!\"","...!","RUMBLE","Shock and realization entrenched the faces of the Hegemonies as they looked towards the figure of the Blue Cthulhu with a myriad of expressions.","\"A Universal Emperor Slime...that- that should not be possible!\"","An impossibility had yet again appeared!","The Hegemonies looked at the blue shining existence even closer as everything seemed to click into place, their gazes going through a myriad of emotions as they thought about many things.","An event that had occurred many, many years ago appeared in their minds once again as many of them seemed to have arrived at an epiphany, but even with this epiphany...their faces still turned somber soon after.","It was a mystery what was going on in their minds!","---","The figures of the Subjugations of the Usurper erupted with power as even with the essence of Chronos protecting Noah’s summons and the Temporal Inversion working to rewind any injuries they received, their figures were still pushed back a few hundred miles!","Then, the 7 shining obsidian existences all turned towards the blue figure of the Blue Slime as they considered this being the worst enemy.","Not Noah who could create holes the size of his body when he moved against them, but this being that could somehow erase everything about them in a second!","They considered this figure much of a threat because they could also sense the aura of a Hegemony beginning to stem from it.","It seemed like this being was on the cusp of a breakthrough, and they had to do all they could to stop it!","Otherwise...their only weakness would be exposed.","Their only weakness was Hegemonies.","So they moved to protect themselves.","RUUMBLE!","A gorgeous array of light flashed out as while all 7 terrifying beings thundered towards it, the Blue Slime wasn’t the least bit fearful as it looked towards them with fervor and happiness.","Beside the Slime, Noah’s enormous Cthulhu form appeared protectively as he stretched his arms out, the obsidian colored essence that had helped eradicate 2 Subjugations stretching out dangerously.","The two of them seemed to be getting ready for an all out battle against the rushing Subjugations, but it was entirely different than many expected as while the Subjugations formed a ring to surround Noah and the Blue Slime- the rest of the Animus Summons that were pushed back had also formed a ring to surround them!","Then, Tiamat called out lightly as out of nowhere, a purple crimson clock appeared in the skies and gushed out the essence of Chronos.","[Temporal Halt].","BZZZT!","Space and time seemingly came to a halt, but the figures of the 7 Subjugations were too powerful as their bodies vibrated intensely, and they broke out of the Temporal Halt a moment later as they continued!","But....","[Temporal Halt].","The Galaxy Devouring Serpent spoke out.","[Temporal Halt].","The Obsidian Panther spoke out.","[Temporal Halt].","Even Tiamat again spoke up!","All of Noah’s summons at this moment fully utilized the feature of spamming as they called forth multiple Temporal Halts, all of them focused on the moving enemies below as with so many of such Halts layered...they came to a stop for more than a second before they could break through.","This one second was a decider that would change many things.","This one second was an action that would steer the course of history in a vastly different direction than what many beings expected.","SHAA","Within the second of the halt, the Blue Slime appeared next to the nearest Subjugation of the Usurper who turned out to be the last planetary sized Trepidity of the Deep.","His jaws expanded as tentacles wriggled out, wrapping around the enormous body of the creature within the one second as...","<Universal Devouring>.","WAP!","Like the blinking of eyes, the last Chthonian among the Subjugations of the Usurper disappeared.","When all of them broke through the time halts with sheer power and might, they found that another one of them had disappeared!","They also found...a particular shining blue creature that had begun to release blue rays of light that shot out across hundreds of thousands of miles.","The rays contained a magisterial aura that wasn’t that of a Paragon!","It contained the pristine and magisterial essence of something else entirely as at this point, 100 Billion Galaxies were fully connected in the Origin of a certain being.","BZZZT!","The body of the Blue Slime undulated majestically as a glorious sense of awe descended.","Inside of its Origin, 100 Billion clear lines of connections rang throughout the galaxies as at this moment, they all shone in unison and resonance as a boundary began to form over them!","This boundary was crystalline blue in color as it was extremely beautiful...and this boundary represented the outer layer of a seed.","At this moment, a Universal Seed coalesced within the body of the Blue Slime as a second later....it bloomed!"]},{"number":1077,"title":"Chapter 1077: Chapter 1076 - A Slime Rides The Winds Of Destiny! I","paragraphs":["Hegemony.","A title given to a being that had successfully birthed a Universe within their Origin!","The title had many meanings, but the main and central focus from the definition of this word at this moment was its meaning of dominance.","Dominance!","The capability to utterly and completely dominate others based on one’s own ability!","A few beings very correctly displayed the dominance of a Hegemony as these were the true experts of this level.","An example was the Oathkeeper that was currently wielding a glimmering Sword of Primordial Essence as he tore across a Universe while working against the authority of an Antiquity and two other powerful Hegemonies!","Chronos and the Goliath were free of any restriction as the Oathkeeper actually felt the effects of Corruption of the Usurper, Malignant Madness, and Heretical Malediction.","Yet...this being was unhindered as with the Cosmic Treasure releasing waves of Primordial Essence in hand, he tore across everything on his path as he approached a Universal Construct.","This was dominance!","This was true Hegemony!","Now...yet another being was stepping into the rank of a Universe within the Primordial Cosmos.","All eyes were on the singular form of a cerulean Cthulhu that emanated this blue light for millions of miles. With all 100 Billion galaxies connected, a Universal Seed had formed as the vast number of connected galaxies came together and seemingly fused into one!","All 100 Billion Galaxies fused together seamlessly, giving birth to the Universal Seed that bloomed...and carefully structured and formed a Universe.","THRUUUM!","Brand new Galaxies bloomed from the Universal Seed, these Galaxies being strongly interconnected as they had a starry cerulean color! The moment the Seed bloomed and spat them out, the aura outside the body of the Blue Slime changed.","A terrifying aura and might erupted from it as the essence of a being that had successfully formed their own Universe reverberated out!","OOOOOH!","The Blue Slime bellowed forth gloriously at the newfound sense of power and freedom!","A unique authority seemed to descend unto its body as mana conduction and efficiency, mana reserves, Origin, life force...everything about it went through a qualitative change.","Then, its body transformed from Noah’s similar Cthulhu form as with a glimmer of blue, the image of a Planetary sized blue slime appeared!","As if breaking out of a cocoon! As if he could finally and freely be his true self!","...!","The glorious form of the Blue Slime became clear to all as the eyes of the watching Hegemonies trembled with confirmation and stupor.","On this day, the last Universal Emperor Slime had achieved the Realm of a Universe, fulfilling the destiny of its name!","Universal!","...","In the Dark Universe, Noah’s main body was surrounded by a storm of golden essence currently, his figure being elevated far above his subordinates as they all stared at him from below while also trying to stare at the shocking development on the illusory screen that shoved the events in the Chthonian Universe.","The storm of golden essence surrounding Noah were vast seas of Destiny and Fortune, Noah having utilized them with such success that they raged ever higher, the boon this time around not just befalling the Blue Slime alone.","Yes, the Blue Slime had ridden Noah’s waves of destiny and fortune in this ordeal to obtain the most benefits, but it was still a being that was bound to Noah!","Its power...was also Noah’s power.","Its strength was also Noah’s strength!","So when the Blue Slime rose to Hegemony...Noah also obtained the shocking power of the Universal Realm, even if it was through his Animus Summon!","While his clone was fused with it, Noah had been there to feel and witness the birth of the Universal Seed and of the blooming Universe that was glimmering brightly at this moment, his heart feeling like his road had been paved forward so damn smoothly.","Something even more shocking was that through their connection, Noah was getting a myriad of information sent to him as he found that while stepping into the Universal Realm...the Blue Slime that had truly become a Universal Emperor Slime had unlocked a new racial ability and even had an enhancement in the <<Universal DEvouring >> ability!","Noah’s eyes released gorgeous beams of golden light as he focused on this feed of information and quantified what he was getting.","[Blue Slime](PRISMATIC+) :: An Animus Summon at the UNIVERSAL Realm. A unique species that is the last of its kind in the Primordial Cosmos. This Blue Slime comes from the thought to be perished lineage of Universal Emperor Slimes that were hunted down to extinction in the Animus Universe by a coalition of beings from the Primordial Cosmos. Its unique composition gives it complete immunity to physical attacks and 90% Damage reduction to all other forms of damage. This Blue Slime has assimilated a Myriad of Grand and Lesser Daos, and has currently gained comprehensions in the Cosmic Daos of Chronos, Extinction, Annihilation, Phantasm...It has fully become a Universal Emperor Slime as the racial ability <<Universal Devouring>> can now stay true to its name and devour Universes themselves. The action of Devouring a Universe accelerates the process for an existence to form Universal Filaments and achieve a state known as Apocryphal Antiquity- a Realm of power not achieved through the Marks of Antiquity acting to completely morph one’s Galaxies into Dao Galaxies. No Universal Emperor Slime in the Primordial Cosmos has ever successfully utilized <<Universal Devouring>> due to its sheer impossible mana requirements. The last time a Universal Emperor Slime tried to do so, it only held a Universe hostage for 1000 years in the Primordial Cosmos. Aside from this, the racial ability of <<Universal Sense>> has been unlocked, allowing the Universal Emperor Slime to have a sense of direction on other Universes outside of the Primordial Cosmos.","...!","A description of the Blue Slime similar to the one that Noah had seen when he first obtained this creature and contracted it, but it was much different this time around as many new things were added!"]},{"number":1078,"title":"Chapter 1078: Chapter 1077 - A Slime Rides The Winds Of Destiny! II","paragraphs":["From the information Noah was receiving, an abundant amount of surprises could be found.","One was the fact that shockingly, <<Universal Devouring>> could now...devour a Universe.","Well, it was a feature that actually fit its name more, but it wasn’t even something Noah thought of trying before!","One must recall that it had only been a matter of months for Noah to elevate a Spiritual Land into a Universal Core and fuse it to a Universe, never would he have thought that he would be bound to a creature that could actually devour such Universes.","Such an action...would make it possible for the Blue Slime to do what many found impossible to do!","It was the action that Chronos and the Goliath could not do, it was why these beings had reached out to another force.","Antiquity!","The Blue Slime could actually obtain Antiquity if he went around doing the monstrous and questionable thing of devouring entire Universes as by the end of it, he would obtain something called Apocryphal Antiquity.","Apocryphal. This word had many meanings, but it was along the lines of questionable, fake, or even fictitious!","It wasn’t the natural way that existences obtained Antiquity, being something that this unique race of Universal Emperor Slimes could do alone.","Yet, even they weren’t able to do it as after millions of years, only a single Emperor Slime had held a Universe hostage while they were fighting for their lineage, but even they did not succeed.","As always, the problem lay in mana!","Mana seemed like a natural restriction in existence for many things, preventing many beings from doing shocking things that would otherwise shatter the balance of natural power.","But...","RUMBLE!","The essence around Noah raged madly, a terrifying smile appearing on his devilishly handsome face as though he was surrounded by golden seas of Destiny and Fortune...this smile seemed extremely menacing. He had such a smile as he thought about how he was an exception.","He could make it possible! He could supply all the mana that the Blue Slime needed if ever an opportunity to swallow an entire genuine Universe arose!","\"Ah...\"","He calmed himself down as he thought of such shocking possibilities, looking at the newly unlocked feature of <<Universal Sense>>.","A terrifying ability by itself, and one that held terrifying implications. When Noah glanced at this, he became somber as at this moment...he would only think about the current Universes within the Primordial Cosmos.","He already had too much on this plate as when it came to what was out there in the vast Ruination Sea...it was something for another time!","RUMBLE!","He was taken out of his thoughts as the seas of fortune and destiny raged around him even harder, the situation continuing to unfold in the Chthonian Universe as at this time as the figure of the true Blue Slime appeared before everyone.","The viscous body was shining a starry blue, the entire slime seeming like he had vast numbers of blue planetary bodies swirling beautifully throughout. His eyes were an even brighter shade of blue as when they opened, they released terrible might as they caused the surrounding void to shake!","The aura of a Hegemony...fully unfolded at this moment as the eyes of the Blue Slime gazed over a certain area.","It actually wasn’t the 6 remaining Subjugations of the Usurper, but the eyes of the slime actually turned up as they crossed innumerable light years of the Chthonian Universe to gaze outside the boundary at the figures of the many watching Hegemonies!","WAA!","The eyes of the Great Old Nazzagath shook along with all the Hegemonies that felt the gaze of the Blue Slime, feeling as if they were being stared at by a shockingly deadly predator! Within the eyes of the Blue Slime, they felt a sense of power and hidden wrath as the first thing that this being did when he achieved Hegemony was gaze towards the Universal Realm experts of the Primordial Cosmos.","The beings that had been moving to the very forefront when the race of Universal Emperor Slimes were eradicated!","RUMBLE!","A weaker Hegemony that had only achieved this level a few million years ago was even pushed back by the gaze of the Blue Slime alone, this existence letting out a silent harrumph as his gaze then turned towards the 6 Subjugations of the Usurper.","The Hegemonies outside of the boundary felt like they could breathe thereafter, but as they gazed upon the glimmering body of the Universal Emperor Slime, they couldn’t help but think of what outcome this existence would seek in the near future!","In the Chthonian Universe, the 6 remaining Subjugations were those from the Abyssal, Liberated, and Microbial Universe. 2 of each...but these beings weren’t letting out the terrifying might they released before.","This was because their only enemy was a Hegemony.","At this moment...such an existence stood before them as what else was there left to say?","WAA!","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone and even the Animus Summons gazed towards the Blue Slime without doing a single thing, watching as this existence began to release a circular field of light from its body that eventually expanded and formed a starry cluster of Galaxies in the nearby hundreds of thousands of miles.","It actually seemed...like a manifestation of the Universe within the Origin of the Blue Slime, this manifestation being brought to the outside world at this moment as shockingly, he superimposed his Universe onto a genuine one!","\"Universal Authority.\"","THRUM!","The voice of the Blue Slime rang out languidly, the childish tone still apparent in the voice as this Hegemony utilized an authority unique to Universal Realm experts. It was the superimposition of their Universe into the surroundings, an ability that made them king within this area as if no other Hegemony existed to dispel the {Universal Authority}, they were unhindered within the area!","It was also a dangerous authority to utilize as if an even more powerful Hegemony released their Universal Authority and it was much larger than yours, your very Origin would be hurt since it was manifested outside.","So very rarely did Hegemonies display their precious Universes outside of their bodies unless it was a life and death battle, but the Blue Slime...the Blue Slime had no such fears.","His Universe was superimposed on another as while staring at the bodies of the 6 Subjugations of the Usurper, he called out lightly!","\"Extinction.\"","...!","BZZZZT!","It wasn’t the cast of a skill or any ability. It was just the Blue Slime speaking.","It was just a word!","Yet in the next second, boundless essence of Extinction emerged from the illusory Galaxies of the Blue Slime displayed outside, descending instantaneously on all the Subjugations as space itself shattered and tumbled!","The bodies of the Subjugations of the Usurper shook in a terrifying manner as one could see skin and bones fly out, as if the defences of these terrifying existences didn’t even exist. The same essence...was utilized by a Hegemony as its effect was ridiculous.","All 6 Subjugations of the Usurper that had nearly even destroyed Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone before could only shake at a single word from the Universal Emperor Slime at this moment, all their figures becoming ravaged by Extinction!","It was undeniable might.","Undeniable dominance!","It was genuine Hegemony!"]},{"number":1079,"title":"Chapter 1079: Chapter 1078 - Aim For A Universal Construct! I","paragraphs":["How could one describe the feeling of commanding the power of a Universe under their fingertips?","Noah was relishing this feeling at this moment, the actions and thoughts of the Blue Slime he was fused with being akin to his own as all he could say when it came to power at the Universal Realm...was that it was addictive!","RUMBLE!","The moment the vibrant Blue Slime uttered the words ’Extinction’, this essence rushed out in droves from the galaxies of the Manifested Universe as they surrounded the figures of the Subjugations of the Usurper on all sides.","These beings that were just showing off crazy levels of battle power seemingly became docile when such an attack rained down, giving the effect of them having somehow gotten weaker.","But they hadn’t gotten weaker, it was just the might that the Blue Slime released at the Universal Realm was just that much greater! It was similar to how a baby would not be able to put up much of a fight against a man.","To the Blue Slime that was now a Hegemony, these beings in front of it were no more than big babies!","If we take this analogy further and expand it to Noah and how he was able to stand against Hegemony Dark Shadow with the use of [Plot Armor] and the Hegemony of Necromancy from just testing his attacks, Noah was akin to a genius baby that was given a gun that he could shoot endlessly. When putting such a baby against a man, one or two shots were bound to hit!","This was the feeling of power that Noah was currently taking in.","The feeling of looking at the beings that decimated his other summons that his clones fused with in a single hit...and they were currently struggling against the {Universal Authority} of a Hegemony as their bodies creaked under the pressure of the utterance of ’Extinction’.","\"Ah...\"","Noah sighed endlessly at such power as the Blue Slime looked at the constricted figures of the Subjugations that couldn’t even move, the ethereal voice of this existence ringing out slowly once more.","<<Universal Devouring>>.","RUMBLE!","A cluster of essence erupted out as the cerulean body of the Blue Slime expanded in an instant, covering an area of tens of thousands of miles as this area contained the figures of all the remaining Subjugations of the Usurper.","The two from the Microbial Universe, Abyssal Universe, and the Liberated Universe all trembled as they suddenly felt the viscous film around them, their soulless eyes seemingly gaining a hint of fear and unwillingness as soon after that...","WAP!","They disappeared!","The beings that were giving Noah and the others so much trouble had actually been taken care of so seamlessly and easily by the Blue Slime that was currently a Hegemony!","\"...\"","The field of battle was entirely silent as even the three original Chthonian Paragons that had come to greet Noah were shaking fearfully.","Outside of the boundary of the Chthonian Universe, the Hegemonies looked at these scenes with varying expressions as their gazes were somber at the illusory manifested Universe that the Blue Slime was blatantly displaying.","Great Old Nazzagath looked at such a scene as his voice was the first one to rumble out.","\"Seeing the gaze of this existence...he will be looking for answers on what happened all those years ago!\"","His words reminded every Hegemony of a distant past when creatures such as the one they saw before them ran rampant, filling multiple Universes as their power was something to be feared!","Events had progressed in such a way that eventually, all Hegemonies had come to agree on the resolution that the race of the Universal Emperor Slimes were too destructive as they had to be eradicated.","At the lead of this was...","\"This wasn’t on our shoulders, the one who spearheaded this whole ordeal was Chronos! He must have been scheming something in the very beginning to have. If you consider how the events played out, he might have even been the one to instigate the race of the Universal Emperor Slime to do what they did until the war broke out...!\"","RUMBLE!","A sonorous voice from the Hegemony of Light rang out, a dazzling woman with wings of light speaking out as her words made many Hegemonies ponder!","But at the end of it all...","\"It does not matter whether we were played or if it was a scheme of Chronos. Each of us participated in the eradication of the Universal Emperor Slimes. Now that we know Chronos’s nature, we can definitely question his intent behind it all...but it doesn’t matter!\"","The voice of the Great Old Nazzagath resounded out powerfully as this Chthonian seemed entirely exhausted!","\"It doesn’t matter because we all have their blood on our hands!\"","WAA!","A disastrous set of words, and it was ones that made the mood around the many Hegemonies even more somber. But there were some that were those with high pride and honor, even among those currently standing alongside Oathkeeeper.","\"So what?\"","A voice perked up that caused many eyes to turn towards it.","It was from a Hegemony that had the exact features of a fantastical existence known as a dwarf, this being holding the stature of a dwarf but being over 500 meters tall just with their natural body alone!","This was a Hegemony that stemmed from the Universe of Metal, a Universe that held a myriad of races like this who were proficient in anything to do with metal working and smithing as they created the most renowned Dao Treasures across the Primordial Cosmos.","The one who spoke just now was the Hegemony of Smithing, a being that had risen far above his peers as he claimed such a title by himself!","The golden hammer that this Hegemony of Smithing carried on his hands glimmered as he spoke out with a sense of calm and power.","\"It was events a long time ago, just mistakes of the past. If he seeks answers, we will give them to him. But what can he do? What are you all fearful of? He just achieved Hegemony, and even if it was through the schemes of Chronos...many of us have faced Universal Emperor Slimes before!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1080,"title":"Chapter 1080: Chapter 1079 - Aim For A Universal Construct! II","paragraphs":["\"...He just achieved Hegemony, and even if it was through the schemes of Chronos...many of us have faced Universal Emperor Slimes before!\"","...!","The voice was filled with the majesty of a Hegemony as some eyes shone while others became filled with distaste.","Even with the powerful universal Realm Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos, there were many characters who had vastly different mentalities even if they stood on the same side!","\"Hegemony of Smithing, you...!\"","Great Old Nazzagath had an angered expression as he turned towards the Hegemony carrying the enormous golden hammer, shaking his figure thereafter as if it wasn’t worth it and instead turning his gaze back onto the events within the Chthonian Universe.","These beings before them were fighting with their lives on the line to save the very Universes they called their homes, and would treat them as such when the time came?","This aged Chthonian had many thoughts swirling in his mind as even after he sent the commands for all those under his influence in the Chthonian Universe to accept the rule of the Tyrannical Emperor that now moved with a Hegemony, he still felt like he wasn’t doing enough.","Just sitting around and watching, that was all they were good for at this moment.","And yet some of them had to gall to talk?!","---","In the Chthonian Universe, Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone looked at the devastating scene of the Blue Slime wiping out the Subjugations of Chaos within seconds as his eyes shone with an excited luster, wanting to obtain such a power himself as he wondered what level his clone could display it!","After he finished reveling in this feeling though, he got himself back on track as he thought about what he would be doing now that he had unexpectedly gotten his hands on the power of a Hegemony.","Conquering the remaining universes....such an action could now be done with ease!","The only problem was standing against the Hegemonies protecting them. But even then, could these beings match up to the power of the Universal Emperor Slime?","Could they match up against a being that would soon be seeking answers from all the Hegemonies in the Primordial Cosmos?!","RUMBLE!","When Noah thought about such things, his gaze became firm as millions of thoughts crossed through his mind every second.","A path formed in his mind.","One that was built by the seas of fortune and destiny that his main body was currently swimming in as he collected more and more Marks of Antiquity!","At the end of it all, his gaze turned towards a certain direction.","At the same time, the gaze of the stupendous Planetary sized Blue Slime also turned its gaze into this direction.","It was where the Universal Construct of the Chthonian Universe lay!","It was the location that a Chthonian Hegemony protected!","Noah and the Blue Slime looked towards this position as when considering the power they could now wield, they considered the plans of Chronos to be as good as done.","They would simply tear apart the machinations of this being with pure strength from now on, and they would start with the Universal Constructs that allowed for the descent of Antiquity!","Towards the direction that the gaze of the Blue Slime was pointing to.","The other Chthonian Hegemony that had sided with Chronos was standing in front of the huge cocoon like Universal Construct as when he saw the blue eyes of the slime turn this way, this aged being couldn’t help but utter out...","\"Fuck...\"","...!","Ah!","At the same time this occurred, the relentless figure of the Oathkeeper in the Microbial Universe was getting closer and closer to the Universal Construct within this Universe, the might of Chronos and the Goliath not being enough to withstand a Hegemony that could wield a Cosmic Treasure!","OOOOOH!","Billowing white luster continued to wave out of the Oathkeeper in waves as with the Sword of Primordial Essence in hand, he tore across the authority of the Antiquity as he was currently a few hundred miles away from the cocoon like Universal Construct.","He could already see it in front of him as the Cerulean Hegemony that was in charge of protecting this Universal Construct looked towards the scene of the Goliath and Chronos trying to stop the Oathkeeper in shock, his somber expression loosening soon after when the auras of multiple Hegemonies began to appear in the Microbial Universe!","It was reinforcements from the other 8 Universes, each of them turning into streaks of light as they rushed towards the battle to make sure the Oathkeeper wouldn’t move any further!","Such a development caused the Oathkeeper’s eyes to flutter as his momentum only increased, but he actually stopped advancing forward as the swirl of the Primordial Dao around him only became more and more intense.","When he looked at the mere few hundred miles away he was from the Universal Construct, he nodded his head as he seemed to think it was enough, grasping the Primordial Disk within his hands tightly as the Universe within his Origin thrummed!","WAA!","He had less than half of his mana reserves remaining, but they depleted at this moment to 25% as he used over one fourth of all his mana in an instant, the Primordial Disk within his hands letting out glorious waves of light as he spoke to it calmly.","\"Take me through the same folds of space that Primordial Essence created...take me to that Universal Construct...\"","BZZZT!","As if a machine had been fed with all it could need for a terrifying task, the Primordial Disk vibrated intensely as it released a shocking light to cover the Oathkeeper, causing for a fantastical scene to occur in the next second!","As multiple streaks of light that represented Hegemonies tore through the void to reinforce Chronos and the Goliath against the terrifying Oathkeeper, this being actually stopped his advance as a second later...he disappeared.","...!","Shock and stupor appeared in the eyes of all as when they sensed the aura of this domineering being again...it was actually behind them!","WAA!","Even past the crimson boundary that protected the cocoon like Universal Construct, the Oathkeeper had actually appeared just a few meters away from the pulsing outer layer of this terrifying Tool of Descent.","His Sword of Primordial Essence raised up as his expression was impassive, his eyes showing the light of dominance of the being that deserved to be the number one strongest in the Primordial Cosmos!","With a shocking eruption of light, a Sword filled with Primordial Essence smashed into the Universal Construct!"]},{"number":1081,"title":"Chapter 1081: Chapter 1080 - Aim For A Universal Construct! III","paragraphs":["As Noah had just gazed towards a Universal Construct and began making his way towards it with the Blue Slime, the Oathkeeper had shockingly achieved this goal first as his Sword of Primordial Essence thundered onto a Universal Construct under the eyes of Chronos and all other Hegemonies.","Chronos looked at such a scene with sheer shock and frustration as his figure burned with light trying to reach for the untouchable figure of the Oathkeeeper, the others being too shocked as they could barely even act!","The Cerulean Hegemony that was the closest to the Universal Construct as he was supposed to be protecting it actually froze in place as he fearfully looked at the glimmering Primordial Disk within the hands of the Oathkeeper with greed and fear.","That was a Cosmic Treasure!","Under the aid of such an item, the glorious Sword of Primordial Essence thundered down and smashed into the cocoon like Universal Construct!","BZZZZT...BOOOOM!","A sound akin to Clusters of Galaxies exploding rang out, the Universal Construct putting up a fight in the beginning but soon after...its outer layer shattered in a shower of blood as this phenomenon acted like a chain reaction.","The Primordial Essence permeated throughout as pristine white spread all around, every area it passes exploding in a glorious fashion as the enormous Universal Construct began breaking down from the point of contact and continued throughout!","The Primordial Essence was like a poison to it, and this poison spread out to cover all of this huge structure in its entirety within seconds, it had permeated throughout as the tool of Descent only continued to break.","Akin to dominoes falling.","When a single piece failed, the rest of them would.","The entirely of the Universal Construct that many light years large began to vibrate unstably from the point of impact as it was like an egg in the process of breaking apart, and it shockingly did so a few seconds later as it exploded out with a shower of gory blood and pulsing crimson masses!","...!","Shock and horror spread throughout at such a scene as Chronos had an ashen look.","The black hole on the Goliath’s head shook terribly as The Cerulean Hegemony and the few Hegemonies that had come to aid Chronos against the Oathkeeper were currently only staring forward in shock and stupor!","Those outside the broken boundary of the Microbial Universe were also frozen in a stupor as they watched the breakdown of the Universal Construct...and the glorious figure of the Oathkeeper.","At this time, the Oathkeeper floated in the chaotic void as Primordial Essence swirled around him mythically, this being looking extremely regal as he stared at the bloody pieces of Universal Constructs silently.","His gaze seemed lost for a few seconds before it focused on another set of beings.","Chronos, the Goliath, the Cerulean Hegemony, and all the other Hegemonies that were within the Microbial Universe all fell under his gaze!","In their shock and stupor, they heard the voice of the magisterial being.","\"Vile creatures.\"","RUMBLE!","The Oathkeeper only had less than one fourth of his mana remaining, but his aura remained as immense as ever.","He called out to these beings as the Primordial Essence around him coagulated and thrummed, actually ready to attack after achieving something as shocking as breaking apart a Universal Construct!","He was the first to notice among many that after the breakdown of the Universal Construct, the Authority that prevented Hegemonies from entering and the aura of an Antiquity that pressed beings from all around had disappeared!","With such knowledge in hand, the Oarhkeeper looked at all the beings that turned their backs against their own Cosmos as he moved.","The shimmering pristine white finally brought everyone back to attention as their senses warned them of immense danger, Chronos’s expression becoming more and more ashen as he bellowed out!","\"Pull back!\"","WAA!","His words caused reality to dawn on many, his own body beginning to flicker away with a spatial light as the Goliath did the same.","Against the terrifying and relentless aura of the Oathkeeeper, these powerful Hegemonies actually ran as one of the fastest ones to do so were the two most powerful ones, the Cerulean Hegemony, and then all the other ones followed!","Even though it was against a single existence, none of them stayed behind to fight anything out with him.","This was dominance! This was true Hegemony!","With a Universal Construct in tatters, the Oathkeeper didn’t find anyone to battle against as they all disappeared, his gaze becoming impassive as the aura around him died down.","He only had one fourth of his mana reserves left, and any further battle would have actually put him in a difficult spot. His thoughts were many as when he sensed the freed Universe around him, his heart was at peace.","He had taken out one Universal Construct today, and once his essence recovered fully within half a day, he would be able to start again on another Universe!","Like this, he would put everything on his shoulders and stop the oncoming descent of Antiquity!","He turned towards the Hegemonies in the skies who were still looking over in shock as he voiced out.","\"Will you all just continue staring and gawking there? Come down here and secure this Universe!\"","RUMBLE!","---","The events of the Subjugations of the Usurper being erased and the destruction of a Universal Constructs had not happened too far in time.","They came in sequence, one after another as the Great Usurper felt them first hand!","\"What?!\"","THRUM!","His voice boomed out from the unique space where only souls and wills could exist, his powerful eyes staring across the vast rivers of time as he locked on to the one he currently had all of his focus on.","He actually found that the unbeatable Subjugations that could not be taken down by anything other than a Hegemony which he had sent forth were actually erased, and they were erased with a power that definitely didn’t belong to a Paragon!","This was followed by the destruction of one of the Tools of Descent as it made his descension into this Primordial Cosmos that much more complicated.","The form of this being vibrated with power as it actually seemed to become even brighter, a crimson light occupying it as the cerulean blue eyes it held flashed gloriously with power.","\"You want to stop my descent this badly? It only means there are many more benefits waiting for me...and I will not let them slip so easily!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1082,"title":"Chapter 1082: Chapter 1081 - Merely The Universal Realm! I","paragraphs":["Across the vast rivers of time, a single being was shining brilliantly as he began to do something extremely shocking.","\"Many of you are seeking Antiquity...let me show you exactly what one can do when they achieve such power.\"","The Great Usurper uttered coldly his consciousness thrummed powerfully! From it, one could see vast clusters of swirling Universes, some of these Universes clearly having 100 Billion Galaxies that weren’t just normal Galaxies.","A cluster of Universes...this was a being in the Universal Filament Realm!","Within these clusters of Universes, there existed the unique ones that had different colored galaxies. The 100 Billion connected Galaxies of some of the Universes actually shone with a rainbow colored shape as they were fantastically Dao Galaxies!","Dao Galaxies!","Not just in one Universe, but in multiple of them.","But in the next second, the Great Usurper did something shocking as he uttered out emotionlessly while focusing on one of his Universes.","\"Burn. Burn in the void of turbidity and be the fuel for my descension.\"","RUMBLE!","Appallingly, an entire genuine Universe began to burn powerfully as essence of immense proportions flew out, tugging on the thick string that connected this Antiquity to the Primordial Cosmos!","The face of the Antiquity was without any emotions as he watched the burning of a Universe, his voice ringing out coldly.","\"I shall sacrifice one of you for a Cosmic Treasure.\"","The Great Usurper spoke simply as he didn’t burn a normal Universe among the clusters of Universes.","He actually burnt one that was filled with Dao Galaxies as it was termed a Splendiferous Universe! A Universe that was completely filled with Dao Galaxies that could only be born from 100 Billion Marks of Antiquity!","Yet the Antiquity burnt such a Universe because he knew for the task ahead, burning normal Universes would not be enough for it.","The action of burning a Universe was something that only those in the Universal Filament or Cosmic Realm could do, and even then...very few would ever decide to do so as it was a frightening thing. It was only done by beings at this level to release a shocking burst of power that could change the tides of a deadly battle.","Only when it was the last resort did such a thing happen!","For the Primordial Cosmos and the Cosmic Treasure within it, the Great Usurper heartlessly burnt a Universe that would be the prized possession of many beings, the immensity of the essence burned from it causing the line of connection he held with the Primordial Cosmos to expand multiple times over as golden crimson flames now lit upon it.","\"With this...my descent would only be within a day!\"","RUMBLE!","His eyes released the gorgeous burst of cerulean light as he spoke terrifying words, his actions having horrifying effects in the Primordial Cosmos at this moment as the 8 remaining Universal Constructs shone and began to expand at a rapid pace.","The authority of an Antiquity spread out at an even faster pace as the fusion of now 8 Universes accelerated, the Universal boundaries beginning to come ever closer with each other as they nearly fused!","From a possible descent of a few days, it was now reduced to less than 24 hours as the might of the Antiquity seemed unstoppable!","Within the Chthonian Universe, Noah and his summons were atop the bubbly body of the Blue Slime as they tore apart the void of space, moving at the speed of light as their figures glimmered brightly amidst the increased pressure of Antiquity.","The Universal Construct they were going towards had increased in power and might as it expanded rapidly, but even with such changes...Noah continued forward!","His eyes flashed with a golden light of destiny and fortune as his main body did a myriad of calculations, shockingly coming to the same conclusion that with the current changes, the descent of the Antiquity was not too far away.","They had to move, and they had to move fast!","WAA!","Their figures broke through the layers of the void as they arrived a few hundred miles away from the pulsing and expanding Universal Construct that was protected by the Chthonian Hegemony that had sided with Chronos.","\"...\"","The Hegemony was looking towards their party with a difficult expression, his red eyes focused on the unsurpassable might displayed by the Blue Slime!","This Chthonian shared a similar name as the Great Old Nazzagath, his moniker being Great Old Kubo as this being had a cylindrical body that was a planetary sized worm with glistening abyssal black scales, its face simply being an opening that held millions of sharp teeth and eyes that were surrounded by black tentacles!","The jaws seemed capable of swallowing entire galaxies as the terrifying eyes that seemed displaced in between all the teeth looked towards them carefully. These eyes held hesitation with them as they looked at the Universal Emperor Slime, this aged Chthonian recalling the might of such creatures and their terrible devouring abilities in the past.","He truly didn’t want to face such a being, nor did he want to do it alone as he had already sent word to Chronos and the others!","Yet...it seemed they were occupied with something at this moment as none of them sent back word. Within the vast wisdom of the Great Old Kubo, his mind buzzed as he was actually the first to speak in the tense standoff.","\"We can talk amongst each other as equals first. Do you know why we are seeking Antiquity?\"","RUMBLE","The millions of eyes and teeth of the enormous worm tentacled creature trembled with power at the Universal Realm as he spoke, his voice containing an ancient power that seemed capable of enticing anything!","\"Do you know why we go as far as to-\"","Before his words could even finish, there was an abrupt reply. Not from the powerful Blue Slime, but the figure of Noah’s starry Chthonian body that was situated atop it.","\"Shut the fuck up.\"","...!","WAA!","A simple and direct message, and one that cut apart the honor of a Hegemony!","But Noah didn’t care about this as he waved his hands, bringing forth the reason why they even had a stand off to begin with.","It was because in the Dark Universe where his main and the main body of the Blue Slime was located...he had been using vast amounts of mana to produce more Clones of the Blue Slime at the Universal Realm!","The ridiculousness of the [Blood Clone] ability of the Blood Lord Skill Tree shone again at this moment as it was now producing clones of such a shocking rank.","When Noah finished his disrespectful words against a Hegemony in the Chthonian Universe, he waved his hands as to the sheer horror of everyone...an identical Blue Slime releasing terrifying waves of power at the Universal Realm appeared.","...!","The millions of eyes of the Great Old Kubo trembled.","Essence erupted out wildly as a terrifying lesson was about to be taught on this day!","It was a lesson on something these beings didn’t know, but would come to etch in their minds soon after.","It was the lesson that the moment Noah gained the power of a Hegemony, many things were as good as over!"]},{"number":1083,"title":"Chapter 1083: Chapter 1082 - Merely The Universal Realm! II","paragraphs":["Clones!","Other beings could utilize them to a very little extent, as it logically took too much resources to bring forth something with the exact same level of power and origin as yourself.","If a normal Hegemony were able to utilize an ability of cloning another being that could display 100% of their original body’s power and might, it meant they had to replicate their whole origin to be able to do so. They would have to drain nearly all of their mana reserves and spend hours doing it until such a process was complete!","But since the clone came from the same source, it would be utilizing the essence that was filled up within its origin and then also using the essence of the main body when its essence was drained.","So for many existences, it was essentially creating another source of drainage for their Mana Reserves that they couldn’t really afford unless they had enormous reserves of Mana!","An example was Valentina that had just learned the Blood Clone ability, and even with her expanded Mana reserves under her position as Noah’s Vassal, she was only able to form and provide essence for a single Clone that she sent repeatedly over to the Animus Universe for battle.","Normal existences like her could only afford a single clone.","But then...you had Noah.","You had an existence that could provide all the mana required for even changing the nature of a genuine Universe, and such a being was connected to a Hegemony at this moment!","The brilliant Universe of the Blue Slime had heavy requirements to reproduce, but Noah had no problem reproducing it as he had no problems with mana. So the Blue Slime simply pulled along the connection it had with its Master as within seconds, a clone with a genuine Universal Origin was formed.","Then a second...","And a third!","This went on until 4 brand new clones were produced, reaching the maximum limit of 5 Clones that the Blood Clone ability provided when one took into account the already active clone in the Chthonian Universe.","So right after Noah told a Hegemony to shut up within this Universe, he waved his hands as he teleported one of the clones of the Blue Slimes over, the aura of another fantastical Hegemony spreading out.","...!","The black scales of the Great Old Kubo shook at such a scene, and they shook even harder when in the next moment, Noah’s eyes continued to wave forth multiple times.","RUMBLE!","A third Blue Slime appeared...a fourth...and a fifth one!","In a short period of a few seconds, enormous Blue Slimes reaching over tens of thousands of miles in diameters appeared to surround the single Great Old Kubo as shockingly, a fearful yelp released from this aged existence!","\"Ah...!\"","The Chthonian horror was actually feeling immense stupor and fear at this moment, and it wasn’t alone as outside the boundaries of the Chthonian Universe, the huge body of the Hegemony of Smithing was also shaking as he nearly dropped his hammer.","He had just been talking about how it was just one Universal Emperor Slime, and that they didn’t all have to be jittery when the time came that this being questioned them of their actions hundreds of thousands of years ago!","Yet...he was now seeing the genuine auras of 5 Hegemonies that each looked like the Blue Slime, and all of them were called forth with a wave of a hand from the Apex Paragon.","\"...The fuck is this?!\"","The Hegemonies were confounded to an extreme as too many natural laws were broken to bring the current reality to fruition!","We can talk about many aspects of this fantastical reality and how it came to be at this moment, but the source of it remained the same.","The clones of the stupendous Universal Emperor Slime were connected to their main body, being kept alive and receiving mana from this main body that they could utilize at all times. This main body they depended on...it was connected to a single being that was then the true source, a being capable of providing enough mana to the Origins of multiple Universes!","Noah alone was sustaining the Origins of the original Universal Realm Hegemony and all 5 of its clones!","What might!","What ridiculousness!","\"I...I...\"","It seemed like everything was thrown to a stupor as the aged Great Old Kubo was stuttering when faced with the power and might of 5 genuine Hegemonies, each having the terrifying form of the Universal Emperor Slime.","A Hegemony brought down to the point where they could only stutter!","Noah looked at such a scene as while his body lay on top of one of the Blue Slimes majestically, his face became filled with dignity and might as his domineering eyes gazed upon the shaking Hegemony while he shook his head and uttered even more disrespectful words.","\"You thought you were something special within your Realm of power? It is merely the Universal Realm...and I can call forth a myriad of such beings with a wave of my hands!\"","RUMBLE!","The words smashed onto the Chthonian Hegemony like a brick as he seemed injured before the battle even began, Noah merely shaking his head as he gave a terrifying command.","\"Decimate this old fogey and the construct he protects.\"","WAA!","His command was given.","So the Blue Slime moved.","5 illusory manifestations of a Universe descended down with ease.","The Universal Authority of 5 Hegemonies was used at once as it pressed down on the Chthonian Hegemony with such might and power that the abyssal scales protecting this worm like creature trembled and fissured!","\"Wait..!\"","The terrifying bellow of an old existence resounded out, but the eyes of the 5 Blue Slimes were cold as they uttered forth in synchrony.","\"Skewer.\"","BZZZT!","From the bodies of the Blue Slimes, millions of terrifying blue spears extended from their viscous bodies as they travelled even faster than the speed of light and seamlessly pierced into the worm like body of the Great Old Kubo!","...!","This being felt intense waves of pain from the attacks of 5 Hegemonies and their manifested Universal Authority, his origin actually feeling terror as he bellowed out and shocking might blasted from him.","\"OOOOOH!\"","It was a bellow of a being actually fighting for their life, a Universe blooming from him as it also wanted to manifest outside!"]},{"number":1084,"title":"Chapter 1084: Chapter 1083 - Merely The Universal Realm! III","paragraphs":["\"OOOOOH!\"","A majestic scene of a Chthonian horror bellowing out could be seen, the planetary sized worm like body having its pierced abyssal scales vibrate as its millions of teeth and jaws that made its head shone with multicolored luster.","From this figure, a manifestation of a Universe bloomed as this Hegemony had to actually resort to this if he was to obtain even a hint of survival against 5 other Universal Experts!","BZZZT!","The glorious 100 Billion galaxies of his Universe tried to stretch out wildly to withstand against the cerulean blue Galaxies that numbered 500 Billion from the 5 Blue Slimes.","Over a billion of them were actually vibrant Dao Galaxies as they shone with a rainbow colored luster, these ones being the only thing that even allowed his Universal Authority to be able to display itself briefly under the pressure of 5 other manifested Universes!","But...this was all it did.","The universe of a Hegemony that had the moniker of ’Great Old’ was actually only able to display itself for a brief few seconds before the 5 slimes that had the spear like extensions of their bodies still stabbing into this being harrumphed.","RUMBLE!","The 500 Billion Galaxies of the manifested Universes of the Blue Slimes shone with a terrifying cerulean glint as in the next second, something terrifying occurred.","With the Great Old Kubo trying to manifest his Universe outward, its many galaxies were flickering in and out as in the next second, it was dominated by the 5 already manifested one and this wondrous Universe...faded!","WAA!","The Hegemonies outside of the boundary of the Universe watching this scene were breathless as they now saw the unhindered pressure of the 5 Blue Slimes fall upon the single Chthonian Hegemony, even more spear like extensions releasing from their bodies and skewering this being left and right.","When few seconds passed, the scene became clear as the enormous worm like body of the Hegemony was pierced on all sides, a dazzling array of light displaying itself thereafter as all those watching were able to see...an innumerable number of blue spears surrounding the deeply hidden and protected Universe within the body of the Great Old Kubo!","The spear like extensions of the viscous slime had actually entrenched themselves into the Universe of this being, into his very Origin as in the next second...","\"Universal Devouring.\" \"Universal Devouring.\" \"Universal Devouring....","5 synonymous voices rang out from the splendid Blue Slimes.","After the advancement to fully become a Universal Emperor Slime, these existences could even swallow genuine Universes s when enough of such a thing happened- they might be capable of becoming Apocryphal Antiquites and forming their Universal Filaments in this manner.","Even though it was not the natural process of Antiquity and was even given a word that meant false, it was still Antiquity! So...what would happen when a Universal Emperor Slime didn’t devour a genuine Universe, but the Universe that an existence had built within their Origins?","The answer....","\"AHHHHHHH!\"","Was the resonating and loud cry of an aged being that could visibly feel it’s Universe being devoured.","The worm like figure of the Great Old Kubo trembled with such intense pain and fear at this moment as his screams reached the ends of the Chthonian Universe!","Meanwhile, Noah provided all the mana required as the bodies of the 5 Blue Slime caused the few light years around them to turn a beautiful cerulean blue, the screams of a Hegemony being drowned out as their spear like projection sucked dry a Universe.","The Galaxies within it went dark one by one as in a matter of seconds, the appalling sight of a dimming Universe that eventually cracked and began to fall apart played out!","It was bright red and black to begin with, but in a matter of seconds it turned gray and lifeless as it began to disappear as if it were dust.","\"...\"","It was a breathless scene as the screams thereafter stopped.","The millions of eyes and jaws that were vibrating fearfully dimed as they lost all luster.","The enormous planetary sized body of the worm like Chthonian then began to crack and splinter as without the support of a core, it faded away!","\"...\"","Like this, a Hegemony was shockingly put to rest.","If one kept track of the time, they would also be able to notice that it didn’t take longer than a minute!","Ah!","To elevate the matter even further, a single humanoid Chthonian that shone with a starry galactic luster with his Cthulhu form just sat on top of a Blue Slime while watching the scene playing out with eyes shining with brilliant lights.","At such a reality, Noah’s voice resounded out as he shook his head in a dissatisfied manner.","\"What a disappointment!\"","BOOM!","His words were like strikes of thunder to the watching Hegemonies that just observed an ancient existence ganged up on by 5 Blue Slimes and then decimated in less than a minute, their own Origins shaking at such a scene as a pervasive feeling entered their hearts when they looked at these beings!","\"That...the Universal Emperor Slimes couldn’t do that before, right?!\"","The voice of the Hegemony of Smithing resounded out, seemingly at a higher pitch than his usual deep voice as a trace of stupor and fear was hidden within!","Of course, he was referring to the fact that the Blue Slimes were actually capable of devouring the entire Galaxy of a Hegemony and reap their life in a matter of seconds! It truly wasn’t something they came across in the past.","But...there was nobody to answer his question as the rest of the Hegemonies had extremely somber expressions after witnessing the harsh reality. Many of them were asking themselves- if they were the ones to face the descent of 5 Universal Authorities...would they fare any better than Great Old Kubo?!","What caused them to become somber was the fact that each of them wfound themselves answering no to this question! None of them could see any other pathway except for death if they were in the same situation.","This was why they were so somber as at this moment, the glimpse of fear of the cerulean light of a Blue Slime had begun to bud within their hearts and Origins!","But things were not over.","There was the fact that the Blue Slime had just devoured the Universal Core of a genuine Hegemony just minutes after it entered this Realm, and the fact that a Universal Construct lay unprotected at this very moment!"]},{"number":1085,"title":"Chapter 1085: Chapter 1084 - Unceasing Fortuity! I","paragraphs":["The moment the Universal Core of a Hegemony was absorbed, all 5 clones of the Blue Slime glimmered in a dazzling fashion.","They were clones, so of course their Origins and everything they obtained all went towards the Origin of the main body, and the main body sent back even more feedback to make the clones just like it thereafter!","At this moment, the main body and the clones of the Blue Slimes had their Origins letting off waves of powerful light, the Universal Origin of the Hegemony being digested in a terrifying manner as a spectacular phenomenon occurred from it.","There was already the vibrant Universal Origin of the Blue Slime, but at this moment...a second illusory one began to form right beside it!","...!","Against all known and established laws and structures of power, a second illusory Universe was actually forming as for it to truly come to fruition was incredibly hard.","This was because one had to always achieve a complete set of Dao Galaxies, which meant obtaining 100 Billion Marks of Antiquity- before they could step on the path to Antiquity and begin forming other Universes!","This was the natural way.","Yet the slime was defying all this as before he even obtained a single Mark of Antiquity, he already wanted to Construct another Universe through his racial skill.","It was a nigh impossible reality he brought to fruition, but only an illusory Universe formed from his efforts as for it to be actualized and become a genuine one...it seemed like he would have to devour multiple other Hegemonies!","THRUM!","The bodies of the 5 Slimes emanated even greater levels of power after Devouring a Hegemony, all of their gazes then looking towards the singular huge structure standing before them.","One must not forget that after all their efforts, there was now a Universal Constructs pulsating madly before them unprotected.","A Construct that was filled to the brim with the Aura of the Antiquity that wanted to descend through them!","Noah looked at this cocoon like structure as his main body carried out a myriad of calculations, and his dominant voice still came out in the end as he spoke to the Blue Slime carefully.","\"Devour it...\"","..!","Yes!","Not to destroy or tear apart, but to devour it! In the past days, there had been many things that rose in succession for the Blue Slime to devour, each of them elevating its level to what it was now.","Currently, the glimmering blue eyes looked at the pulsating Universal Construct as it mattered not to it what benefits there would be and only followed the words of its master.","BZZZT!","The 5 bodies of the Blue Slime expanded at a pace faster than the speed of light as they began to cover the vast surface area of the Universal Construct.","From Noah, essence madly surged as he made it possible for the bodies of the Blue Slime to continue expanding, the Universal Construct being larger than most Galaxies as it towered over 100,000 light years!","It meant that the Blue Slime would cross the diameter of millions of miles and become a gargantuan creature, with the diameter of its clones expanding rapidly as each one came to cover over 20,000 Light years.","The circular figures of the Blue Slimes then layered themselves on top of each other as they covered the Universal Construct completely and then uttered out...","<<Universal Devouring>>.","...","WAP!","A flash of blue light, and a Universal Construct disappeared!","...!","The overpowering might of an Antiquity and authority that prevented other Hegemonies from entering that was permeating across the Chthonian Universe...disappeared!","Seamlessly! Beautifully!","This cocoon like Universal Construct had contained within it the dense aura and authority of an Antiquity, so when the Blue Slime devoured it...","BZZZT!","It allowed for something wondrous to occur within its Origin.","One by one, Hundreds of millions of the Galaxies within its Origin began to light up with a rainbow colored luster as they became genuine Dao Galaxies.","Dao Galaxies that represented bound Marks of Antiquity!","In a matter of seconds, Billions of Galaxies were transformed as by the end of it, the figure of the Blue Slime let out terrifying waves of power as in an instant, 10 Billion of its Galaxies became branded with Marks of Antiquity!","One tenth of what one needed to become an Antiquity in just an instant.","\"...\"","Even Noah was speechless at this as he shook his head at the ridiculous capabilities of the Blue Slime.","He didn’t know that the only reason the number was so high was because of the Antiquity wanting to descend even faster had actually burnt a Splendiferous Universe that was filled with 100 Billion Dao Galaxies, and it was actually a portion of this that the Blue Slime absorbed!","If the Antiquity had not done anything, the Blue Slime would have only been capable of getting a few hundred million Marks of Antiquity from the base aura of the Antiquity within the Universal Construct.","Yet events coincided as they brought about the current reality, the Antiquity just continuing to benefit Noah and the Blue Slime more and more without him even knowing it!","RUMBLE!","Noah gazed at the empty spot where the Universal Construct used to be, feeling the much lighter air around them as he nodded passively.","Since he was on a time crunch, he didn’t waste any time as while monitoring the changes of the Blue Slime in real time, he utilized its waves of power to begin releasing the Dao of Fealty across the Chthonian Universe!","He released this Dao Essence with the trace aura of a Hegemony that also contained memories of them brutalizing the Great Old Kubo that half of the Chthonian revered, Noah wanting to fully bring this Universe under him as well in a quick manner.","Outside of the boundary of the now freed Chthonian Universe, the figures of multiple Hegemonies watched this blatant scene of authority as they made no moves...only staring with a myriad of thoughts and expressions.","The authority that prevented them from entering the Universe in front of them had disappeared, and yet....none of these Hegemonies entered the Chthonian Universe!"]},{"number":1086,"title":"Chapter 1086: Chapter 1085 - Unceasing Fortuity! II","paragraphs":["It was an extremely unique situation where even though the authority of an Antiquity had disappeared, these Hegemonies still didn’t enter the boundary of the Universe as if another invisible barrier existed that prevented them from doing so!","Of course, it was the presence of the 5 clones of the Blue Slimes that were currently releasing waves of power and essence across the Chthonian Universe, the Star of Conquest above them and on the Apex Paragon shining brilliantly as their auras pristinely emanated out.","This was power.","This was might!","Being capable of causing an entire group of Hegemonies to not even dare to step into the same Universe as a being that had just advanced to the Realm of a Hegemony minutes ago.","Minutes after the advancement...they also butchered another being that had lived millions of more years more than them!","Ah!","Within the Chthonian Universe, Noah was focused on gaining fealty at this moment, the terrible waves of power and prompts were appearing on the few quintillion Chthonians within this universe as with his display of power, they all acquiesced.","As he gained the recognition and fealty of more and more beings, he gradually approached the same Realm that his summon had already reached, the number of Marks of Antiquity he held currently surpassing 22 million!","He was more than halfway there as the number still increased, many calculations crossing through his mind as a few minutes passed.","WAA!","The eyes of his Primordial Clone then blazed open as they released gorgeous crimson-gold light, uttering forth coldly.","\"All the quintillions of Chthonians have pledged fealty, now...\"","The moment his words finished, even more mana flew out of him as if he was uncomfortable if he wasn’t spending insane units of mana constantly, this time the essence being that of the spatial type as it flew out faster than light to wrap the quintillions of beings that had just pledged their Fealty to him!","He located them all nigh instantaneously with them being his Vassals, the bodies of enormous Chthonians of all types being wrapped by this silver spatial light.","First was them becoming Vassals, and thereafter it was transporting them into the Dark Universe so that Noah could go towards the goal of upgrading the Universal Core!","He required 100 Quintillion existences, and he would obtain them without fail within the Primordial Cosmos.","In the case of the Chthonians, he had already begun utilizing the [Architecture] feature of the Universal Core that had moved on from just being able to design buildings and landmass to now being able to design entire star systems and galaxies.","In preparation for bringing these Chthonians into the Dark Universe, his main body had already been using this feature in the past day to design enormous Galaxies and star systems that fit with the Chthonians!","The glorious Universal Core simply pulled in the boundless mana and essence it was able to call upon from Noah as things were shocking done with utter ease.","As these Chthonians were transported into another Universe...they would find that it doesn’t look all that different from their old homes!","\"...\"","The surroundings were quiet except for the sound of the surging essence around Noah’s body.","Outside the boundary of the Chthonian Universe, Great Old Nazzagath watched as those he had influenced or lorded over in the past pledging fealty to someone else and even being taken away thereafter.","Towards such a thing...he did nothing as he simply looked at such a scene with a reminiscent expression!","His bright eyes shone a bright golden luster of destiny as he didn’t stop Noah’s actions, this being’s monstrous form actually being the first to begin walking towards the boundary as he looked to be the only one brave enough to enter!","His Chthonian form of an enormous crimson star shaped monstrosity with purple flames constantly burning throughout its vibrant fleshly mass seamlessly passed through the Universal barrier as he entered into the Universe he called his home.","Unlike others, he wasn’t fearful. After all, he held the moniker of a Great Old One, the Star of Destruction, and the Hegemony of Venerable Chaos!","RUMBLE!","Towards his speedy descent, Noah’s eyes only raised up to watch this being slightly as he continued with his work of teleporting all the remaining existences within this Universe into his Dark Universe.","The star shaped Chthonian traveled a myriad of light years as he soon arrived near Noah and the figures of the 5 Blue Slimes and all the other Animus Summons. His focus was on the Blue Slimes as his eyes flashed with a regal purple light, his voice resounding out.","\"Hegemony of Devouring...it is my honor to be among the many that witnessed your birth!\"","WAA!","The body of Blue Slimes released a lustrous blue light as he was given a title from this ancient Hegemony, and it truly fit him so as he specialized in the aspect of devouring! The pressure that the Blue Slime was releasing eased up when it came to this being after such a compliment as the Great Old Nazzagath then turned towards Noah.","Towards the being that actually controlled a terrifying Hegemony!","\"You’re taking them to a safe place.\"","...!","He spoke slowly, but he was naturally speaking of the few Quintillions of existences that Noah had just snatched away.","He also spoke as if he was sure of it, causing Noah to turn his Cthulhu form towards him as he gave a light nod while wrapping up the last few trillions of beings. The Great Old Nazzagath nodded at this as he didn’t question what his own light of destiny told him, simply questioning again.","\"What will you do now?\"","\"...\"","A simple question, but it was one with immense implications!","The essence coming from Noah was reeled in at this moment as he finished his work, leaving an empty Universe behind as he turned towards the questioning ancient being- the only inhabitant of the Chthonian Universe that wasn’t taken away by him.","\"Chronos and whatever Antiquity he called forth are getting desperate...with the descent of the Antiquity not being too far away.\"","RUMBLE!","His gaze was filled with power and might as he rose while waving his hands, causing the disappearance of the other Animus Summons and 4 clones of the Blue Slime as only he and one other Blue Slime Clone remained.","\"We only have a time limit of a day, so I will be taking it upon myself to decimate the remaining Universal Constructs and any Hegemonies standing in my way until the descent of this Antiquity is stopped.\"","...!","A glorious answer to a simple question, the figure of the Great Old Nazzagath trembling as he stared at the unbound confidence and demeanor of this Apex Paragon that seemed above that of any Hegemonies!","This being...wasn’t even at the Universal Realm, and yet the way he carried himself was as if he was even beyond it in power!","Ah!"]},{"number":1087,"title":"Chapter 1087: Chapter 1086 - A Race Against Time! I","paragraphs":["The Apex Paragon would take it upon himself to destroy the remaining Universal Constructs and any Hegemonies that stood in his way!","The words were extremely grand as the Hegemonies that heard them would normally find them unbelievable...but they actually couldn’t refute them at this time.","After all, they had just seen a scene of those exact actions occurring moments ago!","As for how he would do it with the limited amount of time he had? Naturally, Noah had already made plans that were being carried out at this instant.","Before he left the Chthonian Universe that he had managed to conclude the events of in less than an hour, Noah looked at the Great Old Nazzagath as his eyes flashed with a mysterious light.","This was a powerful Hegemony, and a sensible one as well as he had paved the way for Noah to gain the fealty of half the Universe with utter ease even before he met him. Towards such a being, Noah smiled mysteriously as he voiced out.","\"Say...why don’t you pledge Fealty to me? Your power can be increased multiple times over, and you’ll even be able to see all the Chthonians from your Universe again.\"","\"...!\"","The Great Old Nazzagath looked towards Noah with utter stupor at such words, this powerful existence not even knowing how to answer!","He was actually given the same treatment as the few Quintillions of Chthonians had just received, but someone of his might and caliber naturally could not have the same answer.","Noah saw the troubled expression on the face of the Great Old Nazzagath as his body and the figure of the remaining Blue SLime began to be covered with a spatial light.","\"Take your time and think about it. I’ll ask you again when the time is right.\"","WAA!","With these words, Noah’s figure disappeared as he left behind a befuddled Hegemony and many more outside of the universal boundary of the Chthonian Universe in shock.","For the conquest of the Chthonian Universe, not even an hour had passed before it was completed as Noah already forged ahead to the next one.","This was because he was racing against time before a terrifying Antiquity descended and did whatever he wanted to the entire Cosmos that his Dark Universe stemmed from!","---","At the same time Noah left the Chthonian Universe, his enemies were recuperating in the Liberated Universe after facing an appalling amount of successive losses.","The Liberated Universe was vast, with its nature being unique in the Primordial Cosmos as it was one where its existences established very clear lines of two factions throughout the Universe.","These factions were labeled Heroes and Villains as interestingly, the Hegemony that was the head of the faction of Heroes had sided with Chronos for their search of Antiquity!","After the shocking battle against the Oathkeeper and watching him destroy a Universal Construct, Chronos and the others left the Microbial Universe that didn’t have the authority to keep out Hegemonies anymore as they arrived in the abode of the Heroic Hegemony that was right beside the Universal Construct within this Universe.","The mood was grim as these powerful beings were all on a glimmering flat star that shone with a red and gold luster, its surroundings beautifully matching with the Heroic Hegemony that had a costume with a cape shining with the same colors of red and gold.","It was a grim mood as it became grimmer soon after when Chronos seemingly stood up in shock, having received information as he looked towards the far away direction of the Chthonian Universe with unbridled stupor!","\"The Universal Construct of the Chthonian Universe...has also been destroyed!\"","...!","\"What?!\"","RUMBLE!","The atmosphere became extremely oppressive as powerful auras rose and question this stated reality, Chronos being surrounded by the figures of the Goliath, Heroic Hegemony, Cerulean Hegemony, Hegemony Dark Shadow, Microbial Hegemony...and multiple other Hegemony at this moment as the total number within this Liberated Universe actually towered over 20 Universal Realm experts.","None of them could believe the words of Chronos as the ancient voice of the Goliath rang out with somberness.","\"Oathkeeper is this powerful with the Cosmic Treasure? To be capable of facing all of us and even resisting the authority of a Hegemony that he can so quickly destroy two Universal Constructs in such a short period of time?\"","WAA!","The somber voice of this ancient being was actually filled with hidden amazement at such power, but Chronos quickly shook his head as he replied.","\"No. It wasn’t the Oathkeeper that destroyed the Universal Construct in the Chthonian Universe...but the Apex Paragon!\"","...!","Ah!","The faces of all Hegemonies blanked out for a second as they absorbed the words, Chronos relaying the information that a Hegemony under him in a nearby Universe had observed within the Chthonian Universe as the reality was one that nobody listening could believe!","\"The contracted Summon under him has somehow achieved Hegemony, with their battle power being enough to kill Great Old Kubo before they destroyed the Construct...\"","Chronos has his hands massaging his forehead as he spoke, the sequence of events seemingly making this powerful being so frustrated that he had to do this humane action!","Still, his words could barely be believable when he said them as they seemed like rubbish to these powerful existences.","The Summon of a Paragon had risen to the Universal Realm and gone ahead to kill a Hegemony right after? Someone as old and powerful as Kubo?","Some would think it was a joke if it wasn’t for the seriousness that Chronos said the words with!","As they all absorbed his words, Chronos had a terrifying light cross through his eyes as they became firm and decisive, turning towards all the Hegemonies and looking at them with calm eyes that seemed utterly devoid of emotion.","\"The mission we have all worked very hard to achieve is right before our eyes, with the Great Usurper feeling the changes even faster than us as his authority within the occupied Universes has even increased, his descent being within a matter of hours!\"","WAA!","Hours!","A measure of time that these Hegemonies considered nothing!","To beings like them that lived for millions of years, the set of hours within a day was akin to them blinking before they passed.","But in the coming hours, these powerful existences would come to feel as if the hours were stretched into years!"]},{"number":1088,"title":"Chapter 1088: Chapter 1087 - A Race Against Time! II","paragraphs":["In the Liberated Universe, the voice of Chronos continued to resound out as he looked at many powerful Hegemonies.","\"Within the remaining hours of this day...all of us will have to put our lives on the line to defend the remaining Universal Construct.\"","His gaze was somber as his eyes were devoid of emotion, but his voice captured their hearts as it held with it something they all dearly wanted!","\"We all want Antiquity, and now it is time to put that want to the test. If you can risk your life for Antiquity as we pass through these few hours within a day, the process of Amalgamation will be complete as the Antiquity will descend.\"","\"The enemies that stand against us are few, but they are most likely the weapons of the Primordial Cosmos themselves to prevent us from getting what we want! There is the Oathkeeper with his Cosmic Treasure, and then the Apex Paragon that controls a Hegemony!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Stand against them for just a matter of hours...and we succeed.\"","His words finished as the faces of all the Hegemonies were filled with an intense light.","Only a matter of hours.","This was all they had to do to defend!","Sometimes, the battles of Universal Realm experts could even be drawn out to days depending on how they fought, so them standing against a Hegemony that was under the control of a Paragon should not be too much of an issue.","As for the Oathkeeper...","\"The Oathkeeper will not be able to make another move until at least some hours from now, which gives us ample time for preparation. Whichever Universe he appears in next, the majority of us will head there and stop his descent into it as much as we can.\"","As if he could read their minds, Chronos spoke with an impassive expression and continued.","\"Same thing for the Hegemony under the Apex Paragon. It is a Universal Emperor Slime that I nearly eradicated with you all before, we will just have to do it again. This one should be even easier to deal with as they just newly advanced. Dark Shadow, you can reinforce Ambrose in the Animus Universe when the time comes. Microbial Hegemony...\"","Chronos began delegating tasks and how they should move when the eyes of the Cerulean Hegemony began to tremble off to the side.","He recalled the words he just heard from Chronos as he was first confused, and then they opened in shock as he remembered a particularly unique scene a few months back in a Universe that had detached itself from the Primordial Cosmos!","He thought of a certain existence that had actually gotten his hands on the pieces of a Cosmic Treasure and had utilized his contracted summon- a Blue Slime, to actually destroy a minor piece of his soul in the end.","He recalled this very clearly as he had cursed at how a being could get his hands on a Cosmic Treasure and an existence like a Universal Emperor Slime at the same time, promising to rip them apart if the time ever came!","But not too long after, all Hegemonies felt the cry of the Primordial Cosmos as the Dark Universe should have been destroyed, and the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION should have been lost in the Ruination Sea.","But as the Cerulean Hegemony heard the words of a Blue Slime that was also under the control of another being...as he put many pieces together and the fact that the entire race of Universal Emperor Slimes should be eradicated, the Cerulean Hegemony actually arrived at the conclusion that somehow, the Noah Osmont of the Dark Universe had survived!","He had survived along with his contracted summons as the Blue Slime with the special devouring ability that even killed him had somehow come into the Primordial Cosmos!","...!","His shocked gaze only became more and more immense as put many things together, a singular thought appearing in his mind.","It was the thought of a second Cosmic Treasure actually being in the hands of a newly risen Hegemony, a second Cosmic Treasure appearing in the Primordial Cosmos once more!","Coming to such a conclusion, the shocked light gradually faded from the eyes of the Cerulean Hegemony as it was replaced with immense greed.","His expression became normal as he wiped away his shock, actually choosing not to share his shocking findings with the other Hegemonies around him as he actually rose and spoke up powerfully.","\"I will lead the force against the Apex Paragon and the Hegemony he controls!\"","WAA!","His actions caused many being to look towards him unhappily, many of them and especially Chronos recalling the fact that this being was right in front of the Universal Construct when the Oathkeeper struck, but he was frozen in fear as he couldn’t even make a move, and he ran even faster than the rest of them after the Construct was destroyed.","Chronos looked at the Cerulean Hegemony with disappointed eyes as he spoke out.","\"You’ll be in the team that the Heroic Hegemony will lead against the Universal Emperor Slime and the Apex Paragon, not leading it!\"","...!","Even with such an admonishment, the Cerulean Hegemony smiled and nodded as he returned to himself, many thoughts crossing his mind as it had begun to buzz with many ideas of a Cosmic Treasure.","A Cosmic Treasure that could allow one to survive in the Ruination Sea!","When he got his hands on it, what prevented him from leaving the Primordial Cosmos and exploring the vast Ruination Sea?","As for the Apex Paragon and the Universal Emperor Slime...they would have to face his main body and the multiple other Hegemonies this time around, so the Cerulean Hegemony concluded they would have no chance!","’Noah Osmont...I won’t let it end the same way a second time!’","RUMBLE!","A Hegemony plotted at this time as Noah’s enemies paved a plan to counter a defensive, this Hegemony not sharing crucial details that would have changed many things.","The sharing of knowledge about the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION being in the hands of a Paragon was dangerous enough for his teammates.","But the withholding of knowledge about this Paragon himself? Withholding the name of [Noah] that even an Antiquity was extremely cautious of and had warned Chronos about beings with such names in any Cosmos?","This was actually the most dangerous thing!"]},{"number":1089,"title":"Chapter 1089: Chapter 1088 - A Race Against Time! III","paragraphs":["The enemies hatched plans as they began to move soon after.","Meanwhile, Noah made his own plans as at this moment, he actually appeared in the Microbial Universe with the body of one of the clones of the Blue Slime.","His figure was still in the terrifying starry Cthulhu form as he sat above the wobbly body of the terrifying Hegemony of Devouring, his intrusion causing many of the Hegemonies still within this Universe towards him with sharp eyes!","THRUM!","The essence was palpable as Noah was entirely calm, observing the universe around him as he affirmed another Universal Construct was actually destroyed, and it wasn’t by him!","He used the senses of the Blue Slime as he gazed over the entire Universe, finding the shimmering body of the Oathkeeper that was pulsating with a glorious aura of white Primordial Essence while situated in a meditative position near the destroyed pieces of the Universal Constructs.","Noah ignored the auras of the many Hegemonies that had landed on him as his figure teleported away from the region of the void he was in and appeared near the recovering Oathkeeper and the very Hegemonies that surrounded him.","The gaze of this domineering being opened as his eyes landed on Noah, especially at the glimmering Star of Conquest that released a dazzling array of white light onto Noah’s body constantly as he called out lightly!","\"Apex Paragon.\"","RUMBLE!","He called out such words while also locking his golden eyes onto the powerful aura of the Blue Slime, Oathkeeper and the others having long since received the news of Noah and the actions of the Blue Slime from the Hegemonies that had been watching everything outside the boundary of the Chthonian Universe!","He knew that this being and the Hegemony he controlled had somehow been capable of destroying a Universal Construct that required someone like him who held a Cosmic Treasure to be able to do so.","It was a surreal action that made the Oathkeeper continue to reevaluate everything he thought he knew about this being.","He looked up towards Noah’s new form as he saw the glorious head of the Cthulhu nod nonchalantly.","\"I didn’t expect you to be able to take down a Universal Construct.\"","...!","Such words escaped Noah’s mouth as the surrounding Hegemonies beside the Oathkeeper looked towards such a scene with some dissatisfaction, thinking Noah should pay this powerful being of their Cosmos much more respect!","But the Oathkeeper’s golden eyes remained placid as he replied simply towards Noah.","\"Neither did I expect a Paragon to be able to command a Universal Emperor Slime.\"","He actually spoke to Noah in equal terms, not talking down to this being in any way purely from his achievements! At such a being, Noah’s eyes shone brightly as he replied.","\"And yet I do. I’m also ready to head to another Universe and destroy another Construct, but I see you...will take a significant amount of time before being able to do so. Even though the descent of the Antiquity is in less than a day!\"","RUMBLE!","His words caused fluctuations of essence and destiny to erupt out as the eyes of the Oathkeeper constricted, questioning slowly as mana undulated across his golden wings.","\"What exactly are you getting at?\"","\"I’m getting to the fact that you have a problem in mana...and I have the solution! You saw this with the Hegemony of Summoning first hand, she pledged allegiance to me as soon after...she had her Mana Reserves and Regeneration enhanced by tens of times.\"","...!","Yes!","This was the reason why Noah had come into the Microbial Universe and even took the time to talk to the Oathkeeper!","He was actually planting seeds of possibilities similar to what he had done with the Great Old Nazzagath!","\"I’m extending that same offer to you, Oathkeeper. Pledge fealty to me...and you will gain all the Mana you need to be able to go across the Primordial Cosmos to destroy the rest of the Universal Constructs.\"","RUMBLE!","Stupor appeared on the faces of all listening Hegemonies as the Oathkeeper’s eyes flashed with a glorious golden light.","\"...\"","Utter and pervasive quietness arrived in the area as his aged and ancient golden eyes locked with Noah’s from far away.","He looked at this being and the Hegemony he was standing on, a myriad of thoughts crossing in his mind as this domineering being that could be considered the pillar of the Primordial Cosmos seemed to actually be entertaining the words of the Apex Paragon!","...!","The seconds passed as Noah and the Oathkeeper had their eyes locked onto each other tightly, the Oathkeeper ultimately shaking his head as he spoke.","\"That is not my path.\"","WAA!","\"In another two to three hours, I will be ready to descend onto another Universe and do the same as I have done right now. If you are truly capable of doing again what you did in the Chthonian Universe...we should be able to stop the descent of the Antiquity!\"","His words were strong and mighty, giving off the will of an ancient being that couldn’t be steered to another direction!","Noah only smiled and nodded at this as a spatial light began to cover his body, his eyes dazzling with the light of conquest as he finished planting his seeds and waited for them to sprout.","\"Let me know if anything changes. The offer will always be there!\"","WAA!","With such words, the Apex Paragon and the Hegemony of Devouring below him disappeared.","Before they did, the Origins of many of the watching Hegemonies shook as they actually felt a deadly killing intent from the Blue Slime below the Apex Paragon, all of them recalling the history of this existence and what its resurgence meant!","But at this moment, Noah had fully delved into his mission that was considered to be divided into two parts that really went together.","One was to stop the descent of the Antiquity and devour the Universal Constructs, and the other was to make the inhabitants of multiple Universes pledge Fealty to him as he then took them out of the Primordial Cosmos!","To work efficiently with the little time he had, he had divided these tasks to his most powerful weapons yet- namely the clones of the Blue Slimes that he had already teleported to different Universes as he was speaking with the Oathkeeper!"]},{"number":1090,"title":"Chapter 1090: Chapter 1089 - Delivered On A Platter! I","paragraphs":["Out of the 9 Universes that were affected by the Universal Amalgamation of the Antiquity, the Microbial and the Chthonian Universes were the only ones to be freed as it left behind 7 Universes that still had Universal Constructs standing strong within them.","From these 7 Universes...Noah had completely conquered three of them as they didn’t even have any existence living within their vast stars, only having the Universal Constructs and the Hegemonies that protected them!","These three were the Animus, Necrotic, and the Automaton Universes. They left behind the Liberated, Euthenia, Omicron, and the Abyssal Universes as for Noah, these Universes that contained Universal Constructs and existences that he could have pledge fealty to him to gain the remaining half of the Marks of Antiquity he needed...he considered these Universes to be the fat sheep that he wanted to milk.","All of them would involve battles with Hegemonies, but the latter mentioned 4 would also grant Noah billions of Marks of Antiquity as it was within these 4 Universes that Noah sent a clone of the Blue Slime in each.","THRUM!","Simultaneously, a glimmering Blue Slime appeared within the Liberated, Euthenia, Omicron, and the Abyssal Universes as the Hegemonies protecting the Universal Constructs within them were alerted en masse.","One might wonder, what happened to the authority of Antiquity that prevented any Hegemonies aside from those that branded their Origins onto the Universal Constructs or were already within the Universe when the authority descended? How could the Blue Slime at the level of a Hegemony so seamlessly enter 4 vastly different universes?!","The answer was of course, the seamless assimilation of the Universal Construct devoured through <<Universal Devouring>>.","Aside from the gift of 10 Billion Marks of Antiquity for the Blue Slime, it also took in and assimilated the aura and core of the Universal Construct as it understood them inside and out, with even more depth than those that merely branded their auras onto them!","So the 4 clones of the Blue Slimes appeared seamlessly in the Universes with Quintillions of beings and Universal Constructs, their auras reverberating out wildly as their shining cerulean figures shot towards the Universal Constructs where the defending Hegemonies were located at with fervor.","Noah’s other subordinates that had entered these 4 Universes to begin the conquest before continued unhindered, the Seven Deadly Sins, Legions of Undead, Automaton Sentinel Legions...all of the forces went forward from galaxy system to galaxy system as they already took the first steps to spread Noah’s domination!","The Blue Slimes were the topping on the top as they would face the defending Hegemony at each of the Universal Constructs, the defeat of these Hegemonies meaning Noah could widely spread his essence of Fealty out across the Universe like he did for the Chthonian Universe and bring the conquest to a close on these Universes as well.","This was the mission of the 4 Clones and Noah’s subordinates that were given for the sake of efficiency.","You then had Noah himself and the 5th clone of the Blue Slime that appeared...in the Animus Universe!","WAA!","When he teleported away from the Oathkeeper and others in the Microbial Universe, the Chthonian figure of Noah seated upon a Blue Slime appeared in the Animus Universe as he was soon joined together by an alluring figure of a Hegemony that had this same Universe as her home.","The vibrant clone of Valentina looked towards the mountainous figure of the Blue Slime at the realm of a Hegemony in a daze as she questioned everything she knew about cultivating the power of Realms, sighing endlessly in her heart about how such a thing could even become a reality!","The three of them appeared not too far from the Universal Construct, the figure of Ambrose coming to attention and looking towards them with cold eyes as he wasn’t alone. The Hegemony that had broken the Oath and initiated the chase across the Universe while holding onto Noah was also there, Hegemony Dark Shadow looking towards them with baleful eyes that shook with the aura of Tenebrosity.","But even this wasn’t all.","It was because at this very moment, Chronos received information on all the happenings of the 5 affected Universes that Noah’s forces arrived in as his expression changed, and he spoke towards the many Hegemonies around him and gave out commands!","Numerous figures flashed and disappeared, a particularly jubilant Cerulean Hegemony being one among the party of Hegemonies that went towards the Animus Universe while others went to reinforce the defenders in the other 4 Universes.","As for Chronos and the Goliath...their eyes were on the Oathkeeper that could make his move at any moment, these powerful beings also conserving their power as they got ready to fight with everything on the line to achieve their dreams.","Their actions meant grand changes in the Animus Universe as Noah’s eyes raised up when he began to see the light of teleportation call forth multiple Hegemonies to stand beside Ambrose and Dark Shadow.","There was Solerno, two other Hegemonies Noah hadn’t yet met, and the Cerulean Hegemony!","The two that Noah was seeing for the first time was the caped Heroic Hegemony and the Hegemony of Fire, a being from the race of Flame Spirits that shone brighter than many suns.","But even with all of these new faces...Noah’s eyes perked up when they landed on the Cerulean Hegemony.","The eyes of the Cerulean Hegemony also landed on him and the Blue Slime as this Hegemony with the blue crown brilliantly floating on his head looked towards them with immense hidden greed and fervor!","Enemies that had known each other months ago met again on this day!","\"Haha!\"","Noah couldn’t help but let out a boisterous laugh that shook the surroundings as he looked at the Cerulean Hegemony that was delivering himself to him on a platter.","The figure of the Cerulean Hegemony also buzzed with power, this being seemingly not being able to wait amidst his excitement and greed as he was the first to vibrate with essence before he shot out towards Noah and the 2 Hegemonies surrounding him- as he shot out to what he considered a free Cosmic Treasure!"]},{"number":1091,"title":"Chapter 1091: Chapter 1090 - Delivered On A Platter! II","paragraphs":["A beautiful sight was opening itself up at this moment in the Animus Universe.","On one side was an Apex Paragon and two Hegemonies, the other side actually having 6 Hegemonies standing against them as their very aura caused the surroundings to distort and fracture!","The Heroic Hegemony shone with a glorious aura as his caped costume shimmered gold and red, looking like a valiant hero that was standing against immense evil.","You then had Ambrose bounded on both sides by Solerno and Dark Shadow, with the Hegemony of Fire floating beside them as he raised the temperature of the surrounding hundreds of miles.","Then there was the Cerulean Hegemony!","His body had actually turned into a vast Sea at this moment, building up immense momentum as it expanded to become bigger than 50,000 miles, and it continued to stretch out endlessly!","One must recall that when the Cerulean Hegemony was first introduced within his Universe, this being had been sitting down on a Galaxy as he could expand his body to vast sizes.","This was an innate nature of his body that seemed to be made from an endless sea, the color of this destructive sea shining an illustrious blue as it was fighting for supremacy against the glimmering color of the Blue Slime!","Such was the fantastical scene currently in play! A vast Sea filled the essence of a Hegemony rolling towards a planetary sized Blue Slime that had a starry galactic Cthulhu sitting atop it, a beautiful Hegemony of Summoning expanding her body as it also began to thrum with power!","\"Hoo...\"","Towards such a scene, Noah breathed out slowly as his fused clone that was with the Blue Slime resonated with each other, their connection becoming crystal clear.","The chaotic undulations of the void around them seemed to slow down as they nearly came to a stop, Noah’s mind being the only thing that was moving millions of times faster than anything else!","The Star of Conquest above him shone brightly as it cascaded down waves of the essence of Conquest.","He had gone through multiple other Universes since he last used the essence of Conquest, and it had built up immensely again as when faced with the shocking number of 6 Hegemonies, Noah was actually unfazed.","Against 6 Hegemonies, he wasn’t the least bit worried!","His eyes glimmered brightly as in this slowed time, he turned towards the glimmering Star of Conquest as he thought of enhancing another one of the strongest skill trees he held at this moment so that he could carry out a certain fantastical plan.","It was the skill tree that allowed the smooth and simplified usage of the Dao of Chronos...the Dao that he could now use to play with these Hegemonies in a myriad of ways!","It was a Dao that was only a level below the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination, and the Blue Slime at the level of a Hegemony could now utilize it to call forth a shocking array of results against other Hegemonies.","With the descent of an Antiquity on the line, Noah was planning on going entirely crazy for the battles to come as just too many things were in play.","His fight for his own Universal Realm, the fight for the Universal Constructs, and the fight for the Fealty of multiple Universes!","With such things in the back of his mind, Noah gave the command for the pure essence of Conquest to flow into a skill tree.","\"Fill the [Wielder of Chronos] with the Light of Conquest.\"","RUMBLE!","His main body that was floating in the skies above the huge stadium that the main bodies of his subordinates were observing everything in gave the command.","A pristine white color shone as the Star of conquest buzzed, half of its current essence rushing into Noah’s soul and Origin as it searched for the Wielder of Chronos skill tree that was entrenched into Noah!","Thereafter, Noah’s body shone a glorious cacophony of colors as a powerful skill tree of a Cosmic Dao was enhanced, its effects becoming crystal clear in the next instant.","[Wielder of Chronos] <EMPOWERED>:: A skill tree geared towards a basic application of the Cosmic Dao of Chronos. Abilities include [Temporal Looping] (5/20), [Instantaneous Age Regression and Progression](5/20), [Temporal Manipulation Perception](5/20), [Temporal Halt](5/20), [Temporal Inversion](5/20)","...!","First was the fact that after the empowerment of this skill tree, the cap on its skill points for how strong its abilities could be was enhanced from 5 to 20!","Such an enhancement allowed for crazy possibilities, and Noah would have to undertake many tests just to know the full quantitative effect of such a thing.","But at this moment, he just clicked the plus button as he filled all the skills to their new max skill point cap before viewing their details once more!","None of the abilities of the skill tree, whether it was Temporal Looping or Temporal Halt- had any numerical quantifiable number for the resultant of their skill effects.","So when the Light of Conquest filled them, these skills simply all gained a percentage of the enhancement they received attached to them, as well as a few unique boosts of their own!","[Temporal Looping] 20/20) <Enhanced>:: Depending on the mana used, the user can place a certain area or being on a temporal loop that is extremely hard to escape from. Only those capable of releasing strength to shatter the effects of time itself of beings proficient in the workings of time can seamlessly escape Temporal Looping. Mana requirements are reduced by 90% for this ability while its effectiveness is increased by 20,000%","20,000%.","That was an effectiveness increase of 200 times, and it was written like so for the rest of the skills under the Wielder of Chronos!","Noah felt the strength of these skills scream out from his soul as he finally came out of his reverie.","He looked at the vast Sea that was the Cerulean Hegemony rushing towards him, this being seemingly not caring about the fact that Hegemonies could not hurt those of the lower Realms under the rules of the Universal Constructs!","The Cerulean blue sea should have been extremely beautiful to look at in the darkness of the chaotic void, but it was actually tinged with the green of greed and envy as this being only had one thought in mind.","That was the thought of a Cosmic Treasure!"]},{"number":1092,"title":"Chapter 1092: Chapter 1091 - Delivered On A Platter! III","paragraphs":["As the vast sea roiled towards him, Noah’s gaze was calm as neither Valentina nor the Blue Slime made a move.","They remained utterly still as no fluctuations of essence could be seen on their bodies, even going as far to make one think they weren’t thinking of fighting!","This was somewhat true at this moment as the only being on their side to be thrumming with essence was actually Noah.","His body released waves after waves of power as the image of the starry Cthulhu that had the majestic colors of moving galaxies on his body...actually lifted off the planetary sized body of the Blue Slime and went forward alone!","...!","The gazes of the 5 Hegemonies behind the Cerulean Hegemony had already turned dark when they saw their ally give no care about who he attacked, and they were even more dumbfounded when they saw the figure of the Apex Paragon be the one to move towards the Cerulean Hegemony and not the two Hegemonies he came with.","RUMBLE","Their bodies lit up brightly with a myriad of essence as they also turned into streaks of light that followed behind the vast Cerulean sea, intent on stopping the 2 Hegemonies that the Apex Paragon left behind as well as deviating the attacks of the Cerulean Hegemony against the Paragon if need be!","Against such a fantastical force of 6 moving Hegemonies, Noah’s body only blazed with more and more power as he stood before them, his right hand pulled back as if he was charging a punch.","Yes! A punch!","The aura around him rose ever higher as hiddenly, the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION had begun to light up with him in his chest at this very moment!","His tentacles and feelers stretching out of his face rumbled with the essence of Ruination, Chronos, and many others as at this moment, he looked extremely magisterial!","With his tentacles waving around madly, a bellow came out from the galactic Cthulhu that shook the very void itself, the image of a single Paragon standing against 6 Hegemonies being made a reality at this very moment.","\"OOOOOOOH!\"","A bellow that resonated with the bubbling essence that reached its peak!","Noah was like an arrow pulled back to its furthest point before it could be let go, the very void around him beginning to crackle and break.","At this second, Noah’s red eyes flashed madly as he could feel his heart thumping in excitement, his terrifying tentacles covering his face actually forming into a devilish smile as he howled out while shooting like a supersonic missile towards the roaring blue seas!","\"LET’S GOOOO!!!\"","His bellow was a crescendo that reached the very void itself, shaking everything with it as his hand punched out.","A mere punch, but when it neared just a few tens of miles away from the vast sea that was the Cerulean Hegemony and the 5 other Universal Experts behind him...this punch actually caused the void itself to break!","With this punch as the center point, an enormous Rupture began to stretch out as the folds of the Universe itself were torn apart!","The covered distance was extremely wide as Noah gave but a single command to his Cosmic Treasure.","Turn the area in front of him in a vast and endless Sea of Ruination as it should cover all of the 6 Hegemonies before him while sparing the Universal Construct behind them.","So a fracture tens of thousands of miles in diameter spread out, and it covered within it all 6 Hegemonies that could only experience such a reality in shock and horror!","The moment Noah’s punch landed on the void, it cracked and shattered as they found themselves in boiling Ruination Sea that began to eat away at their defenses and Origin simultaneously!","The terror they felt was something that very few would ever get a chance to experience, and they wanted to make an escape and leave this Sea of Ruination at the quickest time possible!","But this was when one of the Hegemonies behind Noah shimmered with light.","The Blue Slime that was fused with Noah’s close spoke lightly, Noah’s clone using a skill that had just been pumped with the Light of Conquest through the authority of a Hegemony.","\"Temporal Halt.\"","RUUMBLE!","A vast Blue clock appeared above the rupture within the Animus Universe as it gushed out the essence of Chronos endlessly.","This essence was extremely unique as with the +20,000% Effectiveness under the Light of Conquest, the Blue color was tinged with a pristine white as its authority seemed inevitable!","It wrapped around the shocked and horrified Hegemonies as all 6 of them without question...were put on a halt in time!","....!!!","All 6 Hegemonies!","None could break free!","For the few seconds that they were halted in time and couldn’t move...the Ruination Sea ate them up as the Cerulean Hegemony was actually the one affected the most with his body that was turned into a vast sea.","\"No...\"","The seabody called out in despair and shock as it could have never imagined this, as it could have never thought a Paragon would be able to utilize a Cosmic Treasure to such an extent!","Meanwhile, Ambrose, Solerno, Dark Shadow, the Heroic Hegemony, and the Hegemony of Fire were all just in utter confusion and horror as they didn’t even grasp what was going on, just that a pervasive essence was corroding everything about them and eating them up before they could even blink.","But they were of course, powerful Hegemonies as in the middle of such a life and death reality, they bellowed out as they burned their very Universes for the essence to defend themselves and break through the shackles of Chronos that the Blue Slike hat set up!","But just when they thought they were close...","\"Temporal Halt.\"","WAA!","The skill was cast again as the fantastical blue clock above the rupture gushed out more essence of Chronos.","\"Temporal Halt.\"","And again.","\"Temporal Halt.\"","And Again!","RUMBLE!","Every time the Blue Slime uttered such words, its enormous body moved ever close to the rupture as the essence of Ruination wrapped around its body protectively, its eyes hungrily looking at the desperately struggling Hegemonies within the Sea of Ruination that seemed like they could have their Origins corroded and eaten up at any time!!!"]},{"number":1093,"title":"Chapter 1093: Chapter 1092 - Butchering Hegemonies as if they were nothing! I","paragraphs":["Glorious scenes of such utter majesty didn't come often but when they did...they were ones that should be witnessed and inscribed onto history books!","The current scene of an Apex Paragon releasing a single punch and causing a rupture to split apart the very fabrics of the Universe itself was seen by a few Hegemonies that had been following the actions of this being and the Universal Emperor Slime he controlled.","They were actually following the actions of a being that had seemingly popped up from nowhere in the Primordial Cosmos just weeks ago, and yet now he seemed to be in the center point of the most crucial battles as he stood in the way of some of the most powerful Hegemonies!","Outside of the boundary of the Animus Universe, the few that were paying attention to the happenings of the 9 affected Universe arrived just in time to see Noah's Cthulhu figure throw out a single punch that tore apart the space for tens of thousands of miles.","The watching Hegemonies didn't see the blazingly crimson Ruination Sea stretching out from Noah's punch, as through the Dao of Subterfuge...their eyes saw a blooming and massive black hole expand outwards from the punch of this Apex Paragon.","This overwhelming black hole overtook the bodies of all 5 Hegemonies that stood against him as a moment later, the enormous figure of the Blue Slime glimmered brightly with the essence of Chronos gushing forth from it, locking the 6 Hegemonies that could barely be seen in this terrifying black hole!","Even with their eyes being shown something false with the Dao Of Subterfuge, what they saw still shook them to their Cores as their eyes focused on the terrifying figure of the Apex Paragon.","Their minds were buzzing with questions on exactly how this being had been confident enough to throw out a punch against multiple Hegemonies, and how it was even possible for this punch to display enough prowess to lock down and terrify Universal Realm experts!","How could a Paragon have climbed over the ranks and be able to match a Hegemony?!","WAA!","A myriad of questions, but not a single answer in sight as only the shocking reality before them played out.","Within the Animus Universe, the glimmering body of the Blue Slime was spamming [Temporal Halt]s every millisecond as the essence of Chronos flew around widely, the Cerulean blue clock above the rupture spinning in a dazzling fashion as wisps of Conquest were released from it!","This essence wrapped tightly around the 6 Hegemonies as their terrified gazes turned to those of despair, their vast experience telling them at this moment exactly where they were that could cause their Mana and origin to be getting eaten up like so.","The reality that they were somehow in the Ruination Sea caused them even more fear as when it was compounded with the fact that their bodies felt constant shackles from time constricting them, they weren't able to pay attention to anything but trying to preserve their souls and Origins!","None of them...could even pay attention to the planetary sized body of the Blue Slime that had begun to edge its way towards the torn fabric of the Universe and enter the very same portion of the Ruination Sea they were struggling in.","The Hegemony of Slaughter that was the first one to design the terrifying Universal Constructs that were then modified and adapted by Chronos could not do anything.","The wizened being that had cursed Valentina and threatened her with slaughter could not do anything.","The Holder of Tenebrosity that could traverse the Primordial Cosmos and was known as the strongest assassin couldn't do anything!","Even the powerful Heroic Hegemony that didn't even get to display a hint of his shocking power and how much more unique it was compared to others...even this being couldn't do anything.","None of the Hegemonies within the Ruination Sea could make any actions as they could only watch in shock and despair as their Origins were slowly corroded and devoured.","Ah!","Mind you, these were genuine Universal Realm existences that lived for millions of years.","But shockingly, it seemed that the battle against these 6 Hegemonies was about to end in a short minute as if they were the same as the Subjugations of the Usurper that were defeated not too long ago!","As if Noah and the methods he could deploy with his Cosmic Treasure didn't differentiate between the titles of Paragons or Hegemonies.","As their numbers didn't matter!","As if their power was just nothing.","And truly so...against the Ruination Sea, it was nothing!","RUMBLE!","Unknowingly, the enormous body of the Blue Slime arrived within the vast stretching Ruination Sea, its body wrapped all around with the essence of Ruination as its eyes targeted a single being first.","It was of course, the largest one that had changed his form into an endless blue sea, this Cerulean Hegemony being affected the most by the Ruination Sea as his body had been nearly entirely corroded crimson at this moment!","Against the vast seabody struggling to survive, the viscous body of the Blue Slime instantly overlapped and superseded it, its eyes barely glancing upon the terrifying enemy that had crowned itself the head of the Spirit Race in the Dark Universe as the Slime uttered forth coldly.","<<universal devouring=\"\">>.</universal>","WAP!","A gorgeous flash of cerulean blue, and only a single blue colored being remained in the horrifying Sea of Ruination.","\"...\"","The Cerulean Hegemony and all of his greed for the Cosmic Treasure that he didn't even share the information of the enemy he knew of was actually the first to die among all Hegemonies!","As if his death was insignificant and not worth anything!","At this time, the only Hegemony that had first hand knowledge on another Cosmic Treasure within the Primordial Cosmos aside from the Primordial Disk in the Oathkeeper's hands perished.","The only Hegemony that somewhat understood Noah and his history from the Dark Universe perished as after him...many more would follow!"]},{"number":1094,"title":"Chapter 1094: Chapter 1093 - Butchering Hegemonies As If They Were Nothing! II","paragraphs":["As he watched the death of the Cerulean Hegemony, Noah’s face was placid as his flashing eyes recalled the feeling of excitement of throwing out a single punch that sealed the lives of 6 Hegemonies.","Yes, it wasn’t his own power and it was actually the power of his Cosmic Treasure, but still!","To be capable of doing such a shocking feat was something very few could say they accomplished.","THRUM!","While taken in by his own reverie, the situation was still unfolding within the Ruination Sea, the bound bodies of the Hegemonies still trembling in a terrifying manner as the Blue Slime moved towards them.","The more important detail to observe was the fact that within the Origin of the Blue Slime, the second illusory Galaxy that had formed hazy outlines after the Devouring of the Great Old Kubo has become more distinct, the lines of its Galaxies seemingly being drawn in as it slowly came to life!","The aura that the Blue Slime released only shot up higher and higher as efficiently, it already pounced on the other remaining targets before they were devoured by the Ruination Sea.","The Blue sea that represented the Cerulean Hegemony was vast to cover, but the figures of the Heroic Hegemony, the Hegemony of Fire, Solerno, Dak Shadow, and Ambrose were simply human sized as it meant the Blue Slime could cover all of them at once!","To the Universal Emperor Slime, it didn’t matter whether it was one or millions. As long as it could fit them into its stomach, it wouldn’t matter as everything would be devoured.","BZZZT!","The bodies of the 5 remaining Hegemonies tried to twist madly to break the chains of Chronos binding them, Noah having found a truly deadly combination of throwing people into the Ruination Sea and making it so they couldn’t move with a Temporal Halt!","They all twisted and turned crazily as if they knew that somehow, their time was here! Their very Origins cried out fearfully as they didn’t want to face oblivion, but these beings couldn’t do anything.","The essence of Chronos surrounding them was something cast through the body of a Hegemony, with the skill being enhanced by over 200 times through the essence of Conquest as it wasn’t something these beings could breakthrough!","With such a reality in play, the Blue Slime silently moved as his viscous body covered the figures of the 5 Hegemonies.","The terror within their eyes was clear as their alarm bells rang out, but it was all for naught as the voice of a Blue Slime thundered down coldly.","<Universal Devouring>.","WAP!","...!","A resplendent flash of light.","A disappearance of 5 Hegemonies!","It mattered not their status.","It mattered not their power!","It didn’t matter that Ambrose who had been the first to design the Universal Constructs was now dead, or what history and uniqueness the Heroic Hegemony and the other 3 Hegemonies had.","To the Blue Slime, it was just meals that it had now devoured.","RUMBLE!","The body of the Blue Slime seemed to thrum gloriously as the second Universe within its Origin bloomed with illusory Galaxies, this Universe gradually becoming more and more complete as it was only a matter of time before a shocking process took place.","It was the process of a being achieving a second Universe without first forming A Splendiferous Universe- without obtaining 100 Billion Marks of Antiquity and turning all of their galaxies into Dao Galaxies.","They wouldn’t be stepping on the path for an Antiquity, but instead it would be a path that didn’t follow the natural laws and was termed false- the stage of an Apocryphal Antiquity!","As for how strong this Apocryphal Antiquity stage was compared to real Antiquity? How vast was the difference between it and Hegemonies?","All of these would be things Noah would have to figure out as at this moment, the Cosmic Treasure within his Origin vibrated out as a command came from him.","\"Close the rupture.\"","WAA!","The folds in space of the Animus Universe began to heal and close as the figure of the Blue Slime teleported to appear below Noah again, Valentina looking at such a scene in a stupor as her mouth formed an O shape!","She wasn’t the only one to be utterly surprised at the scene of 6 Hegemonies being wiped out within a minute.","So effortlessly at that as if they weren’t powerful existences!","Amidst her surprise, she was also dissatisfied as she didn’t even get to make a move herself to take care of these beings.","She could only stare at Noah to direct her shock as even with what she knew and had been finding out about him, his actions just now were really stretching it.","Her voice was shaking as she carefully spoke.","\"Are you...are you actually an Antiquity in hiding or something? How can you...\"","The Cosmic Treasure was Noah’s secret that he didn’t make a habit of sharing, and Valentina had yet to find out about this fully as she only had some guesses.","Towards her shocked question, Noah just shook his head as a devilish smile formed on the enormous Starry Cthulhu.","\"It’s nothing like that. These Hegemonies were just too weak, merely being low tier beings in the Universal Realm!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Maybe if they were to comprehend Chronos or Extinction they could stand a chance against me. But for now, they can only be cannon fodder!\"","WAA!","His words were extremely cruel, domineering, and even seemingly looked down upon Hegemonies!","All the Hegemonies that heard them felt their bodies trembling as they couldn’t refute such words.","Yet Valentina found her heart beating faster at the sight of Noah saying such words.","The way he said them, the way he carried himself...the utter confidence he had in the words!","When he said these words just now...just why did he seem just so damn devilishly handsome and hot?!","...!","The thoughts of Valentina would remain her own as Noah gave another command to the Blue Slime.","\"Go ahead and devour the Universal Construct.\"","SHAA!","Left without any protectors and pulsing dangerously by itself, the Blue Slime bloomed to be larger than even a Galaxy as he went to devour a second Universal Construct!","In total, it would be the third one to fall as its effects were bound to be far reaching!"]},{"number":1095,"title":"Chapter 1095: Chapter 1094 - An Unrelenting Will! I","paragraphs":["A glorious blue expansion of color covered its second cocoon-like Universal Construct as the Blue Slime called out calmly.","<<Universal Devouring>>.","WAP!","The thumping structure was eaten up an instant later, the body of the Blue Slime once again shone with a gorgeous array of colors as within its Origin, Billions of Dao Galaxies fantastically bloomed!","THRUM!","Only when a full 10 Billion were added on did its body stop vibrating, the Origin of the Blue Slime currently showing over 25 Billion Dao Galaxies.","The other 10 Billion were from the first Universal Construct, and he had actually gained 5 Billion Dao Galaxies after collectively Devouring 7 Hegemonies now!","The Great Old Kubo from the Chthonian Universe, and now the 6 Hegemonies from this Animus Universe.","The Blue Slime was only 75 Billion Dao Galaxies away from attaining Antiquity, its pace being something that would horrify even those that were already Antiquities!","This was because even the Great Usurper had promised Chronos that he would share with them the method for one to attain Antiquity within a few million years.","Yet the Slime was one-fourth of the way there in just less than an hour...","Even Noah had to work hard and put in a few days to reach the one fourth of progress that the Blue Slime reached!","But it mattered not whether it was unfair or if others could not do it.","The Blue Slime could do it, and that was the end of the story.","Noah looked at the vibrant and powerful aura of the Blue Slime as Valentina’s clone beside him stretched her slender fingers out the chaotic void they were in.","She could no longer feel the oppressive aura of a Hegemony in this Universe as it was returned to normal, this powerful existence sighing endlessly as she turned to focus on Noah.","The existence that had truly changed her destiny and Fortune to what it was now, and it seemed he was going towards her realm of power and even superseding it constantly as she felt like he would exceed her in power before she knew it!","When she gazed on the Blue Slime that had happily returned to Noah and was nudging him with the very same dangerous body that just devoured 6 renowned Hegemonies, one could even say he had long since surpassed her.","\"We’ll be going to another Universe. Things could drastically change at any moment so we have to continue moving quickly.\"","His voice echoed her mind as she nodded while biting her lips, this regal Hegemony actually speaking in a pouting manner thereafter!","\"You didn’t even need me here for support.\"","...!","Yes! Noah and the Blue Slime had finished everything themselves as Valentina had not even been able to make a move!","Towards her words, Noah just smiled and patted her head as his body and the figure of the Blue Slime began to be covered with a spatial light.","\"I’ll let you know when I’ll need you again. You can give all the support you want then!\"","\"Mmm.\"","The regal Hegemony nodded as Noah disappeared, her gaze reminiscent as she looked at the vast Animus Universe she had called her home for so many thousands of years.","----","The moment Noah’s actions finished in the Animus Universe, the reality of his actions spread out as they were far reaching!","He had just caused for the Devouring of renowned Hegemonies like Ambrose, the Cerulean Hegemony, and Dark Shadow as he just nonchalantly destroyed a Universal Construct and left thereafter.","But to others, the result of his actions were truly shocking as in the Microbial Universe where the Oathkeeper was healing, his hands held a Wings of Primordial Destiny that communicated to him what a few Hegemonies just saw within the Animus Universe!","The hands holding the Wings of Primordial Destiny were trembling as the content of the voice coming out was too shocking!","\"He...he killed 6 Hegemonies simultaneously...!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Ambrose, Hegemony of Fire, Heroic Hegemony, Solerno, Dark Shadow, and the Cerulean Hegemony...they are all dead!\"","WAA!","\"The Universal Construct within the Animus Universe has also been destroyed!\"","...!","Word after word came out, each one being more unbelievable than the last as Oathkeeper and the Hegemonies protectively surrounding him could hardly believe it.","Didn’t this being just eradicate the Great Old Kubo in the Chthonian Universe and destroy a Universal Construct there?","Did he not just leave this same Universe after saying shocking words to Oathkeeper just minutes ago?!","Yet somehow within these minutes, he had decimated 6 Hegemonies and destroyed another Universal Construct!","\"...\"","The Hegemonies were silent as they had no words.","Oathkeeper’s eyes were lighting up brightly as while taking in such news, he called out lightly as he held a thoughtful expression.","\"Mana...\"","...!","This word caused the eyes of many beings to perk up as they remembered Noah’s offer to Oathkeeper!","It was about Mana Reserves, where he offered to expand them tens of times if Oathkeeper pledged fealty to him!","As they now saw this being moving relentlessly from one Universe to another doing things they themselves could not do, they actually started to believe his words.","\"For him to constantly move without ever stopping, his Mana reserves and those of the Universal Emperor Slime should be multiple times that of any of us...if not truly tens of times!\"","The A Hegemony spoke out from a barely discernible place as his words caused a tremor to pass through the hearts of all Hegemonies.","The golden color undulating over Oathkeeper’s body also shone brighter as his wings thrummed, repeating this word to himself as he recalled the words of the Aped Paragon.","’Mana.’","This word and concept fully began entrenching itself into the minds of the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos on this day!","It would only perpetuate as time passed, and it would be the reason why many of them in the not too distant future would utter forth a certain name.","It would be the reason that they would look up in utter awe and stupor as they unconsciously called out....the Antiquity of Mana!"]},{"number":1096,"title":"Chapter 1096: Chapter 1095 - An Unrelenting Will! II","paragraphs":["Their shock about this being’s Mana reserves aside, there was also the reality of him defeating 6 Hegemonies all at once!","This shock was perceived more not by Oathkeeper’s group, but Chronos’s group that was getting ready to focus on their big battle with the Oathkeeper.","Currently, Chronos had a blank expression as the Black Hole on the face of the Goliath swirled silently.","These powerful beings could barely absorb the fact that somehow, 6 of their people were dead within minutes of them being sent out to stand against a mere Paragon and the Hegemony he controlled!","None of them could fathom what the hell had happened, Chronos being the only one capable of speaking a moment later as his eyes still seemed blank.","\"This...this existence must be the true chosen weapon of the Primordial Cosmos...he has to be!\"","RUMBLE","\"He came out of nowhere, and now he displayed such unrealistic and impossible battle power that one might even mistake for him to have the Cosmic Treasure and not the Oathkeeper!\"","...!","Chronos actually came close to the truth as his black face adopted a pained expression, the heart of this being actually thinking of the unfairness of it all as he looked at this situation.","All he wanted was the method of Antiquity.","After so many Reincarnations and living so many lives, he just wanted to progress forward and didn’t want his path to be restricted to just Hegemony!","But why...why would his own home stand against him so much? Why would the Primordial Cosmos break its own natural rules to bring forth existences that could stand in his way like this?","The being questioned inside, but he received no answer as the others could only blankly stare while thinking of the news they just heard.","Aside from the Goliath and Chronos, the other Hegemonies were actually feeling a myriad of emotions as among them...was fear!","Fear from looking at the fact that most of them were on the same level if not weaker than beings like the Heroic Hegemony and Ambrose who had birthed their own Grand Dao, and yet they heard how all these beings were collectively killed in such a short period of time by this Apex Paragon.","They began to feel fearful as when the news spread to the other 4 Universes where the clones of the Blue Slime and Noah’s subordinates were moving across for Conquest, the Hegemonies actually didn’t proactively go to stand against the terrifying Blue Slime!","All they had to do was protect the Universal Construct, and the Blue Slimes were only leading Noah’s forces on a speedy path of Conquest across the Galaxy Clusters of these Universes so that Noah could quickly gain immense numbers of the Marks of Antiquity.","The 2 or 3 Hegemonies within these Universes actually didn’t move a single step away from the Universal Construct to stop the clones of the slimes, even hoping that they would not target the Construct that they were protecting!","This was how shocking the result of Noah’s actions of killing the 6 Hegemonies were!","\"Should....should we still be preparing and waiting for the Oathkeeper’s move, or should we go to stand against the Apex Paragon wherever he appears next...?\"","...!","A careful voice of a Hegemony known as the Hegemony of Thunder stretched out amongst Chronos and the group of Hegemonies around him.","\"...\"","His words actually received no answer as these beings were actually evaluating the strongest threat between Oathkeeper and Noah..and they actually couldn’t arrive at an answer!","But as they reeled themselves in with the recent actions, so did another being that was much more powerful than them.","Across the vastness of space and time, even across timelines and Dimensions!","The consciousness of an Antiquity that had just burned a Splendiferous Universe was looking at the thick cylindrical line of connection he had with a far away Cosmos coldly.","He sensed the consequent downfall of 2 more Universal Constructs one after another, as if it was to challenge his authority after he burned an entire Universe to speed up his descent!","The Antiquity eyes became exceedingly cold at such an outcome as he looked within his Origin and gazed upon the myriad of Universes within it.","His cerulean blue eyes flashed emotionlessly as between the normal Universes filled with the bright 100 Billion normal Galaxies or the Splendiferous Universes filled with 100 Billion Dao Galaxies...his eyes actually chose 3 Universes at this moment as they also began to burn!","Without a second pause or delay, this being had actually chosen to burn not one, but three Universes to act as the fuel for his descent! Two were normal Universes shimmering calmly, while the third was another Splendiferous Universe that shone beautifully with Dao Galaxies.","Ye. In response to the increasing reality of him being stopped from obtaining a Cosmic Treasure- something that only those in the Cosmic Realm enjoyed...the Great Usurper chose to burn these 3 Universes without even a pause.","He was a being that had lived for too many millions of years and had experienced too much! The sacrifices he could make were things that even other average Antiquities could not understand, and he had reached the upper stages of this level of Nirvanic Antiquity as he was very close to the Cosmic Level!","His methods of searching for Cosmos not by traversing the Ruination Sea but through the unique means he was using right now was actually the secret that Chronos wanted to find out, and his success had always been achieved smoothly apart from a few losses.","The only losses suffered were caused by a set of beings stretched out across the Cosmos that uniquely shared similar names, but the Great Usurper didn’t consider these existences normal as he waved off these losses!","But...in this Primordial Cosmos that had no such a being holding a high rank of power? How could he lose such a Cosmos that even had a Cosmic Treasure?!","RUMBLE!","As three Universes burnt and became a fuel to further increase the rate of his descent, the Antiquity merely looked on coldly as he couldn’t wait to glance upon all the faces of the beings within this Cosmos.","They would learn of the unrelenting will of the Great Usurper.","They would learn it very clearly as he would make sure to descend no matter what!"]},{"number":1097,"title":"Chapter 1097: Chapter 1096 - Merely Hours Before An Apocalypse Arrives! I","paragraphs":["From the stupendous strength of the Antiquity, authority descended down like a tide as it followed the thick cylindrical connection he held with the Primordial Cosmos, this line of connection burning crimson gold with the essence of three more Universes burning through them!","In the Primordial Cosmos, these changes were that much more pronounced as the 6 remaining Universes which held the Universal Constructs were pulled in closer together, the process of Amalgamation fully underway as at this moment, the barriers of these Universes had already fully melded together.","After this melding, they began to slowly disappear as when these boundaries between the Universes faded, the Antiquity would have arrived!","The authority of this being came out in even more terrifying waves from the Universal Constructs as Noah had at this moment just teleported to the Automaton Universe, raising his head towards the Construct not too far from him that was protected by a few Hegemonies.","Looking at the newly increased intensity of the waves of power it released, his eyes shone with the light of destiny as he discerned a few things and found out that...they now had a few hours and not merely the day before the descent of the Great Usurper!","They truly just had a few hours before an Antiquity descended...before another Apocalypse came to be as nobody knew the designs of this descending being.","Noah’s eyes shone sharply at this development as a myriad of thoughts crossed his mind.","The fact that the Antiquity would descend in even less time caused his heart to tighten somewhat, and it did this because one of the many cards that gave him confidence was the fact that the cooldown of Plot Armor was a few days away, but Deus Ex Machina could already be used as if the Antiquity ever truly descended...he would have to use this!","Of course, if he was efficient enough to obtain the remaining 20 Billion Marks of Antiquity before the descent of this Antiquity, he would be able to become a Hegemony himself. But he didn’t know whether such a power would be enough against a being that had multiple Universes established in his Origin.","But yes, he actually only had 20 Billion Marks of Antiquity remaining to collect before he reached the 50 Billion Mark, and another 50 Billion after that to make all 100 Billion Galaxies into Dao Galaxies as he became a genuine Antiquity and became capable of birthing more Universes!","His subordinates and the clones of the 4 Slimes he sent to the Euthenia, Abyssal, Omicron, and Liberated Universes had been moving with immense efficiency as they collectively had 25% of all of these Universes already pledging fealty to Noah.","This was what bumped his numbers of Marks of Antiquity crazily as even at this moment, he was gaining tens of millions of Marks every single second!","His main body had to isolate itself in the skies as clouds of gold had already gathered around him while the Marks of Antiquity descended one after another, making him look like a primordial being undergoing a fantastical trial.","With his subordinates and the Clones of the Blue Slimes causing others to swear fealty to him and getting him closer towards Hegemony, Noah could continue attacking the Universal Constructs protected by Hegemonies as he now appeared near the one in the Automaton Universe that was protected by 3 Hegemonies!","The Mechanical Hegemony had its metallic gears vibrating intensely at Noah’s appearance, the other two Hegemonies being an enormous existence that was known as the World Tree from the Euthenia Universe, and a huge demonic looking creature that was the Hegemony of Brutality from the Abyssal Universe.","These three Hegemonies actually remained back near the barrier they enacted around the Universal Construct, not going forward to face Noah as they had received the news of how this being and his Blue Slime had actually decimated 6 Hegemonies in a matter of seconds in the Animus Universe!","These beings actually cursed their luck that Noah came into this Automaton Universe next, and they would have to put their lives on their line and even potentially face destruction against this being that they didn’t understand.","Noah was still in his Cthulhu form as he stood atop the Blue Slime, edging closer to the Universal Construct and seeing the hesitation on the faces of the Hegemonies as he smiled and spoke out.","\"Are you all...actually afraid?\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking sentence that the galactic Ctuhlhu said with utter dominance!","Yet the 3 Hegemonies didn’t reply to such an insult as at this moment, they were communicating rapidly with Chronos.","\"What are we to do?! If you don’t send reinforcements, we won’t be able to hold this being down!\"","The Mechanical Hegemony was furious as he sent many mental messages to Chronos, not wanting his existence to be another set of news that gets passed to others on how he and the other 2 Hegemonies around him were somehow defeated by the unexplainable being before them.","Towards all of the mental messages he sent, the Mechanical Hegemony didn’t receive anything back until only a few seconds later when Chronos’s impassive voice reached him.","\"Hang on for just a minute and reinforcements will come. You can achieve that against a single Paragon and Hegemony, right?!\"","...!","Frustrations and conflict were running rampant within this group of beings that only banded together for the sake of Antiquity, and it was showing at this moment as the Mechanical Hegemony turned his red robotic eyes towards Noah after hearing the reassurance of Chronos, his voice ringing out.","\"No, Apex Paragon...we are not afraid!\"","THRUM!","His words came with a wild eruption of power as his body changed shape and size, mechanical gears moving in and out as this Hegemony soon became a planetary sized robotic being that held deadly weapons that could easily vaporize the molecules of a Paragon with a hit!","The World Tree and the Hegemony of Brutality beside him also received the assurances of Chronos as they roared out malevolently, these Universal experts finally showing off their teeth against a being they actually dreaded to face at this moment!"]},{"number":1098,"title":"Chapter 1098: Chapter 1097 - Mere Hours Before An Apocalypse Arrives! II","paragraphs":["Ah!","How far one could advance on their path of power!","Noah thought such a thing as he looked at the Hegemonies that actually turned hesitant to his arrival, only to bolster their courage a second later as if they received reassuring words from somewhere.","He actually made an entire group of Hegemonies fear him before he himself became a Hegemony, such a feat making Noah smile as he looked mockingly towards his enemies while his body began to bubble forth with power once more!","\"No...it definitely looked like you guys were scared just a second ago. Did you hear about how 6 dudes in the same realm as you perished just a few minutes ago?\"","RUMBLE!","He spoke nonchalantly as immense waves of mana emanate from him, the Mechanical Hegemonies and the other 2 Hegemonies feeling their hearts turn cold at his nonchalant words as they didn’t know whether to focus on the Paragon or the Blue Slime that wasn’t even moving below him!","\"Do you want to know how they died? I’m about to recreate it right now.\"","...!","His body vibrated like an unstable bomb about to be let loose, his figure lifting from the Blue Slime as his right hand pulled back and seemed ready to punch.","Such a stance caused the eyes of the Hegemonies to shake, and this was because they had received a description of the manner that this being attacked as they didn’t want such a scene to be recreated with them in it!","Chronos had just told them to hold off for one minute before reinforcements arrived, so the figure of the Mechanical Hegemony flashed with light as he continued to speak, simply trying to buy that little more time.","\"We can pause and talk a bit like equals, Apex Paragon. We can share with you what we are doing here and how it can benefit you to also become an Antiquity...\"","His ancient voice was as slow as possible, waiting for Noah to converse with him as the essence of his body was undulating around him powerfully so he could be ready for anything!","But the reply he received...","\"I have no need for methods of Antiquity. After all, I can become one in just a matter of days!\"","RUMBLE!","The moment that his words finished, Noah’s figure flashed.","His pulsing body that had been accumulating essence within itself and in the Cosmic Treasure exploded out as he appeared a few miles away from the enormous figure of the Mechanical Hegemony, his punch flying out as he once again used the capabilities of the Cosmic Treasure to initiate a rupture of the folds of the Universe he was in!","No more talk, just action!","BOOM...RIIIP!","The rupture began to spread with him at the center as the figures of the Mechanical Hegemony and others bellowed out, their bodies lighting up with powerful waves of essence as they got prepared to fight whatever was to come.","But their hearts were actually shaking as the words of the Apex Paragon rang out in their ears and even the ears of all eyes that were now directed within this universe.","It was the words of this Apex Paragon that actually said he could become an Antiquity in a matter of days!","Such arrogant words would have made them scoff and not take such a being seriously, but when it came to this mysterious Apex Paragon..were they actually a lie, or was this being actually capable of this?!","As they found themselves grappling with this question, a rupture tore apart tens of thousands of miles as it completely devoured the figure of the Mechanical Hegemony that Noah wasn’t too far from. As for the World Tree and the Hegemony of Brutality, these beings had turned into streaks of light that shot off in different directions to try and outrun the expansion of the deadly rift they could only see as an all devouring black hole!","But could existences in the Universal Realm really escape from the speed that a Cosmic Treasure unfurled a Universe?","The answer was no as shockingly, it seemed like the black hole had sentience as the main rupture split in two and set out branching ruptures in the different directions these beings were running towards, the two of them becoming embedded in it a moment later.","WAA!","Each of them felt like they had fallen into a quagmire as it was already hard enough for anyone without RUINATION to move around in the Ruination Sea, but they despaired a second later when they felt the descent of the essence of Chronos wrap around them and hold them down even more!","The Blue Slime had now made a move as his voice stretched out for all of them to hear.","\"Temporal Halt.\"","...!","A shimmering blue clock had inexplicably appeared in the space above them as these three beings were locked in place, their hearts screaming in anger and denial as their fear fully exploded at this moment! Even though they knew it was coming! Even though they thought they were prepared! They still fell into the Sea of Ruination as their Origins began to be eaten up while a lone Slime moved towards them.","Noah looked on at this scene coldly as his gaze was on the Universal Construct that now lay unprotected, just waiting for the Blue Slime to finish devouring these 3 Hegemonies before he proceeded forward to other Universes and entirely prevented the descent of the Antiquity!","But...this was when he felt waves of spatial essence stretch out a few hundred miles away, his eyes turning towards a certain direction as they were able to hone in and observe 3 newly appearing figures.","If it was just the reinforcements of another 3 Hegemonies, Noah would even bat an eye as he would simply consider them another set of cannon fodder. But from the three, the one at the very forefront had a vibrating black hole as his entire body shook with the profound essence of Extinction!","The Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos- the being that was one of the oldest who was still alive today...this being had actually appeared to stand against Noah today!","\"Hmmm?\"","Noah’s red eyes shone gloriously at such a development, a devilish smile appearing on his terrifying Cthulhu-like face as within the newly formed Ruination Sea, the Blue Slime had already swallowed the terrified Mechanical Hegemony and was rushing towards the other two Universal experts without even batting an eye towards the arriving reinforcements!"]},{"number":1099,"title":"Chapter 1099: Chapter 1098 - Mere Hours Before An Apocalypse Arrives! III","paragraphs":["The Goliath was actually the reinforcements that Chronos sent, this being appearing in an ecstatic fashion as he brought with him two terrifying Hegemonies that already had their bodies vibrating with a myriad of Cosmic essence.","The black hole of this ancient being locked its gaze onto Noah and the rupture before them that seemed like a pulsating black hole, the feeling this black hole gave off being something that made one uncomfortable!","Noah looked at such a scene with a smile as a sharp glint crossed through his eyes as he looked at the Goliath.","One of the oldest beings of the Primordial Cosmos. A being that had been renowned in the Primordial Cosmos and took on its highest positions. Meanwhile, he himself was just a being in his 20s as he had begun on the path of power for only less than a year!","How would such a match up be? Could he seamlessly be on the same playing field as someone that had lived for millions of years?!","Such a thought brought a devilish smile to his face as with their entrance, his voice was the first to stretch out.","\"They’re in there.\" Noah said while pointing to the pulsing ’black hole’ that the 3 Hegemonies saw.","In here, the Mechanical Hegemony had already been swallowed by the Blue Slime as it was currently making its way over to the World Tree and the Hegemony of Brutality!","\"Why don’t you all go in and save them? The Hegemony of Devouring will swallow them all soon if you don’t save them.\"","RUMBLE!","He spoke domineeringly to the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos and two other Hegemonies as when these beings turned towards the black hole before them, their consciousness screamed for them to stay away and not even near it!","Yet the arrogant voice of the Apex Paragon stretched in their minds as the two Hegemonies behind the Goliath looked towards him for direction.","Sensing his very Origin tell him not to go near the rupture, the Goliath actually didn’t make a move as his voice stretched out instead.","\"What are you?\"","...!","The voice of ancient and primal, seeming like something unearthed after millions of years as every syllable commanded to be paid attention to!","\"I have lived for a very long time, and I have yet to come across a creature that can do what you can. Just...what are you?\"","The ancient being sought to understand the enemy that just popped from nowhere, Noah listening to his words as he only had his tentacles and feelers vibrate with power.","\"...\"","His eyes blazing intensely with beams...Noah actually didn’t reply.","He gazed upon the rupture where the Blue Slime had begun to come out of, its body glimmering with intense light as this existence...had already finished its job and swallowed the remaining two Hegemonies by the time a few sentences were exchanged!","The second illusory Universe that would make the Blue Slime an Apocryphal Antiquity had already had its Billions of Galaxies being actualized, Noah sensing that the Devouring of a few more Hegemonies would get the Blue Slime there.","But without replying to the Goliath, Noah’s figure teleported to stand in front of the colossal figure of the Blue Slime as the rupture near them began to recede.","It seemed like he was standing protectively in front of the slime as his body bubbled with power once more, his eyes shining brightly as he gave a command!","\"Devour the Universal Construct.\"","BZZZT!","The viscous figure of the Blue Slime shot towards the Construct behind them as Noah stood in the way of 3 powerful Hegemonies!","\"...\"","It was a stupendous situation to see, an ancient sigh coming out of the figure of the Goliath as his body began to rage with the profound essence of Extinction and he moved.","He couldn’t let the Universal Construct be destroyed, even if they couldn’t save the ones they were sent to reinforce!","So he moved as the two Hegemonies beside him followed, intent on bypassing the Apex Paragon and stopping the Hegemony of Devouring.","But...","\"You...\"","THRUUM!","Noah’s voice echoed out in waves as his hand was already wound up for a punch, his galactic Cthulhu form shining with glorious light as yet another punch shot out!","\"...shall not pass!\"","BOOOM!","As Noah played with his words from a story he had seen too long ago, his fist caused waves of ruptures to spread out as they covered everything before him.","...!","The figure of the Goliath glimmered with innumerable lights as Extinction bloomed from him, the very space around him seemingly being destroyed as he moved, providing very little resistance for him as he veered away from the stretching ruptures!","The other two Hegemonies were in worse shape as even while prepared, they nearly got caught in the spreading out ruptures every few milliseconds. But the main point was that their advancement was stopped right at this moment as the Blue Slime was seamlessly expanding to cover the Universal Construct behind Noah.","RUMBLE!","The scene caused the air of the Goliath to turn somber as while wearing away to escape the ruptures, his hand that was a mass of the essence of Chaos rose up as he called out with his agely voice.","\"Sword of Extinction.\"","...!","In the void, a planetary sized obsidian crimson sword formed, its origin coming from the handle that the Goliath held as this being swung this terrifying weapon with the intent to erase the ruptures before him!","But...","WAA","The Sword of Extinction entered the ruptures as the Goliath watched with somber eyes as the destructive essence of this sword... was simply swallowed up by the ruptures as if they were nothing.","\"...\"","After all, how could one hurt the Ruination Sea?!","It was a shocking reality that came to be, but a single Paragon really stopped the advancement of powerful Hegemonies as at this moment, a certain Slime covered an entire Universal Construct as he called out lightly!","\"<<Universal Devouring>>\"","WAP!","In front of their very eyes, another Universal Construct disappeared."]},{"number":1100,"title":"Chapter 1100: Chapter 1099 - Apocryphal Antiquity! I","paragraphs":["A Tool of Descent disappeared soundlessly as only a single Blue Slime remained.","Its body glimmered beautifully in the void as within its Origin, 15 Billion Dao Galaxies were added instead of the usual 10 Billion that were added per Universal Construct! This was because the Antiquity had burned another Splendiferous Universe as his essence became even more condensed and pervasive!","This put the total number of Dao Galaxies the Blue Slime held at 35 Billion as he continued forward at a pace that was actually faster than even Noah.","THRUM!","The ruptures that Noah created to hinder and try to swallow the Goliath and other two Hegemonies disappeared, these powerful existences looking towards the area that the Universal Construct used to be as their faces were those of utter wrath and shame.","Only the Goliath could not be read as he floated soundlessly in the Void, these powerful beings actually not being able to stop a Paragon and his contracted summon!","Noah’s galactic Cthulhu figure flashed as he appeared above the Blue Slime once more, his figure becoming situated comfortably above the viscuous head as he spoke out nonchalantly.","\"It’s a shame, really.\"","RUMBLE!","\"A shame that I don’t have more time to waste, otherwise I would entertain the great Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos and see just how long it takes until your Extinction runs out and you fall like everyone else.\"","...!","Shocking words came from Noah’s mouth as they felt like thunderclaps descending down, his figure and the figure of the Blue Slime becoming enveloped in a spatial light as they disappeared!","They only left behind 3 somber Hegemonies that still couldn’t accept what they just saw within their own eyes.","When Noah and the Blue Slime reappeared, they were in the last Universe that he emptied out of its existences- the Necrotic Universe.","He was currently moving at a fast pace as it seemed like the Antiquity was rushing...and so would he!","After the destruction of one Universal Construct, he went to another just as quickly as he arrived a few miles away from the Construct that was being protected by the Hegemony of Necromancy and three other Hegemonies he didn’t know.","To him, it didn’t matter as this time around, his body was already bubbling with power and might as his fist was ready, his Cosmic Treasure being even more prepared as Noah was a streak of light that glimmered towards the Hegemony of Necromancy and those around him!","Only his voice could be heard before the void ruptured as he tore open the very fabric of the Universe.","\"I told you that you’d taste death just as easily as the Paragons in this Universe faced, didn’t I?\"","WAA!","His voice was the harbinger of death as the Hegemony of Necromancy had only just looked towards him in shock as his body began to erupt with power, the three Hegemonies near him doing the same as a second later...","RIIP!","All of them fell into the Ruination Sea that bloomed from Noah’s fist!","\"Ah...!\"","The shocked bellows began as Noah paid it no heed, the Slime already moving in position as an enormous blue clock gushed out the essence of Chronos and wrapped around the 4 Hegemonies.","What happened thereafter was just history repeating itself as these beings could simply not defend against a combination of the Sea of Ruination and the essence of Chronos that was enhanced by the Dao of Conquest!","Within less than a minute, the Hegemonies were devoured as the Universal Construct followed.","It now made it so that Noah and the Blue Slime had taken down 4 Universal Constructs on their own!","With the one in the Microbial Universe that Oathkeeeper had personally destroyed, that made it a total of 4 Universal Constructs that had undergone complete Annihilation.","Only 4 Universes remained under the influence of the Antiquity at this moment, and of these...","RUUMBLE!","Noah’s main body felt his Origin explode with Marks of Antiquity as it signified one of these Universes falling completely under his reign as the existences within all pledged Fealty!","It was the Euthenia Universe that was filled with all sorts of plant like races, the Universe where the now devoured World Tree stemmed from.","The other Universes aside from Euthenia weren’t too far off as his subordinates and the clones of the Blue Slime continued their relentless advance, more than half of these Universes already being conquered as the current Marks of Antiquity Noah held...were knocking on the door of 40 Billion.","Just 10 Billion more until he reached Hegemony!","Within the next hour as his forces continued...this would all but be guaranteed.","Meanwhile, the Blue Slime had now breached 50 Billion Dao Galaxies after the 4th Universal Construct, being just 50 Billion away from becoming a genuine Antiquity.","But before that happened, Noah could already see that the illusory second Universe the Blue Slime had gained was becoming ever real, and that this being would most likely experience the title of an Apocryphal Antiquity before a genuine one!","All of this...depended on time and how fast they moved.","So Noah moved with glorious efficiency as the moment the 5th Universal Construct fell, they disappeared from the Necrotic Universe as they made their way to the Euthenia Universe!","And the moment they left, multiple figures of the Goliath and other powerful Hegemonies appeared, only to see the devastating scene of an empty area where the Universal Construct used to be.","\"...\"","A pervasive silence descended onto the group of Hegemonies as they didn’t even know how to feel.","Under the relentless assault of the Apex Paragon that seemed to have endless energy, they were actually facing loss after loss as they didn’t even know what to do!","But there was another being that had a much stronger form of will than them, the one that had currently put everything in play and was trying to descend at this very moment.","Under the consecutive losses as he sensed the fall of the 5th Tool of Descent, the Antiquity turned entirely expressionless across the boundaries of spacetime, his Origin merely lighting up again as yet another Splendiferous Universe and 3 other normal Universes burned with a crimson light.","...!","It was an extremely heavy price to pay, even for a being like him.","Yet when he saw the thick line of connection burn bloody with his authority, he only uttered forth with an ancient and emotionless voice!","\"A mere hour remains...Chronos, don’t fail me with just this!\"","RUMBLE!","After the burning of numerous Universes, the days of Descent that had been weeks were reduced to days and then to hours, and now....only 60 minutes remained before the Antiquity made his entrance!"]}]);
